——以南昌航空大学材料化学文献检索课程为例', 'Innovation is the soul of a nation’s progress and an inexhaustible driving force for social development.College students are the major driving force of innovation and entrepreneurship in the new era. How to organically integrate innovation and entrepreneurship education into the course of document retrieval of materials chemistry and cultivate builders and successors of socialism in the new era with "emphasis on moral education, solid foundation,strong practice, innovation, and potential" is a subject, which is worthy of research and exploration. Based on the actual situation of the course of “document retrieval of materials chemistry”in the national first-class major of Nanchang Hangkong University, this paper carries out teaching reform from five aspects: innovation of teaching content, innovation of teaching methods, upgrade of assessment methods, helping students with learning difficulties and persistent improvement to enhance the students’ comprehensive literacy and "three innovation capabilities", that is, "entrepreneurship awareness, innovative thinking and creative ability".', '创新是一个民族进步的灵魂,是社会发展的不竭动力,大学生是新时代创新创业的生力军.如何将创新创业教育有机融入材料化学文献检索课中,培养和造就具有"重德育、厚基础、强实践、能创新、有潜质"的新时代社会主义建设者和接班人,是一个值得研究与探索的课题.该文结合南昌航空大学国家一流专业材料化学文献检索课程的实际情况,从教学内容的创新、教学方法的创新、考核方式的升级、帮扶学习有困难的学生和持续改进五个层面进行了教学改革,以提升学生的综合素养和"三创能力",即"创业意识、创新思维和创造能力".', '[{"id":"632462b4a36d2225e1f8b766","name":"ZHOU Dan","name_zh":"周丹","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"53f7b7bcdabfae8faa4abc34","name":"XIE Yu","name_zh":"谢宇","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6156439d60a96506679ede0b","name":"ZHONG Rong","name_zh":"钟荣","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"560cccfb45cedb3397575640","name":"ZHONG Xueming","name_zh":"钟学明","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6324a6aea36d2225e103867c","name":"WANG Fang","name_zh":"王芳","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"name":"SUN Qing","name_zh":"孙青","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6168beb260a9656471ec20bd","name":"SHEN Fangfang","name_zh":"申芳芳","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6379cc91f789b382be9cd3bb","name":"TONG Yongfen","name_zh":"童永芬","org":"南昌航空大学","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"}]', '["National first-class major","Materials chemistry","Document retrieval","Innovation and entrepreneurship","Educational reform","Ideological and political education"]', '["国家一流专业","材料化学","文献检索","创新创业","教学改革","课程思政"]', '{"name_zh":"创新创业理论研究与实践","raw":"The Theory and Pracice of Innovation And Entreptrneurship"}', '2096-5206', '6', '6', 2023, NULL),
('649ea6cad68f896efa1c6626', '10.3976/j.issn.1002-4026.2023.03.015', 'Molecular dynamics simulation and gas adsorption properties of CO2/CH4 adsorbed using Mg-MOF-74', 'Mg-MOF-74对CO2/CH4吸附分离的分子动力学模拟及气体吸附性能研究', NULL, '天然气是一种环保型能源并且可被广泛用做化工原料,但是其中的CO2会严重影响天然气的热值与输送性能,因此对天然气中的CO2进行有效脱除尤为重要.选用Mg-MOF-74作为吸附剂,采用分子动力学模拟计算方法分析Mg-MOF-74对CO2/CH4吸附分离性能的影响.模拟计算结果显示,在一定的温度、压强条件下,CO2比CH4更容易与Mg-MOF-74 的金属位点相结合,Mg-MOF-74 对CO2气体的相互作用力更强,从而证明Mg-MOF-74 对CO2的吸附能力也更好.为验证模拟结果的准确性,制备了Mg-MOF-74 并测试了其CO2/CH4吸附性能,实验结果与模拟结果一致,证明Mg-MOF-74 对CO2有很高的选择性.', '[{"name":"XIE Yi","name_zh":"解祎","org":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","org_zh":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","orgid":"61e69dc2689627346574283f"},{"id":"64ccaaa1d6fcf4e73504462a","name":"ZHANG Jing","name_zh":"张晶","org":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","org_zh":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","orgid":"61e69dc2689627346574283f"},{"id":"654730b98a47b649233c8ce7","name":"SUN Jinqiang","name_zh":"孙金强","org":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","org_zh":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","orgid":"61e69dc2689627346574283f"},{"id":"637d1712f789b382beb14e29","name":"LIU Xiaochan","name_zh":"刘晓婵","org":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","org_zh":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","orgid":"61e69dc2689627346574283f"},{"id":"53f44f7fdabfaedf435f02af","name":"YI Xibin","name_zh":"伊希斌","org":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","org_zh":"齐鲁工业大学(山东省科学院) 新材料研究所 山东省特种含硅新材料重点实验室,山东 济南 250014","orgid":"61e69dc2689627346574283f"},{"id":"542ac9b1dabfae2b4e143b8f","name":"SUN Yongxing","name_zh":"孙永兴","org":"中国石油大学（华东）","org_zh":"中国石油大学（华东）","orgid":"5f71b8ca1c455f439fe60d5d"}]', '[]', '["金属有机骨架","气体吸附分离","分子动力学模拟","模拟计算","材料化学"]', '{"name_zh":"山东科学","raw":"Shandong Science"}', '1002-4026', '36', '3', 2023, NULL),
('64b0a7773fda6d7f065ed160', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2023.09.075', 'Exploration on Course Ideology and Politics in the Experimental Course of Materials Chemistry in the University in Ethnic Minority Area', '民族地区高校材料化学实验课中的课程思政探析', NULL, '民族地区高校以为国家培养民族地区优秀人才为使命."材料化学"是本校材料化学专业的核心课程.以铁酸镧纳米纤维表征分析内容为例,开展研究型实验教学课.在实验教学中,贯穿爱国主义教育,融入铸牢中华民族共同体意识,引进科研创新意识.使用X射线粉末衍射仪、拉曼光谱、扫描电子显微镜、透射电子显微镜以及X射线光电子能谱仪等仪器对铁酸镧纳米纤维的晶体结构、分子振动-转动、形态与微结构以及分子结构与原子价态等进行分析.将思政元素潜移默化地与教学过程融合,学生在了解、熟悉并掌握材料表征技术与分析方法的同时,也将增强民族自豪感和自信心,树立勇于创新和砥砺奋斗的精神,培养较强的专业责任感.', '[{"name":"Hu Quanli","name_zh":"胡全丽","org":"内蒙古民族大学","org_zh":"内蒙古民族大学","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606b8"}]', '[]', '["民族地区","高校","材料化学","课程思政","铁酸镧"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '50', '9', 2023, NULL),
('644470e996e231b8737665ec', '10.3969/j.issn.1004-275X.2023.03.57', 'Teaching Practice of Graduation Design of Material Chemistry Specialty', '毕业设计教学实践——以材料化学专业为例', 'As an important practical teaching link of the material chemistry specialty, graduation design plays a vital role in cultivating students’ practical ability to analyze and solve problems, sense of solidarity and cooperation and innovation ability.In combination with the characteristics of our school-based specialty and talent training objectives, we will carry out reform and practice in such diversified measures as graduation design topic selection, student cognition, process monitoring, multi-dimensional evaluation mechanism, etc.cultivate students’ diversified abilities and lay a solid foundation for training high-level innovative talents.', '毕业设计作为材料化学专业的一个重要实践教学环节,在培养学生实践动手能力,分析解决问题能力,团结协作意识与创新能力等方面起着至关重要作用,结合我校本专业的特色及人才培养目标,从毕业设计选题,学生认知,过程监控,多维评价机制等多元化举措方面进行改革与实践,培养学生多元化能力,为培养高层次创新人才打下坚实的基础.', '[{"id":"616322ad60a9657b486d18a7","name":"Liu Cuiyun","name_zh":"刘翠云"},{"id":"53f42e21dabfaeb2acff3dab","name":"Pang Xianjuan","name_zh":"逄显娟"},{"name":"Li Xiang","name_zh":"李想"},{"name":"He Yuxin","name_zh":"赫玉欣"},{"id":"53f43700dabfaee1c0aa2c65","name":"Yao Dahu","name_zh":"姚大虎"},{"id":"651b2e858a47b61c50cfc3ea","name":"Gao Xiping","name_zh":"高喜平"},{"id":"63156db1cd729caec636e85f","name":"Lu Chang","name_zh":"陆昶"}]', '["graduation design","teaching practice","ability development"]', '["材料化学","毕业设计","教学实践","能力培养"]', '{"name_zh":"云南化工","raw":"Yunnan Chemical Technology"}', '1004-275X', '50', '3', 2023, NULL),
('6540674e939a5f40826fef9d', '10.12219/j.issn.2095-4751.2023.51.115', NULL, '“双碳”背景下材料化学课程的教学实践探索', NULL, '为紧跟“碳达峰、碳中和”战略要求，赋予材料化学课程“双碳”时代人才培养思维，同时适应新工科对人才培养 质量的要求，本文围绕材料化学的课程特点，将新能源材料相关内容融入课程教学过程中，从教学目标、方式与内 容等方面进行深入的实践探索。这不仅能够更新教学内容，紧跟科技前沿，提升学生的学习兴趣和创新实践能力， 同时还有助于大学生课程思政教育，强化“双碳”意识，引导学生树立正确的科学发展观，积极践行绿色低碳生 活，并深化学生对可持续发展理念的认识。', '[{"name_zh":"张晓华","org_zh":"太原科技大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e361"},{"name_zh":"赵新新","org_zh":"太原科技大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e361"},{"name_zh":"丁小凤","org_zh":"太原科技大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e361"},{"id":"53f437e8dabfaee43ec3e082","name_zh":"刘宝胜","org_zh":"太原科技大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e361"}]', '[]', '["碳达峰","碳中和","材料化学","新能源","教学改革"]', '{"name_zh":"新教育时代电子杂志（学生版）","raw":"XINJIAOYUSHIDAIDIANZIZAZHI(XUESHENGBAN)"}', '2095-4751', NULL, '51', 2023, NULL),
('657b32a3939a5f40827ba596', '10.3969/j.issn.1004-275x.2023.11.56', 'Advancing Material Chemistry Education:a Comprehensive Investigation of Effective Teaching Strategies and Pedagogical Approaches', '推进"材料化学"课程教育的有效教学策略与方法', NULL, '材料化学作为综合性较强的交叉学科,有利于诸多行业的发展,也符合当今社会对新时代青年学生的要求,因此材料化学的教学质量显得尤为重要.但目前该课程存在教材自身局限性、教学方式单一、理论与实践联系不紧密和教学评价方式不完善四方面的问题,通过科学分析,深入剖析了每个问题的原因,提出了针对性的改进措施,对材料化学教学质量的提高具有一定地指导作用.', '[{"name":"Jiang Yu","name_zh":"江宇","org":"长江大学","org_zh":"长江大学","orgid":"5f71b5ba1c455f439fe52e29"},{"name":"Zhang Binglin","name_zh":"张丙林","org":"长江大学","org_zh":"长江大学","orgid":"5f71b5ba1c455f439fe52e29"}]', '["materials chemistry","teaching issues","teaching reform","innovation","talent cultivation"]', '["材料化学","教学问题","教学改革","创新","人才培养"]', '{"name_zh":"云南化工","raw":"Yunnan Chemical Technology"}', '1004-275X', '50', '11', 2023, NULL),
('6580afd6939a5f408285fbce', '10.16597/j.cnki.issn.1002-154x.2023.05.017', NULL, '材料化学专业"材料物理性能"课程思政的探索和实践', NULL, '应用技术型高校课程教学以"传道授业"和"立德树人"的协同育人模式为根本目标,因此需要把思政教学元素和社会主义核心价值观"润物细无声"地融入专业课程的教学过程中去.以"材料物理性能"课程为例,对课程思政融入过程中存在的问题进行了总结剖析.在此基础上,探讨分析了该课程关键思政元素发掘和具体思政应用案例,以期为应用技术型高校材料类相关专业课程思政教育的开展提供更多可借鉴的思路和方法.', '[{"id":"63afc8a384ab04bd7fbecadd","name_zh":"张帅国","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"name_zh":"范利君","org_zh":"鹤壁能源化工职业学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638d95"},{"id":"6544e2658a47b6492335e458","name_zh":"马文媛","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"name_zh":"朱景峰","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"name_zh":"刘佳丽","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"}]', '[]', '["应用技术型高校","材料化学","材料物理性能","课程思政"]', '{"name_zh":"化工时刊","raw":"Chemical Industry Times"}', '1002-154X', '37', '5', 2023, NULL),
('64db131c3fda6d7f06669bc0', NULL, NULL, '新工科背景下《材料化学基础》课程建设研究', NULL, '随着产业的快速发展,行业对于创新性、应用型工程科技人才的需求也在不断增加.在新工科建设中,教育教学改革是关键一环,而课程建设是教学改革的核心.课程建设需要及时了解并反映行业发展的最新需求,注重培养应用型和技术技能型的工程科技人才,强化解决实际问题的能力.本文以《材料化学基础》课程建设为例,融合新工科建设理念,融合课程思政教育,构建全方位教学改革体系及全流程教学考核体系,以期能树立学生的理想信念,夯实学生的专业知识,提升学生的工程实践能力,培养学生的工程意识及科研素养,为材料化工行业培养出更多高素质的应用创', '[{"name_zh":"杨康","org_zh":"安徽工业大学材料科学与工程学院","orgid":"5f71b2e21c455f439fe3eef9"}]', '[]', '["新工科","材料化学基础","课程建设","教学改革","人才培养"]', '{"name_zh":"当代教育实践与教学研究（电子刊）","raw":"Contemporary Education Research and Teaching Practice"}', NULL, NULL, '15', 2023, NULL),
('65091fda3fda6d7f06f8baba', '10.16871/j.cnki.kjwh.2023.15.024', 'Problems and Countermeasures in Actual Combat Teaching Reform of Materials Chemistry Courses', '材料化学类课程实战化教学的问题与对策', NULL, '军队院校材料化学类专业课程在实战化方面存在的问题主要包括课程体系及内容设置"贴军性"不强、教学模式实战化程度不高、实践平台实战化环境缺乏等.针对这些问题,该文围绕实战化教学理念,提出材料化学类专业课程实战化教学改革对策.主要通过研究课程体系设计、重整知识架构、重建实战化教学案例资源库、重塑教学模式、优化实战化实践平台等,提升材料化学类专业课程的实战化水平.探索与实践结果表明:丰富实战化课程内容、创新实战化教学模式和优化实战化实践平台,能有效提升材料化学类专业课程的实战化程度和学员的实战化水平.', '[{"id":"652d29458a47b649230f7f0c","name":"REN Wurong","name_zh":"任武荣","org":"中国人民解放军战略支援部队航天工程大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军战略支援部队航天工程大学"},{"id":"53f44df9dabfaee02ad379a0","name":"WANG Danqin","name_zh":"王丹琴","org":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"id":"62e4a482d9f204418d6cb8dc","name":"GUO Qingpeng","name_zh":"郭青鹏","org":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"name":"WANG Hui","name_zh":"王珲","org":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"id":"53f43326dabfaee1c0a7c674","name":"LIU Shuangke","name_zh":"刘双科","org":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"}]', '["materials chemistry","actual combat","teaching","countermeasures"]', '["材料化学","实战化","教学","对策"]', '{"name_zh":"科教文汇","raw":"The Science Education Article Cultures"}', '1672-7894', NULL, '15', 2023, NULL);

——材料化学研究生课程教学改革与实践', NULL, '材料化学是一门新兴的交叉学科课程,针对其涉及的知识面广以及内容多而庞杂等特点,作者在充分调研国内外材料化学课程内容情况的基础上,以培养学生运用化学原理、手段分析和解决材料问题的能力为目标,对国防科技大学材料化学的研究生课程内容进行了凝练和优化,从夯实学科基础、突出前沿交叉、以学生为中心开展教学三方面进行了材料化学课程的教学改革与实践探索,取得了良好的教学效果.', '[{"id":"6152be1960a965200208d54d","name_zh":"许静","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"id":"61667a8460a9657b48716155","name_zh":"李宇杰","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"id":"53f440acdabfaee02ad08525","name_zh":"郑春满","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"id":"53f43326dabfaee1c0a7c674","name_zh":"刘双科","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","课程内容","教学改革","研究生教育"]', '{"name_zh":"大学教育","raw":"University Education"}', '2095-3437', NULL, '1', 2022, NULL),
('62a85f395aee126c0f29a20b', '10.3969/j.issn.1001-9677.2022.05.071', 'Exploration and Practice on Material Chemistry Professional Experiment', '材料化学专业实验教学探索与实践', NULL, '在深入分析材料化学专业实验教学过程中普遍存在的问题的基础上,从江西科技师范大学材料化学专业实验教学实际出发,提出了通过高素质专业教师队伍建设、优化实验项目、共享科研仪器设备提高材料化学专业实验教学软硬件;在专业实验教学过程中,通过"问题"的提出、分析、解决,激发学生的学习积极性和主动性,将创新思维训练方法融入专业实验教学中,培养学生的创新创业能力,提高了材料化学专业实验教学效果.', '[{"id":"6463f897e80f1b0001119c2b","name":"WANG Jun","name_zh":"王军","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"},{"id":"6334000c2fedb730e39b89ae","name":"BAI Ling-yun","name_zh":"白凌云","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"},{"id":"62e3b4a8d9f2043704e735b9","name":"HUANG Long","name_zh":"黄隆","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","专业实验","创新能力"]', '{"name_zh":"广州化工","raw":"Guangzhou Chemical Industry"}', '1001-9677', '50', '5', 2022, NULL),
('649eb3fcd68f896efa273384', '10.13884/j.1003-3807hxjy.2021080239', 'Teaching Practice of Cutting-Edge Scientific Research in Inorganic Nonmetallic Material Chemistry:Application of Point Defect Engineering in Hydrogen Energy Technology', '前沿科研成果在无机非金属材料化学课程教学中的应用——点缺陷工程在氢能源技术中的应用', 'In terms of the strong theoretical and abstract characteristics of inorganic non-metallic material chemistry course, this paper discusses how to introduce cutting-edge scientific research results into teaching. Application of point defect engineering in hydrogen energy technology is taken as an example. Through case studies, we intend to deepen students’ understanding of theoretical knowledge, stimulate students’ interests in learning, and cultivate students’ scientific research ability.', '针对本科生无机非金属材料化学课程教学内容理论性和抽象性较强的特点,以晶体缺陷教学内容为例,探讨如何在教学中引入前沿科研成果,通过实例教学,将理论知识与科学研究融会贯通,以加深学生对理论知识的理解、激发学生的学习兴趣、培养学生的科研素养.', '[{"id":"561a34af45ce1e59645c83e4","name":"LIU Xiao-Fang","name_zh":"刘晓芳","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"645440c4e0a3f070ae13c8f0","name":"YE Jin-Rui","name_zh":"叶金蕊","org":"北京理工大学宇航学院 北京 100181","org_zh":"北京理工大学宇航学院 北京 100181","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0fc"},{"id":"53f47b69dabfaee43ed459bc","name":"SHUI Jiang-Lan","name_zh":"水江澜","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', '["undergraduate teaching","inorganic non-metallic material chemistry","cutting-edge scientific research"]', '["本科教学","无机非金属材料化学","科研前沿"]', '{"name_zh":"化学教育","raw":"Chinese Journal of Chemical Education"}', '1003-3807', '43', '24', 2022, NULL),
('62f08bcf90e50fcafdf8b96f', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-4305.2022.03.021', 'Preliminary study on the reform of material chemistry experiment course', '材料化学实验课程改革探索', NULL, '针对武汉轻工大学目前材料化学实验课程的现状,从教学模式和实验内容两个方面,提出了实验课程改革的可行方式,如引入项目驱动式教学以及实践性强的实验项目等.同时,探讨了在新型冠状病毒肺炎疫情防控的特殊时期高校实验教学存在的客观问题,借鉴ADDIE(Analysis,Design,Develop,Implement,E-valuate)模型教学和虚拟实验,对实现实验课程线上教学提出了可行性建议.', '[{"id":"633442212fedb730e3b4339b","name":"HUANG Chengrui","name_zh":"黄程瑞","org_zh":"武汉轻工大学","orgid":"5f71b8c91c455f439fe60d3a"},{"id":"61647ad760a9657b486e9214","name":"GAO Xinlei","name_zh":"高新蕾","org_zh":"武汉轻工大学","orgid":"5f71b8c91c455f439fe60d3a"}]', NULL, '["实验课程改革","材料化学实验","线上教学"]', '{"name_zh":"实验室科学","raw":"Laboratory Science"}', '1672-4305', '25', '3', 2022, NULL),
('63bd299090e50fcafdd0aaa5', '10.3969/j.issn.2096-8248.2022.04.016', 'Cultivation of Applied Innovative Talents in Experimental Teaching of Material Chemistry', '材料化学实验教学的应用型创新人才培养', 'The important content of comprehensively promoting quality education in China′s higher education is the cultivation of students′ innovative abilities,and practical teaching is an important teaching link for cultivating applied innovative talents in material chemistry specialty.Taking the experimental teaching reform of the material chemistry major in Huaibei Normal University as an example,this paper discusses the cultivation of innovative ability of the students majoring in material chemistry in normal universities.By adjusting the traditional teaching modes,optimizing experimental teaching projects,building an open teaching platform and improving the comprehensive evaluation system,and closely combining professional experimental teaching with scientific research,the experimental teaching reform of material chemistry has been promoted and a new practical teaching system has been established. The teaching effect has significantly improved,and application innovation ability of the students and scientific research literacy have greatly improved to meet the needs of social and economic development for talents in the new era.', '我国高等教育全面推进素质教育的重要内容是学生创新能力的培养,而实践教学是材料化学专业培养应用型创新人才的重要教学环节.以淮北师范大学材料化学专业实验的教学改革为例,探讨师范类院校材料化学专业学生的创新能力培养.通过调整传统教学模式、优化实验教学项目、建设开放式教学平台、完善综合评价体系、专业实验教学与科研互动紧密结合等措施推进材料化学专业实验教学改革,建立新的实践教学体系.教学效果明显提升,学生应用创新能力和科研素养有较大提高,满足新时期社会和经济发展对人才的需求.', '[{"id":"63243c44a36d2225e1f528c4","name":"DING Yan","name_zh":"丁艳","org":"淮北师范大学","org_zh":"淮北师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88a1c455f439fe6032e"},{"id":"6169d32160a9656471ed68a3","name":"HE Zhanjun","name_zh":"赫占军","org":"淮北师范大学","org_zh":"淮北师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88a1c455f439fe6032e"},{"id":"63247a70a36d2225e1fc2118","name":"ZHANG Sujuan","name_zh":"张素娟","org":"淮北师范大学","org_zh":"淮北师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88a1c455f439fe6032e"}]', '["material chemistry","experimental teaching","innovation"]', '["材料化学","实验教学","创新能力"]', '{"name_zh":"淮北师范大学学报（自然科学版）","raw":"Journal of Huaibei Normal University(Natural Science)"}', '2095-0691', '43', '4', 2022, NULL),
('61cacea85244ab9dcb0cc083', '10.3969/j.issn.1001-9677.2021.02.045', 'Teaching Reform and Thought on Introduction to Materials Science for Materials Chemistry Specialty?', '材料化学专业《材料概论》课程的教学改革与思考', NULL, '《材料概论》 课程是材料化学专业的一门专业核心课,在专业培养过程中起到了承上启下的衔接作用.本文针对《材料概论》课程教学中可能出现的问题,分析了课程的定位和特点.在教学前期要充分培养学生的学习兴趣,通过结合信息化教学资源、学生参与授课与考核形式优化等教学方法改革,可提高课程教学质量和培养学生实践创新能力,为今后其他材料课程的学习和学生毕业深造做好准备.', '[{"name_zh":"王娟","org_zh":"南阳师范学院","orgid":"5f71b6e71c455f439fe5b3bf"},{"id":"62e3ab47d9f2043704e1a1f5","name_zh":"高远飞","org_zh":"南阳师范学院","orgid":"5f71b6e71c455f439fe5b3bf"},{"name_zh":"荣盼盼","org_zh":"南阳师范学院","orgid":"5f71b6e71c455f439fe5b3bf"},{"id":"62e3b377d9f2043704e66b99","name_zh":"司朝霞","org_zh":"南阳师范学院","orgid":"5f71b6e71c455f439fe5b3bf"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","材料概论","教学改革"]', '{"name_zh":"广州化工","raw":"Guangzhou Chemical Industry"}', '1001-9677', NULL, '2', 2021, 1),
('619bbaf71c45e57ce976745c', '10.11862/CJIC.2021.017', 'Preparation and <i>in Vitro</i> Experiment of Attapulgite-based Microgels with Magnetic/Temperature Dual Sensitivities', '磁性凹凸棒土温敏性微凝胶的合成及其体外实验', 'The folic acid (FA)-grafted magnetic FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM) composite microgels (attapulgite=ATP, N-isopropyl acrylamide=NIPAM, acrylamide=AAM) were prepared via a method of emulsion copolymerization. The as-prepared microgels were characterized by X-ray diffraction (XRD), vibrating sample magnetometer (VSM), thermogravimetric analysis (TG), infrared spectroscopy (IR), UV-visible spectroscopy (UV), scanning electron microscope (SEM) and transmission electron microscope (TEM). The dynamic light scattering (DLS) results show that the low critical solution temperature (LCST) of microgel was about 38.5 degrees C. The drug delivery ability of the as-prepared microgels was evaluated by using doxorubicin hydrochloride (DOX) as the model drug. Based on the drug loading and releasing results, the presence of ATP increased the amount of drug loading and releasing. Compared with free DOX, the in vitro cytotoxicity of DOX loaded FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM) was decreased and the biocompatibility was improved. Those results indicate that the microgels of FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM) can be used in potential as a slow-release drug system. The in vitro cellular uptake test revealed that the microgels of FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM) at the assigned site were significantly richer than that of other sites. This result indicates that the microgels of FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM) composite are targeting and expectable in the application of targeted drug releasing.', '通过乳液聚合法制备了叶酸(FA)接枝的磁性FA-Fe3O4/凹凸棒土-聚(N-异丙基丙烯酰胺-丙烯酰胺)(FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM))复合微凝胶(凹凸棒土=ATP,N-异丙基丙烯酰胺=NIPAM,丙烯酰胺=AAM),并通过X射线衍射(XRD)、振动样品磁强计(VSM)、热重(TG)、红外分析(IR)、紫外可见分光光度仪(UV)、扫描电子显微镜(SEM)和透射电子显微镜(TEM)对其进行表征.通过动态光散射(DLS)测定的低临界溶液温度(LCST)约为38.5 ℃,该温度适合于细胞实验.选择盐酸阿霉素(DOX)作为模型药物.药物负载和释放试验表明,ATP可以增加药物的负载和释放量.体外细胞毒性实验表明,与游离DOX相比,负载DOX的FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM)具有更好的生物相容性,并有望建立一个药物缓释系统.体外细胞摄取实验表明,FA-Fe3O4/ATP-P(NIPAM-AAM)具有靶向性,可用于靶向药物释放.', '[{"id":"64f0eff08a47b66603eb629a","name":"Li Tian-Le","org":"Nanjing Tech Univ, Coll Chem & Mol Engn, Nanjing 210000, Peoples R China","orgid":"5f71b3501c455f439fe42054"},{"id":"542dca57dabfae11fc4a131c","name":"Zhong Hui","org":"Nanjing Tech Univ, Coll Chem & Mol Engn, Nanjing 210000, Peoples R China","orgid":"5f71b3501c455f439fe42054"},{"name":"Li Xiao-Rong","org":"Huaiyin Normal Univ, Sch Chem & Chem Engn, Jiangsu Key Lab Chem Low Dimens Mat, Huaian 223300, Anhui, Peoples R China","orgid":"61e698686896273465736257"},{"id":"63d315418def4c1ab78d75c0","name":"Zhou Jing","org":"Xinjiang Agr Univ, Coll Food Sci & Pharm, Urumqi 830001, Peoples R China","orgid":"5f71b4471c455f439fe48e03"},{"id":"651d87ac8a47b61c50d36ab5","name":"Liu Yi-Xin","org":"Huaiyin Normal Univ, Sch Chem & Chem Engn, Jiangsu Key Lab Chem Low Dimens Mat, Huaian 223300, Anhui, Peoples R China","orgid":"61e698686896273465736257"},{"id":"562d169245ce1e596774346b","name":"Hu Wei-Cheng","org":"Huaiyin Normal Univ, Coll Life Sci, Huaian 223300, Anhui, Peoples R China","orgid":"61e698686896273465736257"},{"id":"6152217660a9652002078b25","name":"Cheng Zhi-Peng","org":"Huaiyin Normal Univ, Sch Chem & Chem Engn, Jiangsu Key Lab Chem Low Dimens Mat, Huaian 223300, Anhui, Peoples R China","orgid":"61e698686896273465736257"},{"id":"542e1764dabfae498ae2f69a","name":"Yao Cheng","org":"Nanjing Tech Univ, Coll Chem & Mol Engn, Nanjing 210000, Peoples R China","orgid":"5f71b3501c455f439fe42054"}]', '["materials chemistry","magnetic nanocomposites","emulsion polymerization","attapulgite","temperature-sensitive","targeted","drug delivery"]', '["材料化学","磁性纳米复合材料","乳液聚合法","凹凸棒土","温度响应","靶向性","药物输送"]', '{"name_zh":"无机化学学报","raw":"CHINESE JOURNAL OF INORGANIC CHEMISTRY"}', '1001-4861', '37', '1', 2021, NULL),
('61cace825244ab9dcb0a1963', '10.3969/j.issn.1008-021X.2021.04.085', 'Research on Integration of Specialty and Innovation of Material Chemistry', '材料化学课程专创融合实践研究', NULL, '专业教育和创新创业教育融合培养学生是当前高校培养人才的重要举措,本文以材料化学课程教学为研究对象,针对其教学手段单一、实验设计单调等问题,实施教学和考核方法改革,探索专业教学与创新创业融合过程中材料化学教学的新特点.', '[{"id":"6169056260a9656471ec8490","name_zh":"史洪伟","org_zh":"宿州学院","orgid":"5f71b8851c455f439fe602f8"},{"id":"62e8aabdd9f20422f0b89768","name_zh":"李发骏","org_zh":"宿州学院","orgid":"5f71b8851c455f439fe602f8"},{"id":"6152d73a60a965200208f7d0","name_zh":"王聪","org_zh":"宿州学院","orgid":"5f71b8851c455f439fe602f8"},{"id":"6170823160a965737d753930","name_zh":"卞振涛","org_zh":"宿州学院","orgid":"5f71b8851c455f439fe602f8"},{"name_zh":"李奉城","org_zh":"宿州学院","orgid":"5f71b8851c455f439fe602f8"},{"id":"64c98f5ce1382322dd9f8ba3","name_zh":"岳敏","org_zh":"宿州学院","orgid":"5f71b8851c455f439fe602f8"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","专业教育","创新创业","专创融合"]', '{"name_zh":"山东化工","raw":"Shandong Chemical Industry"}', '1008-021X', NULL, '4', 2021, 1),
('64cd74af3fda6d7f0686dd32', '10.3969/j.issn.1008-021X.2021.24.071', 'Development and Construction of Applied Curriculum Based on OBE Concept——Taking Material Chemistry Course as an Example', '基于OBE理念的应用型课程开发与建设——以《材料化学》课程为例', NULL, '国家相关政策推动了应用型人才的培养,而作为应用型人才培养的主体,应用型本科高校中课程的设置涉及到知识结构、能力结构和素质结构,是影响人才培养质量至关重要的因素.OBE(Outcom-Based Education)又称成果导向教育,是把学习成果当作导向的教育理念.该理念强调教育过程的逆向设计,并把学生的"学习产出"为导向,始终坚持学生为主体而开展教育活动的教育理念.适用于材料、化工等相关专业的,基于OBE理念的《材料化学》课程分别从课程目标、课程内容、课程实施到课程评价四个方面对现行课程体系进行改革,形成一套新的教学模式.', '[{"id":"633418112fedb730e3a3fdac","name":"Dang Liyun","name_zh":"党丽赟","org":"河南城建学院","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"name":"Xue Fei","name_zh":"薛飞","org":"河南城建学院","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"id":"53f42fc3dabfaee2a1c9aa56","name":"Hu Jiyong","name_zh":"胡继勇","org":"河南城建学院","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"name":"Zhang Qiao","name_zh":"张乔","org":"河南城建学院","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"id":"65d4add0c136ef13317b991a","name":"Sun Yunyun","name_zh":"孙云云","org":"河南城建学院","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"},{"id":"64d1fff7e1382366bc4bf162","name":"Wu Yuhuan","name_zh":"吴玉环","org":"河南城建学院","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"}]', '[]', '["OBE理念","材料化学","应用型课程"]', '{"name_zh":"山东化工","raw":"Shandong Chemical Industry"}', '1008-021X', '50', '24', 2021, NULL),
('64cd53173fda6d7f06503a4f', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.20.123', 'Teaching Practice of Materials Chemistry based on Function Orientation——Take "Microelectronic Materials" as an Example', '基于功能导向的材料化学教学实践——以"微电子材料"为例', NULL, '本文提出基于功能导向的材料化学教学方法,并以现代微电子技术的物质基础——"微电子材料"例,演绎电学功能材料的教学过程.通过基于功能导向的材料化学教学方法,了解功能材料的分类方式以及电功能材料的发展历程,深入了解微电子材料的应用领域与前沿科技,旨在帮助学生建立扎实专业理论基础的同时,培养同学的工程实践意识,促进同学深入了解材料化学相关应用与前沿科技,激发学习兴趣.', '[{"id":"53f4b3bedabfaedce5647cb2","name":"Ma Xuelu","name_zh":"马雪璐","org":"中国矿业大学（北京）","org_zh":"中国矿业大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b8c41c455f439fe60b8c"},{"name":"Yang Yue","name_zh":"杨越","org":"中国矿业大学（北京）","org_zh":"中国矿业大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b8c41c455f439fe60b8c"},{"name":"Xu Lemin","name_zh":"徐乐敏","org":"中国矿业大学（北京）","org_zh":"中国矿业大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b8c41c455f439fe60b8c"},{"name":"Ren Yongyu","name_zh":"任泳瑜","org":"北京智芯微电子科技有限公司安全传感事业部,北京100080","org_zh":"北京智芯微电子科技有限公司安全传感事业部,北京100080","orgid":"623317730a6eb1456047c88a"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","功能导向","微电子材料","产业应用","教学实践"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '48', '20', 2021, NULL),
('61cacfd35244ab9dcb22e86a', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.12.100', 'Exploration on the Reform of Undergraduate Tutorial System of Materials Chemistry under the Background of"Double Tops"', '"双一流"背景下材料化学本科生导师制的改革探讨与研究', NULL, '"双一流"高校建设时期,培养创新型人才成为各大高校最紧迫的任务,本科生导师制是国内外认可的提高本科生培养质量的模式,是各大高校教学研究的热点.本文介绍在"双一流"背景下南京邮电大学材料科学与工程学院的材料化学本科生导师制取得成效,讨论本科生导师制的目前的现状及存在的问题、提出改善措施促进本科生教学质量,从而为其他高校提供参考与借鉴.', '[{"id":"616fef4e6750f8784091c9f9","name_zh":"许利刚","org_zh":"南京邮电大学材料科学与工程学院,江苏南京210009","orgid":"5f71b4481c455f439fe48e8a"}]', NULL, '["本科生导师制","创新人才","教学改革","南京邮电大学","材料化学"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', NULL, '12', 2021, NULL),
('64cd53083fda6d7f0650278e', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.20.118', 'Brief Opinions on the Issues and Strategies in Bilingual Teaching of Material Chemistry', '浅谈材料化学双语教学问题与策略', NULL, '材料化学双语教学对培养具有国际视野、科研现代化的专业研究人才具有重要意义.最近几年双语教学实践中,我们发现还存在诸多问题需要探讨与改进,主要体现为学生课堂参与度不高的问题.本文从教材、教学手段与教育理念等多个角度提出增加学生学习兴趣的初步应对策略,期望能够为有效提高双语教学水平以及学生学习效率提供新思路.', '[{"name":"Ma Yun","name_zh":"马云","org":"南京邮电大学","org_zh":"南京邮电大学","orgid":"5f71b4481c455f439fe48e8a"},{"id":"64cf84e9a4a3eac765b7df3e","name":"Zhao Weiwei","name_zh":"赵为为","org":"南京邮电大学","org_zh":"南京邮电大学","orgid":"5f71b4481c455f439fe48e8a"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","双语教学","专业词汇","学习兴趣","教学互动","关键词"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '48', '20', 2021, NULL),
('64cd52fa3fda6d7f0650177e', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.21.104', 'Construction on Quality Monitoring and Assurance System for Material Chemistry Major Based on Major Assessment', '基于专业评估的材料化学专业质量监控和保障体系的构建', NULL, '专业质量监控和保障体系是专业评估中的一个重要组成部分.本文对材料化学专业评估质量监控和保障体系存在的一些不足进行分析,从材料化学专业校内专业质量监控和保障、校外专业实践教育质量监控和保障、专业监控信息反馈机制、专业思政教育保障人才培养措施等方面构建了适合本校材料化学专业的专业评估质量监控和保障体系.落实立德树人的根本任务,以提高学生科研创新和工程应用能力为核心,突出专业评估质量监控和保障体系的实践性和有效性.', '[{"id":"543108c6dabfae8cf2ee0de1","name":"Dong Qiujing","name_zh":"董秋静","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"name":"Luo Chunhua","name_zh":"罗春华","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"id":"62e8b459d9f20422f0bedd51","name":"Li Ruiqian","name_zh":"李瑞乾","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"id":"63afbc2b84ab04bd7fbcdb8f","name":"Jiang Guangpeng","name_zh":"姜广鹏","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"name":"Zhang Lin","name_zh":"张琳","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"}]', '[]', '["专业评估","材料化学","质量监控","质量保障","构建"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '48', '21', 2021, NULL),
('61cacf735244ab9dcb1ac74b', '10.16681/j.cnki.wcqe.202112002', NULL, '"双一流"建设背景下高校人才培养模式改革探索 ——以南昌航空大学材料化学专业为例', NULL, '文章以南昌航空大学材料化学专业为例,从立足立德树人,加强课程思政建设;聚焦"两性一度",提升学生创新创业能力;瞄准信息前沿,强化课程资源与教材建设;注重培养和引进,建设"双师型"教学团队四个方面探索了"双一流"建设背景下高校人才培养模式改革.', '[{"id":"5618b45b45ce1e5964116b88","name_zh":"陈德志","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"632462b4a36d2225e1f8b766","name_zh":"周丹","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"53f7b7bcdabfae8faa4abc34","name_zh":"谢宇","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6156439d60a96506679ede0b","name_zh":"钟荣","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"64f964498a47b671e9182546","name_zh":"董永全","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"53f43354dabfaee02acaaa94","name_zh":"樊攀峰","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6324a6aea36d2225e103867c","name_zh":"王芳","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"637aa30df789b382bea2a4e3","name_zh":"虞硕涵","org_zh":"南昌航空大学江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,江西 南昌,330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"}]', NULL, '["人才培养模式","\"双一流\"建设","材料化学专业"]', '{"name_zh":"西部素质教育","raw":"Western China Quality Education"}', '2095-6401', NULL, '12', 2021, NULL),
('61cacea95244ab9dcb0cd49f', '10.3969/j.issn.1001-9677.2021.10.072', 'Teaching Reform and Practice on Experiment of Materials Chemistry', '材料化学实验教学改革与实践', NULL, '以北华大学材料科学与工程学院材料化学专业为例,对材料化学专业实验教学改革与实践现状进行分析.提出强化理论认识,注重实用研究,优化实验资源,借助虚拟平台,发挥办学优势,打造专业特色等材料化学专业实验教学改革与实践措施,提高学生主观能动性、实验兴趣以及科研能力,培养学生探索精神.通过实验教学改革与实践,调动了学生的学习积极性,取得了较好的教学效果.', '[{"id":"560f7fc945ce1e5961c57a81","name_zh":"时君友","org_zh":"北华大学材料科学与工程学院,吉林 吉林 132013","orgid":"5f71b5c51c455f439fe53366"},{"id":"6165d7a860a9657b487046b8","name_zh":"徐文彪","org_zh":"北华大学材料科学与工程学院,吉林 吉林 132013","orgid":"5f71b5c51c455f439fe53366"},{"id":"6155f47860a96506679e6afa","name_zh":"李翔宇","org_zh":"北华大学材料科学与工程学院,吉林 吉林 132013","orgid":"5f71b5c51c455f439fe53366"},{"id":"63c609188def4c1ab779396a","name_zh":"张丹","org_zh":"北华大学材料科学与工程学院,吉林 吉林 132013","orgid":"5f71b5c51c455f439fe53366"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","实验教学","教学改革"]', '{"name_zh":"广州化工","raw":"Guangzhou Chemical Industry"}', '1001-9677', NULL, '10', 2021, 2),
('61cace825244ab9dcb0a182a', '10.3969/j.issn.1008-021X.2021.01.073', 'Construction of Engineering Education Platform for "Combination of Virtual and Real" of Material Chemistry Major in Local Colleges and Universities', '面向新工科理念的地方高校材料化学专业虚实结合工程教育平台构建', NULL, '面向新工科理念的工程教育改革,是地方本科高校实现向应用型转变,对地方产业转型升级和产业布局的迫切要求.从分析地方高校材料化学专业工程教育面临的困境人手,阐述和探讨了近年来在材料化学专业"虚实结合"工程教育平台的构建方面采取的举措与成效.', '[{"name_zh":"陈志国","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"6152142160a9652002076a0d","name_zh":"刘鑫","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"5615b62845cedb3397ad41dc","name_zh":"胡继林","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"5612465445cedb3397918c11","name_zh":"胡传跃","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","新工科理念","工程教育","虚实结合"]', '{"name_zh":"山东化工","raw":"Shandong Chemical Industry"}', '1008-021X', NULL, '1', 2021, NULL),
('61cacf555244ab9dcb1819da', '10.13804/j.cnki.2095-6991.2021.03.024', 'Ideological and Political Reform of Material Chemistry Progress Course (Bilingual )in Material Chemistry', '材料化学专业《材料化学进展(双语)》课程思政与建设改革', NULL, '以甘肃农业大学材料化学专业《材料化学进展(双语)》课为例,对思政教育与专业课同向同行、协同共进的建设内容进行探讨.利用课程改革平台,针对材料化学专业特点,将思想政治教育、参与式教学与知识传授有机融合,创新教学载体和教学方式,着力提升教学效果,为实现中华民族伟大复兴培养合格人才.', '[{"id":"6151502160a96555c0eaa524","name_zh":"徐玉梅","org_zh":"甘肃农业大学 理学院,甘肃 兰州 730070","orgid":"61e698836896273465736588"},{"id":"61560ab360a96506679e8a11","name_zh":"肖雯","org_zh":"甘肃农业大学 理学院,甘肃 兰州 730070","orgid":"61e698836896273465736588"},{"id":"61522dab60a965200207a9db","name_zh":"胡冰","org_zh":"甘肃农业大学 理学院,甘肃 兰州 730070","orgid":"61e698836896273465736588"},{"id":"6326cb8da95e4d1d054ee52a","name_zh":"巩海鹏","org_zh":"甘肃农业大学 理学院,甘肃 兰州 730070","orgid":"61e698836896273465736588"},{"id":"62e3b67ad9f2043704e82162","name_zh":"崔彦君","org_zh":"甘肃农业大学 理学院,甘肃 兰州 730070","orgid":"61e698836896273465736588"}]', NULL, '["思政教育","参与式教学","材料化学专业","课程教学改革"]', '{"name_zh":"兰州文理学院学报（自然科学版）","raw":"Journal of LanZhou University of Arts And Science (Natural Sciences Edition)"}', '2095-6991', NULL, '3', 2021, 4),
('61cacf735244ab9dcb1acf53', '10.19980/j.cn23-1593/g4.2021.15.034', NULL, '工程教育认证背景下材料化学专业产学研人才培养探索与实践', NULL, '从产学研学生专业实践育人、科技成果转化、应用型师资队伍建设和产学研校内实践中心建设四个方面,探索了工程教育认证背景下材料化学专业产学研育人模式,总结了材料化学专业产学研人才培养体系的建设成果.', '[{"id":"62e39a33d9f2043704d6e92e","name_zh":"王畅","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学 化学与材料工程学院,安徽 阜阳 236037","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"id":"543108c6dabfae8cf2ee0de1","name_zh":"董秋静","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学 化学与材料工程学院,安徽 阜阳 236037","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"name_zh":"罗春华","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学 化学与材料工程学院,安徽 阜阳 236037","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"id":"61503d0760a9651ea03e3383","name_zh":"张宏","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学 化学与材料工程学院,安徽 阜阳 236037","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"}]', NULL, '["产学研","材料化学","工程教育认证","人才培养"]', '{"name_zh":"高教学刊","raw":"Journal of Higher Education"}', '2096-000X', NULL, '15', 2021, 3),
('64cce3db3fda6d7f06b4ff98', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-8114.2021.23.038', 'Research on Cultivation Mode of Application-oriented Materials Chemistry Talents in Local Universities', '地方高校应用型材料化学人才培养模式研究', NULL, '新工科背景下,应用型人才培养是国家战略发展需求,如何提高基础相对薄弱的地方高校应用型人才培养质量是一项重要的研究课题.文章结合本校实际,从创新人才培养理念明确培养目标、构建应用型材料化学专业人才培养方案和课程体系以及建设双师型教师队伍等方面探究了我校应用型材料化学专业人才培养的模式.', '[{"name":"Liu Cheng","name_zh":"刘诚","org":"井冈山大学","org_zh":"井冈山大学","orgid":"5f71b4361c455f439fe4863e"},{"name":"Wang Wei","name_zh":"王玮","org":"井冈山大学","org_zh":"井冈山大学","orgid":"5f71b4361c455f439fe4863e"},{"name":"Li Yuntong","name_zh":"李云同","org":"井冈山大学","org_zh":"井冈山大学","orgid":"5f71b4361c455f439fe4863e"},{"id":"53f45424dabfaedf43603171","name":"Sui Yan","name_zh":"隋岩","org":"井冈山大学","org_zh":"井冈山大学","orgid":"5f71b4361c455f439fe4863e"}]', '[]', '["新工科","材料化学","应用型人才培养模式"]', '{"name_zh":"当代化工研究","raw":"Modern Chemical Research"}', '1672-8114', NULL, '23', 2021, NULL),
('64cd4f823fda6d7f064a8e3c', '10.13884/j.1003-3807hxjy.2021060109', 'Practice and Exploration of Ideological and Political Education in Material Chemistry Course:Taking Section of"Common Metal Materials"as Example', '材料化学课程思政的探索与实践——以"常见金属材料"为例', NULL, '以"金属材料"中的"常见金属材料"为例,从教学内容和教学评价2个方面探讨了材料化学课程的思政教学.从铝合金、铜合金、钢铁等几种常见金属材料的生产、应用等方面将教学内容与思政元素有机融合,在教学评价中融入思政教育,增强学生的创新创业意识、环境保护意识、资源保护意识、民族自豪感和社会责任感,践行"立德树人"的教育理念.', '[{"id":"53f462aedabfaeee22a45f6e","name":"CAO Man-Li","name_zh":"曹曼丽","org":"广东第二师范学院化学与材料科学学院 广东广州 510303","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学与材料科学学院 广东广州 510303","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"62e8b591d9f20422f0bfee45","name":"LIU Wen-Ting","name_zh":"刘文婷","org":"广东第二师范学院化学与材料科学学院 广东广州 510303","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学与材料科学学院 广东广州 510303","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"62e8b82bd9f20422f0c25d2e","name":"ZHANG Xiu-Lian","name_zh":"张秀莲","org":"广东第二师范学院化学与材料科学学院 广东广州 510303","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学与材料科学学院 广东广州 510303","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","课程思政","金属材料","硬币"]', '{"name_zh":"化学教育","raw":"Chinese Journal of Chemical Education"}', '1003-3807', '42', '24', 2021, 4),
('61cacea85244ab9dcb0cc4ea', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-8114.2021.02.046', 'Application of Material Chemistry in Aerospace', '基于材料化学在航天中的应用', NULL, '对于航空行业来说,航空材料是行业发展的基础.机身的材料和发动机的材料是整个航天器中最重要的结构,因此对于航班的飞行安全与各方面性能起着重要的作用.航空结构材料的特点是强度高,质量轻,可靠性高.飞行器作为一个整体,还需要一些极为精密的材料,这对于材料的发展提出了更高的要求.在这些高质量材料的研发过程中,离不开材料化学,不但可以使得所具备出的材料符合标准要求,还可以降低成本,提高航天器的质量.', '[{"id":"62e39576d9f2043704d42c35","name_zh":"汪洪波","org_zh":"湖北大学知行学院","orgid":"5f71b4661c455f439fe49b15"},{"id":"616719dd60a9656471e9a0dd","name_zh":"祝媛媛","org_zh":"湖北大学知行学院","orgid":"5f71b4661c455f439fe49b15"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","航天","应用"]', '{"name_zh":"当代化工研究","raw":"Modern Chemical Research"}', '1672-8114', NULL, '2', 2021, NULL),
('61cace825244ab9dcb0a12b4', '10.19319/j.cnki.issn.1008-021x.2021.12.074', 'Introducing an Experiment for Material Chemistry Specialty-Synthesis of Ag nanowires', '介绍一个材料化学专业实验—Ag纳米线的制备', NULL, '将最新的科研成果引进课堂代替陈旧的老实验有利于开阔学生的视野,激发学生的学习兴趣.本文介绍了一个以最新文献为基础设计的材料化学实验.该实验以乙二醇为溶剂、乙二醇和安息香为还原剂、PVP和Br为盖帽剂制备超细Ag纳米线.通过该实验不但可以使学生掌握氮气保护装置、移液枪和高速离心机的使用,而且可以使学生进一步熟悉关于晶体结构的知识.', '[{"id":"540839b2dabfae44f087247e","name_zh":"李芬芬","org_zh":"南阳师范学院化学与制药工程学院,河南南阳473061","orgid":"5f71b6e71c455f439fe5b3bf"},{"id":"53f4545cdabfaee02ad5136b","name_zh":"罗保民","org_zh":"南阳师范学院化学与制药工程学院,河南南阳473061","orgid":"5f71b6e71c455f439fe5b3bf"}]', NULL, '["材料化学专业","实验教学","纳米线","银"]', '{"name_zh":"山东化工","raw":"Shandong Chemical Industry"}', '1008-021X', NULL, '12', 2021, NULL),
('61cacede5244ab9dcb106c55', '10.3969/j.issn.2096-8566.2021.01.019', 'Exploration and Practice of Integrating Ideological and Political into the Courses of Document Retrieval and Professional Experiments of Material Chemistry', '课堂思政融入材料化学文献检索与专业实验课程中的探索与实践', NULL, '在材料化学文献检索与专业实验课程教学过程中结合化学类课程的实际情况,巧妙地植入一些课堂思政元素,如责任感、团队意识、家国情怀、创新意识和工匠精神以及生态环境保护意识等.因此,可以实现传授知识的同时进行品德教育,达到德育"润物细无声"的效果,为社会培养德才兼备的新时代人才.', '[{"id":"615589cf60a96506679df46b","name_zh":"徐海涛","org_zh":"南昌航空大学 江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,南昌 330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"632462b4a36d2225e1f8b766","name_zh":"周丹","org_zh":"南昌航空大学 江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,南昌 330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"53f7b7bcdabfae8faa4abc34","name_zh":"谢宇","org_zh":"南昌航空大学 江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,南昌 330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"62e39bd9d9f2043704d7f2c1","name_zh":"胡斌","org_zh":"南昌航空大学 江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,南昌 330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6379cc91f789b382be9cd3bb","name_zh":"童永芬","org_zh":"南昌航空大学 江西省持久性污染物控制与资源化重点实验室,南昌 330063","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"}]', NULL, '["课堂思政","文献检索","材料化学专业实验","教学改革","德育"]', '{"name_zh":"南昌航空大学学报（自然科学版）","raw":"Journal of Nanchang Hangkong University(Natural Sciences)"}', '1001-4926', NULL, '1', 2021, 1),
('61cacf645244ab9dcb196fc3', NULL, 'Exploration on Training Model of Postgraduates in Material Chemistry under the Background of "Emerging Engineering Education"', '"新工科"视域下材料化学硕士研究生培养模式的探索', NULL, '"新工科"背景下,对武汉科技大学材料化学专业硕士研究生培养存在的问题进行了思考,从入学体系、课程设置及教学体系、导师制培养、科研能力培养措施、双向评价体系等方面分析并探索了材料化学硕士研究生培养模式.这对把握"新工科"建设的内涵,统筹考虑"新的工科专业、工科的新要求",加快培养新兴领域高层次人才具有参考价值.', '[{"id":"63cae02fa777852dcea1d2f9","name_zh":"陈辉","org_zh":"武汉科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4011c455f439fe46ebb"},{"id":"6155976e60a96506679e0526","name_zh":"赵雷","org_zh":"武汉科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4011c455f439fe46ebb"},{"id":"60ade5f09e795ee5472ff4bf","name_zh":"姜婷婷","org_zh":"武汉科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4011c455f439fe46ebb"},{"id":"561719fa45cedb3397bbbc4f","name_zh":"何漩","org_zh":"武汉科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4011c455f439fe46ebb"},{"id":"64bde8e9ede217000102816e","name_zh":"方伟","org_zh":"武汉科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4011c455f439fe46ebb"}]', NULL, '["新工科","材料化学专业","硕士研究生培养模式"]', '{"name_zh":"教育教学论坛","raw":"jiaoyu jiaoxue luntan"}', '1674-9324', NULL, '21', 2021, 2),
('61cacea95244ab9dcb0cda55', '10.3969/j.issn.1001-9677.2021.04.039', 'Comprehensive Materials Chemistry Experiment of Ceramic Preparation and Characterization', '陶瓷的制备及表征综合性材料化学专业实验', NULL, '陶瓷的制备及表征实验内容丰富,实验过程直观,实验结果具有较强的观赏性.作为材料化学综合性大实验项目,通过釉料配方计算设计、陶瓷成型、高温烧结等实验环节,可以将直观的实验过程与抽象的理论知识有机地结合起来,有助于学生理解多元相图概念,建立固相反应的相变模型,深入领会晶体结构与性能的关系.同时,通过实验中的技能训练,培养学生工艺设计能力,提高学生发现问题、分析问题和解决问题的综合素质.', '[{"id":"616bab3160a9656471f11fe7","name_zh":"李山鹰","org_zh":"河南城建学院","orgid":"61e69b77689627346573ce9c"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","陶瓷","釉料配方设计","烧结"]', '{"name_zh":"广州化工","raw":"Guangzhou Chemical Industry"}', '1001-9677', NULL, '4', 2021, NULL),
('61cacea85244ab9dcb0cc2cd', '10.16597/j.cnki.issn.1002-154x.2021.05.018', NULL, '工程教育认证背景下材料化学专业暑假小学期的教学内容设计', NULL, '工程教育认证的标准为材料化学专业培养高素质复合型人才指明了方向.本文结合工程教育认证背景下鲁东大学材料化学专业暑假小学期教学内容设置,从专业人才培养的目标出发,提出具体的教学内容设计和建议,从而达到拓展学生专业视野、加强学生实践体验、促进学生创新能力提高的目的 ,使得本专业学生能更好地满足社会需求.', '[{"id":"615298ad60a9652002088e5d","name_zh":"徐强","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"},{"name_zh":"王颖","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"},{"name_zh":"王峰","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"},{"name_zh":"徐彦宾","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"},{"id":"53f6328ddabfae3d619bf128","name_zh":"殷平","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"},{"id":"63cfc99e8def4c1ab7887f46","name_zh":"张少华","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"},{"name_zh":"杨正龙","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"},{"id":"6165736760a9657b486facc5","name_zh":"刘希光","org_zh":"鲁东大学化学与材料科学学院,山东烟台264025","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d9a9"}]', NULL, '["工程教育认证","材料化学","暑假小学期","教学内容设计"]', '{"name_zh":"化工时刊","raw":"Chemical Industry Times"}', '1002-154X', NULL, '5', 2021, NULL),
('61cacf3f5244ab9dcb16c7d8', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-4305.2021.05.050', 'Research on the responsibility and qualities of instrument management teachers in material chemistry colleges and universities', '材料化学类院校仪器管理人员的责任与素质', NULL, '材料化学类院校大型仪器设备是衡量学校办学规模的重要指标, 同时也是学校开展教学科研工作的重要支撑.具备高素质和高水平的仪器设备管理人员是提高大型仪器设备使用效率的重要保障.对材料化学类院校大型仪器管理人员的岗位职责和应该具备的基本素质进行了阐述和总结, 希望能给兄弟院校大型仪器管理队伍的建设提供借鉴作用.', '[{"id":"616feeab6750f81b6d5f3589","name_zh":"王韦刚","org_zh":"南京邮电大学 材料科学与工程学院, 江苏 南京 210023","orgid":"5f71b4481c455f439fe48e8a"},{"id":"616c850560a9656471f2da8b","name_zh":"涂真珍","org_zh":"南京邮电大学 材料科学与工程学院, 江苏 南京 210023","orgid":"5f71b4481c455f439fe48e8a"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","大型仪器","责任","素质"]', '{"name_zh":"实验室科学","raw":"Laboratory Science"}', '1672-4305', NULL, '5', 2021, 1),
('61cacfd35244ab9dcb22e861', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.12.096', 'Exploration of Ideological and Political Education Innovation in the Professional Basic Course"Physical Chemistry of Materials"', '专业基础课《材料物理化学》思政教改探索', NULL, '高校教师在工作中应时刻坚持以"立德树人"为教学目标.《材料物理化学》作为我校材料化学专业的必修课程,对本科生专业素质的培养起着重要作用.教师在传授书本知识的同时,还应意识到对学生进行思政教育的重要性.本文从课程的学习内容出发,结合我国思政教育的方针政策,深入挖掘课程中所包含的思政元素,以期为相关专业教师的课程思政教改提供参考思路.', '[{"id":"63dd5eb8a777852dcebb2fbc","name_zh":"张国芳","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学材料与冶金学院(稀土学院),内蒙古包头014010","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"id":"53f43959dabfaee0d9b80d0d","name_zh":"蔡颖","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学材料与冶金学院(稀土学院),内蒙古包头014010","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"id":"616098dd60a9657b4869a303","name_zh":"胡锋","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学材料与冶金学院(稀土学院),内蒙古包头014010","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"id":"6163a3d060a9657b486dcfdb","name_zh":"许剑轶","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学材料与冶金学院(稀土学院),内蒙古包头014010","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"}]', NULL, '["材料物理化学","思政教育","教学改革","本科教育","材料化学"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', NULL, '12', 2021, 4),
('64ce127c3fda6d7f0681417e', NULL, NULL, '材料化学的应用与发展研究', NULL, '近年来,我国科学技术的发展随着社会经济的快速发展也在不断进步,尤其在化工领域,越来越多地使用到材料化学,应用范围越来越广泛.应用材料化学可以有效提升能源的利用效率,并且可以极大地提升生产产品的竞争力,在推动我国经济发展中起着举足轻重的作用.本文根据当前材料化学的发展现状,对材料化学未来的发展趋势进行研究,希望可以为相关业内人士提供参考,推动我国材料化学的发展.', '[{"name_zh":"乔善博","org_zh":"辽宁工程招标公司,辽宁 沈阳 110000"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","化工行业","应用","发展趋势"]', '{"name_zh":"商情","raw":"Shangqing"}', '2694-6114', NULL, '24', 2021, NULL),
('64cd311a3fda6d7f061babc3', NULL, 'Training Model of International Innovative and Composite Talents:Taking the Material Chemistry Majors Minoring in English in Local Universities as an Example', '国际化融合型创新人才培养模式的思考——以地方高校材料化学辅修英语专业为例', NULL, '随着"一带一路"倡议与"双一流"学科建设的实施,国际交流与合作进一步深入,需要培养大量既具有相关学科知识,又有较强英语能力的复合型人才.然而,目前地方高校英语教育还不能满足"一带一路"经济发展与用人单位对人才的多层次需求.以材料化学辅修英语专业为例,对地方高校国际化融合型创新人才培养模式进行改革与探索,探讨"E+"一体国际化人才培养的内容框架、逻辑理念与实施方法,建立专业运行管理模式,提高教学效果与质量,培养国际化融合型创新人才,实现材料化学与英语专业的真正融合,更好地为我国及区域经济社会发展服务.', '[{"name":"LIU Fan","name_zh":"刘凡","org":"武汉工程大学","org_zh":"武汉工程大学","orgid":"5f71b4c91c455f439fe4c861"},{"name":"YAN Guo-ping","name_zh":"鄢国平","org":"武汉工程大学","org_zh":"武汉工程大学","orgid":"5f71b4c91c455f439fe4c861"},{"name":"CHEN Si","name_zh":"陈思","org":"武汉工程大学","org_zh":"武汉工程大学","orgid":"5f71b4c91c455f439fe4c861"}]', '[]', '["材料化学辅修英语专业","国际化","融合型创新人才培养模式"]', '{"name_zh":"教育教学论坛","raw":"jiaoyu jiaoxue luntan"}', '1674-9324', NULL, '51', 2021, NULL),
('61caced15244ab9dcb0f86af', '10.16039/j.cnki.cn22-1249.2021.08.011', 'The Practice and Thinking of the Contribution of the Second Class of Scientific Research to the Course Reform of Material Chemistry', '科研第二课堂助力《材料化学》课程改革的实践与思考', NULL, '随着新材料时代的不断发展与进步,高校专业课现有教学过程中存在的内容老化、学科交叉与融合不够深入等问题逐渐突显.本学年以科研第二课堂的形式对《材料化学》课程的教学内容及教学方式进行了改革,将科学前沿知识与授课内容相结合的同时为学生提供了开放科研实验平台,并对改革实践进行了总结与思考.', '[{"id":"63c6699ea777852dce9ba609","name":"WANG Shan","name_zh":"王珊","org":"吉林化工学院","org_zh":"吉林化工学院","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d8c4"}]', '[]', '["科研第二课堂","课程改革","材料化学"]', '{"name_zh":"Journal of Jilin Institute of Chemical Technology","raw":"Journal of Jilin Institute of Chemical Technology"}', '1007-2853', '38', '8', 2021, 1),
('61cacea95244ab9dcb0cd4ed', '10.3969/j.issn.1004-275X.2021.02.71', 'Research Course Construction of Materials Chemistry under the Background of Provincial First-class Specialty:Taking Jinling Institute of Technology as an Example', '省级一流专业背景下《材料化学》研究性课程建设 ——以金陵科技学院为例', NULL, '《材料化学》是材料科学与工程省级一流专业的一门重要基础课程.以金陵科技学院为例,从材料化学课程教学大纲修订、网络平台建设、案例化教学、前沿技术引入、开放实验设置、考核方式优化等多个方面,对材料化学研究性课程的建设进行了实践探索.通过研究性课程建设,本课程的教学及实践取得了较好的效果,为省一流专业人才培养起到了重要作用.', '[{"id":"62e39751d9f2043704d560b2","name_zh":"王威","org_zh":"金陵科技学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9a"},{"id":"63249849a36d2225e1010328","name_zh":"梁栋","org_zh":"金陵科技学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9a"},{"id":"6162386160a9657b486be90d","name_zh":"叶原丰","org_zh":"金陵科技学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9a"},{"id":"5617725045cedb3397bf6b82","name_zh":"赵毅杰","org_zh":"金陵科技学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9a"},{"id":"53f43586dabfaee2a1cdf0ad","name_zh":"林青","org_zh":"金陵科技学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9a"},{"id":"6165f52460a9657b48708688","name_zh":"郝凌云","org_zh":"金陵科技学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9a"},{"id":"615348f660a965200209b208","name_zh":"张小娟","org_zh":"金陵科技学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9a"}]', NULL, '["省一流专业","材料科学与工程","材料化学","研究性课程","课程建设"]', '{"name_zh":"云南化工","raw":"Yunnan Chemical Technology"}', '1004-275X', NULL, '2', 2021, NULL),
('64cd52f93fda6d7f0650164d', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.16.115', 'Research on the Construction of the "Four Combinations" Material Chemistry Practice Model', '"四结合"的材料化学专业实习模式的构建研究', NULL, '针对材料化学专业传统实习模式存在的问题,构建并实施了"四结合"的实习模式.具体包括:实习与就业相结合、实习与毕业设计相结合、集中实习与分散实习相结合、实习考核与实习监控相结合.简要探讨了"四结合"的实习模式实施的作用和效果.该模式构建从学生出发兼顾企业需求,对实现学校、学生、企业和教师的多赢局面具有重要的理论和实践意义.', '[{"id":"64cff083e1382323550d70d3","name":"Chen Xiudong","name_zh":"陈修栋","org":"江西省生态化工工程技术研究中心","org_zh":"江西省生态化工工程技术研究中心"},{"id":"6373ac23ec88d95668d95d1b","name":"Liu Jinhang","name_zh":"刘金杭","org":"江西省生态化工工程技术研究中心","org_zh":"江西省生态化工工程技术研究中心"},{"id":"6160b2a360a9657b4869d81f","name":"Yan Ping","name_zh":"严平","org":"九江学院","org_zh":"九江学院","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"id":"53f45d6ddabfaee0d9c0d750","name":"Zhan Changchao","name_zh":"占昌朝","org":"九江学院","org_zh":"九江学院","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"name":"Wang Yawei","name_zh":"汪亚威","org":"九江学院","org_zh":"九江学院","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"id":"62e4bc17d9f204418d70eb0f","name":"Huang Huanan","name_zh":"黄华南","org":"九江学院","org_zh":"九江学院","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"id":"64d2fa90b2c670017457cff1","name":"Cao Xiaohua","name_zh":"曹小华","org":"江西省生态化工工程技术研究中心","org_zh":"江西省生态化工工程技术研究中心"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","应用型","多赢","实习模式","\"四结合\""]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '48', '16', 2021, NULL);

——以碳材料和单质硅为例', NULL, '"材料化学"为材料科学与工程专业的专业核心课之一,在该课程中合理地融入课程思政,具有很大的必要性和重要性.本文以"材料化学"课程中的碳材料和单质硅这部分教学内容为例,以课程思政为导向,结合互动式教学、引导式教学、研教相融等多种教学方式,借助多媒体与丰富的网络资源,进行了教案设计.通过本教案的展示与分析,探究在工科专业课程中合理融入课程思政元素的方式,使学生在学习专业知识的同时,培养学生的爱国主义精神、家国情怀和民族自豪感,激发学生不畏艰难、追求真理的科学精神,培养学生的辩证唯物主义思想观及可持续发展意识.本文相关探究对工科专业课的课程思政教育具有一定的启发和借鉴意义.', '[{"name":"LIANG Ping","name_zh":"梁萍","org":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020","org_zh":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020"},{"name":"CHEN Yan","name_zh":"陈岩","org":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020","org_zh":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020"},{"name":"ZHANG Chi","name_zh":"张弛","org":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020","org_zh":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020"},{"name":"HE Xin","name_zh":"何鑫","org":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020","org_zh":"五邑大学应用与材料学院 广东·江门 529020"}]', '[]', '["课程思政","案例设计","材料化学","工科专业"]', '{"name_zh":"科教导刊","raw":"The Guide of Science & Education"}', '1674-6813', NULL, '33', 2021, NULL),
('61cacf755244ab9dcb1b0477', '10.3969/j.issn.1000-6168.2021.03.010', 'Construction and Practice of Applied Talents Training Mode for Material Chemistry Major in Local Universities under the Background of New Engineering', '新工科背景下地方本科高校材料化学专业应用型人才培养模式的构建与实践', NULL, '协同育人是地方本科高校推进新工科建设、开展高素质应用型人才培养工作的必然选择.九江学院结合材料工程类专业认证的要求,坚持产教融合、学生中心、结果导向、持续改进的指导原则,构建并实施了新工科背景下材料化学专业"产-联-研-赛-训"的"五位一体"应用型人才培养模式,取得了良好的成效.', '[{"id":"6373459aec88d95668d668a7","name_zh":"王春风","org_zh":"九江学院化学与环境工程学院,江西九江332005","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"id":"53f45d6ddabfaee0d9c0d750","name_zh":"占昌朝","org_zh":"九江学院化学与环境工程学院,江西九江332005","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"id":"64d2fa90b2c670017457cff1","name_zh":"曹小华","org_zh":"九江学院化学与环境工程学院,江西九江332005","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"id":"6160b2a360a9657b4869d81f","name_zh":"严平","org_zh":"九江学院化学与环境工程学院,江西九江332005","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"name_zh":"汪亚威","org_zh":"九江学院化学与环境工程学院,江西九江332005","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"},{"id":"64cff083e1382323550d70d3","name_zh":"陈修栋","org_zh":"九江学院化学与环境工程学院,江西九江332005","orgid":"5f71b2931c455f439fe3cced"}]', NULL, '["新工科","材料化学","人才培养模式","构建与实践"]', '{"name_zh":"化工高等教育","raw":"Higher Education in Chemical Engineering"}', '1000-6168', NULL, '3', 2021, 6),
('61cacea45244ab9dcb0c9ea8', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.18.092', 'Exploration and Practice on Ideological and Political Education in Teaching of Materials Chemistry Course', '课程思政在材料化学教学中的探索与实践', NULL, '为了贯彻落实高校立德树人的根本任务,应当将思想政治教育贯穿教育教学的全过程.本文以材料化学课程为例,将思政元素融入到专业课的讲授中,从爱国奉献精神、执着求实精神及协同创新精神等方面介绍了课程教学中思政元素的挖掘.实现专业知识与思想政治教育的有机统一,在传授知识的同时,引导学生树立正确的世界观、人生观与价值观.', '[{"id":"63ae25e05e15bc6fe4ecf7f1","name_zh":"赵鑫","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"id":"53f43959dabfaee0d9b80d0d","name_zh":"蔡颖","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"id":"616098dd60a9657b4869a303","name_zh":"胡锋","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"id":"65028ae5ea10f8257b351da4","name_zh":"宋金玲","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"name_zh":"辛国祥","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"},{"id":"63da1b15a777852dceb6b722","name_zh":"关丽丽","org_zh":"内蒙古科技大学","orgid":"5f71b8aa1c455f439fe606aa"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","思政教育","教学改革","立德树人","全面发展"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', NULL, '18', 2021, 7),
('64cd533b3fda6d7f06506e0d', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.19.125', 'Research on the Cultivation System of Innovative and Entrepreneurial Talents in Universities with Characteristics of Petrochemical Industry', '石化行业特色高校创新创业人才培养体系的研究', NULL, '针对石油化工行业特色高校学生科技创新对专业知识要求高、创业思维固化与创业素质教育理念落后等难题,本文从双创教育改革的角度对于以上问题进行系统研究.提出石化行业高校在办学理念、学科建设、人才培养、持续保障体制等多方面紧密结合行业特色,发挥行业优势,为石化行业培养科技创新型人才提供理论依据,为石化行业输送高素质的人才奠定基础.', '[{"name":"Li Ning","name_zh":"李宁","org":"常州大学","org_zh":"常州大学","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce60"},{"id":"650e18c3768b11dc72a0ea93","name":"Wang Luyao","name_zh":"王璐瑶","org":"常州大学","org_zh":"常州大学","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce60"},{"id":"63247498a36d2225e1fb4bf5","name":"Yin Peng","name_zh":"殷鹏","org":"常州大学","org_zh":"常州大学","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce60"},{"name":"Feng Keyu","name_zh":"冯苛玉","org":"常州大学","org_zh":"常州大学","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce60"},{"name":"Huang Shaojuan","name_zh":"黄少娟","org":"常州大学","org_zh":"常州大学","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce60"},{"id":"542da4b4dabfae48d123b542","name":"Li Jinchun","name_zh":"李锦春","org":"常州大学","org_zh":"常州大学","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce60"}]', '[]', '["石油化工行业","创新创业","双创教育","材料化学","高分子材料","人才培养"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '48', '19', 2021, NULL),
('6491a3c1d68f896efa8dca1d', '10.3969/j.issn.1000-6168.2021.06.013', 'Integrative Development of Theoretical and Experimental Curriculum for Material Structure and Performance', '材料结构与性能理论和实验课程的融合发展', NULL, '专业课程是面向高年级学生开设的高阶课程,旨在培养学生的综合能力、创新能力及专业知识应用能力,理论课程与实践课程的融合发展是提升学生综合应用能力的关键.文章针对材料化学专业与实践课程体系建设,介绍了以材料结构与性能课程和材料化学专业实验课程为核心,以材料结构与性能之间的关系为主线而构建的"特色鲜明、线上线下、科教融合、创新实践"的理论与实践课程融合发展的教学体系,该体系的建设为一流专业建设奠定了基础.', '[{"id":"543346dcdabfaeb4c6ab4371","name":"Han Xia","name_zh":"韩霞","org":"华东理工大学","org_zh":"华东理工大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e37c"},{"id":"54334715dabfaeb4c6ab44f7","name":"Liu Xiaohui","name_zh":"刘晓晖","org":"华东理工大学","org_zh":"华东理工大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e37c"},{"name":"Cao Xiaoming","name_zh":"曹宵鸣","org":"华东理工大学","org_zh":"华东理工大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e37c"},{"id":"62e380bed9f2043704c773e5","name":"Liu Huihui","name_zh":"刘慧慧","org":"华东理工大学","org_zh":"华东理工大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e37c"},{"id":"543343f6dabfaeb43f2a8056","name":"Wang Yanqin","name_zh":"王艳芹","org":"华东理工大学","org_zh":"华东理工大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e37c"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","课程建设","专业实验","教学实践"]', '{"name_zh":"化工高等教育","raw":"Higher Education in Chemical Engineering"}', '1000-6168', '38', '6', 2021, NULL),
('61cacea95244ab9dcb0cda74', '10.3969/j.issn.1001-9677.2021.04.048', 'Application of Flipped Classroom Teaching Mode in Basic Theory of Material Chemistry', '翻转课堂在《材料化学基础》课程教学中的应用', NULL, '《材料化学基础》 是材料科学与工程专业一门重要的本科生基础理论课程.本文分析了 《材料化学基础》 传统教学模式存在的弊端,基于该课程的性质和特点,引入翻转课堂教学模式,通过课前学生自主学习、课堂上教师组织引导和答疑解惑以及课后学生知识内化过程,对传统教学模式进行改革.这种改革能增加学生在教学中的参与度,激发学生的学习主动性,培养学生自主学习的能力,使教学效果和质量得到显著提高.', '[{"id":"63c35729a777852dce976f58","name_zh":"刘艳丽","org_zh":"湖南大学","orgid":"5f71b2ae1c455f439fe3d7a3"}]', NULL, '["材料化学基础","教学模式","翻转课堂","教学设计"]', '{"name_zh":"广州化工","raw":"Guangzhou Chemical Industry"}', '1001-9677', NULL, '4', 2021, NULL),
('61cacea85244ab9dcb0cc356', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-8114.2021.09.060', 'Teaching Research and Practice of Comprehensive Experiment of Material Chemistry Course Based on the Cultivation of Innovation and Entrepreneurship Ability', '《材料化学综合实验》课程创新创业教育研究与实践', NULL, '国家对加强创新创业教育提出要求,明确专业教育要与创新创业教育有机融合.作为材料化学专业的核心课程,对《材料化学综合实验》课程进行创新创业教育改革与建设非常必要.针对传统实验教学存在的创新创业教育问题,我们在教学方法、教学内容、考核方式、学习困难学生帮扶等方面进行改革,探索出切实可行的实施方法,并取得了良好的教学效果.', '[{"id":"53f7b7bcdabfae8faa4abc34","name_zh":"谢宇","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6156439d60a96506679ede0b","name_zh":"钟荣","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"53f43354dabfaee02acaaa94","name_zh":"樊攀峰","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"637a389cf789b382be9fc084","name_zh":"许秋华","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6379cc91f789b382be9cd3bb","name_zh":"童永芬","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"}]', NULL, '["材料化学综合实验","创新创业教育","改革与建设","切实可行的方法"]', '{"name_zh":"当代化工研究","raw":"Modern Chemical Research"}', '1672-8114', NULL, '9', 2021, NULL),
('64cd53193fda6d7f06503d62', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.06.130', 'Design of Test Question Type for Professional English of Materials Chemistry', '材料化学专业英语课程考核的题型设计探索', NULL, '当前对专业英语的考核大多采取翻译等常见题型,这种方式过于单一,不易激发学生的兴趣.在近几年的材料化学专业英语教学改革实践中,我们对课程考核的题型设计进行了深入探索,比如,我们合理选取了学术期刊中的综述论文内容,在参考四六级和考研的部分阅读题型的基础上对所选取内容进行改编.此外还用归类法的思想进行了题型设计.通过这些题型设计,不仅能有效检测学生的学习效果,而且能实现在“考中学”的目的,让学生了解专业的研究前沿,同时也能提高学生在相关考试中的应试能力.', '[{"id":"63afbc2b84ab04bd7fbcdb8f","name":"Jiang Guangpeng","name_zh":"姜广鹏","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"id":"62e8b459d9f20422f0bedd51","name":"Li Ruiqian","name_zh":"李瑞乾","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"id":"543108c6dabfae8cf2ee0de1","name":"Dong Qiujing","name_zh":"董秋静","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"name":"Luo Chunhua","name_zh":"罗春华","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"},{"name":"Zhang Lin","name_zh":"张琳","org":"阜阳师范大学","org_zh":"阜阳师范大学","orgid":"5f71b88f1c455f439fe603c9"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","专业英语","考核","题型设计","阅读"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '48', '6', 2021, NULL),
('61cacea45244ab9dcb0cb2b0', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.06.098', 'Probe on the Theoretical and Practical Teaching of "Modern Testing Methods of Materials Course" for Applied Undergraduates', '应用型本科《材料现代测试方法.》课程理论与实践教学探讨', NULL, '本文分析了“新工科”背景下我校材料化学专业《材料现代测试方法》理论及实验课的教学现状.结合笔者讲授该课程的教学实践体会,有针对性地提出了在教学内容、教学模式、教学手段和成绩考核评定等几方面所做的一些教学改革与实践措施,并对如何激发学生对该课程的学习兴趣,提升本科课程教学质量进行了相关探讨.', '[{"name_zh":"朱丽丽","org_zh":"长江师范学院","orgid":"5f71b3f21c455f439fe467c3"},{"id":"63e271218def4c1ab7a7b4fd","name_zh":"董君","org_zh":"长江师范学院","orgid":"5f71b3f21c455f439fe467c3"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","材料现代测试方法","教学改革","理论与实践"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', NULL, '6', 2021, 3),
('61cacf675244ab9dcb19c1ba', NULL, NULL, '"模块化"混合式教学在《材料化学导论》课程中的应用探讨', NULL, '在探索新时代人才培养模式的教育背景下,将教学实践经验与现代化信息教育技术相结合,对《材料化学导论》课程进行"模块化"设置,并配套不同的混合教学方式,以提高授课质量和教学成果.', '[{"name_zh":"李绮","org_zh":"辽宁大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e352"},{"id":"654a5c4550dee4c4229e03f2","name_zh":"冯小庚","org_zh":"辽宁大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e352"},{"id":"5611149c45ce1e59626109f4","name_zh":"于海彪","org_zh":"辽宁大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e352"},{"id":"6325f303293b827d8579dc0a","name_zh":"王月娇","org_zh":"辽宁大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e352"},{"id":"5611149d45ce1e5962610a48","name_zh":"单炜军","org_zh":"辽宁大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e352"}]', NULL, '["模块化","材料化学导论","翻转课堂","混合式教学"]', '{"name_zh":"科教导刊-电子版（下旬）","raw":"The Guide of Science & Education"}', '1674-6813', NULL, '8', 2021, NULL),
('62a8601b5aee126c0f2d9486', '10.3969/j.issn.1003-5001.2021.26.034', NULL, '浅谈材料化学在生活中的应用研究', NULL, '材料化学是由材料学、化学和工程学等集合而成的、在人们日常生活中经常用到的一门学科,影响着人们衣、食、住、行的各个方面.本文首先对材料化学相关定义进行阐述,将其分成四大类,并对其在生物、电子信息、环境和能源以及结构材料等应用领域进行分析,最后对其未来应用研究发展方向进行预测,研究结果对帮助普通群众了解材料化学、推动材料化学发展具有一定参考价值.', '[{"name_zh":"何涛","org_zh":"池州学院材料与环境工程学院","orgid":"61e69d5b6896273465741514"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","分类","应用","发展方向"]', '{"name_zh":"人生与伴侣","raw":"Life & Lover"}', NULL, NULL, '26', 2021, NULL),
('64cd530b3fda6d7f06502c06', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2021.02.118', 'Application and Exploration of Mind Map in the Theoretical Teaching of Material Chemistry', '思维导图在材料化学理论教学中的应用与探索', NULL, '思维导图是具有可视化及灵活发散特点的学习辅助工具,可以帮助学生构建知识网络.通过分析材料化学课程知识体系的特点,将思维导图引入材料化学的理论教学,有助于课程内容的优化关联,可以达到提高教学效果和教学质量的目的.', '[{"id":"53f4b3bedabfaedce5647cb2","name":"Ma Xuelu","name_zh":"马雪璐","org":"中国矿业大学（北京）","org_zh":"中国矿业大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b8c41c455f439fe60b8c"},{"id":"542da64adabfae11fc48dc4a","name":"Wang Qibao","name_zh":"王启宝","org":"中国矿业大学（北京）","org_zh":"中国矿业大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b8c41c455f439fe60b8c"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","思维导图","教学探索"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '48', '2', 2021, 1),
('619baf281c45e57ce9f68f23', '10.1360/tb-2021-0090', 'Strategic Development and Discipline Layout of Energy Chemistry of National Natural Science Foundation of China', '国家自然科学基金材料化学学科规划和布局概况', 'In 2020, the research area of energy chemistry with the application code of B09 was founded in the Department of Chemical Sciences, the National Natural Science Foundation of China. The aim is to lay a solid scientific foundation for fostering transformative energy technologies. In this paper, we will give an introduction to the strategic development and discipline layout of energy chemistry. The intension, objective and development trend of energy chemistry are defined in the 14th Five Year Plan & Mid-long Term Strategic Development. As an important step to push her development, the application code of energy chemistry needs to be optimized in accordance with the inherent logic and landscape of the knowledge system. The new application coding system is, thus, established on the basis of the strategic plan and the issues of current system. Eight secondary application codes under energy chemistry are listed as follows. B0901 chemistry of hydrogen energy: The chemical production, storage and conversion of hydrogen; B0902 chemistry of carbon energy: The chemical conversion of coal, oil, natural gas, syngas, carbon dioxide, biomass; B0903 chemistry of thermal energy: The conversion between thermal energy and chemical energy; B0904 chemistry of mechanical energy: The conversion between mechanical energy and chemical energy; B0905 chemistry of electrical energy: The conversion between electrical energy and chemical energy; B0906 chemistry of photo energy: The conversion between photo energy and chemical energy; B0907 energy chemistry in extreme environment: Chemical energy system under extreme conditions like high temperature, high pressure, strong radiation, highly corrosive condition, deep Earth, deep sea, deep space, etc.; B0908 chemistry of energy material: Materials chemistry for efficient energy conversion.', '国家自然科学基金委员会正积极深化科学基金改革,其中优化学科布局是重要任务之一.作为一门新兴的交叉学科,材料化学是发展变革性和战略性功能材料体系的基础科学.2019～2020年期间,化学科学部开展了材料化学"十四五"及中长期发展规划及申请代码调整,本文概述了"材料化学"(申请代码:B05)在优化学科布局方面的工作,供从事相关研究的科研人员参考.', '[{"id":"53f43acbdabfaeecd6989429","name":"Zhenxing Liang","org":"Natl Nat Sci Fdn China, Dept Chem Sci, Beijing 100085, Peoples R China"},{"id":"64814c01c362620001eb6558","name":"Wei Jiang","org":"Natl Nat Sci Fdn China, Dept Chem Sci, Beijing 100085, Peoples R China","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会化学科学部,北京100085","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"},{"id":"6377bd2584d6908c16b18d20","name":"Guojun Zhang","org":"Natl Nat Sci Fdn China, Dept Chem Sci, Beijing 100085, Peoples R China","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会化学科学部,北京100085","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"}]', '["Sustainable Chemistry"]', '["国家自然科学基金","材料化学","\"十四五\"及中长期发展规划","学科布局","申请代码"]', '{"raw":"Scientia Sinica Chimica"}', '1674-7224', '51', '4', 2021, 2),
('6491a3bcd68f896efa8dc44c', '10.3969/j.issn.1000-6168.2020.06.010', 'Exploration on the Construction of Super Golden Class Course Group for Major of Material Chemistry', '材料化学专业"超级金课"课程群建设探索', NULL, '建设符合"两性一度"标准的"金课"是当前课程建设的目标.燕山大学材料化学专业结合OBE教学理念,以项目实施为主线,从增加课程难度、拓展课程深度、将理论课程与实践教学环节有机结合、合理提升学业挑战度等方面着手,进行"超级金课"课程群建设;将CDIO理念贯穿整个教学过程,实现了知识、能力、素质培养的有机融合;同时采用多样化的考核评价方式,注重考查学生解决复杂问题的能力和创新精神.课程群建设可为其他高校的"金课"建设提供参考.', '[{"id":"616299a860a9657b486c732e","name":"Hou Li","name_zh":"侯莉","org":"燕山大学","org_zh":"燕山大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e33e"},{"name":"Jiang Yang","name_zh":"姜洋","org":"燕山大学","org_zh":"燕山大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e33e"},{"id":"53f434acdabfaee4dc772d8b","name":"Gao Faming","name_zh":"高发明","org":"燕山大学","org_zh":"燕山大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e33e"},{"id":"62aacd7ed9f2040d085d8e70","name":"Wang Haiyan","name_zh":"王海燕","org":"燕山大学","org_zh":"燕山大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e33e"},{"id":"53f44fdcdabfaedd74e14195","name":"Gao Dawei","name_zh":"高大威","org":"燕山大学","org_zh":"燕山大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e33e"}]', '[]', '["金课","课程群建设","材料化学","教学改革"]', '{"name_zh":"化工高等教育","raw":"Higher Education in Chemical Engineering"}', '1000-6168', '37', '6', 2020, 2),
('604b6a846f90b7f6ca391c9b', NULL, NULL, '材料化学专业特色培育及创新型人才培养实践探索', NULL, '特色办学是地方院校适应经济社会发展的迫切要求、走转型发展的必由之路.在新形势下,高等教育要适应经济社会发展需要与走向,关键是创新人才培养机制.湖南人文科技学院以材料化学专业特色培育与创新型人才培养为例,重点从人才培养目标、实践教学模式、教学方法与内容、开放性实验体系、校企合作课程、生产实习与毕业论文模式等方面进行实践探索,取得了较好的办学效果.', '[{"id":"5615b62845cedb3397ad41dc","name_zh":"胡继林","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院,湖南娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"6152142160a9652002076a0d","name_zh":"刘鑫","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院,湖南娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"5612465445cedb3397918c11","name_zh":"胡传跃","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院,湖南娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","专业特色","地方院校","创新型人才"]', '{"name_zh":"黑龙江教育（高教研究与评估版）","raw":"Heilongjiang Education(Higher Educational Research and Evaluation)"}', '1002-4107', NULL, '6', 2020, 2),
('64cd53133fda6d7f0650367c', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-1865.2020.18.103', 'Reform and Exploration of Applied Talents Training Mode in Local Colleges and Universities-Taking Material Chemistry Specialty in Hunan University of Science and Technology as Example', '地方高校应用型人才培养模式改革与探索——以湖南科技大学材料化学专业为例', NULL, '新工科和工程认证背景下地方高校人才培养模式面临改革需求,在我国新材料产业布局形势下,应用型人才的培养显得尤为重要.本文结合湖南科技大学材料化学专业的实际情况,从打造合理的专业定位,改进人才培养方案,拓宽专业内涵培养创新能力等方面阐述了地方高校应用型人才培养的改革方法与措施.', '[{"name":"Chen Lijuan","name_zh":"陈丽娟","org":"湖南科技大学","org_zh":"湖南科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4601c455f439fe498c0"},{"id":"542a5509dabfae86fd951a37","name":"Ou Baoli","name_zh":"欧宝立","org":"湖南科技大学","org_zh":"湖南科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4601c455f439fe498c0"},{"id":"6164d30960a9657b486f1d88","name":"Liao Bo","name_zh":"廖博","org":"湖南科技大学","org_zh":"湖南科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4601c455f439fe498c0"},{"name":"Tian Li","name_zh":"田俐","org":"湖南科技大学","org_zh":"湖南科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4601c455f439fe498c0"},{"name":"Guo Yan","name_zh":"郭艳","org":"湖南科技大学","org_zh":"湖南科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4601c455f439fe498c0"},{"id":"542feb86dabfaea2f5546f03","name":"Wang Linyan","name_zh":"王琳艳","org":"湖南科技大学","org_zh":"湖南科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4601c455f439fe498c0"},{"id":"616b287d60a9656471efd4cf","name":"Xiang Yujun","name_zh":"向育君","org":"湖南科技大学","org_zh":"湖南科技大学","orgid":"5f71b4601c455f439fe498c0"}]', '[]', '["材料化学专业","地方本科院校","人才培养","改革与探索"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '47', '18', 2020, 3),
('604b38cb6f90b7f6ca96350b', '10.19319/j.cnki.issn.1008-021x.2020.12.091', 'Introducing an Experiment for Material Chemistry Specialty -Synthesis of PtCo nanotubes', '介绍一个材料化学专业实验—PtCo纳米管的制备', NULL, '本文介绍了一个材料化学专业实验.该实验利用置换反应制备一维铂基合金纳米管.通过该实验一方面可以使学生掌握一些仪器的使用方法,另一方面可以通过对纳米管形成机理的探讨锻炼学生利用理论知识解决实际问题的能力.实践证明,通过该实验的学习,学生的实验技能得到了提高,理论知识得到了巩固,利用理论知识分析实验现象的能力得到了加强.', '[{"id":"53f4545cdabfaee02ad5136b","name":"Baomin Luo","name_zh":"罗保民","org_zh":"南阳师范学院化学与制药工程学院,河南南阳,473061","orgid":"5f71b6e71c455f439fe5b3bf"}]', NULL, '["材料化学专业","实验教学","纳米管,铂钴"]', '{"name_zh":"山东化工","raw":"Shandong Chemical Industry"}', '1008-021X', '49', '12', 2020, NULL),
('604b6a3e6f90b7f6ca36a02d', '10.16400/j.cnki.kjdkz.2020.09.017', 'Exploration and Practice of Teaching Mode Reform in Comprehensive Experiment of Materials Chemistry', '材料化学综合实验课堂教学模式改革的探索与实践', NULL, '随着教育事业的不断推进,越来越多的手段运用到了学生的课堂上,材料化学综合实验课堂教学也逐渐被越来越多的教师熟知,它在学生教学中发挥了重要作用,是培养学生动手能力的绝佳途径,是帮助学生提升实践能力必不可少的环节,在注重实践的学生群体中有着非同一般的意义.本文我们针对材料化学综合实验课堂教学模式改革的探索与实践做一个详细的分析,着重探查教学模式与实践方法,逐步提高化学课堂教学质量.', '[{"id":"56cb18c1c35f4f3c65660b61","name":"Haibo WANG","name_zh":"王海波","org_zh":"苏州大学 江苏·苏州 215325","orgid":"61e698316896273465735d43"}]', NULL, '["材料化学综合实验","教学模式改革","探索实践"]', '{"name_zh":"科教导刊","raw":"The Guide of Science & Education"}', '1674-6813', NULL, '26', 2020, 2),
('604b38be6f90b7f6ca95bfa7', NULL, 'Exploration of Inorganic Chemistry Teaching Reform for Material CVhemistry Major', '针对材料化学专业的无机化学教改探索', NULL, '针对材料化学专业无机化学的教学特点,围绕着激发学生的学习热情和积极性,获得理论知识,并能运用这些知识去分析和解决问题的角度出发,从优化无机化学的知识逻辑,学以致用的教学观,自学能力的培养,教学方法的改进等方面对无机化学的教改进行了探索.', '[{"id":"62e3a2e3d9f2043704dcb1bd","name":"Lianliang Wang","name_zh":"王连亮","org_zh":"百色学院 化学与环境工程学院,广西 百色 533000","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce4a"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","无机化学","教改探索"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '47', '20', 2020, NULL),
('604b78ba6f90b7f6cac0883c', NULL, NULL, '案例教学在材料化学专业文献检索课程中的应用策略', NULL, '随着科技的发展,信息在当今社会中扮演着愈来愈重要的角色.如何从浩如烟海的信息中精准快速找出我们所需要的信息对推动科技创新和社会发展至关重要.本文结合南昌航空大学材料化学专业的实际情况,将本专业的相关案例融入到文献检索课程教学中,调动学生的主观能动性并加深学生对本专业的认识,提高学生分析问题、解决问题和创新创业的能力.', '[{"id":"632462b4a36d2225e1f8b766","name_zh":"周丹","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"615589cf60a96506679df46b","name_zh":"徐海涛","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6567037a8a47b649236b3968","name_zh":"秦元成","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"560cccfb45cedb3397575640","name_zh":"钟学明","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"6156439d60a96506679ede0b","name_zh":"钟荣","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"}]', NULL, '["案例教学","文献检索","教学模式","材料化学"]', '{"name_zh":"文存阅刊","raw":"WENCUN YUEKAN"}', '2095-8633', NULL, '2', 2020, NULL),
('64cdb30b3fda6d7f06fdf36b', NULL, NULL, '材料化学的科研教学法', NULL, '材料化学的科研教学法为拓宽本科学生在化学领域的知识面,将以与人类现代生活息息相关的重要化学材料为切入点,对化学材料的发展历史、性能、应用领域作介绍;再结合材料与教师们近年来在化学领域取得的科研成果,加深本科生对典型化学材料,如能源材料、信息功能材料、环保材料等的认识.', '[{"id":"62e3a943d9f2043704e08f92","name_zh":"史月琴","org_zh":"杭州电子科技大学","orgid":"5f71b3b61c455f439fe44c7e"},{"id":"637212ffec88d95668ca7e35","name_zh":"于占洋","org_zh":"杭州电子科技大学","orgid":"5f71b3b61c455f439fe44c7e"}]', '[]', '["材料化学","科研","理论结合实践","本科生培养"]', '{"name_zh":"科教导刊-电子版（上旬）","raw":"The Guide of Science & Education"}', '1674-6813', NULL, '3', 2020, NULL),
('604b38cb6f90b7f6ca96380f', '10.19319/j.cnki.issn.1008-021x.2020.09.063', 'Exploration and Practice of Applied Talents Training for Material Chemistry Specialty Under the New Engineering Background in Local Colleges', '新工科背景下地方院校材料化学专业应用型人才培养的探索与实践', NULL, '相对于传统的工科人才,新工科以新兴产业和新经济为背景,需要的是工程实践能力强、创新能力强、具备国际竞争力的高素质复合型人才.本文从当前社会发展对应用型人才的需求出发,首先对湖南人文科技学院材料化学专业的专业定位、历史沿革和特色优势进行了简要介绍,然后对深化专业综合改革、加强师资队伍和基层教学组织建设、加强专业教学质量保障体系建设等方面的主要举措和成效进行了探索实践,期望为其他地方院校开展应用型人才培养改革提供参考.', '[{"id":"5615b62845cedb3397ad41dc","name":"Jilin Hu","name_zh":"胡继林","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院 材料与环境工程学院,湖南 娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"6152142160a9652002076a0d","name":"Xin Liu","name_zh":"刘鑫","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院 材料与环境工程学院,湖南 娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"5612465445cedb3397918c11","name":"Chuanyue Hu","name_zh":"胡传跃","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院 材料与环境工程学院,湖南 娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"650ce598768b11dc729fbecd","name":"Hongbin Zhong","name_zh":"钟洪彬","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院 材料与环境工程学院,湖南 娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"637b0605f789b382bea541eb","name":"Zhanjun Chen","name_zh":"陈占军","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院 材料与环境工程学院,湖南 娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"},{"id":"63d02beea777852dcea9296b","name":"Ling Zhu","name_zh":"朱凌","org_zh":"湖南人文科技学院 材料与环境工程学院,湖南 娄底,417000","orgid":"5f71b4671c455f439fe49ba5"}]', NULL, '["地方院校","新工科","材料化学专业","人才培养","探索"]', '{"name_zh":"山东化工","raw":"Shandong Chemical Industry"}', '1008-021X', '49', '9', 2020, 2),
('604b38bf6f90b7f6ca95c2dd', NULL, 'Construction of Cultivation Mode on the Postgraduate (Master Degree) of Material Chemistry', '材料化学专业研究生的培养模式建设', NULL, '构建良好的培养模式,能够使材料化学类研究生的教学质量不断提高,培养出符合社会发展要求的高素质人才.本文对材料化学专业研究生的培养模式进行了研究,通过对目前课程体系所存在问题的分析,提出了材料化学类研究生培养模式的改进目标.并针对目前教学中存在的问题,从材料化学类研究生基础课选择和实践应用能力提高方面,提出了与解决目前实际问题相结合的课程体系改革方式.', '[{"id":"53f447a0dabfaee4dc7d5e9a","name":"Shuwang Duo","name_zh":"多树旺","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学,江西南昌330013","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"},{"id":"63af8ed084ab04bd7fb72bd9","name":"Dongbai Xie","name_zh":"谢冬柏","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学,江西南昌330013","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"},{"id":"54338e23dabfaeb5449b5965","name":"Liman Zhao","name_zh":"赵莉曼","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学,江西南昌330013","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"},{"name":"liang Hu","name_zh":"胡亮","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学,江西南昌330013","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"},{"id":"62e389abd9f2043704ccd342","name":"Hao Zhang","name_zh":"张豪","org_zh":"江西科技师范大学,江西南昌330013","orgid":"61e6988368962734657365fd"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","研究生","培养模式","建设"]', '{"name_zh":"广东化工","raw":"Guangdong Chemical Industry"}', '1007-1865', '47', '13', 2020, NULL),
('604b725a6f90b7f6ca831964', NULL, NULL, '材料化学的应用与发展', NULL, '现阶段我国的科学技术和社会经济发展迅速,工业化进程加快,材料化学作为一种新兴的学科在化工行业得到广泛应用.材料化学的发展不仅可以提高我国的能源利用率,提升产品在市场中的占有比率,还能促进我国经济的快速发展.本文对材料化学的应用现状和发展前景进行了探讨,对材料化学的发展具有一定的参考意义,希望可以促进我国材料化学产业的进一步发展.', '[{"id":"62e397e1d9f2043704d5ad22","name_zh":"王文涛","org_zh":"大连天亿技术服务有限公司 辽宁大连 116000"}]', NULL, '["材料化学","化工行业","发展"]', '{"name_zh":"商品与质量","raw":"Shangpin Yu Zhiliang"}', '1006-656X', NULL, '23', 2020, 1),
('604b5e2f6f90b7f6cac88dc7', '10.13884/j.1003-3807hxjy.2018110100', 'Preparation of Metal-Organic Framework Materials for Experiment Teaching', '制备金属-有机框架材料的教学实验设计', NULL, '为了探索新型的“材料化学实验”课堂教学案例,对铜基多孔金属-有机框架材料(Cu-MOF)的制备条件进行精心优化和设计,使其满足实验课堂教学的要求.以5-氨基间苯二甲酸(AIPA)为配体分别和不同阴离子铜盐(如硝酸铜、三氟甲磺酸铜、氯化铜、硫酸铜)配位.为了降低实验成本、能耗和提高反应产率,通过优化实验条件,探究适合材料化学实验教学的最佳物料配比、反应温度和反应时间等条件,并对所得产物进行粉末X射线衍射(PXRD)测试,表征材料的相纯度.课堂实践表明,学生对晶态材料的实验方法和表征手段表现出浓厚的学习兴趣.', '[{"id":"632448c5a36d2225e1f5f7de","name":"Xiao-Hui LIU","name_zh":"刘小慧","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"633402a12fedb730e39c57cd","name":"Zi-Shan SU","name_zh":"苏紫珊","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"6324de07a36d2225e11022f2","name":"Wei-Tao XIE","name_zh":"谢炜桃","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"6537ed7e8a47b6492326d505","name":"Jia-Liang LIANG","name_zh":"梁家亮","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"542d59ffdabfae12b9802f20","name":"Xiao-Ting WANG","name_zh":"王小婷","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"64cb399ee1382322dda19d4c","name":"Sheng-Jie LIU","name_zh":"刘盛杰","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"53f450a2dabfaee0d9bdcd5d","name":"Yan-Xuan QIU","name_zh":"邱燕璇","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"6170821c60a965737d7538e3","name":"Xiao-Jun LIU","name_zh":"柳晓俊","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"},{"id":"616cb0a660a9656471f35461","name":"Wei-Qin XU","name_zh":"许伟钦","org_zh":"广东第二师范学院化学系 广东广州 510800","orgid":"61e69b5d689627346573ce88"}]', NULL, '["金属-有机框架","5-氨基间苯二甲酸","粉末X射线衍射技术","材料化学实验教学"]', '{"name_zh":"化学教育","raw":"Chinese Journal of Chemical Education"}', '1003-3807', '41', '4', 2020, 5),
('6a2d0c850a96f8c83cf3b1e4', '10.1016/j.dcmed.2026.05.003', 'The Macro, Meso, and Micro Dimensions of Yin-Yang Theory in Traditional Chinese Medicine: a Three-Level Analysis of Yin and Yang', '中医阴阳理论的宏观、中观与微观:一阴一阳,三层意蕴', NULL, 'Yin-Yang theory is one of the core components of the foundational theory of traditional Chinese medicine (TCM), yet its classification as philosophical or scientific has long been controversial. To move beyond the longstanding either-philosophy-or-science debate surrounding Yin-Yang theory in TCM, this article, for the first time, proposes a three-level framework spanning macro, meso, and micro perspectives. At the macro level, Yin and Yang are a theoretical achievement of ancient Chinese natural philosophy, used to explain universal laws governing how the cosmos operates, which constitutes Yin-Yang theory in philosophy; at the meso level, Huangdi Neijing (《黄帝内经》, Inner Canon of Huangdi) translated Yin-Yang from a cosmological framework into medical discourse, making it a core methodological basis for clinical pattern differentiation and treatment, which constitutes Yin-Yang theory in medicine; at the micro level, Yin-Yang theory in TCM has increasingly converged with modern science, showing scientific features that are testable and reproducible, which constitutes Yin-Yang theory in science. The article further demonstrates that Yin-Yang theory in TCM differs markedly from Yin-Yang as a general philosophical doctrine in core application and practical orientation: in the course of its medical transformation, elements related to life phenomena were selectively incorporated, while, within a medical context, abstract propositions such as cosmological speculation were bracketed and rendered concrete, thereby achieving a practice-oriented transition from philosophy to medicine. Based on this, the present study conducts analyses from four aspects, namely philosophical roots, clinical application, modern scientific interpretation, and implications for life sciences; it substantiates the logical basis for Yin-Yang theory in TCM as the overarching framework for clinical pattern differentiation and treatment, reviews modern research progress from perspectives such as systems science and network regulation, and explores its potential value in advancing a new paradigm of state-based medicine. The study suggests that an accurate understanding of Yin-Yang theory in TCM requires moving beyond the either-philosophy-or-science binary and analyzing specific issues on a case-by-case basis. Across different perspectives, Yin-Yang theory in TCM has philosophical, medical, and scientific attributes. Only by grounding the theory in actual clinical efficacy and engaging with modern science can the innovative development of Yin-Yang theory in TCM be promoted, thereby providing valuable Eastern insights for building a life science system with original Chinese contributions.', '[{"name":"Ouyang Miao","org":"Student Affairs Office, Jiangxi University of Chinese Medicine, Nanchang, Jiangxi 330004, China","org_zh":"江西中医药大学学生工作处,江西 南昌 330004,中国"},{"name":"Zhang Gedi","org":"Institute of Advanced Studies, Jiangxi University of Chinese Medicine, Nanchang, Jiangxi 330004, China","org_zh":"江西中医药大学高等研究院,江西 南昌 330004,中国"},{"name":"Yu Mengdan","org":"Research Center for the Differentiation and Development of TCM Basic Theories, Jiangxi University of Chinese Medicine, Nanchang, Jiangxi 330004, China","org_zh":"江西中医药大学中医基础理论分化发展研究中心,江西 南昌 330004,中国"},{"id":"5429bf91dabfaec7081b018b","name":"Liu Hongning","org":"Institute of Advanced Studies, Jiangxi University of Chinese Medicine, Nanchang, Jiangxi 330004, China","org_zh":"江西中医药大学高等研究院,江西 南昌 330004,中国"}]', '["Yin-Yang theory in traditional Chinese medicine","Hierarchical analysis","Life sciences","Systems science","Complexity science"]', '["中医阴阳理论","层级分析","生命科学","系统科学","复杂科学"]', '{"raw":"Digital Chinese Medicine"}', '2589-3777', '9', '2', 2026, NULL),
('682f68ed163c01c850e56ea1', '10.3788/irla20250050', 'Research on Technology and Application of Ultrafast Laser 3D Printing Inorganic Materials(invited)', '超快激光3D打印无机材料技术及应用(特邀)', 'Significance Femtosecond laser 3D printing has emerged as a revolutionary technology in micro-nano manufacturing,enabling the fabrication of complex 3D structures with sub-diffraction-limit resolution.Inorganic materials,known for their excellent mechanical properties,thermal stability,and chemical resistance,are widely used in optical devices,MEMS sensors,and biomedical applications.However,traditional manufacturing methods for inorganic micro-nano structures face limitations,such as complex processing,low precision,and high costs,which restrict their potential in high-performance device fabrication.The advent of femtosecond laser 3D printing provides a promising solution to overcome these challenges,offering exceptional spatial resolution and material versatility.This survey systematically reviews recent progress in the techniques and applications of femtosecond laser 3D printing for inorganic materials,focusing on organic-inorganic hybrid and pure inorganic systems.The study also explores the challenges and future directions,emphasizing the potential of this technology in advancing micro-nano fabrication. Progress Femtosecond laser 3D printing leverages nonlinear optical effects of two-photon absorption to achieve high-resolution fabrication of complex three-dimensional structures,making it a versatile tool for inorganic material processing.This technology has been employed in two primary approaches:organic-inorganic hybrid systems and pure inorganic material systems.Organic-inorganic hybrid systems combine the flexibility of polymer matrices with the superior properties of inorganic components by incorporating precursors or nanoparticles into light-sensitive resins.The process involves two-photon polymerization for precise structuring,followed by high-temperature sintering to enhance material performance,although challenges such as achieving uniformity and minimizing shrinkage remain.Pure inorganic material systems,on the other hand,bypass organic components entirely by using direct laser-induced reactions,such as photochemical reduction or decomposition,to fabricate high-purity structures with enhanced thermal and chemical stability.These techniques have facilitated advancements in various applications,including the production of optical microdevices like microlenses and photonic crystals,MEMS sensors with integrated 3D microstructures for force and environmental sensing,and life sciences applications such as biocompatible scaffolds and micro-robots for minimally invasive procedures.The ongoing development of femtosecond laser 3D printing is characterized by increasing standardization,compatibility with diverse materials and processes,scalability for industrial applications,and modularity in manufacturing,paving the way for significant technological breakthroughs. Conclusions and Prospects Femtosecond laser 3D printing represents a transformative advance in the fabrication of inorganic micro-nano structures.Despite its potential,several challenges remain,including low processing efficiency,material restrictions,and issues with thermal stability and shrinkage during post-processing.Future developments should focus on enhancing processing throughput through techniques such as parallel laser writing and digital light modulation.Additionally,innovations in material chemistry,including the development of low-shrinkage precursors and advanced hybrid systems,are essential for broader applicability.The integration of artificial intelligence and machine learning for process optimization holds promise for automated,intelligent manufacturing.These advancements are expected to unlock new applications in photonics,MEMS,and biomedical engineering,driving the evolution of femtosecond laser 3D printing into a cornerstone technology for next-generation micro-nano manufacturing.', '无机材料因其卓越的机械性能、化学稳定性和耐高温特性,广泛应用于航空航天、电子设备、光学器件等领域.然而,传统无机材料制造方法因工艺复杂、精度不足等限制难以满足高性能器件需求,而飞秒激光三维(3D)打印技术凭借其适用多种材料的能力和出色的空间分辨率,为无机微纳结构制造开辟了新路径.近年来,基于无机材料的飞秒激光3D打印技术取得了重要进展,涵盖有机-无机复合材料和纯无机材料两大工艺.复合材料打印通过将无机成分掺入有机树脂光刻胶,结合双光子聚合技术(TPP)制备高性能结构;纯无机材料打印则直接利用无机前驱体或纳米颗粒,通过激光诱导反应构建无机结构.相比传统工艺,该技术在光学微器件、微机电系统(MEMS)及生命科学等领域展现出显著优势.然而,其在材料选择、加工效率和结构稳定性方面仍面临挑战.本报告系统总结了飞秒激光3D打印无机材料的工艺与应用进展,并深入探讨了其技术瓶颈及解决方案.未来,随着新型光敏材料、共混技术和激光打印方法的发展,该技术有望实现更高效、更精确的微纳制造,并在复杂光纤系统、微纳光子学及生命科学等领域展现更广阔的应用前景.', '[{"name":"LIAO Changrui","name_zh":"廖常锐","org_zh":"深圳大学","orgid":"5f71b3491c455f439fe41cf6"},{"name":"FANG Haorui","name_zh":"方浩锐","org_zh":"深圳大学","orgid":"5f71b3491c455f439fe41cf6"},{"name":"ZHU Dezhi","name_zh":"朱德志","org_zh":"深圳大学","orgid":"5f71b3491c455f439fe41cf6"},{"name":"HE Zhiming","name_zh":"何智明","org_zh":"深圳大学","orgid":"5f71b3491c455f439fe41cf6"},{"name":"CHEN Wentao","name_zh":"陈文涛","org_zh":"深圳大学","orgid":"5f71b3491c455f439fe41cf6"},{"name":"WANG Yiping","name_zh":"王义平","org_zh":"深圳大学","orgid":"5f71b3491c455f439fe41cf6"}]', '["femtosecond laser 3D printing","inorganic materials","optical devices","MEMS sensors","life sciences"]', '["飞秒激光3D打印","无机材料","光学器件","MEMS传感","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"红外与激光工程","raw":"Infrared and Laser Engineering"}', '1007-2276', '54', '4', 2025, 1),
('686cac67163c01c850406c58', '10.11728/cjss2025.02.2024-0155', 'Applications of Microfluidic Chips in Space Life Sciences', '微流控芯片在空间生命科学中的应用', 'Microfluidic chip,also known as Lab-on-a-Chip(LOC),represent a cutting-edge technology that enables the precise manipulation of small volumes of liquid at the microscale.In recent years,this innovative technology has garnered significant attention for its potential to revolutionize life science re-search in vitro.Particularly in the fields of drug screening and in vitro diagnostics,microfluidic chips of-fer remarkable advantages,including high throughput and high sensitivity,allowing for the rapid and ac-curate analysis of large numbers of samples.Moreover,these chips can be engineered to simulate the complex microstructures,microenvironments,and physiological functions of specific human organs,pro-viding researchers with a powerful tool to study biological processes in a controlled and highly specific manner.Characterized by their compact size,minimal sample consumption,short analysis times,and low power requirements,microfluidic chips are especially well-suited for space science experiments,where resources are often limited and environmental conditions are highly complex.In space research,animal models may exhibit significant individual differences,and single-cell models often fail to accurately simu-late the complex in vivo environment.Microfluidic chips effectively address these limitations by offering a more controlled and representative experimental platform.They can simulate the physiological condi-tions of human organs with greater accuracy and reliability compared to traditional models,making them an invaluable tool for space life science research.This article provides an overview of the develop-ment history,fabrication technology,and fluid loading methods of microfluidic chips.It traces the evolu-tion from early concepts to today''s complex devices,discusses various fabrication techniques with their respective advantages and application scenarios,and explores loading techniques that ensure precise flu-id control within the chip.Beyond these,the article also highlights the application of microfluidic chips in both terrestrial and space life sciences.From the aspects of drug screening,in vitro diagnostics,and organ-on-a-chip,it focused on how chips can advance life science research.In the context of space re-search,the article discusses how chips can be utilized to study the effects of microgravity on cell behavior,tissue development,and other biological phenomena.It provides a comprehensive reference for the broad-er application of microfluidic chips in space life science research.', '微流控芯片(Microfluidic chip)又被称为芯片实验室(Lab-on-a-Chip,LOC),可在微米尺度对少量液体进行操控,是近年来新兴的一种可在体外开展生命科学研究的技术,在药物筛选和体外诊断中具有通量大、灵敏度高的优势,可用于模拟人体特定器官的复杂微结构、微环境和生理功能.由于微流控芯片具有体积小、样品用量少、分析时间短、功耗低等特点,十分适合应用于空间科学实验,可以有效弥补动物模型在复杂空间环境中的个体差异缺陷,以及单一细胞模型无法真实模拟体内复杂环境的问题.本文简介了微流控芯片的发展历程、制作技术及加载方式,综述了其在地面和空间生命科学方面的应用,为微流控芯片在空间生命科学研究中的广泛应用提供参考.', '[{"name_zh":"魏栋苹"},{"name_zh":"孙联文"},{"name_zh":"杨肖"}]', '["Microfluidic chips","Space life sciences","Drug screening","Organ-on-a-Chip","In vitro"]', '["微流控芯片","空间生命科学","药物筛选","器官芯片","体外诊断","微重力"]', '{"name_zh":"空间科学学报"}', '0254-6124', NULL, '2', 2025, NULL),
('6738702e01d2a3fbfce05191', '10.1360/ssv-2024-0307', 'Health Management Using Modern Life Sciences—exploring the Concept of “treating Without Illness” in the Modern Context', '用现代生命科学治理健康——“治未病”理念新内涵初探', 'Health and longevity have been the unremitting pursuit of humanity since ancient times.In today''s society,the rising incidences of chronic diseases and rapid growth of sub-healthy population greatly threaten social development.Innovations and breakthroughs in modem life sciences offer new possibilities to address these global health challenges.Traditional Chinese wisdom calls for"the superior doctor(who)treats before illness or treats without illness."This paper aims to explore a conceptual note to achieve this traditional wisdom of health management by employing developments in the frontiers of modem life sciences.The basic strategy is to manage the"healthy state"dynamically and persistently using the knowledge and awareness of modem life sciences,thus maintaining the"disease-free state"to remain healthy in the entire life.The health management system proposed will be a three-dimensional structure:(ⅰ)optimizing daily diets,(ⅱ)timely attention to health indicators,and(ⅲ)regulating personal genes.We propose that these measures should be carried out throughout one''s life to achieve health and longevity,thus leading to people"dying without disease."In recent years,we have launched a pilot project for the"Treating without Illness Action"at Huazhong Agricultural University.Our aim is to accumulate experience,gradually improve,and eventually expand these efforts to benefit the people and contribute to the prosperity of the nation and the strength of the country.', '健康长寿是人类从古至今的不懈追求.当今社会慢性病高发,亚健康人群日益增长.现代生命科学的理论创新和技术突破为破解这一全球性健康难题提供了新的可能.中国传统智慧倡导"上医治未病",本文提出用现代生命科学治理健康,探索为"治未病"理念赋予新的时代内涵.其基本策略为:以现代生命科学的知识和认知,对"未病状态"持之以恒地动态治理,保持"未病状态",实现永久健康;从"优化食谱结构、关注健康指标、调控自身基因"三个维度构建健康治理体系,贯之终身,达到健康长寿、无疾而终的境界.近年,我们在华中农业大学启动了"治未病行动计划",试点先行,以积累经验,渐次完善,冀望逐步推广,惠及百姓,为民族昌盛和国家强盛作贡献.', '[{"name_zh":"张启发","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"黄恺","org_zh":"华中科技大学同济医学院附属协和医院","orgid":"5f71b2d41c455f439fe3e910"},{"name_zh":"石秀娟","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"金红林","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"侯东彬","org_zh":"华中农业大学医院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"董志强","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"陈振夏","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"龚静","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"白涛","org_zh":"华中科技大学同济医学院附属协和医院","orgid":"5f71b2d41c455f439fe3e910"},{"name_zh":"许智勇","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"},{"name_zh":"金安江","org_zh":"华中农业大学生物医学与健康学院","orgid":"5f71b3ad1c455f439fe44863"}]', '["modern life sciences","concept of treating without illness","optimization of diet structure","attention to health indicators","regulation of personal genes"]', '["现代生命科学","治未病理念","优化食谱结构","关注健康指标","调控自身基因"]', '{"name_zh":"中国科学生命科学"}', '1674-7232', NULL, '1', 2025, NULL),
('69002081163c01c850530a77', '10.16288/j.yczz.25-178', 'Examining Funding Policies for Postdoctoral Researchers in Life Sciences: a Case Study of Shandong University.', '生命科学领域博士后资助政策探讨——以山东大学为例', 'Postdoctoral researchers in life sciences confront distinct challenges, including extended training duration resulting from the inherently lengthy research cycles associated with their specialized research subjects and experimental materials. Based on national postdoctoral policies and comparison of funding policies between China and the United States, we focus on postdoctoral researchers in life sciences at the School of Life Sciences, Shandong University. Our analysis reveals how current university funding policies constrain the training process of postdoctoral researchers in this field. To address these limitations, we propose a coordinated reform strategy, including reinforcing ideological and political guidance, extending funding durations, establishing cost-sharing mechanisms, and implementing incentives for major achievements. These reforms aim to improve the quality of postdoctoral training and provide policy insights for optimizing the research talent development system in "Double First-Class" universities.', '生命科学领域博士后因其研究对象和实验对象的特殊性,面临着研究周期长而造成的在站时间较长等系列问题.本文以国家博士后政策为依据,结合国内的博士后资助政策和美国博士后资助政策,以山东大学生命科学学院生命科学领域博士后为对象,分析并揭示当前学校资助政策对生命科学领域博士后培养产生的制约作用,提出加强思政引领、延长资助周期、建立经费分担机制与实行重大成果奖励政策的协同改革方案,以期为提升博士后培养质量、完善"双一流"高校科研人才培养体系提供政策参考.', '[{"name":"Yan Zhou","org":"School of Life Sciences, Shandong University, Qingdao 266237, China.","orgid":"5f71b2a11c455f439fe3d323"},{"name":"Feng Liu","org":"School of Life Sciences, Shandong University, Qingdao 266237, China.","orgid":"5f71b2a11c455f439fe3d323"}]', '["postdoctoral researchers","life sciences","funding policies","training quality"]', '["博士后","生命科学","资助政策","培养质量"]', '{"raw":"Yi chuan = Hereditas"}', '0253-9772', '47', '10', 2025, NULL),
('6938f08794d1bc07b4c8872c', '10.12014/j.issn.1002-0772.2025.21.01', 'Data-Driven Paradigm: A Study on the Evolution of Research Paradigms in Life Science', '数据驱动:生命科学研究范式的演进研究', 'Data-driven paradigms have propelled a profound evolution in research methodologies within the life sciences. With advances in information technology and the emergence of high-throughput data, the field has exhibited a synergistic evolution from the traditional hypothesis-experiment approach toward data-centric research approach. Statistical methods and artificial intelligence have become essential tools for uncovering patterns in data. Meanwhile, information theory and computational theory provide foundational support for processing and interpreting complex biological data, fostering an ongoing reconfiguration of scientific cognition toward data- and information-centric orientations. Overall, data-driven approaches and the traditional hypothesis-experiment paradigm coexist in a complementary and coupled relationship across most areas of the life sciences, while technological progress, tool innovation, and interdisciplinary collaboration continue to render life science research increasingly systematic and efficient.', '数据驱动范式推动了生命科学研究方法的深刻演进.随着信息技术进步和高通量数据的涌现,生命科学呈现出由传统"假设-实验"向"以数据为中心"的研究方式协同演进的格局.统计方法与人工智能成为揭示数据规律的关键工具.与此同时,信息理论和计算理论为处理与理解复杂生物数据提供基础支撑,促进了科学认知方式的数据与信息中心化的持续重塑.整体来看,数据驱动方法与传统的"假设-实验"范式在多数生命科学领域处于互补与耦合状态,技术进步、工具创新和跨学科合作不断推动生命科学研究趋于系统化和高效化.', '[{"name":"QIN Gang","name_zh":"秦刚","org":"School of Philosophy, Beijing Normal University, Beijing 100875, China","org_zh":"北京师范大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e300"},{"id":"54488ecbdabfae1dce8057d4","name":"LI Jianhui","name_zh":"李建会","org":"School of Philosophy, Beijing Normal University, Beijing 100875, China","org_zh":"北京师范大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e300"}]', '["data","paradigm","life science"]', '["数据","范式","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"医学与哲学","raw":"Medicine & Philosophy"}', '1002-0772', '46', '21', 2025, NULL),
('65d7fe35939a5f40823d0e79', '10.16418/j.issn.1000-3045.20231211001', 'A new paradigm of life science research driven by artificial intelligence', '人工智能驱动的生命科学研究新范式', 'The rapid development of biotechnology and information technology has brought life sciences into a new era of data explosion.The traditional life science research paradigm struggles to reveal the fundamental rules of complex biological systems from rapidly growing biological big data.As artificial intelligence continues to achieve disruptive breakthroughs in life science,a new paradigm driven by AI is emerging.This study delves into typical examples of life science research driven by AI,proposes the concept and key elements of the new life science research paradigm,elaborates on the cutting-edge of life science research under this new paradigm,and discusses the challenges in China.', '生物技术和信息技术的迅速发展,使生命科学进入了数据爆发的新时代,传统生命科学研究范式难以在日益增长的生物大数据中揭示生命复杂系统的本质规律.随着人工智能(AI)在生命科学研究领域持续取得颠覆性突破,AI驱动的生命科学研究新范式呼之欲出.文章通过深入剖析AI驱动的生命科学研究的典型范例,提出了生命科学研究新范式的内涵和关键要素,阐述并讨论了新范式下的生命科学研究前沿和我国面临的挑战.', '[{"name":"LI Xin","name_zh":"李鑫","org":"中国科学院动物研究所 北京 100101","org_zh":"中国科学院动物研究所 北京 100101","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"616bc7f860a9656471f16229","name":"YU Hanchao","name_zh":"于汉超","org":"中国科学院前沿科学与教育局","org_zh":"中国科学院前沿科学与教育局","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '["scientific research","life science","artificial intelligence","big data","scientific paradigm"]', '["科学研究","生命科学","人工智能","大数据","科学范式"]', '{"name_zh":"Bulletin of Chinese Academy of Sciences","raw":"Bulletin of Chinese Academy of Sciences"}', '1000-3045', '39', '1', 2024, NULL),
('65dfef6013fb2c6cf62a5fb3', '10.16476/j.pibb.2023.0049', 'Exploration and Practice of Curriculum Construction of Biological Clock and Health', '“生物钟与健康”通识课程建设与思考', 'General education in natural sciences is a critical component in higher education.In this article,I introduced the exploration and practice of curriculum construction of"Biological Clock and Health"at Tsinghua University.The course has been open to students for 3 semesters so far.Students who selected the course come from 27 departments of the university.The students provided positive feedbacks after taking this class,including self-report of improved sleep quality and better understanding of the research logic and methods in life sciences.The logic and methods of the construction of"Biological Clock and Health"described in this article provide insights to the construction of other courses in natural sciences of general education.', '科学类通识课程是高校通识教育中的重要组成部分。本文介绍了清华大学“生物钟与健康”科学类通识课程的建设情况，从课程建设的必要性出发，介绍课程的教学内容设计和评价标准，分析课程开课情况，并对未来课程规划进行讨论。课程已开设3个学期，选课学生已覆盖了全校27个院系，学生评教成绩优异。通过课程学习，学生自述生活习惯有明显改善，对生物学研究的思维方式和方法的理解有显著提升；课程在教学内容和教学方法上有关键创新点。本门课程建设的思路和方法，对高校科学类通识课程建设具有借鉴意义。', '[{"id":"62e392fed9f2043704d2e2aa","name":"Wang Tian","org":"Tsinghua Univ, Sch Life Sci, Beijing 100084, Peoples R China","org_zh":"清华大学生命科学学院","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c860"}]', '["life sciences","biological clock","general education","curriculum construction"]', '["生命科学","生物钟","通识教育","课程建设"]', '{"raw":"PROGRESS IN BIOCHEMISTRY AND BIOPHYSICS"}', '1000-3282', '51', '2', 2024, NULL),
('66f46b2201d2a3fbfc227731', '10.13345/j.cjb.230807', 'Development Characteristics,problems and Countermeasures of Major Scientific and Technological Infrastructures in the Field of Life Sciences', '生命领域重大科技基础设施发展特征、问题与对策', 'The major science and technology infrastructure in the field of life science is an indispensable and important content in the large-science facility landscape.It encompasses cutting-edge,strategic,and fundamental aspects.This field differs from traditional facilities such as particle physics,astronomy and nuclear energy.Moreover,it represents a relatively underdeveloped area in China''s facility landscape.Unique characteristics are observed in terms of capital investment,physical form,facility lifespan,digitization degree,organizational structure,project risk,and development effect when compared to traditional facilities.Despite its importance,challenges persist in project establishment,investment,management,and construction.Therefore,it is necessary to strengthen the condensing mechanism for addressing major scientific issues in the life science field,improve the strategic investment layout,facilitate the localization of technical equipment based on original scientific ideas,and strengthen the differentiated management capacity of life science facilities.', '生命科学领域重大科技基础设施是国家重大科技基础设施板块中不可缺少的重要内容,其前沿性、战略性、基础性强,具有与粒子物理、天文、核能源等传统设施领域不同的特点,也是我国设施相对“短板”的领域。研究发现,生命领域设施在资金投入、物理形态、设施寿命、数字化程度、组织形式、项目风险和发展效应等方面,具有与传统设施领域不同的特点。生命领域设施在立项、投入、管理和建设方面还需要强化生命领域大科学问题凝练机制,提升战略性投入布局水平,推进基于原创科学思路的技术设备国产化,加强生命领域设施的差异化管理能力。', '[{"name":"Lili Qiao"}]', '["life sciences","major scientific and technological infrastructure","development characteristics","problems","countermeasures"]', '["生命科学","重大科技基础设施","发展特征","问题","对策"]', '{"raw":"Sheng wu gong cheng xue bao = Chinese journal of biotechnology"}', NULL, '40', '9', 2024, NULL),
('667fb05e01d2a3fbfc70ca86', NULL, NULL, '数据驱动的生命科学研究进展 后印本', NULL, '生命科学发展日新月异，伴随着大量实验技术的更新，生物大数据逐渐产生并在生命科学研究中扮演 着日益重要的角色。首先，生物大数据具有多样性和复杂性，包括基因组数据、表观基因组数据、蛋白质组 数据等多种类型。这些数据为研究人员提供了更全面的信息，有助于揭示生命现象背后的规律。其次，数据 驱动的生命科学新发展和应用涵盖了基因编辑、精准医疗、药物研发等诸多领域，为人类健康和生命质量提 供了前所未有的可能性。然而，生命科学研究大数据时代也面临着包括数据存储、数据共享、隐私保护等多 方面的问题，以及如何将海量数据转化为可靠的科学发现等挑战。文章简要概括了生物数据推动生命科学的 发展规律，梳理了生物大数据组成、特点及来源，阐述并讨论了数据驱动的生命科学研究新范式下的共性问 题和我国面临的挑战。', '[{"name_zh":"江海平","org_zh":"中国科学院动物研究所 北京 100101","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"name_zh":"高纯纯","org_zh":"国家生物信息中心 北京 100101"},{"name_zh":"刘文豪","org_zh":"中国科学院动物研究所 北京 100101","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"5611ce1f45cedb33978cdbbd","name_zh":"杨运桂","org_zh":"国家生物信息中心 北京 100101"},{"name_zh":"李鑫","org_zh":"中国科学院动物研究所 北京 100101","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', NULL, '["科学研究范式","大数据","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"中国科学院院刊"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2024, NULL),
('643030e190e50fcafdbc475c', '10.16418/j.issn.1000-3045.20220902001', 'Practice of Building Biomedical Innovation Highland in the United States and Its Enlightenment to China', '美国建设生物医药创新高地的实践及对我国的启示', NULL, '现代医药产业始于化学合成药的大规模生产,随着生命科学等基础科学的激进式创新,生物医药成为现代医药产业发展的重心,前景广阔.第二次世界大战以来,美国政府、企业、科学界历经多年培育生物医药产业基础并夯实科学基础,营造创新环境,建立了有效的生命科学创新系统,逐渐成为世界生物医药创新高地.建设生物医药创新高地是中国成为世界科学中心的重要一环.中国可借鉴其经验,保持发展耐心和信心,增强生命科学创新系统效用,推进生物医药创新高地的建设.', '[{"name_zh":"马晓玲","org_zh":"中国国际经济交流中心"}]', NULL, '["医药产业发展历史","生命科学创新系统","青霉素产业化","美国国立卫生研究院"]', '{"name_zh":"中国科学院院刊"}', '1000-3045', NULL, '2', 2023, NULL),
('649eb6b9d68f896efa294608', NULL, NULL, '亲历"养蚕"实践感悟生命科学教育', NULL, '新版《义务教育科学课程标准》(下称《课程标准》)指出,科学教学要以促进学生核心素养发展为宗旨,倡导在探究和实践中引导学生形成正确的价值观、必备品格和关键能力.生命科学贯穿整个义务教育阶段各个年级学习的全过程,可见国家对学生进行生命教育的重视."动物的一生"是教科版科学三年级下册第二单元的学习内容,以"养蚕"为例探究动物生命周期的主题.科学指导"养蚕"的探究实践,了解动物的生命周期,帮助学生深刻感悟生命科学教育的"知""情""意""行",感悟生命的可贵,感悟父母养育我们的艰辛与不易,感悟生命的短暂与奉献的意义.', '[{"id":"64dee289e1382366bc5b3f37","name_zh":"刘洪媛"}]', '[]', '["小学科学","生命科学","感悟生命"]', '{"name_zh":"小学科学","raw":"xiaoxue kexue"}', '1674-6317', NULL, '11', 2023, NULL),
('64b31b053fda6d7f063345b6', '10.16647/j.cnki.cn15-1369/X.2023.02.015', 'Safety management practice of hazardous chemicals in university life science laboratory under"five pairs"system——Taking the Laboratory of College of Life Sciences of Yulin University as an example', '"五双"制度下高校生命科学类实验室危险化学品安全管理实践——以榆林学院生命科学学院实验室为例', NULL, '高校生命科学类实验室的危险化学品管理是实验室安全管理的重点.本文以榆林学院生命科学学院实验室为例,通过实地调研与问卷调查等研究方法,明确实验室特点以及危险化学品种类,发现在危险化学品管理方面存在管理分散、分类不明确以及处理基础设施不完善等问题.在危险化学品管理过程中,通过明确分类统一管理、完善流程管理明确安全责任人、加强基础设施建设、建设信息化管理系统等,最终落实"五双"制度,达到危险化学品安全管理的目的.该研究为高校生命科学类实验室危险化学品的安全管理提供参考.', '[{"id":"6164435a60a9657b486e54fb","name":"Xue Lu","name_zh":"薛璐","org":"榆林学院","org_zh":"榆林学院","orgid":"61e69d5b68962734657417c2"},{"id":"65337bfc50dee4c42278f964","name":"Wang Fugang","name_zh":"王富刚","org":"榆林学院","org_zh":"榆林学院","orgid":"61e69d5b68962734657417c2"},{"name":"Liu Juan","name_zh":"刘娟","org":"榆林学院","org_zh":"榆林学院","orgid":"61e69d5b68962734657417c2"},{"id":"64c41e88e1382322dd99440a","name":"Zhang Ruiyi","name_zh":"张瑞益","org":"榆林学院","org_zh":"榆林学院","orgid":"61e69d5b68962734657417c2"},{"id":"66987c57a125282d5b35f35d","name":"Cui Changzhen","name_zh":"崔长珍","org":"榆林学院","org_zh":"榆林学院","orgid":"61e69d5b68962734657417c2"},{"id":"543148eedabfae8fa2cc37eb","name":"Jing Rui","name_zh":"景瑞","org":"榆林学院","org_zh":"榆林学院","orgid":"61e69d5b68962734657417c2"}]', '[]', '["危险化学品","实验室安全","信息化管理","\"五双\"制度","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"环境与发展","raw":"Inner Mongolia Environmental Sciences"}', '1007-0370', '35', '2', 2023, NULL),
('659cb780939a5f4082df84f2', '10.19850/j.cnki.2096-4706.2023.24.033', 'A Space Automatic Microimaging System Based on FPGA', '一种基于FPGA的空间自动化显微成像系统', 'Conducting related experiments in space life sciences,including cell culture,and studying the complex effects of special space environments on human bodies and various animal and plant biological tissues at both the cellular and molecular levels has become one of the important objectives of space life sciences research.To meet the requirements of real-time dynamic monitoring of the entire process of cell growth status and movement throughout,a visible light microimaging system with space carrying conditions is also an essential tool for conducting space life sciences experiments.In view of above problems,this paper describes an automatic microimaging device based on FPGA which can be used in space station.It has the functions of automatic observation,automatic focus,image and video data transmission.It can complete the observation task of growth,development,evolution of situ biological cell samples,and conduct data recording and analysis.It has undertaken the task of microscopic observation of cells,proteins and other samples on the space station,and has been successfully applied in the core module of the space station.', '开展空间生命科学包括细胞培养等相关试验,进而从细胞水平乃至于分子水平研究空间特殊环境给人体和各种动植物生物组织带来的复杂影响,已经成为空间生命科学研究的重要目的之一.为满足对细胞生长状态以及运动情况等的全过程实时动态监测的要求,具备空间搭载条件的可见光显微成像系统也是开展空间生命科学试验活动的必备工具.针对上述问题,文章叙述一种基于FPGA的可应用于空间站使用的自动化显微成像装置,具备自动观察、自动对焦、传输图像与视频数据功能,可完成原位生物细胞样品的生长、发育、演化等观察任务并进行数据记录与分析,承担了空间站上细胞、蛋白质等样品显微观察的任务,并已成功应用于空间站核心舱中.', '[{"name":"DONG Dong","name_zh":"董栋","org":"中国科学院上海技术物理研究所","org_zh":"中国科学院上海技术物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"name":"ZHANG Tao","name_zh":"张涛","org":"中国科学院上海技术物理研究所","org_zh":"中国科学院上海技术物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"60dae1449e795e60d9aea844","name":"ZHENG Weibo","name_zh":"郑伟波","org":"中国科学院上海技术物理研究所","org_zh":"中国科学院上海技术物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '["space station","FPGA","automatic microimaging","life sciences"]', '["空间站","FPGA","自动化显微成像","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"现代信息科技","raw":"Modern Informationn Technology"}', '2096-4706', '7', '24', 2023, NULL),
('64b27fb93fda6d7f0653fc94', '10.3868/j.issn.2095-1574.2023.02.007', 'Exploration on the Construction of General Curriculum of "Foundation of Life Science" Based on Interdisciplinary', '基于学科交叉的"生命科学基础"通识课程建设探索', NULL, '普及现代生命科学知识,培养新时代高素质、跨学科、创新型、复合型人才是高等教育的核心.针对北京理工大学非生物学专业开设"生命科学基础"通识课的现状,着重优化教学内容,突出学科交叉和实践应用.并基于本校获批的"生命科学基础"国家级一流本科课程,进行线上线下混合式教学模式探索.结合案例教学、翻转课堂、实践课堂,充分发挥学生的主动性,激发学习兴趣.课程采取多元化、贯穿整个教学过程的考核方式,初步取得较好的评教结果,以期打造理工类高校非生物专业"生命科学基础"通识"金课",助力"双一流"建设,培养具备较强生命科学素养、全面发展的新时代复合型人才.', '[{"id":"60dadf716750f876c2cb4bd7","name":"WANG Yan-feng","name_zh":"王燕峰","org":"北京理工大学","org_zh":"北京理工大学","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0fc"},{"name":"ZHAO Dong-xu","name_zh":"赵东旭","org":"北京理工大学","org_zh":"北京理工大学","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0fc"},{"id":"5604e0aa45cedb33964d5d8d","name":"QING Hong","name_zh":"庆宏","org":"北京理工大学","org_zh":"北京理工大学","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0fc"},{"name":"WANF Feng","name_zh":"王丰","org":"北京理工大学","org_zh":"北京理工大学","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0fc"}]', '[]', '["生命科学通识课程","学科交叉","国家级一流本科课程","线上线下混合式教学"]', '{"name_zh":"高校生物学教学研究（电子版）","raw":"Biology Teaching in University"}', '2095-1574', '13', '2', 2023, NULL),
('6429494690e50fcafda741c5', '10.19848/j.cnki.ISSN1005-2739.2022.12.0009', 'Research on Teaching Reform of Cell Biology Course Based on the Establishment and Cultivation of Scientific Thinking', '基于科研思维建立与培养的细胞生物学教学改革探究', 'Cell Biology is a discipline studying the life phenomena and laws of cells to reveal the cell activities related to various physiological functions of the human body. Benefiting from close connection with scientific research is one of the important attributes of Cell Biology discipline. In the teaching activities of Cell Biology, establishing and cultivating students’ scientific thinking should be emphasized. Taking the teaching of Cell Biology in the Medical College of Guangxi University as an example, this paper proposed four ways of optimizing the structure of teaching contents, re-study classic experiments, reading authoritative literatures and improving the examination model to cultivate students’ interest in scientific research and motivation of independent learning, which were practical for achieving satisfactory teaching results.', '细胞生物学是以细胞的生命现象和规律为研究对象,揭示与人体各项生理功能相关的细胞活动的一门学科.细胞生物学与科学研究联系密切,是该学科的重要属性之一,在细胞生物学教学活动中要注重建立与培养学生的科研思维.文章以广西大学医学院细胞生物学教学为例,提出优化教学内容结构、重现经典实验、阅读权威文献与改进考核模式四种途径,培养学生对科学研究的兴趣与自主性学习内驱力,取得满意的教学效果.', '[{"name":"LIU Yu","name_zh":"刘玉"},{"id":"542f6adadabfaed7c7c41781","name":"QI Zhongquan","name_zh":"齐忠权"}]', '["Cell Biology","life science","scientific thinking","teaching","reform"]', '["细胞生物学","生命科学","科研思维","教学","改革"]', '{"name_zh":"黑龙江动物繁殖"}', '1005-2739', '31', '1', 2023, NULL),
('655b8155939a5f40825dadca', '10.12026/j.issn.1001-8565.2023.10.08', 'New Requirements and Improvement Suggestion for the Protection of Vulnerable Groups in Ethical Review Measures for Life Science and Medical Research Involving Humans', '《涉及人的生命科学和医学研究伦理审查办法》对保护弱势群体的新要求及改进建议', NULL, '2023 年 2 月,国家卫生健康委员会联合教育部、科技部、国家中医药管理局发布了《涉及人的生命科学和医学研究伦理审查办法》,其中强调对涉及儿童、智力障碍者、精神障碍者等弱势群体的研究参与者,应当予以特别保护.从相关法律法规对弱势群体的保护不到位、弱势群体的界定尚未清晰、相关部门监管不足、伦理委员会审查能力难以满足弱势群体的保护、难以公平纳入弱势群体、研究者及弱势群体伦理意识有待提升六个方面阐述了保护弱势群体的现状,并从以下三个方面分析《涉及人的生命科学和医学研究伦理审查办法》对保护弱势群体的新要求,扩大关注潜在的弱势研究参与者,更重视无民事行为能力或限制民事行为能力的研究参与者的同意,民事行为能力等级提高后的再次知情同意.最后从健全相关法规体系,明确弱势群体类别、监管部门加强落实、研究机构组建研究参与者保护体系、提高伦理委员会伦理审查能力、行业协会制定审查指南、加强各方教育培训六个方面提出了加强保护弱势群体的建议,以最大限度降低弱势群体参加临床研究的风险,助力中国临床研究的质量提高和速度提升.', '[{"id":"62e3ae33d9f2043704e36143","name":"ZHANG Zengrui","name_zh":"张增瑞","org":"西南医科大学附属医院","org_zh":"西南医科大学附属医院","orgid":"6233173a0a6eb14560472b57"},{"id":"637259b0ec88d95668cd3783","name":"DING Ruilin","name_zh":"丁瑞麟","org":"西南医科大学附属医院I期临床研究病房,四川 泸州 646000","org_zh":"西南医科大学附属医院I期临床研究病房,四川 泸州 646000","orgid":"6233173a0a6eb14560472b57"},{"id":"6513dc08768b11dc72a73991","name":"WAN Juyi","name_zh":"万居易","org":"西南医科大学附属医院","org_zh":"西南医科大学附属医院","orgid":"6233173a0a6eb14560472b57"},{"id":"6164939360a9657b486eb627","name":"ZHOU Jiyin","name_zh":"周吉银","org":"陆军军医大学新桥医院","org_zh":"陆军军医大学新桥医院","orgid":"5f71b8c31c455f439fe60b7a"}]', '["Life Science and Medical Research Involving Humans","Vulnerable Groups","Ethics Committee"]', '["涉及人的生命科学和医学研究","弱势群体","伦理委员会"]', '{"name_zh":"中国医学伦理学","raw":"Chinese Medical Ethics"}', '1001-8565', '36', '10', 2023, NULL),
('64b00bda3fda6d7f06efd8df', '10.19311/j.cnki.1672-3198.2023.02.078', NULL, '"生命科学导论"课程思政元素的挖掘与实践', NULL, '本文论述了在"生命科学导论"课程教学中思政元素融入课程教学的方法,课程在挖掘中华优秀文化、科学研究和爱国主义等几方面的思政元素,发挥课程在弘扬社会主义核心价值观、弘扬求真务实的科学精神、弘扬伟大的爱国主义精神等几方面的思政作用,进行了课程思政探讨与实践,以期为我国高校公选课生命科学导论的课程思政的教学与改革提供参考.', '[{"id":"6166c69560a9656471e9304d","name_zh":"韩新才","org_zh":"武汉工程大学","orgid":"5f71b4c91c455f439fe4c861"}]', '[]', '["公选课","生命科学导论","课程思政","思政元素挖掘"]', '{"name_zh":"现代商贸工业","raw":"Modern Business Trade Industry"}', '1672-3198', '44', '2', 2023, 1),
('6570a19f939a5f4082e49b0f', NULL, NULL, '生命科学视域下初中化学课堂教学探索', NULL, '初中化学是必不可少的课程之一，化学课程内容主要包含各类化学变化规律，各类物质不断转换生成的过程。在初中教育阶段，在化学教学中渗透生命教育极为重要，能够让学生在课堂学习中逐渐领会生命科学的力量，增强生命保护意识和生态保护意识，学习生命保护技能，切身体会生命科学的魅力。文章将以初中化学课堂教学实际为依据，站在教师层面对生命科学视域下的初中化学课堂教学进行探究。', '[{"name_zh":"季晓云"}]', '[]', '["初中化学","生命科学教育","课堂教学"]', '{"name_zh":"教育界","raw":"Education Circle"}', NULL, NULL, '3', 2023, NULL),
('648ff9f6d68f896efa344e52', '10.3969/j.issn.0006-3193.2023.05.014', NULL, '跨学科整合的教学设计与探索——以"永不落地的北京雨燕"为例', NULL, '上海市新中考改革将生命科学、地理学等学科的跨学科案例分析作为综合测试考试内容,通过考试评价引导一线教师进行跨学科教学实践.本文以"永不落地的北京雨燕"为主题,探索了生命科学、地理学跨学科教学方式.', '[{"id":"64d7dcf7e1382366bc537875","name_zh":"李艳光","org_zh":"上海市蒙山中学"}]', '[]', '["跨学科","生命科学","地理学","北京雨燕"]', '{"name_zh":"生物学通报","raw":"Bulletin of Biology"}', '0006-3193', '58', '5', 2023, NULL),
('649eb1f8d68f896efa25ba84', '10.3969/j.issn.1673-5641.2023.05.109', NULL, '高校生命科学类学科竞赛组织管理体系研究与实践——以四川省大学生"生命之星"科技邀请赛为例', NULL, '学科竞赛是高校培养学生创新能力的主要途径.本文将经验总结和理论研究相结合,以四川省大学生"生命之星"科技邀请赛历届组织经验为基础,探索竞赛组织发展与人才培养的关系,完善创新型人才竞赛管理模式.形成了由竞赛设计框架、组建组织机构、指定规章制度、制定竞赛方案等组成的高校学科竞赛组织管理体系建议范本.', '[{"name_zh":"孔琳","org_zh":"西南交通大学","orgid":"5f71b3761c455f439fe430dd"}]', '[]', '["生命科学","学科竞赛","组织管理"]', '{"name_zh":"产业与科技论坛","raw":"Industrial & Science Tribune"}', '1673-5641', '22', '5', 2023, NULL);


——以"吐鲁番的葡萄熟了"为例', NULL, '开发了基于核心概念和"问题链"的生命科学和地理跨学科教学流程,并以"吐鲁番的葡萄熟了"为例进行了教学实践,取得了较好的效果.', '[{"id":"542a35d1dabfae86fd94f256","name_zh":"王文娟","org_zh":"上海师范大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e385"},{"id":"616e1d5660a9656471f61edf","name_zh":"闫白洋","org_zh":"上海市行知中学","orgid":"5f71b85c1c455f439fe5f7fb"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","地理","跨学科教学","核心概念","问题链"]', '{"name_zh":"中学生物学","raw":"Middle School Biology"}', '1003-7586', '38', '2', 2022, NULL),
('62a862045aee126c0f36c6fd', NULL, NULL, '对小学生命科学拓展性课程的探索', NULL, '生命科学的内容趣味性强,贴近小学生生活,往往作为小学生入门科学世界的启蒙内容.但是,关于生命科学内容的课堂教学往往会受到教学时间、教学素材、活动形式等因素的束缚.文章基于小学科学教材,从"资源开发""平台建设""目标验收"等三方面探索关于儿童生命科学教育的拓展性课程实施策略,解决了当前科学课堂教学的诸多难题,使内容题材更开放,组织形式更自由,目标定位更灵活.', '[{"id":"62e37f35d9f2043704c69a46","name_zh":"俞晓东","org_zh":"浙江省德清县乾元镇中心小学"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","拓展性课程","资源开发","平台建设","目标验收"]', '{"name_zh":"甘肃教育","raw":"Gansu Education"}', '1004-0463', NULL, '1', 2022, NULL),
('62cd46af5aee126c0f0d31d9', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-0407.2022.04.047', NULL, '生命科学课程中增强文化自信的两则重要教学案例', NULL, '自我国改革开放以来,多元价值观的交织与渗透已发生和正在发生,对当代大学生的价值观产生重要影响.过度依赖思想政治理论课的局限性也越来越明显,由此,建立多学科协同共振的大思政体系是新时代的必然要求.本文通过生命科学专业课程与思政教育中已有和新发现的交叉点,深化一则并新增一则重要教学案例,辅以多种教学途径,有效融入思政元素,用以增强大学生的文化自信与民族自豪感,提升大学生的文化传承责任感.', '[{"name_zh":"陆桂华","org_zh":"淮阴师范学院","orgid":"61e698686896273465736257"},{"id":"62e3a51bd9f2043704ddefac","name_zh":"张曈","org_zh":"淮阴师范学院","orgid":"61e698686896273465736257"}]', NULL, '["价值观","课程思程","生命科学专业课程","中华优秀文化","文化自信"]', '{"name_zh":"南北桥","raw":"South North Bridge"}', '1672-0407', NULL, '4', 2022, NULL),
('646b3413d68f896efa18ef83', '10.19484/j.cnki.1000-8934.2022.12.002', 'From Evidence to Belief:Resolving Goodman''s New Riddle of Induction', '从证据到信念:重解古德曼的新归纳之谜', NULL, '古德曼的新归纳难题探讨如何从多个可能的类律命题中确证科学定律,曾引发诸多争论及解法.其中古德曼的投射法有效地揭示出由客观证据到科学定律确证的路径,却忽略了主体信念的中介作用.鉴于此,可尝试采取一条证据、信念到科学定律确证的新路径,结合与信念相关的心理学理论,证明信念可能贯穿于从证据到科学确证的全过程:影响人们对新证据的认识及对科学命题的判别,揭示科学定律的确证不是一蹴而就的,而是伴随着主观变化的过程.最后,通过生命科学的案例探析信念对证据及科学发现的影响.', '[{"id":"64bb4b0de138232355f7351d","name":"LI Shuang","name_zh":"李双","org":"上海交通大学","org_zh":"上海交通大学","orgid":"5f71b54b1c455f439fe502b0"},{"id":"6154548060a96506679c8efb","name":"LI Xia","name_zh":"李侠","org":"上海交通大学","org_zh":"上海交通大学","orgid":"5f71b54b1c455f439fe502b0"}]', '[]', '["新归纳难题","古德曼","信念","生命科学","科学定律"]', '{"name_zh":"自然辩证法研究","raw":"Studies in Dialectics of Nature"}', '1000-8934', '38', '12', 2022, NULL),
('62b527555aee126c0f24aa4f', '10.14031/j.cnki.njwx.2022.05.045', NULL, '地方院校生命类专业创新人才培养模式的探索', NULL, '创新人才的培养是地方高校的教学宗旨.全国大学生生命科学竞赛作为已被选入"2020年全国普通高校大学生竟赛排行榜"的学科竞赛,在生命科学类专业竞赛中具有代表性,可成为培养创新人才的有效载体.针对目前生命科学类专业人才培养中存在的问题,主要从教育教学改革、"导师制+项目化"的科研训练和学科竞赛组织与保障三方面进行了教学改革的探索和尝试,初步形成了生命类专业实践与创新能力培养的人才培养模式.', '[{"id":"646a2ec8e80f1b0001167834","name_zh":"赵海燕","org_zh":"安阳工学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9b"},{"id":"62e392b2d9f2043704d2abdd","name_zh":"王建设","org_zh":"安阳工学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9b"},{"id":"62e8b58ad9f20422f0bfe5d3","name_zh":"王兴云","org_zh":"安阳工学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9b"},{"id":"6155183360a96506679d7cc2","name_zh":"刘玉玲","org_zh":"安阳工学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9b"},{"id":"542caea5dabfae4bbcf6734c","name_zh":"刘震","org_zh":"安阳工学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9b"},{"id":"53f4c892dabfaee57b77de63","name_zh":"彭仁海","org_zh":"安阳工学院","orgid":"61e69e3f6896273465743b9b"}]', NULL, '["大学生生命科学竞赛","地方院校","生命科学","创新人才","培养模式"]', '{"name_zh":"农机使用与维修","raw":"Farm Machinery Using & Maintenance"}', '1002-2538', NULL, '5', 2022, NULL),
('63d7d66490e50fcafd4085d9', NULL, NULL, '在生命科学探究活动中幼儿深度学习的支架策略', NULL, '本文运用具体案例分析，以探究含羞草的机械感受器细胞为例，从深度学习目标的设定，到深度学 习过程的开展，再到对教师深度教学支架策略的总结，运用情境导入支架的方式唤醒经验策略，有效提问支架， 奠基深度学习策略、应答及激励支架，深化学习策略，使教师在生命科学探究活动中能有效地提供给幼儿深度学 习的教学支架。', '[{"name_zh":"姜瑶","org_zh":"深圳市南山区南方科技大学附属幼儿园，广东深圳 518000","orgid":"5f71b52c1c455f439fe4f4e4"}]', '[]', '["生命科学","幼儿深度学习","支架策略"]', '{"name_zh":"孩子","raw":"haizi"}', '1671-2943', NULL, '13', 2022, NULL),
('6426ef1490e50fcafd46f96f', '10.19927/j.cnki.syyt.2022.12.048', 'About International Training Course under the Covid-2019 Epidemics ——an Example of Sino-US International Scientific Virtual and Field Training for Life Science', '新冠疫情下国际化实践教学模式的探索与思考——以南京大学中美生命科学国际云科考为例', NULL, '中美生命科学国际云科考项目是在新冠疫情背景下为促进国际交流、推动学科融合及培养国际化拔尖人才的新探索.本次科考注重学科的多样性和综合性,队员来自南京大学6个院系的15名优秀本科生和学校"飞越计划"选拔的5名优秀中学生,科考由波多黎各大学和南京大学的生命科学、地理学、社会学和历史学教师联合参与指导,教学方式采取线上授课与线下实践两种教学模式进行.科考训练的前4天为国际云科考教学,后4天为国内实地(盐城)科考.通过云科考教学,学生实现了与国际一流实践教育的有机结合,从结构到内容,科考采取虚实结合、内外贯通方式,效果良好.科考在培养具有国际化创新思维的同时,加深了学生的野外认知和思考,为国际化教学实习提供了新思路和新模式.', '[{"id":"62e396edd9f2043704d518db","name":"TIAN Xingjun","name_zh":"田兴军"},{"name":"ZHU Jingning","name_zh":"朱景宁"},{"id":"633415922fedb730e3a30a31","name":"YANG Yinghui","name_zh":"杨映辉"},{"name":"WANG Li","name_zh":"王丽"},{"name":"LI Can","name_zh":"李灿"},{"id":"64cda4a2a4a3eac765b5e2b5","name":"ZHOU Changfang","name_zh":"周长芳"}]', '[]', '["生命科学","国际化实践教学","云科考","疫情"]', '{"name_zh":"实验室研究与探索"}', '1006-7167', '41', '12', 2022, NULL),
('638968c290e50fcafde28b07', NULL, 'Thoughts on the Essence and Function of Life Gate Theory of Traditional Chinese Medicine from the Perspective of Modern Medicine', '现代医学视域下中医命门实质与功能思考', NULL, '文章通过系统梳理命门学说现代研究进展,对命门实质、功能进行总结、分析与思考.目前研究重点有二:一是对命门实质的争论仍在持续,但也在不断发展,发现"内分泌系统""脑""生殖系统"等与命门关系密切;二是命门实质决定功能,重在调节生命机能,涵盖现代医学内分泌与生殖调节功能,以及多能干细胞功能等.总体而言,现代医学发展不仅促进了命门实质的揭示,也拓展了命门学说的临床应用范围、深化了对某些疾病的认识.命门作为独立和高于五行脏腑系统调节枢纽的认识,进一步完善和丰富了中医学有关人体生命机能调节的理论.命门学说是中医学传承、创新、发展的"命门".', '[{"id":"6164542f60a9657b486e650d","name":"LIN Ming-xin","name_zh":"林明欣","org_zh":"中国中医科学院中医基础理论研究所","orgid":"61e6984d689627346573611e"},{"id":"62e38363d9f2043704c8ff4e","name":"WU Shan","name_zh":"吴珊","org_zh":"中国中医科学院中医基础理论研究所","orgid":"61e6984d689627346573611e"},{"id":"64d49971958ed6e72ace7c84","name":"CHEN Nan-jie","name_zh":"陈南杰","org_zh":"中国中医科学院中医基础理论研究所","orgid":"61e6984d689627346573611e"},{"name":"YANG Yan","name_zh":"杨燕","org_zh":"中国中医药科技发展中心(国家中医药管理局人才交流中心),北京100027"},{"id":"6170575d60a965737d74aa33","name":"WANG Chuan-chi","name_zh":"王传池","org_zh":"中国中医药科技发展中心(国家中医药管理局人才交流中心),北京100027"}]', NULL, '["命门","中医","现代医学","生命","生命科学","实质","功能"]', '{"name_zh":"中华中医药杂志"}', '1673-1727', '37', '7', 2022, NULL),
('62a8614a5aee126c0f340916', '10.11656/j.issn.1672-1519.2022.01.01', NULL, '文明互鉴,中西医并重,推进生命科学进步——太湖世界文化论坛六届年会的发言文稿', NULL, '中华文明历来提倡包容和合,56个民族的文明各有差异而融洽和谐.在当今民族大团结德政的引领下,各民族和谐相处,互鉴互动,为共筑中华民族伟大复兴而共同奋斗,堪为当今世界"文明互鉴"的典范.', '[{"id":"5431854bdabfae8fa2cc6f18","name_zh":"王永炎","org_zh":"中国中医科学院","orgid":"61e6984d689627346573611e"}]', NULL, '["中医药","中西医结合","哲学思维","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"天津中医药","raw":"Tianjin Journal of Traditional Chinese Medicine"}', '1672-1519', '39', '1', 2022, 1),
('62ef9b0690e50fcafd0263da', NULL, NULL, '刍议核心素养下初中生命科学教学中学生质疑能力的培养', NULL, '近几年来,教育教学中不断提及核心素养这个词汇,它不仅影响到该学科的最终教学效果,也决定了学生未来发展的最终方向.所以,培养学生的核心素养是理所当然的事情,教师注重培养学生的核心素养,越来越多的教师开始尝试以此为突破口,提高其教育质量.随着新课改的深入,教育界对基础教育阶段提出了新的要求,要求学生必须在学习基础知识的基础上,积极思考,发现问题,提出问题,最终通过自己的努力来解决.在此基础上,笔者对核心素养指导下初中生命科学教学中如何培养学生质疑能力进行了探索,提出了一些行之有效的教学策略,以便更好地培养学生的核心素养,提高初中生命科学教学质量.', '[{"name_zh":"唐鹿逸","org_zh":"上海市教育学会青浦清河湾中学"}]', NULL, '["初中生命科学","核心素养","质疑能力"]', '{"name_zh":"课堂内外·初中教研","raw":"Inside and Outside the Classroom"}', '1007-4899', NULL, '6', 2022, NULL),
('64b0e41b3fda6d7f06d12765', '10.12319/j.issn.2096-1200.2022.22.52', NULL, '初中生命科学实践活动中提升学生学科核心素养的探索', NULL, '生命科学实践活动是课堂教学活动的补充与延伸,是提升学生综合素养的重要方式.笔者以动手实验、开展科技活动、组织社会实践考察等生命科学实践活动为载体,对如何提升学生的生命科学学科核心素养做了探索.', '[{"id":"6333ff4d2fedb730e39b3ef0","name_zh":"陆红兰","org_zh":"上海市南洋初级中学"}]', '[]', '["初中生命科学","实践活动","学科核心素养"]', '{"name_zh":"丝路视野","raw":"The Silk Road Vision"}', '2096-1200', NULL, '22', 2022, NULL),
('6357fedc90e50fcafd2fd0f5', '10.19848/j.cnki.ISSN1005-2739.2022.04.0009', 'Exploration and practice of integrating ideological and political education into Cell Biology based on Nobel prize cases', '基于诺贝尔奖案例的细胞生物学课程思政探索与实践', NULL, '课程思政是落实高校立德树人根本任务的重要途径.对于生命科学类专业来说,细胞生物学等专业课程是课程思政建设的基本载体.细胞生物学的发展与诺贝尔奖密切相关,蕴含了丰富的思政元素.文章聚焦细胞生物学领域的诺贝尔奖案例,探讨如何用不同的授课方式将诺贝尔奖相关的思政案例融入到教学实践中,旨在培养学生在学习专业知识的基础上提高团队合作能力,树立正确的科学观、伦理道德观和价值观,增强民族自信心和培植爱国主义精神,以期为生命科学类专业开展课程思政提供参考.', '[{"id":"63340ddd2fedb730e3a00e1a","name":"LI Chengmin","name_zh":"厉成敏","org":"江苏科技大学","org_zh":"江苏科技大学","orgid":"61e6a22a689627346574d814"},{"id":"542a6d36dabfae2b4e103a7c","name":"XIAO Longyun","name_zh":"肖龙云","org":"江苏科技大学","org_zh":"江苏科技大学","orgid":"61e6a22a689627346574d814"}]', '[]', '["细胞生物学","生命科学","课程思政","诺贝尔奖案例","教学方法"]', '{"name_zh":"黑龙江动物繁殖","raw":"Heilongjiang Journal of Animal Reproduction"}', '1005-2739', '30', '4', 2022, 2),
('629f3d065aee126c0f075124', '10.16429/j.1009-7848.2022.01.045', 'Bibliometric Analysis of the Pungent Scientific Research from China and Foreign Countries', '国内外辣味科学研究的文献计量分析', NULL, '辣椒属植物如辣椒不仅具有独特的辣味,其组分如辣椒素类物质还具有诸多药理作用.为了更直观地把握辣味科学研究领域的现状和主要学术脉络,本文以Web of Science核心数据库中共13389篇文献作为数据源,从辣味科学研究文献数量、国家/期刊/学术机构/作者的影响力和研究热点等角度出发,借助文献计量学方法,运用VOSviewer软件、CiteSpace软件、MATLAB软件和Origin软件等统计分析工具,对2010—2020年期间全球辣味科学研究进行分析.结果表明,辣味科学研究不仅涉及食品科学和药理学等传统领域,还涉及植物科学、神经科学、毒理学和生物化学与分子生物学等众多领域,其中生物化学与分子生物学、药理学和神经科学是近10年的研究热点.美国在辣味科学研究领域的发文总量最多,中国和日本等国家紧随其后.中国年发文量增速较快,发文TOP20作者占比和论文整体的H指数均较大,而篇均引用次数低于美国和德国等国家.不同国家学术机构或作者间的合作已成为一种常态,主要涉及上述热点领域.本文通过关键词突跃分析,明确突跃强度最强、持续突跃时间最长和近年来的主要突跃关键词.分析结果对食品科学、化学、药理学和分子生物学等领域的学者整体把握辣味科学研究方向、发展趋势和热点具有重要的指导意义,也为辣味产业的决策提供理论依据.', '[{"name":"He Yuyu","name_zh":"贺宇玉","org_zh":"浙江工商大学统计与数学学院 杭州 310018","orgid":"5f71b43e1c455f439fe489f0"},{"name":"Zeng Ziyi","name_zh":"曾子逸","org_zh":"浙江工商大学统计与数学学院 杭州 310018","orgid":"5f71b43e1c455f439fe489f0"},{"name":"Wang Hui","name_zh":"王卉","org_zh":"浙江工商大学统计与数学学院 杭州 310018","orgid":"5f71b43e1c455f439fe489f0"},{"id":"5627fe9845cedb3398761b2e","name":"Chen Kexian","name_zh":"陈可先","org_zh":"浙江工商大学食品与生物工程学院 杭州 310018","orgid":"5f71b43e1c455f439fe489f0"}]', NULL, '["文献计量分析","辣味","科学引文索引","辣椒素","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"中国食品学报","raw":"Journal of Chinese Institute of Food Science and Technology"}', '1009-7848', '22', '1', 2022, 2),
('632a9ff190e50fcafd59cf6c', '10.3969/j.issn.1004-3381.2022.15.005', NULL, '生物科技的应用场景和发展趋势', NULL, '近20年来,生命科学和生物技术快速发展,基因编辑、合成生物学、脑科学、干细胞、生物信息存储、生物育种等前沿科学技术发展给人类生产生活带来诸多红利.一方面,生命科学的发展深刻地改变了人类对生命本质及其运行规律的认识;另一方面,生物技术的广泛应用引领了医学、农业、食品、能源、环境等领域的科技进步,前所未有地提升了人们的生活质量,为人类健康和经济社会发展作出了重要贡献.', '[{"id":"61525cee60a9652002081de4","name_zh":"刘云","org_zh":"中国科学院大学","orgid":"5f71b3941c455f439fe43dc6"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","生物科技","生物技术"]', '{"name_zh":"人民论坛","raw":"People''s Tribune"}', '1004-3381', NULL, '15', 2022, NULL),
('62a85f8f5aee126c0f2afcbb', '10.3969/j.issn.1005-2259.2022.12.003', NULL, '依托高校共建生命科学科创实践教育平台', NULL, '创新是科技强国的核心,为了建设校园科创文化,上海市松江一中与东华大学秉承"鼓励创新,培育精英,合作共赢"的原则,共同创建了"生命科学科创实践教育平台",这对于培养创新型人才意义深远.通过科学讲座、科创实践活动、科创项目和科创竞赛等形式,激发学生对生命科学知识的兴趣和科创热情,以实践促新知,充分发挥学生创造力.', '[{"id":"63246d37a36d2225e1fa1d5a","name_zh":"李清梅","org_zh":"上海市松江一中","orgid":"5f71b86b1c455f439fe5fe1b"},{"id":"632464d8a36d2225e1f8fbb6","name_zh":"周钢","org_zh":"上海市松江一中","orgid":"5f71b86b1c455f439fe5fe1b"},{"id":"560f852c45ce1e5961c7c7c2","name_zh":"张云龙","org_zh":"东华大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e37d"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","实践教育平台","校园科创文化","创新能力"]', '{"name_zh":"中学生物教学","raw":"BIOLOGY TEACHING IN MIDDLE SCHOOLS"}', '1005-2259', NULL, '12', 2022, NULL),
('6315df2990e50fcafd9d96dd', '10.3969/j.issn.2096-0387.2022.03.041', 'Research Progress of Molecular Imprinting Technology in The Life Science', '分子印迹技术在生命科学研究中的进展', NULL, '分子印迹技术是指为了获得在空间结构和结合位点上与目标模板分子完全相匹配的聚合物的一种实验制备技术,所制备的印迹聚合物具有较好的选择性、稳定性和广泛适用性等特质.本文从分子印迹技术的发展及在生命科学研究领域的应用等角度,对分子印迹技术进行综述,指出目前分子印迹技术在这些领域存在的问题,并简要预测分子印迹技术在这些领域的发展趋势.', '[{"id":"653022e950dee4c42271a882","name":"DAI Yin","name_zh":"戴寅","org_zh":"云南中烟工业有限责任公司技术中心 云南省烟草化学重点实验室,云南昆明 650231","orgid":"623316ed0a6eb14560465207"},{"name":"WANG Xiaochen","name_zh":"王潇辰","org_zh":"云南中烟工业有限责任公司技术中心 云南省烟草化学重点实验室,云南昆明 650231","orgid":"623316ed0a6eb14560465207"},{"id":"650bf7d8768b11dc729ec035","name":"ZHENG Yani","name_zh":"郑雅妮","org_zh":"云南中烟工业有限责任公司技术中心 云南省烟草化学重点实验室,云南昆明 650231","orgid":"623316ed0a6eb14560465207"},{"id":"64d6da168a47b677856ba78a","name":"LI Zhenjie","name_zh":"李振杰","org_zh":"云南中烟工业有限责任公司","orgid":"623316ed0a6eb14560465207"},{"name":"HONG Junli","name_zh":"洪俊丽","org_zh":"云南中烟工业有限责任公司技术中心 云南省烟草化学重点实验室,云南昆明 650231","orgid":"623316ed0a6eb14560465207"}]', NULL, '["分子印迹技术","分子印迹聚合物","生命科学"]', '{"name_zh":"生物化工","raw":"Biological Chemical Engineering"}', '2096-0387', '8', '3', 2022, NULL),
('62a861fe5aee126c0f36ac29', '10.13492/j.cnki.cmee.2022.04.006', NULL, '借助血型鉴定实验促进小学生科学思维的发展', NULL, '教育的本质是人与人之间的相互影响,其中最核心的相互影响就是思维的改变.科学课堂上如何发展学生的科学思维一直是困扰教师的难点.借助实验探究引导学生进行科学知识的学习及科学技能的训练,是一个操作性较强的切入点.对生命科学领域经典实验——血型鉴定进行延展,逐步促进学生思维发展,巧妙地为一线教师开发教学实验提供了新视角.', '[{"id":"6161dcb160a9657b486b4969","name_zh":"杨青青","org_zh":"北京教育学院","orgid":"61e69ea268962734657449c2"}]', NULL, '["科学思维","血型鉴定","生命科学领域","模拟实验","探究实验"]', '{"name_zh":"中国现代教育装备","raw":"China Modern Educational Equipment"}', '1672-1438', NULL, '4', 2022, NULL),
('62abf1495aee126c0f47e327', '10.16418/j.issn.1000-3045.20210802002', 'Overview of Cutting-edge Innovation in Life Sciences: Learning from Perspective of Broad Institute', '从美国博德研究所成功之道看生命科学前沿创新', NULL, '美国博德研究所自2004年成立起,坚持科技创新与管理创新并重;不到10年,即迈入世界一流生命科学研究机构行列,成为生命科学前沿创新的"领头羊""风向标",其独特的发展模式值得借鉴.研究表明,聚焦重大疾病诊治需求牵引科研攻关,打通从基础研究到转化应用的通路,构建跨学科、多层次整合研究模式,发挥战略科学家的领航领军作用,集聚小而精的杰出科学家团队,实施高度灵活的项目组织管理,以及打造背靠一流、辐射全美、拓展全球的创新网络,有效支撑了博德研究所高质量创新发展.我国可借鉴其经验,从将生命科学作为建设科技强国的突破口、面向人民生命健康加强顶层设计、夯实生命科学人力资源根基、深度融入生命科学全球创新网络4个方面,推进生命科学前沿创新.', '[{"id":"616bde6a60a9656471f18c8b","name":"ZHAO Runzhou","name_zh":"赵润州","org":"中国人民解放军军事科学院","org_zh":"中国人民解放军军事科学院","orgid":"5f71b5141c455f439fe4ea69"},{"id":"6597c675e577a45cc2eb45fc","name":"LIU Shu","name_zh":"刘术","org":"中国人民解放军军事科学院","org_zh":"中国人民解放军军事科学院","orgid":"5f71b5141c455f439fe4ea69"}]', '[]', '["生命科学","科研机构","博德研究所","前沿创新"]', '{"name_zh":"Bulletin of the Chinese Academy of Sciences","raw":"Bulletin of the Chinese Academy of Sciences"}', '1000-3045', '37', '2', 2022, NULL),
('62a85f555aee126c0f2a2ce0', '10.19980/j.CN23-1593/G4.2022.13.021', NULL, '生命科学理论体系的思政元素探究', NULL, '在立德树人的价值引领教育中,生命科学的知识体系是对学生进行生命价值观塑造的良好素材.理论体系中涉及的下列理念是应该贯彻的.人作为自然演化的最高等形式,在生命科学理论体系中应贯彻生命至上的理念;同时生物是自然演化的产物,应尊重生命的唯物主义的历史观,同时又需尊重人与自然的和谐共生、尊重现存生物个体的多样性,从而做到敬畏生命,敬畏自然.就生命本身而言,生命个体是复杂性和矛盾性的统一;科学思维的阶段性和螺旋式上升体现人类认识生命规律的创新性和批判性.生命科学理论体系所涉及的思政元素,为生命科学领域课程思政的实施提供了着力点和目标方向.新时代教师积极性、主动性、创造性的发挥和能力提升,是实现学生价值观引领的关键所在.', '[{"id":"56cb18b9c35f4f3c6565e2c8","name_zh":"余光辉","org_zh":"中南民族大学","orgid":"5f71b5211c455f439fe4efe3"},{"id":"6333ff7d2fedb730e39b5710","name_zh":"周雪妹","org_zh":"中南民族大学","orgid":"5f71b5211c455f439fe4efe3"},{"id":"6167981560a9656471ea7cc4","name_zh":"覃永华","org_zh":"中南民族大学","orgid":"5f71b5211c455f439fe4efe3"},{"id":"542bfe0ddabfae2b4e1c8f14","name_zh":"谭艳平","org_zh":"中南民族大学","orgid":"5f71b5211c455f439fe4efe3"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","知识体系","立德树人","思政元素","唯物史观"]', '{"name_zh":"高教学刊","raw":"Journal of Higher Education"}', '2096-000X', '8', '13', 2022, NULL),
('62a861cc5aee126c0f35bd32', '10.19935/j.cnki.1004-2326.2022.01.025', NULL, '信息技术在小学生命科学领域教学中的应用', NULL, '信息技术在教育领域的广泛应用,凸显了教育方式的多样化和教育途径的立体化.在小学科学生命科学领域教学中,为激发学生了解和认识自然界的兴趣,感受生命的奇妙,可运用信息技术手段辅助教学,让学生亲身经历种植、养殖过程,观察植物和动物完整的生命过程,并在教学中进一步促进生命科学领域教学与信息技术实现深度融合.', '[{"id":"6324c4aaa36d2225e108b25d","name_zh":"卢淼鸿","org_zh":"株洲市天元区白鹤小学"}]', NULL, '["信息技术","小学科学","生命科学","深度融合"]', '{"name_zh":"实验教学与仪器","raw":"Experiment Teaching and Apparatus"}', '1004-2326', '39', '1', 2022, NULL),
('62f9b11490e50fcafddeca99', '10.11946/cjstp.202204070254', 'Research fronts and researchers of top journals in life sciences published in China and abroad:A comparative study based on visualization technique', '国内外生命科学领域代表性期刊发文热点及学者构成分析', NULL, '[目的]对国内外生命科学领域17种代表性英文科技期刊进行大数据可视化比对分析,为中国科技期刊建设提供参考.[方法]采用文本聚类分析、文献检索与统计分析、内容调研分析、描述性统计分析及可视化分析等方法,多视角比较我国生命科学领域多个学科分类中英文科技期刊与国外对标期刊之间的差距,如前沿热点跟踪、热点作者追踪,以及其他文献计量学等方面的客观表现差异.[结果]国外期刊的总体优势大于国内对应期刊,但国内期刊正在逐步缩小与国外期刊的差距.ESI数据库前沿热点研究中美国占比最高,但呈逐年下降趋势;中国的占比正在不断上升,并在植物和动物学科领域中赶上美国.17种期刊中国外期刊的作者国际化程度并不都高于对应的国内期刊,有的国内期刊的作者国际化程度也比较高,尤其是Cellular&Molecular Immunology.国外各刊的核心作者国家来源都是美国居首,国内各刊的核心作者国家来源都是中国居首.[结论]我国生命科学领域的科研实力在某些细分领域追赶上美国,因此国内英文科技期刊需要逐步加大发文体量或是培育新刊以适应国内科研成果的发表需求,吸引正在外流的国内高水平稿件.国内期刊在发文策略上需要进一步明确,在紧跟科研热点与前沿的同时也要突出自己的宗旨和范畴,稳扎稳打、逐步发展.国内期刊要不断发展和培育核心作者,才能源源不断地获得高水平稿件.', '[{"id":"540967c9dabfae8faa68ba25","name":"LUO Lifeng","name_zh":"罗丽丰","org_zh":"中国科学院生物物理研究所Protein & Cell编辑部,北京市朝阳区大屯路15号 100101","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"61689f6a60a9656471ebdbfd","name":"GUO Wenjiao","name_zh":"郭文姣","org_zh":"中国科学院文献情报中心","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"5432001ddabfae8eb14cdd6d","name":"ZHANG Yanan","name_zh":"张亚男","org_zh":"中国科学院生物物理研究所Protein & Cell编辑部,北京市朝阳区大屯路15号 100101","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"name":"HAO Ning","name_zh":"郝宁","org_zh":"中国科学院生物物理研究所科学传播处,北京市朝阳区大屯路15号 100101","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"542fe00ddabfaea2f5545b6d","name":"ZHANG Xiaoxue","name_zh":"张晓雪","org_zh":"高等教育出版社,北京市朝阳区惠新东街4号 100029"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","英文科技期刊","ESI研究前沿","VOSviewer","聚类分析","核心作者"]', '{"name_zh":"中国科技期刊研究","raw":"Chinese Journal of Scientific and Technical Periodicals"}', '1001-7143', '33', '6', 2022, NULL),
('64b0060a3fda6d7f06e6a1c8', NULL, NULL, '遗传平衡新说·推导式与思考', NULL, '以自由交配的去隐状态这一特殊的遗传平衡表现形式为契机.对现有的利用哈代·温伯格公式进行的有关基因的计算进行了计算方法的改进,形成了推导式,并在此思路的基础上对由哈代·温伯格定律所表现出的遗传平衡做出更深层次的挖掘,让遗传平衡定律以最本质的形式展现出来,也就是——配子间的比例关系.这些理论可以更加直观的体现出基因之间的数学关系,也使得几乎所有的有关配子或者基因型的计算变得更加简单,值得进一步研究和推广.', '[{"name_zh":"金希合","org_zh":"安徽医学高等专科学校药学院 安徽 合肥 230601","orgid":"5f71b88b1c455f439fe60369"},{"name_zh":"李华","org_zh":"安徽医学高等专科学校药学院 安徽 合肥 230601","orgid":"5f71b88b1c455f439fe60369"}]', '[]', '["基因","哈代·温伯格定律","遗传平衡","生命科学","基因型频率与基因频率"]', '{"name_zh":"饮食保健","raw":"Diet Health"}', '2095-8439', NULL, '6', 2022, NULL),
('62a861ff5aee126c0f36b10c', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-550X.2022.04.009', NULL, 'PDCA循环在生命科学专业危机预警学生帮扶工作中的实践路径研究', NULL, 'Plan(策划)、Do(实施)、Check(检查)和Act(处置)是PDCA循环的四个组成部分,可以在管理过程中有提高工作质量.高校危机预警学生是高校管理工作的重要对象,本文以F大S院学生为研究对象,结合问卷调查及数据分析,探讨和设计使用PDCA循环帮扶危机预警学生的实践路径和实施方案,旨在缓解危机预警学生的焦虑情绪,促进高校"以人为本"理念实施,推动"三全育人"机制落实.', '[{"id":"6524b0af55b3f8ac46430960","name_zh":"连萍丽","org_zh":"福建师范大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e32f"},{"id":"64bd1092ede217000101de0e","name_zh":"张淼","org_zh":"福建师范大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e32f"},{"id":"64b9ffd5eaebc6696d6c6e78","name_zh":"王妍","org_zh":"福建师范大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e32f"}]', NULL, '["PDCA循环","危机预警学生","生命科学专业"]', '{"name_zh":"福建轻纺","raw":"The Light & Textile Industries of Fujian"}', '1007-550X', NULL, '4', 2022, NULL),
('62a8613b5aee126c0f33e366', '10.3969/j.issn.1005-2291.2022.02.098', NULL, '生命科学概论课程思政教学中结合茶文化的创新策略', NULL, '作为高等院校的基础课程,生命科学概论课程思政的体系建立是必不可少的.要完善生命科学概论课程思政的建设,在教学中不断挖掘思政教育元素尤为重要.茶文化作为中国优秀文化的代表,本身就具有一定的思政教育属性,因此,将二者进行融合有助于生命科学概论课程思政的教学开展.', '[{"id":"61676ffb60a9656471ea471a","name_zh":"房媛","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"},{"id":"6324dd08a36d2225e10fbb74","name_zh":"董林娟","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"},{"id":"6333fd5e2fedb730e39a9290","name_zh":"石钰","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"},{"id":"62e395efd9f2043704d47c14","name_zh":"王孟","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"}]', NULL, '["生命科学概论","课程思政","茶文化"]', '{"name_zh":"福建茶叶","raw":"Tea in Fujian"}', '1005-2291', '44', '2', 2022, NULL),
('6302e99690e50fcafd4846ff', '10.13865/j.cnki.cjbmb.2022.05.1626', 'Reform and Practice of Ideological and Political Teaching in Frontier of Life Science', '《生命科学前沿》课程思政的教学改革与实践', NULL, '"课程思政"融入研究生课程体系具有重要意义,"大思政"格局下的课程改革不断推进.《生命科学前沿》是湖南师范大学生物学科的研究生必修课程,致力于普及学科发展前沿.其思政元素较为丰富,是开展课程思政的优秀载体.在分析了 目前课程思政教学现状和存在问题的基础上,通过树立思政理念,提升教师开展课程思政的能动性;开展课程思政教学设计,注重课程前沿性和思政元素的有机融合.采用嵌入式课程思政的教学路径,提高课程思政教学效果等具体举措进行改革实践,实现学科前沿知识普及和价值引领相结合.实践证明,将思政内容引入专业课,可以提高学生学习主动性,引导学生树立正确的价值观,实现专业课协同育人的效果.课程思政重在建设,课程内容设计是先决条件,教师是关键,课程管理是基本保障,对课程思政教学改革实践进行反思,以期为相关生物学专业课程思政教学提供参考.', '[{"id":"63cff9368def4c1ab788c644","name":"ZHANG Yan","name_zh":"章燕","org_zh":"湖南师范大学","orgid":"5f71b3a61c455f439fe44569"},{"id":"542cb56edabfae4bbcf6ac37","name":"LIU Zhong-Hua","name_zh":"刘中华","org_zh":"湖南师范大学","orgid":"5f71b3a61c455f439fe44569"}]', NULL, '["生命科学前沿","课程思政","教学改革实践"]', '{"name_zh":"中国生物化学与分子生物学报","raw":"Chinese Journal of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology"}', '1007-7626', '38', '6', 2022, 1),
('62c804815aee126c0f4730c2', '10.3969/j.issn.1004-7549.2022.06.039', NULL, '利用学科知识渗透,让生命之花绽放——为专门学校学生开展生命教育的探索', NULL, '有了基于生命的价值观,才会有健康积极的人生态度和学习动力,才能逐渐成长为一个有价值、有正能量的人.本文结合专门学校生命教育的教学实践案例,阐述用生命科学相关知识,渗透到教育教学中,引导学生爱自己、爱生活、爱生命,建立生命与自我、与自然、与社会的和谐关系.希望藉生命科学教学,让那些处于"边缘"的学生重拾青春,让生命之花绽放.', '[{"name_zh":"吴晓","org_zh":"上海市澄源中学 上海 200065"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","生命教育","专门学校学生"]', '{"name_zh":"生物学教学","raw":"Biology Teaching"}', '1004-7549', '47', '6', 2022, NULL),
('62bd44ec5aee126c0f07871f', '10.12026/j.issn.1001-8565.2022.06.01', 'Supervision Strategy and Implementation Key Points of Scientific and Technological Ethical Governance in Health and Medical Field', '医学科技伦理治理监管策略和实施重点', NULL, '科技伦理治理属于实践伦理学范畴,其在不断解决科技活动产生的伦理问题和伦理冲突中发展.伦理治理具有共性要求和专业性标准,与健康相关的医学科技活动,包括生命科学和人工智能在医学领域的应用使医学科技伦理治理面临共性和独有的挑战.科技监管和伦理治理应考虑生命科学和医学研究的专业特殊性,并充分发挥现有伦理审查体系的作用.因新一代测序、基因编辑和人工智能等技术的应用使伦理治理的关注、侧重和标准有所改变,应采取措施加强医学科技伦理治理,进一步推动伦理先行.讨论了分类分级的监管审查策略和潜在的高效的区域伦理委员会的组织架构及审查机制,进而建议加强医学科技伦理治理的医学教育和继续教育.', '[{"id":"5440f2ccdabfae61acc0f6f3","name":"GUAN Jian","name_zh":"关健","org_zh":"中国医学科学院 &北京协和医学院 北京协和医院国家人口健康科学数据中心<临床医学>,北京 100730","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee2f"}]', NULL, '["科技伦理","伦理治理","伦理审查","生命科学","医学研究","区域伦理委员会"]', '{"name_zh":"中国医学伦理学","raw":"Chinese Medical Ethics"}', '1001-8565', '35', '6', 2022, 1),
('6357c7bd90e50fcafd645d43', '10.17520/biods.2022243', 'Why Do We Believe in Darwin’s Theory of Evolution—on the 25 Folds of Aesthetic Parsimony of on the Origin of Species', '为何要信达尔文的演化论——论《物种起源》的二十五重简约美', NULL, '科学理论的本质较量是解释力之简约美的较量,其使得科学革命成为可能.本文通过整理与剖析达尔文的《物种起源》的论述,展示了生命科学史上最伟大革命的内在理性,即,演化论相对于神创论的25重简约性优势,分别体现在解释:(1)驯化品种的产生、(2)驯化品种在内外性状层面的多样性的差异性、(3)(杂交的子代的)遗传性状的变化、(4)杂种与混血在健康度与生殖力方面的差异、(5)杂种与混血在性状变化上的差异、(6)生物形态分布的簇状格局、(7)生物形态分化在不同分类阶元内部的不均等性、(8)不同性状分化的不均等性、(9)物种间性状差别的渐变性、(10)伴随环境变化的形态变化、(11)相对环境变化的形态惯性、(12)生物间竞争强度分布的不均等性、(13)不同物种间的形态同似性、(14)个体间的形态差异随着个体发育而变大的现象、(15)生物的痕迹构造、(16)生物地理分布的系统差异性(贯穿诸生物分类阶元的稳定偏向的差异性)、(17)物种的"等级性"与其地理分布范围的关系、(18)生物地理分布的"岛屿"现象、(19)岛屿物种的总丰度低而土著物种丰度高的特征、(20)岛屿生物的类别构成特征、(21)岛屿生物与相邻大陆的生物间的相似度关系、(22)物种迁移与物种灭绝的地域差异性、(23)物种灭绝的渐变模式、(24)古生物与现存生物在形态上的关系、(25)胚胎形态与古生物形态间的相似关系.正是这25重简约美,铸造了《物种起源》作为最伟大的科学著作的底色,并奠定了现代生命科学研究的大方向与总方法——"范式".这一剖析亦有助于我们理解科学发展的真精神以及把握当代科学研究的进展.', '[{"id":"63249a7cc03fbd5be1f9a130","name_zh":"孙亚君","org":"上海对外经贸大学会展与传播学院,上海201620","org_zh":"上海对外经贸大学会展与传播学院","orgid":"6481881e6fdfd94331125355"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","科学革命","形态","生物地理学","岛屿","灭绝","古生物学","胚胎学"]', '{"name_zh":"生物多样性"}', '1005-0094', NULL, '9', 2022, NULL),
('62a85f115aee126c0f28f666', '10.3969/j.issn.1002-8196.2022.05.020', NULL, '小学科学"生命科学"领域有效教学策略研究', NULL, '小学科学课程中的"生命科学"领域内容贯穿整个小学阶段的学习周期,是科学课程中的重要组成部分,在生命教育方面具有重要意义,是落实科学课程标准的重要载体.在科学教学过程中,教师要高效完成"生命科学"领域的教学任务,促进学生科学能力的提高,就需要引导学生走进自然,从大自然中认识生命;动手实验,从实验中了解生命;观看视频,从视频中感受生命;搜集资料,从资料中理解生命.', '[{"name_zh":"蔡玲","org_zh":"辽宁省大连市甘井子区实验小学"}]', NULL, '["小学科学","\"生命科学\"领域","科学能力","素养"]', '{"name_zh":"辽宁教育","raw":"Liaoning Education"}', '1002-8196', NULL, '5', 2022, NULL),
('62a85eeb5aee126c0f2846ac', '10.16871/j.cnki.kjwh.2022.07.018', 'Teaching Reform of Life Science Experiment Classes under the Background of General Education:A Case of Zhejiang University', '通识教育背景下生命科学实验课堂的教学改革——以浙江大学为例', NULL, '在通识教育中,实验课的价值一直被人们所忽视.浙江大学通过开展通识教育课程改革,将实验课的教学内容生活化、层次化.在教学方法上,运用体验法让课堂变得更加鲜活,运用启发法促进学生跨学科学习,运用"抽丝剥茧"法培养学生正确的社会认知并使学生形成良好的批判性思维,对当前的通识教育以及实验课堂的教学改革有重要的启示.', '[{"name":"ZHANG Li","name_zh":"张丽","org_zh":"山东管理学院发展规划处 山东·济南 250357","orgid":"5f71b8ca1c455f439fe60d5f"}]', NULL, '["生命科学","通识教育","生物实验","课堂"]', '{"name_zh":"科教文汇","raw":"The Science Education Article Cultures"}', '1672-7894', NULL, '7', 2022, NULL),
('62ac14745aee126c0f3ab9bc', '10.16262/j.cnki.1000-8217.2022.01.004', 'Proposal Application,Peer Review and Funding of the Department of Life Sciences in 2021:An Overview', '2021年度生命科学部基金项目评审工作综述', NULL, '本文总结了2021年度国家自然科学基金委员会生命科学部项目申请、评审及资助情况,梳理了科学基金深化改革的实施情况,并提出下一年项目评审的工作思路.', '[{"id":"54270bd7dabfaebcea2619ef","name":"Tian Yanyan","name_zh":"田艳艳","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"},{"name":"Zhao Haiming","name_zh":"赵海铭","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"},{"name":"Zhu Mengjuan","name_zh":"朱孟娟","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"},{"name":"Zhu Xuejing","name_zh":"朱雪婧","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"},{"id":"6161b28460a9657b486b0740","name":"Xu Yanying","name_zh":"徐岩英","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"},{"id":"54374260dabfae9ef36374ed","name":"Feng Xuelian","name_zh":"冯雪莲","org_zh":"国家自然科学基金委员会","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee58"}]', NULL, '["国家自然科学基金委员会","生命科学","项目评审","资助情况"]', '{"name_zh":"中国科学基金","raw":"Bulletin of National Natural Science Foundation of China"}', '1000-8217', '36', '1', 2022, NULL),
('62cd48f45aee126c0f0f02a9', NULL, NULL, '"三单"设计,提升项目化学习的实效性——以教科版《科学》三年级下册"动物的一生"单元为例', NULL, '生命科学领域是小学阶段的重要学习领域,其进阶性、整体性、真实性特点,使其成了项目化学习的热点研究领域.教师根据学生的学习特点,设计了"三单",即"以导学单了解学生的学习需求,以助学单进行指导和反馈,以成果展示单呈现实证结果",以此促进学生科学思维的发展和学习能力的提升.', '[{"name_zh":"方丽丽","org_zh":"浙江省杭州市丁兰第二小学 310021"}]', NULL, '["小学科学","生命科学领域","项目化","\"三单\"设计"]', '{"name_zh":"教学月刊（小学版）综合","raw":"JIAOXUE YUEKAN(XIAOXUE BAN)"}', '1671-704X', NULL, '6', 2022, NULL),
('63c1a0a490e50fcafd8800d6', '10.16400/j.cnki.kjdk.2022.32.015', 'On the Construction of Disease Case Bases in Life Science General Education', '生命科学通识教育疾病案例库建设刍议', NULL, '生命科学通识教育旨在普及生命科学的基本理论和方法,是培养高素质复合型人才必不可少的重要支柱.自2000年以来,国内各高等院校都陆续建立了生命科学通识教育课程.但是,在新的时代和社会背景下,生命科学通识教育水平必须不断改进和提高.以健康和疾病这一课程紧密相关、学生普遍关心的话题作为突破口,建设和运用疾病案例库为实现上述目标提供了一条有效途径.', '[{"name":"LIANG Chao","name_zh":"梁超","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"id":"562b957645cedb3398ac25fd","name":"YE Zonghuang","name_zh":"叶宗煌","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"id":"53f42f6ddabfaee02ac7aac2","name":"HU Biru","name_zh":"胡碧茹","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"},{"name":"LIU Long","name_zh":"柳珑","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"}]', NULL, '["生命科学通识教育","疾病","案例库建设"]', '{"name_zh":"科教导刊"}', '1674-6813', NULL, '32', 2022, NULL),
('6357b7c890e50fcafdf8572f', '10.3969/j.issn.1003-7586.2022.08.026', NULL, '生命科学地理跨学科视域下"内环境与医药常识"专题复习', NULL, '进行了生命科学地理跨学科视域下的"内环境与医药常识"专题复习实践,在分析问题和解决问题中,提升了学生信息提取与处理、问题分析与质疑、结论阐释与创新的跨学科能力.', '[{"name_zh":"黄成","org_zh":"上海市宝山区教育学院"},{"id":"616e1d5660a9656471f61edf","name_zh":"闫白洋","org_zh":"上海市行知中学","orgid":"5f71b85c1c455f439fe5f7fb"}]', '[]', '["生命科学","地理","跨学科","专题复习","内环境","医药常识"]', '{"name_zh":"中学生物学","raw":"Middle School Biology"}', '1003-7586', '38', '8', 2022, NULL),
('63bfa40b90e50fcafd1654f6', '10.3868/j.issn.2095-1574.2022.05.010', 'Exploration and Practice of the Curriculum Construction of General Education Course "life Science Experiment in Life"', '"生活中的生命科学实验"通识课程建设的探索与实践', NULL, '通识教育是"双一流"建设背景下高等教育的重要组成部分,是新时期全面育人的必要途径.南开大学生物国家级实验教学示范中心以此为契机,以"生活中的生命科学实验"课程为锚点,面对不同专业背景的学生开设通识教育课程.依托生动丰富的实验项目,采用灵活适用的教学模式,在提升学生知识素养的同时,提高学生的实践能力,引导学生以更加多元化的角度和更加开阔的视野感受生活,热爱生活,享受生活.该课程取得了良好的教学效果,收获了学生的广泛好评,可为实践教学通识课和生命科学专业课的建设、改革与创新提供借鉴的思路和经验,具有良好的示范辐射作用.', '[{"id":"5613a91745ce1e596316a2ce","name":"SHEN Guang-shuang","name_zh":"沈广爽","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"name":"SUN Jie","name_zh":"孙洁","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"62e38dacd9f2043704cf58fa","name":"LI Jing-jing","name_zh":"李晶晶","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"5613a91745ce1e596316a2e0","name":"SHI Xue-qin","name_zh":"石雪芹","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"5613a91945ce1e596316a3e2","name":"DENG Fei","name_zh":"邓飞","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"5613a91a45ce1e596316a42c","name":"ZHAO Yu-hong","name_zh":"赵玉红","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"5613a91a45ce1e596316a44a","name":"LI Xin","name_zh":"李欣","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"5613a91a45ce1e596316a43e","name":"WEI Yuan","name_zh":"魏远","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"6162506160a9657b486c0bfc","name":"CHEN Rong-rong","name_zh":"陈容容","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"},{"id":"5613a91745ce1e596316a2ef","name":"XU Xin-xin","name_zh":"徐欣欣","org":"南开大学","org_zh":"南开大学","orgid":"5f71b2971c455f439fe3ceed"}]', '[]', '["生命科学","通识教育","实验教学"]', '{"name_zh":"高校生物学教学研究（电子版）","raw":"Biology Teaching in University"}', '2095-1574', '12', '5', 2022, NULL),
('62ab1f0d5aee126c0f40de42', '10.12026/j.issn.1001-8565.2022.05.04', 'Research and Reflection on Strengthening the Construction of Life Science and Medical Research Ethics Training System in Colleges and Universities', '关于加强高校生命科学和医学研究伦理培训体系建设的研究与思考', NULL, '科技伦理管理体系建设对于保障科学研究健康发展至关重要,也是高校科技创新和"双一流"建设的前提与基础.通过对高校生命科学和医学研究伦理委员会相关情况进行调研,并重点对培训体系建设情况进行对比分析,提出短板问题,进而结合北京大学的工作实例与当前生命科学与医学研究的发展态势提出加强前瞻性预防机制、发挥高校医教研协同优势、形成"三位一体"的伦理培训体系的工作建议,希望对高校科技伦理管理工作的优化提升有所借鉴.', '[{"id":"5611bb8445ce1e5962939f93","name":"ZAHNG Nannan","name_zh":"张楠楠","org_zh":"北京大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c85d"},{"id":"6166418160a9657b48711805","name":"ZHANG Haihong","name_zh":"张海洪","org_zh":"北京大学医学部科学研究处,北京 100191","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c85d"},{"name":"XIAO Yu","name_zh":"肖瑜","org_zh":"北京大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c85d"},{"id":"53f43fa7dabfaeb22f4acac3","name":"HAN Hongbin","name_zh":"韩鸿宾","org_zh":"北京大学医学部医学技术研究院/国家药品监督管理局医学成像设备质量评价与检测重点实验室,北京 100191"}]', NULL, '["科技伦理","高校","生命科学","医学","伦理培训"]', '{"name_zh":"中国医学伦理学","raw":"Chinese Medical Ethics"}', '1001-8565', '35', '5', 2022, NULL),
('6368e3b590e50fcafd21471c', '10.3969/j.issn.1674-6023.2022.26.004', NULL, '指向核心素养的生命科学探究能力提升的实验教学研究', NULL, '初中生命科学是自然学科中的基础学科,运用概念建构、模型建构、实验探究等教学策略可以培养学生的生命科学核心素养.生命科学学科含有大量的实验课程,通过创新教学模式、提升教学理念以及对实验课授课方式的改进,可以提高学生科学探究的能力,落实核心素养的培养.学生通过观察、推测、设计、实验、归纳分析和概括总结等过程,可以深度体验科学探究的过程;学生在感受科学探究带来的成就感的同时也锻炼了自己的动手能力,并且提高了形象思维和创造性思维能力.通过在实验过程中发现问题、分析问题、解决问题,可以培养学生严谨的科学态度,激发学生动手实验的兴趣,提高学生创新能力,引导学生在进行实验时多动手、多动脑.', '[{"name_zh":"姚乃隼","org_zh":"上海市奉贤中学附属三官堂学校","orgid":"623317410a6eb14560473dac"}]', NULL, '["初中教学","生命科学","核心素养","探究能力"]', '{"name_zh":"基础教育论坛"}', '1674-6023', NULL, '26', 2022, NULL),
('62a861385aee126c0f33df26', '10.3969/j.issn.1005-2291.2022.04.060', NULL, '浅析茶文化在生命科学概论课程思政教学中的应用和结合方法', NULL, '2020年,教育部印发的《高等学校课程思政建设指导纲要》中提出,课程思政建设要在全国所有高校、所有学科专业全面推进.由此可见,我国对于高校课程思政教育建设的重视度.随着传统文化、国学的兴起,把传统文化融入高校思政课堂的声音也越来越多.基于此,本文简要介绍了茶文化在生命科学概论课程思政教学中的应用,并提出有效的结合方法.', '[{"id":"61676ffb60a9656471ea471a","name_zh":"房媛","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"},{"id":"6324dd08a36d2225e10fbb74","name_zh":"董林娟","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"},{"id":"6333fd5e2fedb730e39a9290","name_zh":"石钰","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"},{"id":"62e395efd9f2043704d47c14","name_zh":"王孟","org_zh":"陕西服装工程学院","orgid":"623315d10a6eb14495638f3f"}]', NULL, '["茶文化","生命科学概论","高校思政"]', '{"name_zh":"福建茶叶","raw":"Tea in Fujian"}', '1005-2291', NULL, '4', 2022, NULL),
('6a91053b0a96f8c83c61c499', '10.11868/j.issn.1005-5053.2026.000074', 'Research Progress，global Trend，and Engineering Challenge of High-Performance High-Entropy Alloys', '高性能高熵合金的研究进展、全球态势及工程化挑战', 'To meet the stringent requirements for high-performance structural materials in the aerospace sector，high-entropy alloys (HEAs) have emerged as critical candidate materials owing to their unique design philosophy and distinctive performance characteristics. This work focuses on three typical HEA systems，namely refractory HEAs，lightweight HEAs，and eutectic HEAs. It systematically analyzes the representative compositions，microstructural features，and performance advantages of the three alloy systems，as well as the major technical bottlenecks and corresponding breakthrough approaches in core aerospace application scenarios such as ultra-high temperature service and lightweight design. By analyzing the research and development progress in major countries and regions worldwide，this work identifies the developmental trend of HEAs shifting from theoretical exploration to demand-driven research. It also sorts out the common scientific and technical challenges concerning composition design，fabrication，and performance evaluation that urgently need to be addressed for the engineering application of HEAs in aerospace，which are summarized as follows：(1) design and screening of HEAs component systems that break through the performance limits of conventional materials；(2) integrated computation and high-throughput rapid optimization technologies for the vast compositional space of HEAs；(3) high-quality and high-efficiency fabrication and forming technologies for complex HEAs components；(4) determination of cost-effective composition ranges that realize the coordinated optimization of mechanical performance and production cost for HEAs；(5) comprehensive performance assessment and database construction targeting extreme service environments. Furthermore，this work puts forward a forward-looking prospect on the future technological development directions of aerospace HEAs，aiming to provide theoretical support and technical references for accelerating the transformation of HEAs from fundamental research to vital engineering applications.', '为满足航空航天领域对高性能结构材料严苛的要求,高熵合金因其独特设计理念和性能特点成为重要的候选材料.本文聚焦难熔高熵合金、轻质高熵合金及共晶高熵合金 3类典型体系,系统分析这 3类高熵合金的代表性成分、组织特征与性能优势,以及在超高温、轻量化等航空航天关键应用场景中存在的主要技术瓶颈及突破路径.通过剖析世界主要国家和地区的研发态势,明确高熵合金由理论探索向需求牵引转化的发展趋势,梳理高熵合金在航空航天领域工程化应用亟须解决的设计、制备、性能评价等共性科学与技术挑战,主要包括:(1)突破传统材料性能极限的高熵合金组元体系设计与遴选;(2)高熵合金巨大成分空间的集成计算与高通量快速优化技术;(3)高熵合金复杂构件的高质量、高效率制备与成形技术;(4)寻求高熵合金性能与成本协同优化的"高性价比"成分区间;(5)面向极端服役场景的全方位性能评估与数据库建设.同时,对航空航天用高熵合金未来技术发展方向进行前瞻性展望,旨在为加速高熵合金从基础研究向关键工程化应用提供理论支撑与技术参考.', '[{"id":"63b4cbb7d844ef7aedfec4d3","name":"LIU Wei","name_zh":"刘伟","org":"3D Printing Research & Engineering Technology Center, AECC Beijing Institute of Aeronautical Materials, Beijing 100095, China","org_zh":"中国航发北京航空材料研究院"},{"name":"WANG Han","name_zh":"王瀚","org":"3D Printing Research & Engineering Technology Center, AECC Beijing Institute of Aeronautical Materials, Beijing 100095, China","org_zh":"中国航发北京航空材料研究院"},{"id":"56301eaf45ceb49c5d9acfc7","name":"LI Jia","name_zh":"李佳","org":"State Key Laboratory for Advanced Metals and Materials, University of Science and Technology Beijing, Beijing 100083, China","org_zh":"北京科技大学 新金属材料全国重点实验室,北京 100083","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e36a"},{"name":"CAO Jun","name_zh":"曹俊","org":"State Key Laboratory for Advanced Metals and Materials, University of Science and Technology Beijing, Beijing 100083, China","org_zh":"北京科技大学 新金属材料全国重点实验室,北京 100083","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e36a"},{"name":"ZHANG Bingbing","name_zh":"张兵兵","org":"Institute of High Energy Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100049, China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"name":"CHEN Sen","name_zh":"陈森","org":"Institute of Fluid Physics, China Academy of Engineering Physics, Mianyang 621900, Sichuan, China","org_zh":"中国工程物理研究院","orgid":"5f71b82d1c455f439fe5eb5b"},{"id":"53f47001dabfaeecd6a319e9","name":"LIU Binbin","name_zh":"刘斌斌","org":"State Key Laboratory for Advanced Metals and Materials, University of Science and Technology Beijing, Beijing 100083, China","org_zh":"北京科技大学 新金属材料全国重点实验室,北京 100083","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e36a"}]', '["aerospace","refractory high-entropy alloy","lightweight high-entropy alloy","eutectic high-entropy alloy","microstructure","mechanical property"]', '["航空航天","难熔高熵合金","轻质高熵合金","共晶高熵合金","微观组织","力学性能"]', '{"name_zh":"航空材料学报","raw":"Journal of Aeronautical Materials"}', '1005-5053', '46', '8', 2026, NULL),
('69ccd0049be8eb7c4b86389b', '10.15302/j-sscae-2026.01.012', 'Aeronautical and Astronautical Engineering in China: Development Status and Perspectives', '我国航空航天领域装备研制进展与展望', 'Aeronautical and astronautical engineering exemplifies national strategic emerging industries. Its system development builds upon industrial foundations to propel the comprehensive upgrade of the technological and manufacturing ecosystem. This study reviews the representative achievements in China''s aeronautical and astronautical engineering over the past decade, evaluates the industrial landscape and technological evolution, and proposes strategic measures for high-quality development. Progress is highlighted in two main sectors. In the aeronautical sector, highlights include the generational upgrade and systematic exploration of military aircraft, the independent development and commercial operation of civil aircraft, the core technology breakthroughs and support capability construction of propulsion, and the development and intelligent evolution of unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) systems. In the astronautical sector, achievements include the world-renowned feats of major engineering projects, launch vehicle capabilities leaping to the global forefront, satellite and application systems reaching international advanced levels, and the development of commercial spaceflight. Future development directions include: efficiency enhancement and configuration diversification of aircraft; high-efficiency, low-carbon, and multi-mode fusion of propulsion; intelligent connectivity, electrification, and integration of airborne systems; material innovation, intelligent manufacturing, and software ecosystem development in industrial technologies; all-domain perception, ubiquitous interconnection, and artificial intelligence (AI) empowerment in advanced enabling technologies; along with airline-like space access, cloud‒network-based space utilization, and all-domain space exploration. Finally, strategic actions are suggested in the following areas: constructing digital-empowered forward design capabilities; establishing a flexible, high-efficiency, and intelligent manufacturing system; developing resilient industrial clusters; improving regulatory frameworks adapted to new business formats and participating in international standards formulation; and strengthening engineering-oriented research.', '航空航天产业是国家战略性新兴产业的典型代表,相关装备发展既依托科技积淀与工业根基,也引领带动整体科技与制造体系的升级.本文梳理了过去10年我国航空航天领域装备的代表性进展,研判了我国航空航天领域装备的整体格局与发展方向并进一步提出发展举措建议.我国航空航天领域装备研制进展表现在:军用航空的装备跨代升级与体系化探索、民用航空的自主研制与规模化商业运营、航空动力的核心技术攻关与保障能力建设、无人机系统的体系化发展与智能化演进,航天重大工程取得举世瞩目成就、运载火箭能力跃居世界前列、卫星及应用体系达到国际先进水平、商业航天蓬勃发展.我国航空航天领域装备发展方向为:先进飞行器的效能提升与构型多元化,先进动力的高效、低碳与多模式融合,先进机载系统的智联化、电气化与集成化,先进工业技术方面的材料革新、数智制造与软件生态构建,先进使能技术方面的全域感知、泛在互联与人工智能赋能;进出空间航班化、利用空间云网化、探索空间全域化.后续,可在构建数字赋能的正向设计能力、建立柔性高效的现代化智能制造体系、发展韧性强劲的航空航天产业链群、完善适应新业态的监管体系并参与国际标准制定、筑牢工程导向的基础研究等方面采取行动,推动我国航空航天领域装备高质量发展.', '[{"id":"542e66acdabfae3f1d588be4","name":"Xiang Jinwu","name_zh":"向锦武","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"1.supSchool of Aeronautic Science and Engineering, Beihang University, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name":"Wang Guoqing","name_zh":"王国庆","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"2.supChina Aerospace Science and Technology Corporation, Beijing 100048, China","org_zh":"中国航天科技集团公司"},{"name":"Shao Haoyuan","name_zh":"邵浩原","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"1.supSchool of Aeronautic Science and Engineering, Beihang University, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name":"Zhang Yongwei","name_zh":"张永伟","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"3.supChina Academy of Aerospace System and Innovation, Beijing 100088, China","org_zh":"中国航天科技体系与创新研究院,北京 100088"},{"id":"560f40a845ce1e5961a788bd","name":"Li Daochun","name_zh":"李道春","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"1.supSchool of Aeronautic Science and Engineering, Beihang University, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name":"Sun Shengkai","name_zh":"孙胜凯","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"3.supChina Academy of Aerospace System and Innovation, Beijing 100088, China","org_zh":"中国航天科技体系与创新研究院,北京 100088"}]', '["aeronautical and astronautical engineering","digital transformation","forward design","low-altitude economy","commercial spaceflight"]', '["航空航天装备","数字化转型","正向设计","低空经济","商业航天"]', '{"name_zh":"中国工程科学","raw":"Strategic Study of CAE"}', '1009-1742', '28', '1', 2026, NULL),
('69f437d10a96f8c83c30fb6f', '10.11868/j.issn.1005-5053.2026.000021', 'Functional Design of MXene-based Composite and Research Progress in the Field of Intelligent Electromagnetics', 'MXene基复合材料的功能设计及在智能电磁领域的研究进展', 'MXene,as a typical two-dimensional transition metal carbide/nitride,exhibits broad application prospects in intelligent electromagnetic fields owing to its exceptional electrical conductivity,tunable interlayer spacing and rich surface functionalization.This review systematically summarizes recent advances in the synthesis,performance modulation strategies and research progress of MXene-based composites within the domain of electromagnetic functional materials.Firstly,it introduces the fundamental structural and electronic characteristics of two-dimensional MXene and critically examine prevailing synthesis routes alongside the resulting microstructural features of MXene-based composites.Secondly,it deeply explores the performance control strategies for these composites,elucidating the underlying mechanisms of multidimensional interfacial optimization—including tailored structural design,targeted surface functionalization and synergistic hybridization.Finally,in response to the key challenges currently faced by MXene-based composite,such as inadequate environmental stability,underdeveloped scalable manufacturing protocols and difficulties in achieving balanced multifunctional integration—it proposes promising future research directions to facilitate their translation into high-end applications,particularly in aerospace and related advanced technological fields.', 'MXene 作为新型二维过渡金属碳/氮化物的典型代表,凭借优异的导电性、可调控的层间距及丰富的表面官能团,在智能电磁领域展现出广阔应用前景.本文围绕 MXene 基复合材料的制备方法、性能调控策略及其在电磁功能材料前沿领域的研究进展展开系统论述.首先,介绍二维 MXene 材料的核心特性,重点分析 MXene 基复合材料的主要制备路径与微观结构特点;随后,深入探讨复合材料的性能调控策略,详细剖析结构设计、表面改性、复合杂化等多维界面协同优化的作用机制;最后,针对当前 MXene 基复合材料面临的环境稳定性欠佳、规模化制备技术受限、多功能协同平衡难度大等核心挑战,提出未来智能电磁材料设计的研究方向,为该类材料在航空航天等高端领域的实际应用提供参考.', '[{"name":"ZHANG Ran","name_zh":"张苒","org":"School of Materials and Chemical Engineering，Xuzhou Institute of Technology，Xuzhou 221018，Jiangsu，China","org_zh":"徐州工程学院 材料与化学工程学院,江苏 徐州 221018","orgid":"5f71b5411c455f439fe4febb"},{"name":"FANG Guian","name_zh":"方贵安","org":"School of Materials and Chemical Engineering，Xuzhou Institute of Technology，Xuzhou 221018，Jiangsu，China","org_zh":"徐州工程学院","orgid":"5f71b5411c455f439fe4febb"},{"name":"LU Yinqi","name_zh":"陆银琪","org":"School of Materials and Chemical Engineering，Xuzhou Institute of Technology，Xuzhou 221018，Jiangsu，China","org_zh":"徐州工程学院","orgid":"5f71b5411c455f439fe4febb"},{"name":"ZHANG Hongcheng","name_zh":"张洪程","org":"Foshan (South China) New Materials Research Institute，Foshan 528222，Guangdong，China","org_zh":"佛山(华南)新材料研究院,广东 佛山 528222","orgid":"648189716fdfd94331163937"},{"name":"DONG Liming","name_zh":"董黎明","org":"School of Materials and Chemical Engineering，Xuzhou Institute of Technology，Xuzhou 221018，Jiangsu，China","org_zh":"徐州工程学院","orgid":"5f71b5411c455f439fe4febb"}]', '["MXene","composite","intelligent functional material","electromagnetic shielding","aerospace and aviation"]', '["MXene","复合材料","智能材料","电磁屏蔽","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"航空材料学报","raw":"Journal of Aeronautical Materials"}', '1005-5053', '46', '4', 2026, NULL),
('6a0a78890a96f8c83c9b547f', '10.1631/jzus.a2500604', 'Flow Analysis of Asymmetric Clearance and Optimization of Pressure Equalization Grooves to Mitigate Hydraulic Spool Valve Sticking', '液压滑阀阀芯均压槽非对称间隙流动分析及防卡滞结构优化', 'The hydraulic spool valve is a critical control component in aerospace hydraulic systems.However,complex working environments can cause the valve core to become stuck,thus severely restricting the performance of such valves.This in turn can hinder the precise control of hydraulic oil,reduce the stability of the hydraulic system,and lead to serious accidents in aerospace systems.The unbalanced radial force and solid particle intrusion into the fit clearance are the main factors behind this sticking.To better understand these issues,in this study,we simulated the fluid dynamics and particle behavior within the clearance of the valve core and analyzed the effects of inclination angle,clearance size,particle diameter,and pressure equalization groove(PEG)properties.The mechanism behind valve core sticking was revealed,and it was found that the PEG has an inhibitory effect on the unbalanced radial force and particle intrusion.Furthermore,we proposed an optimized structure for a triangular pressure equalization groove with an arc-shaped bottom(Tri-PEG).The structural parameters were determined through multi-objective optimization,with the objectives of minimizing the leakage at the clearance and maximizing the particle volume fraction at the bottom of the Tri-PEG.The optimal parameters were an arc-shaped radius of 0.200 mm,a groove depth of 0.392 mm,and a half groove width of 0.215 mm.Comparing Tri-PEG with a rectangular PEG,the leakage was reduced by 12%,and the particle concentration was increased by 6%.Overall,these findings serve as an important reference for alleviating spool valve sticking.', NULL, '[{"name":"Zhen-hao Lin","org":"Zhejiang University","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0e1"},{"name":"Yu-wei Wang","org":"Zhejiang University","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0e1"},{"name":"Zhe-hui Ma","org":"Zhejiang University","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0e1"},{"name":"Tian-xiao Zhang","org":"Zhejiang University","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0e1"},{"id":"53f46763dabfaee02ad98c62","name":"Zhi-jiang Jin","org":"Zhejiang University","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0e1"},{"id":"5433b5e4dabfaeb5449b7f84","name":"Jin-yuan Qian","org":"Zhejiang University","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0e1"}]', '["Spool valve","Flow characteristics","Multi-objective optimization","Solid-liquid two-phase flow","Aerospace hydraulic systems","Valve sticking"]', '["Spool valve","Flow characteristics","Multi-objective optimization","Solid-liquid two-phase flow","Aerospace hydraulic systems","Valve sticking","滑阀","流量特性","多目标优化","固液两相流","航空航天液压系统","阀门卡滞"]', '{"raw":"Journal of Zhejiang University-SCIENCE A"}', '1673-565X', NULL, NULL, 2026, 33),
('6979fa9f9be8eb7c4be5c65e', '10.12073/j.hjxb.20241017001', 'Welding of NiTi Alloy with Dissimilar Metals and Its Application in Aerospace and Aviation Field', 'NiTi合金与异种金属焊接及其在航天航空装备制造领域的应用', 'NiTi alloy is a shape memory material with significant industrial value, boasting excellent shape memory properties, wear resistance, superelasticity, and biocompatibility. It holds extremely broad application prospects in many fields. However, due to its inherent high processing difficulty, in order to meet the lightweight requirements of NiTi shape memory alloy’s structural parts, NiTi shape memory alloy often needs to be welded with another easily processable material. The welding of heterogeneous materials can not only give full play to the performance advantages of the material itself but also greatly reduce the problem of system integration caused by the material. Fusion welding and solid-state welding methods for joining NiTi shape memory alloys with dissimilar metals were primarily introduced, and the main challenges faced during the welding process and their corresponding solutions were analyzed. Finally, based on the welding of NiTi shape memory alloys with dissimilar metals, their applications in the field of aerospace and aviation were introduced. This article aims to provide readers with an understanding of the research progress in welding NiTi shape memory alloys with dissimilar metals, while offering insights for optimizing the quality of dissimilar metal welded joints.', 'NiTi合金是一种具有重要工业价值的形状记忆材料,具有良好的形状记忆效应、耐磨性、超弹性和生物相容性,在许多领域都有极其广泛的应用前景.受限于其加工难度较大,为满足NiTi形状记忆合金结构件的轻量化要求,通常需要将NiTi形状记忆合金与其他易于加工的材料进行焊接.异质材料的焊接既能充分发挥材料本身的性能优势,又能大大减少由材料带来的系统集成的问题.文中主要介绍了NiTi形状记忆合金与异种金属的熔化焊与固相焊方法,分析了焊接过程中面临的主要难题及其解决措施.最后文中在NiTi形状记忆合金与异种金属焊接的基础上,介绍了其在航天航空制造领域的应用.文中总结了NiTi形状记忆与异种金属焊接的研究进展,同时为优化异质金属焊接接头质量提供思路.', '[{"id":"62e4beb8d9f204418d71bd98","name":"ZHANG Timing","name_zh":"张体明","org":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Nanchang Hangkong University, Nanchang, 330063, China","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"name":"LAN Ming","name_zh":"兰鸣","org":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Nanchang Hangkong University, Nanchang, 330063, China","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"63272fcaa95e4d1d0555436d","name":"CHEN Yuhua","name_zh":"陈玉华","org":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Nanchang Hangkong University, Nanchang, 330063, China","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"616fda0260a9652c7ca2cfd5","name":"FANG Naiwen","name_zh":"方乃文","org":"Harbin Welding Institute Limited Company, Harbin, 150028, China","org_zh":"中国机械总院集团哈尔滨焊接研究所有限公司,哈尔滨,150028"},{"id":"6170732160a965737d75027c","name":"XIE Jilin","name_zh":"谢吉林","org":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Nanchang Hangkong University, Nanchang, 330063, China","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"},{"id":"5458f511dabfaeb0fe2a4a6e","name":"WANG Shanlin","name_zh":"王善林","org":"School of Materials Science and Engineering, Nanchang Hangkong University, Nanchang, 330063, China","org_zh":"南昌航空大学","orgid":"5f71b4c41c455f439fe4c60b"}]', '["NiTi shape memory alloy","welding technology","dissimilar materials welding","aerospace and aviation field"]', '["NiTi形状记忆合金","焊接技术","异种金属焊接","航空航天领域"]', '{"name_zh":"焊接学报","raw":"Transactions of the China Welding Institution"}', '0253-360X', '47', '1', 2026, NULL),
('6a62e1320a96f8c83ca5e1be', '10.11868/j.issn.1001-4381.2026.000068', 'Research Progress in Wide-Temperature-range Superelastic NiTi-based Shape Memory Alloys and Their Applications in Aerospace', '宽温域超弹性NiTi基形状记忆合金研究进展及其在航空航天领域的应用', 'The rapid development of the aerospace field imposes stringent requirements on elastic materials， which need to simultaneously exhibit light weight， high strength， large recoverable strain， excellent energy dissipation， and fatigue resistance over a wide temperature range. NiTi shape memory alloys are promising candidates due to their superelasticity derived from thermoelastic martensitic transformation. However， limited by their low yield strength and high temperature dependence of superelastic stress， they exhibit a narrow superelastic temperature range， which limits their engineering applications in extreme environments such as aerospace. This paper focuses on NiTi-based alloys with wide-temperature-range superelasticity， systematically reviews the governing mechanisms of the superelastic temperature window， and summarizes the research progress of optimization strategies for expanding the superelastic temperature window， including grain refinement， elemental doping， heat treatment regulation， and composite structure construction. The temperature window expansion efficiency and engineering applicability of each strategy are analyzed. Furthermore， it summarizes the latest frontier applications in the aerospace field and discusses prospective technical pathways for improving material properties as well as potential directions for application expansion. This work aims to provide theoretical reference and technical insights for the high-performance design and engineering application of such materials.', '航空航天领域的快速发展对弹性材料提出了严苛要求,要求其在宽温域范围内兼具轻质高强、大的可回复应变、优异的能量耗散及抗疲劳性能.NiTi形状记忆合金因热弹性马氏体相变赋予的超弹性而展现出巨大应用潜力.然而,受限于低屈服强度与超弹应力的高温度依赖性,导致超弹性服役温域狭窄,制约了其在航空航天等极端温变环境中的工程应用.本文聚焦于宽温域超弹性NiTi基形状记忆合金,综述了超弹性温域的调控原理,总结了晶粒细化、元素掺杂、热处理调控及构建复合结构等拓展超弹性温域的研究进展,分析了各策略在温域拓展效果及工程适用性方面的优劣,概述了其在航天领域的最新应用,并对超弹性合金性能提升的技术路径与应用场景的拓展方向进行了展望,以期为该类材料的高性能设计与工程化应用提供理论参考和技术思路.', '[{"name":"CHEN Boer","name_zh":"陈波尔","org":"College of New Energy and Materials，China University of Petroleum，Beijing 102249，China","org_zh":"中国石油大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b5f91c455f439fe54a70"},{"name":"GUO Chunjiang","name_zh":"郭春江","org":"College of New Energy and Materials，China University of Petroleum，Beijing 102249，China","org_zh":"中国石油大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b5f91c455f439fe54a70"},{"name":"LI Zhonghan","name_zh":"李仲瀚","org":"College of New Energy and Materials，China University of Petroleum，Beijing 102249，China","org_zh":"中国石油大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b5f91c455f439fe54a70"},{"id":"5429e020dabfaec7081c32ec","name":"CUI Lishan","name_zh":"崔立山","org":"College of New Energy and Materials，China University of Petroleum，Beijing 102249，China","org_zh":"中国石油大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b5f91c455f439fe54a70"},{"id":"53f469addabfaedce55f4eda","name":"HAO Shijie","name_zh":"郝世杰","org":"College of New Energy and Materials，China University of Petroleum，Beijing 102249，China","org_zh":"中国石油大学（北京）","orgid":"5f71b5f91c455f439fe54a70"}]', '["NiTi shape memory alloy","superelasticity","wide temperature range","aerospace"]', '["NiTi形状记忆合金","超弹性","宽温域","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"材料工程","raw":"Journal of Materials Engineering"}', '1001-4381', '54', '7', 2026, NULL),
('67d4b379163c01c850ea00a1', '10.16356/j.1005-2615.2025.01.002', 'Review on Magnetically Controlled Welding Technology for Aerospace Materials', '航空航天材料磁控焊接技术综述', 'Magnetically controlled welding technology,as an efficient and high-quality metal welding method,possesses broad application prospects in the field of aerospace material processing.This paper pro-vides a comprehensive review on the basic principles,technical classifications,applications in aerospace mate-rials,as well as the current research status and development trends of magnetically controlled welding.By analyzing the impact of magnetically controlled welding on arc morphology,droplet transfer,molten pool flow,and solidification processes,the advantages of this technology in improving weld bead formation quality and enhancing mechanical properties are explored.Furthermore,with specific case studies and data analysis,the future development of magnetically controlled welding technology in the aerospace industry is identified.', '磁控焊接技术作为一种高效、高质量的金属焊接方法，在航空航天材料加工领域具有广泛的应用前景。本文综述了磁控焊接的基本原理、技术分类、航空航天材料的应用以及研究现状与发展趋势。通过分析磁控焊接对电弧形态、熔滴过渡、熔池流动及凝固过程的影响，探讨了其在提高焊缝成形质量、增强力学性能方面的优势。同时，结合具体案例和数据分析，展望了磁控焊接技术在航空航天工业中的未来发展。', '[{"name_zh":"李富祥","org_zh":"兰州理工大学省部共建有色先进加工与再利用国家重点实验室"},{"name_zh":"王敏"},{"name_zh":"林巧力"},{"name_zh":"石玗"}]', '["magnetically controlled welding","aerospace material","arc shape","weld formation","mechanical property"]', '["磁控焊接","航空航天材料","电弧形态","焊缝成形","力学性能"]', '{"name_zh":"南京航空航天大学学报"}', '1005-2615', NULL, '1', 2025, NULL);

——以北京航空航天大学、麻省理工大学及帝国理工大学为例', NULL, '航空航天工程的水平体现一个国家的科学技术水平,也是国家综合国力的体现.为促进航空航天事业发展,航空航天的人才培养显得尤为重要.北京航空航天大学、美国麻省理工大学和英国帝国理工大学高质量的航空航天学科本科教育得益于构建一套系统的航空航天人才培养体系,包含培养目标、专业教育能力要求、课程体系和教学模式等.通过中、美、英三国航空航天学科的人才培养模式对比分析,为我国航空航天人才培养模式的完善和创新提供一定的启示.', '[{"name_zh":"高静","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name_zh":"王耀坤","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name_zh":"李玉华","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', NULL, '["航空航天","人才培养体系","工程人才","培养目标","对比分析"]', '{"name_zh":"高教学刊"}', '2096-000X', '9', '4', 2023, NULL),
('6444377596e231b873f1b163', '10.16080/j.issn1671-833x.2023.03.030', 'Research Progress on Machining Condition Monitoring During Milling of Aerospace Thin-Walled Parts', '航空航天薄壁件铣削过程加工状态监测研究进展', NULL, '对切削加工状态进行精准监测,是实现航空航天薄壁件加工变形控制的重要保障.围绕航空航天薄壁件铣削加工状态监测的最新研究进展进行了评述,详细介绍了建立加工状态监测模型的关键技术与方法,包括加工信息采集处理、特征提取和特征融合.归纳了学者们在薄壁件加工过程中对刀具磨破损、铣削颤振、铣削变形等具体状态监测的研究进展.基于数字孪生技术,构建了面向薄壁件铣削加工状态监测的优化系统.最后,根据现阶段本领域发展状况对薄壁件铣削加工状态监测进行了展望.', '[{"id":"53f4cd12dabfaee579783b6c","name":"YUE Caixu","name_zh":"岳彩旭"},{"id":"6324bacca36d2225e10670ca","name":"ZHOU Tianxiang","name_zh":"周天祥"},{"id":"65138077768b11dc72a6ef2e","name":"QIN Yiyuan","name_zh":"秦怡源"},{"name":"WANG Le","name_zh":"王乐"},{"name":"HU Desheng","name_zh":"胡德生"}]', '[]', '["航空航天薄壁件","特征提取","刀具磨破损","铣削颤振","铣削变形","数字孪生"]', '{"name_zh":"航空制造技术","raw":"Aeronautical Manufacturing Technology"}', '1671-833X', '66', '3', 2023, 2),
('64d9ff8b3fda6d7f066c09b6', '10.13330/j.issn.1000-3940.2023.07.002', 'Hotspot technology mining in forging field based on patent big data analysis method', '基于专利大数据分析方法的锻压领域热点技术挖掘', NULL, '首先利用智慧芽专利大数据检索平台,梳理并分析了先进锻压各细分领域的热点技术及其全球分布情况与发展态势;继而采用可视化方法,对比分析了锻压领域各细分方向的全球主要研发实体及其重点技术布局、创新情况.结果表明:中国在先进锻压领域的专利总量全球排名第一,但日本、美国、德国的部分先进锻压技术仍处于全球领先水平;锻压前沿热点技术主要集中在高速精密锻造、锻压模具、锻件质量检测、连续锻造、锻压操作机、锻压数字化等方向;应用主要集中在航空航天大型模锻件、发动机环形锻件、钛合金锻件,汽车覆盖件、铝合金轮毂、燃料电池板,高速列车制动器轮毂、盘体,复杂薄壳体、风电发动机主轴等领域.', '[{"id":"63343a442fedb730e3b080cb","name":"Fan Lulu","name_zh":"樊璐璐","org":"中机生产力促进中心","org_zh":"中机生产力促进中心","orgid":"6233172c0a6eb145604703ee"},{"name":"Fan Xin","name_zh":"范鑫","org":"中机生产力促进中心","org_zh":"中机生产力促进中心","orgid":"6233172c0a6eb145604703ee"},{"name":"Li Andi","name_zh":"李安迪","org":"中机生产力促进中心","org_zh":"中机生产力促进中心","orgid":"6233172c0a6eb145604703ee"},{"id":"615fcf4760a965255bd76089","name":"Li Jingying","name_zh":"李晶莹","org":"中机生产力促进中心","org_zh":"中机生产力促进中心","orgid":"6233172c0a6eb145604703ee"},{"name":"Wu Jinjun","name_zh":"吴进军","org":"中机生产力促进中心","org_zh":"中机生产力促进中心","orgid":"6233172c0a6eb145604703ee"}]', '["forging","patent analysis method","precision forming","aerospace","automobile"]', '["锻压","专利分析方法","精密成形","航空航天","汽车"]', '{"name_zh":"锻压技术","raw":"Forging & Stamping Technology"}', '1000-3940', '48', '7', 2023, NULL);

——以航空航天特色专业研究生课程教改为例', NULL, '以培养具有航空报国、创新超越意识的飞行器设计领域专业人才为目标,分析了高校研究生课程思政的建设现状,针对目前高校研究生教育的课程思政教改实践还未深入贯彻,特别是一些特色工科专业研究生课程的课程思政仍在起步阶段的问题,以航空航天类特色专业研究生课程"起落架设计基础"为抓手,通过课程思政建设总体设计、教学团队建设、思专融合的教学设计及协同育人路径等实践途径,开展研究生课程思政教学实践,打造了国家级课程思政示范课程,提出了"理论、实践、工程、综合"的研究生培养层次递进模型,研究了课程思政教学团队的建设原则与机制,提出三种不同的思专融合教学设计方法,并通过充分调动校内外资源实现协同育人.为新工科背景下研究生专业课的课程思政教学改革提供了具体思路与参考.', '[{"id":"60b483cc9e795e6baaaa8db1","name":"YIN Qiao-zhi","name_zh":"尹乔之"},{"name":"DENG Jian","name_zh":"邓健"},{"id":"60b483c39e795e6baaaa8d9b","name":"WEI Xiao-hui","name_zh":"魏小辉"},{"id":"6161b1ef60a9657b486b065a","name":"NIE Hong","name_zh":"聂宏"}]', '[]', '["课程思政","研究生培养","新工科","航空航天特色","思专融合"]', '{"name_zh":"教育教学论坛","raw":"jiaoyu jiaoxue luntan"}', '1674-9324', NULL, '8', 2023, NULL),
('646b438dd68f896efa213ee9', '10.12125/j.chj.202204130', 'The application of flipped classroom in aerospace cardiovascular medicine—taking the effect of weightlessness on cardiovascular functions as an example', '翻转课堂在航空航天心血管医学教学中的应用—以"失重对心血管功能的影响"为例', NULL, '目的 探索翻转课堂在航空航天心血管教学中的应用方法和效果.方法 以"失重对心血管功能的影响"章节为例,选取2018级航空航天专业学员49名学员,采用传统教学模式进行授课(对照组),选取2019级航空航天医学专业44名学员,采用翻转课堂教学模式进行授课(实验组).通过考试成绩、调查问卷结果对翻转课堂教学方法进行评估与分析.结果 实验组学员失重相关章节试题考试成绩明显优于对照组(P＜0.05);问卷调查结果表明翻转课堂模式下教学效果明显优于传统教学模式.结论 采用翻转课堂的教学模式能够解决航空航天心血管医学课程教学中的痛点问题,打破传统教学模式的限制,提高相关课程教学质量.', '[{"id":"63c4a59ddf1d768b3c42ed9f","name":"XUE Tong","name_zh":"薛桐","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"61542e8360a96506679c655b","name":"GAO Yuan","name_zh":"高原","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"56cb189dc35f4f3c65655db5","name":"ZHANG Shu","name_zh":"张舒","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"name":"SHI Fei","name_zh":"石菲","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"63dc0f59a777852dceb9809a","name":"GUO Xian","name_zh":"郭显","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"62e38586d9f2043704ca3e22","name":"SUN Quan","name_zh":"孙权","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"616aff9f60a9656471ef6a64","name":"ZHAO Jiang-dong","name_zh":"赵疆东","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"638b672dcba47807f61b61a1","name":"HU Ze-bing","name_zh":"胡泽兵","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"}]', '[]', '["翻转课堂","航空航天心血管医学","失重","心血管生理","教学应用"]', '{"name_zh":"心脏杂志","raw":"Chinese Heart Journal"}', '1009-7236', '35', '1', 2023, NULL),
('6462ed72d68f896efa8ef9d2', '10.3969/j.issn.2095-5065.2023.04.001', NULL, '"航空发动机结构分析与设计"课程线上线下混合式教学及思政教学实践研究', NULL, '"航空发动机结构分析与设计"是飞行器动力工程专业学生重要的核心专业课之一,对学生的专业水平、职业认同、未来规划等方面均有较大影响.南京航空航天大学能源与动力学院"航空发动机结构分析与设计"课程组基于课程特色构建了线上线下协同、理论实践结合、课堂内外兼修的多层次混合式课程思政教学模式,通过强化过程性考核实现了课程思政育人效果的检验,为航空航天类课程的思政引领教学提供了可行思路.', '[{"id":"60b484309e795e6baaaa8eb9","name_zh":"于国强","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"60b484299e795e6baaaa8ea6","name_zh":"孙志刚","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"542eecf9dabfae3ee71b08a2","name_zh":"尤超","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"56cb18c6c35f4f3c656620f3","name_zh":"宋迎东","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"}]', '[]', '["混合式课程","航空航天","课程思政"]', '{"name_zh":"工业和信息化教育","raw":"Indusrty and Information Technology Education"}', '2095-5065', NULL, '4', 2023, NULL),
('6553a612939a5f40825a2b8f', '10.16400/j.cnki.kjdk.2023.25.018', 'Exploration of Research-oriented Teaching Practice in Engineering Thermodynamics Course', '工程热力学课程研究型教学实践探索', NULL, '工程热力学是北京航空航天大学航空宇航科学与技术和动力工程及工程热物理学科的重要专业基础课,对航空航天专业人才的培养具有重要意义.文章针对工程热力学传统教学中存在的学生学习积极性不高等问题,结合航空航天专业特点,引入研究型教学模式.该研究型教学方法旨在培养学生自主学习的能力和创新意识,激发学生的学习积极性,为培养服务国家需求和引领时代发展的未来领军人才打下基础.', '[{"name":"LI Yulong","name_zh":"李育隆","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name":"HAN Can","name_zh":"韩灿","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"5611a98345ce1e59628d76c4","name":"DONG Bensi","name_zh":"董苯思","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', '["engineering thermodynamics","research based teaching","aerospace","thermal cycle"]', '["工程热力学","研究型教学","航空航天","热力循环"]', '{"name_zh":"科教导刊","raw":"The Guide of Science & Education"}', '1674-6813', NULL, '25', 2023, NULL),
('658e332b939a5f4082cfc39f', '10.13555/j.cnki.c.m.e.2023.06.013', 'Application of the aviator participate in class teaching mode in practical teaching of aviators''ear function assessment', '"飞行员进课堂"教学模式在飞行员耳功能评定实践教学中的应用', 'Objective To explore the application and effectiveness of"Aviator Participate in Class(APC)"teaching mode in the practical teaching of aviators''ear function assessment in aerospace clinical medicine.Methods A comparative study was conducted on students majoring in Aerospace Clinical Medicine who were enrolled in the 2017 and 2018 undergraduate programs.The observation group adopted the APC teaching mode,while the control group used traditional methods for practical teaching.We compared the results of the case analysis test in final theoretical exam and practical operation assessment between two groups,and evaluated their comprehensive abilities from four aspects:communication,health education,team collaboration,and aviation clinical thinking.We also analyzed the attitude of the observation group to the APC teaching mode and traditional teaching methods.We performed t-tests using SPSS 22.0 software.Results The results showed that the scores of case analysis questions and practical assessment of eustachian tube ventilation function in the observation group were higher than those in the control group(P＜0.05).The observation group scored higher than the control group in three aspects of communication,health education,and aviation clinical thinking(P＜0.05);The observation group believes that compared to traditional teaching methods,the APC teaching mode can effectively enhance learning motivation and interest,enhance sense of professional honor,and improve problem-solving and thinking abilities.Conclusion The adoption of the APC teaching mode not only enhances students''understanding and mastery of knowledge and skill application,but also stimulates their enthusiasm for learning aviation clinical medicine,realizes the role of aviation clinical medicine thinking in solving practical problems,enhances the sense of honor of aviation military medicine profession,and gains recognition and appreciation from students.It is worth further promoting and applying.', '目的 探索"飞行员进课堂"教学模式在航空航天临床医学飞行员耳功能评定实践课教学中的应用及效果.方法 对开设航空航天临床医学的2017级、2018级航空航天临床医学专业五年制本科学员开展对照研究.观察组采用"飞行员进课堂"教学模式,对照组采用传统方法进行实践教学.对比两组学员理论考试病例分析试题成绩、实践操作考核成绩,从沟通交流、卫生宣教、团队协作、航空临床思维等四个方面进行综合能力评价,分析观察组学员对"飞行员进课堂"教学模式和传统教学方法的满意度.用SPSS 22.0软件进行t检验.结果 观察组理论考试中的病例分析试题成绩、咽鼓管通气功能检查实践考核成绩均高于对照组(P＜0.05).教学后观察组在沟通交流、卫生宣教、航空临床思维三个方面的能力评分均高于对照组(P＜0.05);观察组学员认为相较于传统教学方法,飞行员进课堂教学模式能够有效提升学习动机兴趣、增强职业使命荣誉感、提高分析解决问题能力与思维能力.结论 采用"飞行员进课堂"教学模式不仅增强了学员对知识、技能应用的掌握,还激发了对航空临床医学的学习热情,体会到航空临床医学思维在解决实际问题中的作用,提升了航空军医职业荣誉感,获得了学员的认可和喜爱,值得进一步推广应用.', '[{"name":"ZHANG Min","name_zh":"张敏","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"name":"ZHU Jing","name_zh":"朱靖","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"name":"SU Yuting","name_zh":"苏玉婷","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"64edfe578a47b66603e88d62","name":"JIANG Yihong","name_zh":"姜一弘","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"name":"WANG Han","name_zh":"王瀚","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"id":"61574e9360a9650667a042fb","name":"WANG Xiaocheng","name_zh":"王小成","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"}]', '["aviator participate in class","aerospace clinical medicine","practical teaching"]', '["飞行员进课堂","航空航天临床医学","实践课教学"]', '{"name_zh":"医学教育研究与实践","raw":"Medical Education Research and Practice"}', '2096-3181', '31', '6', 2023, NULL),
('653b704d939a5f4082710991', '10.16871/j.cnki.kjwh.2023.18.030', 'Exploration on Teaching Reform of Digital Circuit and System Design in Specialties of Aeronautics and Astronautics', '航空航天特色专业数字电路与系统设计教学改革探索', NULL, '南京航空航天大学数字电路与系统设计是探测制导与控制、自动化、电气工程与自动化、测控技术与仪器等航空航天特色专业的技术基础课和必修主干课.航空航天专业特色对数字电路与系统设计教学提出了具体要求.该文深入分析了南京航空航天大学航空航天特色专业数字电路与系统设计课程教学存在的若干问题,从教学内容与教学资源推陈出新、教学/考核方式丰富创新、空天报国情怀与专业技能融合培养等多个方面,对航空航天特色专业数字电路与系统设计教学改革进行探索与思考,为提高数字电路系列课程教学水平、培养新形势下航空航天后备人才提供支撑.', '[{"id":"60b484659e795e6baaaa8f46","name":"SU Zikang","name_zh":"苏子康","org":"南京航空航天大学","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"561572f845cedb3397aa785b","name":"YOU Xia","name_zh":"游霞","org":"南京航空航天大学","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"}]', '["teaching reform","Digital Circuit and System Design","specialties of aeronautics and astronautics","un-dergraduate teaching"]', '["教学改革","数字电路与系统设计","航空航天特色","本科教学"]', '{"name_zh":"科教文汇","raw":"The Science Education Article Cultures"}', '1672-7894', NULL, '18', 2023, NULL),
('65539e9d939a5f408246b999', '10.3969/j.issn.1002-2376.2023.19.012', 'Reflections on the Management of Clinical Internship Teaching for Undergraduate Students Majoring in Aerospace Medicine', '对航空航天医学专业本科学员临床实习教学管理工作的思考', NULL, '临床实习是医学专业本科学员获得岗位胜任力的关键环节.航空航天医学专业及相关医学岗位任职需求具有特殊性,对本科学员临床实习的教学管理工作提出了更高要求.该研究在介绍航空航天医学专业本科学员临床实习教学特殊性的基础上,通过分析空军军医大学在该专业本科学员临床实习教学管理中存在的问题,探讨改进措施,以提高临床实习教学水平及本科学员的岗位胜任力.', '[{"id":"63342ad52fedb730e3aa0dc5","name":"Liu Fengzhou","name_zh":"刘峰舟","org":"空军军医大学航空航天医学系 (陕西西安 710032)","org_zh":"空军军医大学航空航天医学系 (陕西西安 710032)","orgid":"62331e350a6eb147dca8a7f6"},{"name":"Wu Kan","name_zh":"吴侃","org":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学","org_zh":"中国人民解放军空军军医大学"},{"name":"Wan Qun","name_zh":"万群","org":"空军军医大学西京医院","org_zh":"空军军医大学西京医院","orgid":"62331e350a6eb147dca8a7f6"},{"id":"61574e9360a9650667a042fb","name":"Wang Xiaocheng","name_zh":"王小成","org":"空军军医大学航空航天医学系 (陕西西安 710032)","org_zh":"空军军医大学航空航天医学系 (陕西西安 710032)","orgid":"62331e350a6eb147dca8a7f6"},{"id":"53f46801dabfaee4dc854821","name":"Xue Junhui","name_zh":"薛军辉","org":"空军军医大学航空航天医学系 (陕西西安 710032)","org_zh":"空军军医大学航空航天医学系 (陕西西安 710032)","orgid":"62331e350a6eb147dca8a7f6"},{"name":"Yuan Peng","name_zh":"袁鹏","org":"第四军医大学唐都医院","org_zh":"第四军医大学唐都医院","orgid":"62331e350a6eb147dca8a7f6"}]', '["Aerospace medicine","Clinical internship","Post competency","Teaching management"]', '["航空航天医学","临床实习","岗位胜任力","教学管理"]', '{"name_zh":"医疗装备","raw":"Chinese Journal of Medical Device"}', '1002-2376', '36', '19', 2023, NULL),
('6553adec939a5f40826e56c8', '10.16673/j.cnki.jcfzdx.2023.0263', NULL, '基于共享视角的高校宿舍设计优化', NULL, '随着中国高等教育的现代化进程不断深入,各地高校园区的建设日益活跃.通过探讨与高校学生宿舍相关的设计与实践,强调住宿环境及其空间使用效率对学生生活的重要性.通过分析当前国内高校宿舍建筑的设计及使用情况,揭示其存在的普遍问题.为解决这些问题,提出了"共享"的设计方案和解决思路,着重强调如何在宿舍内部创造共享的空间,利用共享的资源和设施来提高宿舍的使用效率和空间体验,以满足当代大学生的生理和心理需求.', '[{"name_zh":"夏昱","org_zh":"南京工业大学","orgid":"5f71b3501c455f439fe42054"},{"name_zh":"王畅","org_zh":"南京工业大学","orgid":"5f71b3501c455f439fe42054"}]', '[]', '["南京航空航天大学","高校学生宿舍","共享空间","高效利用","建筑设计"]', '{"name_zh":"建材发展导向","raw":"Development Guide to Building Materials"}', '1672-1675', '21', '20', 2023, NULL),
('64b652d43fda6d7f068180cd', NULL, 'Teaching Method Exploration of Advanced Engineering Thermodynamics Combined with Cutting-edge Technology Development in Aeronautics and Astronautics', '结合空天技术前沿的"高等工程热力学"教学方法探索', NULL, '"高等工程热力学"是工程热物理及热能工程专业研究生的必修课之一.在航空航天类院校开展"高等工程热力学"课程教学,对高等工程热力学基础理论和专业知识进行系统讲授的同时,需要紧密结合航空航天技术发展前沿,培养学生的学习兴趣,增强其学习动力和主动性.通过对"高等工程热力学"课程教学现状进行分析,指出了目前存在的"重知识,轻能力"的问题.针对上述问题,从教学方法、教学实践方面给出了结合航空航天技术发展前沿的"高等工程热力学"课程教学改革实施方案,并对某教学实例进行细致分析,切实提升教学质量.', '[{"id":"560f40cb45ce1e5961a799cc","name":"BAI Li-zhan","name_zh":"柏立战","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"560f40a945ce1e5961a7896e","name":"PANG Li-ping","name_zh":"庞丽萍","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', '[]', '["高等工程热力学","航空航天","发展前沿","课程教学"]', '{"name_zh":"教育教学论坛","raw":"jiaoyu jiaoxue luntan"}', '1674-9324', NULL, '22', 2023, NULL),
('6498ed89d68f896efacb637b', '10.3969/j.issn.1006-3013.2023.04.014', NULL, '航空文旅产业融合发展路径的实践探索研究——以寿昌航空小镇为例', NULL, '随着国民经济的发展和人民生活水平的提高,航空文旅产业融合发展备受关注.首先分析了航空文旅产业融合发展的现状和特点,然后以寿昌航空小镇为实践案例,探讨航空文旅产业融合发展的路径和实践探索.提出构建航空文化创意产业生态圈策略和措施、打造特色空间规划的建设思路等.为其他地区推进航空文旅产业融合发展提供了有益的参考和借鉴.', '[{"id":"63e9d6848def4c1ab7b3fa8c","name_zh":"刘文祥","org_zh":"信阳农林学院","orgid":"61e69ca2689627346573fc29"},{"id":"6324998aa36d2225e101426c","name_zh":"薛莹","org_zh":"信阳农林学院","orgid":"61e69ca2689627346573fc29"}]', '[]', '["航空航天","文旅产业","融合发展"]', '{"name_zh":"海峡科技与产业","raw":"Technology and Industry Across The Strait"}', '1006-3013', '36', '4', 2023, NULL),
('64b651e13fda6d7f067e8a4a', '10.3969/j.issn.1003-4226.2023.03.001', 'Development status of superalloy fasteners for domestic aerospace', '国内航空航天用高温合金紧固件发展现状', NULL, '随着航空航天工业的快速发展,服役工况更加复杂而严苛,对材料的高温性能提出了更高的要求,高温合金紧固件因其优良的高温性能而得到广泛应用.从国内航空航天用高温合金紧固件典型产品选材、研发生产现状、主要研制生产单位、关键核心技术突破等方面分析国内航空航天用高温合金紧固件发展,指出在批次稳定性、基础制造能力和标准规范体系建设等方面存在的问题和不足,提出了今后努力的方向.', '[{"name":"Zhu Hangxin","name_zh":"朱行欣","org":"中钢集团郑州金属制品研究院","org_zh":"中钢集团郑州金属制品研究院","orgid":"5f71b3a41c455f439fe444a5"},{"id":"64beae65ede217000102eca5","name":"Hu Xiaopei","name_zh":"胡晓培","org":"国家知识产权局专利审查协作河南中心,河南 郑州 450001","org_zh":"国家知识产权局专利审查协作河南中心,河南 郑州 450001","orgid":"5f71b8451c455f439fe5ee4e"}]', '[]', '["航空航天","高温合金","紧固件","疲劳性能"]', '{"name_zh":"金属制品","raw":"Steel Wire Products"}', '1003-4226', '49', '3', 2023, 1),
('64b09d943fda6d7f064abc8b', '10.19980/j.CN23-1593/G4.2023.11.002', NULL, '航空航天背景下自动控制原理课程思政教学设计与实践', NULL, '思政课的本质是讲道理,是落实立德树人根本任务的重要举措.该文通过航空航天背景下自动控制原理课程建设的具体实践,深入挖掘课程蕴含的思政元素,将其与专业知识内容有机融合,采用灵活的授课形式与教学方法,提高思政课教学的实效性.通过课堂教学实践,取得良好的效果.', '[{"name_zh":"时伟","org_zh":"中南大学","orgid":"5f71b32e1c455f439fe410d4"},{"id":"56302ac845ceb49c5d9f0af5","name_zh":"陈溅来","org_zh":"中南大学","orgid":"5f71b32e1c455f439fe410d4"},{"id":"56302ac845ceb49c5d9f0aef","name_zh":"杨德贵","org_zh":"中南大学","orgid":"5f71b32e1c455f439fe410d4"},{"id":"53f4d1bcdabfaef0eef80543","name_zh":"梁步阁","org_zh":"中南大学","orgid":"5f71b32e1c455f439fe410d4"},{"id":"56302ac845ceb49c5d9f0b34","name_zh":"赵党军","org_zh":"中南大学","orgid":"5f71b32e1c455f439fe410d4"}]', '[]', '["航空航天","自动控制原理","思政教育","教学设计","人才培养"]', '{"name_zh":"高教学刊","raw":"Journal of Higher Education"}', '2096-000X', '9', '11', 2023, NULL),
('64286afd90e50fcafddfc4b7', '10.3969/j.issn.1009-8518.2023.01.007', 'Research and Application of Sensors with Great Flexibility and Deformability for Aerospace Recycling Equipment(2)——Stretchable Strain Sensor', '面向航天回收装备的大变形柔性传感器研究与应用(二)——大应变传感器', NULL, '在极端环境条件下,受温度、压力、速度等因素影响,具有柔性和大变形特征的航空航天装备极易发生故障,因此研发相应的大变形柔性传感器以对其服役状态下的应变、曲率、气动外形等参数进行实时监测面临巨大的挑战.文章面向具有柔性和大变形特征的航天回收降落伞,设计了大变形柔性应变传感器(简称大应变传感器),研究结果表明该大应变传感器在高达35％的应变范围内保持了优异的线性度(拟合优度>0.999).文章还进一步探索传感器在降落伞的伞衣、伞绳、径向带等部位的集成方案并进行系统性测试,通过航天降落伞地面高塔投放试验和风洞试验的示范应用,有效地获得降落伞的变形状态信息,这对降落伞的结构设计优化与实时控制具有重要意义.', '[{"id":"6475d54e9dd32e0001960766","name":"LIU Hao","name_zh":"刘浩"},{"id":"56286b7a45cedb33987ab893","name":"LI Shuang","name_zh":"李爽"},{"id":"6473566e9dd32e0001943abd","name":"LIU Guodong","name_zh":"刘国栋"},{"id":"6167e33a60a9656471eac25e","name":"JIA He","name_zh":"贾贺"},{"id":"53f44afddabfaee1c0affa3d","name":"FANG Guanhui","name_zh":"房冠辉"},{"id":"64b97095e138232355f5ec18","name":"FENG Rui","name_zh":"冯瑞"},{"id":"56cb18c6c35f4f3c65661f8d","name":"SU Yewang","name_zh":"苏业旺"}]', '[]', '["柔性","大变形","应变","传感器","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"航天返回与遥感"}', '1009-8518', '44', '1', 2023, 1),
('64c774c23fda6d7f06bf758f', '10.3969/j.issn.1674-1641.2023.07.003', NULL, '电子封装用金属基复合材料加工制造的研究进展', NULL, '在航空航天领域中,金属封装材料被广泛应用,对其加工制造工艺的研究具有重要的意义.近年来,金属基复合材料逐渐代替传统金属材料应用于新一代的航空航天电子封装领域中,对金属基复合材料的加工工艺进行优化,是满足新一代电子封装产品需求的关键.对传统封装金属和金属基复合封装材料加工制造的研究及应用现状进行阐述,分析金属基复合封装材料的加工难点,并对该领域未来的发展进行展望.', '[{"name_zh":"盖晓晨","org_zh":"成都四威高科技产业园有限公司 四川成都 610097","orgid":"6233175a0a6eb14560478578"}]', '[]', '["航空航天","金属基复合材料","电子封装","加工制造"]', '{"name_zh":"金属加工（冷加工）","raw":"Metal Working"}', '1674-1641', NULL, '7', 2023, NULL),
('64d9d5d23fda6d7f0640cfd7', '10.11868/j.issn.1001-4381.2022.000862', 'Research Progress in Resistance Implant Welding of Advanced Polymeric Composites', '先进聚合物基复合材料电阻植入焊技术研究进展', '(APC)areimportantstructural materialsforrealizingthe lightweight of aerospace vehicles. However, unfavorable factors such as low manufacturing efficiency,high cost,and serious energy consumption hinder the further expansion of APC applications.Resistanceimplantwelding (RIW)technologyhastheadvantagesofsimpleequipment, high weldingefficiency,energysavingandenvironmentalprotection,andissuitablefortheconnection oflarge structuralparts with curved surface.Itcan replacethetraditional bonding process and promoteAPC structuralpartstorealizegreen manufacturing,re-manufacturingandrecycling.The researchprogress of APC resistanceimplant welding process andits application technology were presentedinthispaper.Thechallengesfaced by APC resistanceimplant weldingtechnology were introduced.Theresearchstatusofthermoplasticcomposite RIW,processparameteroptimizationfor weldingpressureand weldingtime,implanttypes,thermosettingcompositeRIW andtheapplication technology of RIW in the manufacturing of large APC structural parts were summarized systematically.Theexisting problemsof APC resistanceimplant welding werepointed out,which relateto materialdesign,processoptimizationandfixture manufacturing.Inthefuture,theresearch on RIW technologyof TPC structureisexpectedtofocus onthe developmentofhigherstrength weldingbinder,the design of HE with new structure and theimprovement ofinterface bonding strengthbetweenbinderand HEtoimprovethebearingcapacityofjoints.Theresearchonmechanical constitutivemodel,fatiguestrengthandservicelifeofRIW jointswillbestrengthened;theresearch on weldingequipmentandfixturesforspecific APCcomponents willbecarriedouttopromote RIW engineeringtofillthegapsinthisareainChina.', '先进聚合物基复合材料(APC)是实现航空航天装备轻量化的重要结构材料,而制造效率低、成本高、耗能严重等因素阻碍了 APC的进一步扩大应用.电阻植入焊(RIW)技术具有设备简单、效率高、节能环保、适合大型曲面结构连接等优点,是能够替代传统的胶接工艺实现 APC 结构件的绿色制造、再制造、循环利用的革新性技术之一.本文综述了APC电阻植入焊工艺及应用技术的研究进展,介绍了 APC电阻植入焊技术面临的挑战,系统归纳总结了热塑性复合材料 RIW原理、电阻植入体类型、焊接工艺参数优化、热固性复合材料 RIW原理以及 RIW在大型 APC 结构件制造中的应用技术等,指出了 APC的 RIW目前存在涉及材料设计、工艺优化和夹具制造等方面的问题.在未来,热塑性复合材料(TPC)结构的 RIW技术相关的研究有望集中在发展更高强度的焊接黏结剂、设计新型结构的发热元件(HE)和改善黏结剂与 HE的界面结合强度等方面,以提高接头的承载能力;加强 RIW接头力学本构模型、疲劳强度以及服役寿命的研究;针对特定 APC部件开展焊接设备和夹具的研究,推动 RIW工程化,填补国内在该方面的空白.', '[{"id":"53f43377dabfaee2a1cc8b7c","name":"Xuhai Xiong","org":"沈阳航空航天大学","org_zh":"沈阳航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b4181c455f439fe478dc"},{"name":"Mengyuan Jiao","org":"沈阳航空航天大学","org_zh":"沈阳航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b4181c455f439fe478dc"},{"id":"62e8b607d9f20422f0c05923","name":"Lin Tian","org":"沈阳航空航天大学","org_zh":"沈阳航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b4181c455f439fe478dc"},{"id":"616fd9c56750f81b6d5ed9a7","name":"Guiyang Li","org":"Aerosp Res Inst Mat & Proc Technol, Beijing 100076, Peoples R China","org_zh":"航天材料及工艺研究所","orgid":"61e69d416896273465741491"},{"id":"62e8ac8cd9f20422f0b97134","name":"Daosheng Wang","org":"Aerosp Res Inst Mat & Proc Technol, Beijing 100076, Peoples R China","org_zh":"航天材料及工艺研究所","orgid":"61e69d416896273465741491"}]', '["advancedpolymer-matrixcomposites","aerospacevehicle","resistanceimplantwelding","welding parameter"]', '["先进聚合物基复合材料","航空航天装备","电阻植入焊","焊接工艺参数"]', '{"raw":"CAILIAO GONGCHENG-JOURNAL OF MATERIALS ENGINEERING"}', '1001-4381', '51', '7', 2023, 3),
('6549444d939a5f4082a049ed', '10.16871/j.cnki.kjwh.2023.19.024', 'Teaching Exploration of Thin Film Materials and Technology by Adding Aeronautics and Astronautics Contents', '融入航空航天元素的"薄膜材料与技术"课程教学探索', NULL, '"薄膜材料与技术"课程是为功能材料和新能源材料与器件专业本科生开设的一门专业选修课.该文结合学校航空航天特色,从真空技术基础、薄膜气相沉积方法、薄膜生长过程及薄膜结构、薄膜表征方法、薄膜材料应用五大章节入手,根据不同内容及特点融入不同的航空航天教学元素,达到既增强学生对课程知识的兴趣和理解力,又培养学生深爱祖国、航空报国的情怀的目的.', '[{"id":"60b485506750f87a4ab7b8a0","name":"LIU Jinsong","name_zh":"刘劲松","org":"南京航空航天大学","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"name":"ZHANG Shuai","name_zh":"张帅","org":"南京航空航天大学","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"60b485526750f87a4ab7b8a6","name":"TAO Haijun","name_zh":"陶海军","org":"南京航空航天大学","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"60b484469e795e6baaaa8ef0","name":"LI Yufang","name_zh":"李玉芳","org":"南京航空航天大学","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"}]', '["aeronautics and astronautics contents","Thin Film Materials and Technology","course teaching"]', '["航空航天元素","薄膜材料与技术","课程教学"]', '{"name_zh":"科教文汇","raw":"The Science Education Article Cultures"}', '1672-7894', NULL, '19', 2023, NULL),
('6491ef0ed68f896efaeefb06', NULL, 'A method for modeling three-dimensional morphology of dust particle based on cross-sectional SEM data characteristics', '基于截面SEM数据特征的微尘三维形貌建模方法', NULL, '多尘环境下服役的航空航天装备其性能受到微尘的严重影响,如沙漠起降的军用直升机、运输机和火星多尘表面使用的火星车等.为加强航空航天装备的防尘设计,微尘的三维形貌十分关键且影响着微尘的气动和附着等特性,但由于微尘粒径分布宽、成分复杂、外形不规则,获得精确的微尘三维形貌十分困难.提出了一种基于截面SEM数据特征的微尘三维形貌建模方法,通过逐层剥离获得高精度的微尘断层二维图像,基于埋入的钢球在断层图像中的半径变化,解决断层图像间距的精确测定难题,实现了基于断层图像的微尘三维形貌重构.以粒径100 μm微尘样品,利用所提出方法进行了三维形貌重构和分析,获得了500个砂尘的近似三维模型.定量化表征了微尘的三维形貌,形成了微尘的外形特性分析方法,为研究微尘气动、反弹与吸附特性提供了微尘的形貌数据,进而推动航空发动机冲蚀防护、航空发动机气体动力学与航天探测器的研究,对航空航天装备的防尘设计有重要意义.', '[{"name":"ZHOU Linhong","name_zh":"周林宏","org":"西安交通大学","org_zh":"西安交通大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc31"},{"id":"64eefe648a47b66603e9a0f5","name":"HE Guangyu","name_zh":"何光宇","org":"西安交通大学 机械工程学院,西安 710049","org_zh":"西安交通大学 机械工程学院,西安 710049","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc31"},{"id":"53f42e3cdabfaeb22f413895","name":"ZANG Shunlai","name_zh":"臧顺来","org":"西安交通大学","org_zh":"西安交通大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc31"}]', '[]', '["航空航天装备","微尘","几何特征","图像处理","三维形貌"]', '{"name_zh":"航空学报","raw":"Acta Aeronautica ET Astronautica Sinica"}', '1000-6893', '44', '4', 2023, NULL),
('6532277a939a5f408259e332', '10.16410/j.issn1000-8365.2023.3202', 'Research Progress and Aerospace Applications of Aluminum Matrix Composite', '铝基复合材料研究进展及其航空航天应用', NULL, '以铝及其合金作为基体的铝基复合材料不仅继承了铝合金选择范围广、易于加工制备及可热处理等优点,同时利用了不同类型增强体的优势,具有良好的综合力学、物理及化学等性能.高性能的轻质高强铝基复合材料的出现,为满足航空航天领域的应用需求提供了新途径,逐渐替代传统铝合金及其他基体类型的复合材料,在航空航天领域具有广阔的应用前景.基于此,本文介绍了铝基复合材料的基本分类,综述了近年来国内外铝基复合材料制备方法的主要进展,总结分析了铝基复合材料的物理、化学、力学、摩擦等性能,概述了铝基复合材料在航空航天领域的应用情况,最后展望了铝基复合材料的发展及应用,以期对促进铝基复合材料的发展及在航空航天领域的应用有所帮助.', '[{"id":"654a7541fa4d86e4aa9da357","name":"CAO Lin","name_zh":"曹遴","org":"西北工业大学","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"id":"5611e2cf45ce1e59629f1c55","name":"CHEN Biao","name_zh":"陈彪","org":"西北工业大学凝固技术国家重点实验室,陕西西安710072","org_zh":"西北工业大学凝固技术国家重点实验室,陕西西安710072","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"name":"JIA Zhendong","name_zh":"贾振东","org":"西北工业大学","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"name":"GAO Jianglin","name_zh":"高江霖","org":"西北工业大学","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"name":"LI Jinshan","name_zh":"李金山","org":"西北工业大学凝固技术国家重点实验室,陕西西安710072","org_zh":"西北工业大学凝固技术国家重点实验室,陕西西安710072","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"}]', '["aluminum matrix composites","preparation method","mechanical property","physical and chemical properties","aerospace applications"]', '["铝基复合材料","制备方法","力学性能","物理化学性能","航空航天应用"]', '{"name_zh":"铸造技术","raw":"Foundry Technology"}', '1000-8365', '44', '8', 2023, 1),
('653b6e2a939a5f40826c36f0', '10.3969/j.issn.1006-8945.2023.09.019', 'An Effective Way for Teenagers to Carry Out Aerospace Science Popularization Education', '开展中小学生航空航天类科普教育的一种有效方式', NULL, '开展青少年航空航天科普教育是提升青少年科研能力的重要举措,对推进现代国家的国防教育具有重大意义,能够有效解决航空航天高水平技术需求与科研队伍低创新力之间矛盾,以及缓解高水平素质教育要求与基础教育经费投入不足之间矛盾.以辽宁省为例,立足辽宁现有的 81 家航空航天类单位,将航空航天企事业单位、科研院所、高校汇集起来,通过搭建 14 个科普教育平台形成一套完整的教育体系,以实现科普教育由单纯体验式的被动接受模式向主动参与转变.', '[{"name":"SHI Feng","name_zh":"石峰","org":"沈阳航空航天大学","org_zh":"沈阳航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b4181c455f439fe478dc"},{"id":"6167370960a9656471e9d9de","name":"ZHOU Linna","name_zh":"周琳娜","org":"沈阳航空航天大学","org_zh":"沈阳航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b4181c455f439fe478dc"}]', '["teenagers","aerospace","science popularization education","new mode","science popularization platform"]', '["中小学生","航空航天","科普教育","新模式","科普平台"]', '{"name_zh":"天津科技","raw":"Tianjin Science & Technology"}', '1006-8945', '50', '9', 2023, NULL),
('657c7874939a5f4082fcab98', '10.16184/j.cnki.comprg.2023.11.010', NULL, 'ARINC818协议综述及设计', NULL, '针对在航天领域广泛应用的ARINC818协议进行了介绍.首先,介绍了协议的发展历史和组成;然后介绍了协议中的视频帧、主要协议层次,并详细介绍了ARINC818的帧格式及容器;最后,设计了一个将818视频数据转换成DVI视频数据的系统.', '[{"name_zh":"石岩","org_zh":"航空工业西安航空计算技术研究所"},{"name_zh":"李凤","org_zh":"航空工业西安航空计算技术研究所"},{"name_zh":"雷俊婷","org_zh":"航空工业西安航空计算技术研究所"}]', '[]', '["航空航天","ARINC818协议","协议层次","视频帧格式"]', '{"name_zh":"电脑编程技巧与维护","raw":"Computer Programming Skills & Maintenance"}', '1006-4052', NULL, '11', 2023, NULL),
('6553a46e939a5f408255fbbc', '10.3969/j.issn.2095-4085.2023.09.063', NULL, '航空航天飞行器热端部件用高温材料极端环境力学性能测试标准分析及展望', NULL, '本文结合现有高温、超高温等极端环境下先进材料力学性能测试技术,列举国内外相关测试标准,综合分析了航空航天飞行器热端部件用陶瓷材料、先进复合材料、金属及合金材料相关测试标准的现有情况,并对极端环境材料力学性能测试技术及相关标准体系建设提出展望.', '[{"name_zh":"刘莉","org_zh":"中国国检测试控股集团山东有限公司,山东枣庄 277100"},{"name_zh":"王利行","org_zh":"中国国检测试控股集团山东有限公司,山东枣庄 277100"},{"name_zh":"张正","org_zh":"中国国检测试控股集团山东有限公司,山东枣庄 277100"}]', '[]', '["航空航天发动机","极端环境","测试标准","先进复合材料","精细陶瓷","高温合金材料"]', '{"name_zh":"居业","raw":"Create Living"}', '2095-4085', NULL, '9', 2023, NULL),
('63be12e390e50fcafd9a3c90', '10.13467/j.cnki.jbuss.2022.05.007', 'The Evolution Process of Independent Innovation Model in Chinese Aerospace and the Chip Hard Technology Industry —Based on the Analysis Framework of Industrial Innovation Evolution System', '中国航空航天硬科技产业自主创新模式演进历程及其启示——基于产业创新演化系统分析框架', 'Hard technology industry is not only a high-tech industry, but also a strategic industry for a country to develop and maintain its competitive advantage. The aerospace industry is one of the most typical hard technology industries in the world today. Based on the industrial innovation evolution system, the paper reviews and summarizes the evolution of the independent innovation model of China’s aerospace hard technology industry from the two dimensions of “horizontal” and “vertical”, and finds that: In the early, middle and late stages of independent innovation and development of China’s aerospace industry, especially the aerospace hard technology industry, under the nationwide system, each innovation subject appropriately adopted the original innovation mode and the integrated innovation mode on the basis of introducing, digesting and absorbing re-innovation mode, and ensured the dominance of these two modes, thus achieved considerable success, which has laid a good foundation for China to transform from a weak aerospace country to an aerospace power in a relatively short period of time, and then to become a strong aerospace country, and provided useful inspiration for China to build itself into an aerospace power and achieve high-level scientific and technological self-reliance.', '硬科技产业不仅是高精尖产业,更是一个国家发展并保持竞争优势的战略产业.航空航天产业是当今世界最为典型的硬科技产业之一.基于产业创新演化系统,从"横向"和"纵向"两个维度,回顾总结中国航空航天硬科技产业自主创新模式的演进历程,可发现:中国在航空航天、尤其是航天硬科技产业自主创新发展的早期、中期和后期,在举国体制下,各创新主体能够较为恰当地在采取引进消化吸收再创新模式的基础上,采取原始创新模式以及集成创新模式,并确保后两种模式的主导地位,获得了相当大的成功.为中国在较短时期从航空航天弱国走向航天大国,进而实现航空航天强国奠定了良好基础;也为中国建设航空航天强国,实现高水平科技自立自强提供了有益启示.', '[{"id":"616a2d8660a9656471ee1b69","name":"NIE Xiao-jing","name_zh":"聂晓静","org":"宝鸡文理学院","org_zh":"宝鸡文理学院","orgid":"5f71b63a1c455f439fe566b8"},{"id":"6160d38960a9657b486a18ad","name":"YANG Zhong-tai","name_zh":"杨忠泰","org":"宝鸡文理学院","org_zh":"宝鸡文理学院","orgid":"5f71b63a1c455f439fe566b8"}]', '["hard technology","aerospace hard technology industry","original innovation mode","integrated innovation mode","introducing,digesting and absorbing re-innovation mode","inspiration"]', '["硬科技","中国航空航天硬科技产业","原始创新模式","集成创新模式","引进消化吸收再创新模式","启示"]', '{"name_zh":"宝鸡文理学院学报（社会科学版）","raw":"Journal of Baoji University of Arts and Science (Social Science Edition)"}', '1008-4193', '42', '5', 2022, NULL),
('64cbc2e03fda6d7f06a4795d', '10.3760/cmi.j.cn113854-20220908-00114', 'Advances on the integration of medicine and engineering in aerospace medicine—the papers of 
     2021 Aerospace Human and Environmental Engineering Conference', '航空航天医学之医工结合新进展——2021年航空航天人体与环境工程学术交流会论文综述', NULL, '2021年航空航天人体与环境工程学术交流会于2021年9月11—12日在北京举办。会议邀请了来自人机环领域的专家、学者和工程技术人员，就航空航天人机与环境工程专业发展和科技前沿等内容进行了报告交流。会议论文集共收录交流论文41篇，其中与航空航天医学密切相关的论文16篇（含英文摘要2篇）。笔者对航空航天医学领域的论文进行了综述，主要包括低压性缺氧的应对措施、温湿度的影响及热应激评价、人机工效与人工智能、座舱环境的影响、航空医学训练以及航天医学等方面。', '[{"id":"616c41dd60a9656471f2427c","name_zh":"葛朝丽","org_zh":"空军特色医学中心期刊编辑部，北京　100142"},{"name_zh":"陈雪","org_zh":"空军特色医学中心期刊编辑部，北京　100142"},{"id":"6165dc1660a9657b48705041","name_zh":"王志翔","org_zh":"空军特色医学中心期刊编辑部，北京　100142"}]', '["Aerospace medicine","Anoxia","Integration of medicine and engineering","Man-machine systems","Conference"]', '["航空航天医学","缺氧","医工结合","人机系统","会议"]', '{"name_zh":"中华航空航天医学杂志","raw":"Chinese Journal of Aerospace Medicine"}', '1007-6239', '33', '4', 2022, NULL),
('62ba66e95aee126c0f950821', '10.19980/j.CN23-1593/G4.2022.17.019', NULL, '航天器非线性动力学专业课程中分形维数的概念教学设计', NULL, '文章针对西北工业大学的航空航天专业航天器非线性动力学研究生课程的分型维度这一重要专题,围绕其教学设计、教学过程、教学思路和教学效果分析等进行创新,探索性地对航空航天类专业课程教学进行改革,旨在将创新思维培养、创新能力塑造的理念融入工科专业课程中,达到"如盐在肴,融于细微"的效果.文章所提出的教学设计方法将对推进西北工业大学专业课程实践具有重要引导作用.', '[{"id":"5614df3445ce1e5963532190","name_zh":"代洪华","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"id":"60dadfe09e795e60d9aea62d","name_zh":"谢丹","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"id":"5433979adabfaeb43f2ac598","name_zh":"岳晓奎","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"id":"56128ffa45ce1e5962caac99","name_zh":"朱战霞","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"}]', NULL, '["教学设计","航空航天","专业课程","分型维度"]', '{"name_zh":"高教学刊","raw":"Journal of Higher Education"}', '2096-000X', '8', '17', 2022, NULL),
('64b0a3e53fda6d7f06579ee8', NULL, 'Exploration and Practice of "Curriculum Ideological and Political Education" in Aerospace Majors', '航空航天专业课程思政教育的探索与实践', NULL, '课程思政是新时代对高校思想政治教育工作的新要求.航空航天类等理工科专业是高校课程思政教育的难点,也是航天类院校课程思政的重点.以"航天飞行器控制系统设计"课程为例,分析了航空航天类专业课程思政存在的现状和问题,探讨了航空航天类专业开展课程思政的路径,设计了融入爱国情怀、社会责任、科学素养等思政元素的教学内容,提出了适应课程思政内容的教学模式改进措施,为航空航天类专业课程思政有机融入专业教学提供参考.', '[{"name":"ZHANG Ran","name_zh":"张冉","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"645da0c6e80f1b00010d0d16","name":"ZHANG Rui","name_zh":"张蕊","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"560f7fd545ce1e5961c58031","name":"LI Hui-feng","name_zh":"李惠峰","org":"北京航空航天大学","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', '[]', '["课程思政","航空航天","思政育人","教学模式"]', '{"name_zh":"教育教学论坛","raw":"jiaoyu jiaoxue luntan"}', '1674-9324', NULL, '40', 2022, 1),
('6367f33990e50fcafd90aeb4', '10.3969/j.issn.1671-8909.2022.09.005', NULL, '激光清洗在电力及航空航天领域应用简介', NULL, '作为一种新兴的清洗技术，激光清洗具有适用材料范围广、对基体损伤小、非接触加工、无工具损耗、环境污染小等显著优势，在船舶、航空航天、电力电网、汽车制造、轨道交通、精密电子等领域均有广阔的应用前景。本文针对电力及航空航天两个典型行业，概述激光清洗技术的应用进展，分析激光清洗与传统人工去除、化学清洗、机械加工等方式的对比优势，为这一技术的进一步推广应用提供参考。', '[{"name_zh":"刘化平","org_zh":"安徽吉电新能源有限公司"},{"name_zh":"管迎春","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学合肥创新研究院","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', NULL, '["激光清洗","电力","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"清洗世界"}', '1671-8909', NULL, '9', 2022, NULL),
('64917e3dd68f896efa53b2f2', '10.19328/j.cnki.2096-8655.2022.06.010', 'Recent Development of High Strength Mg-RE Alloys for Aerospace Application', '航空航天用高强度Mg?RE系合金的研究进展', NULL, '近年来,镁稀土合金由于其高强度、低密度和高温性能良好等特点,在追求轻量化的航空航天产业当中受到越来越多的关注.总结当前主流的2系高强度Mg-RE合金(Mg-Gd和Mg-Y系合金)的性能特点、强化机制和研究进展,简要介绍其他Mg-RE合金的研究情况,最后回顾镁稀土合金在航空航天领域的应用.', '[{"id":"64fea0a88a47b670c8cc58aa","name":"GU Kan","name_zh":"顾侃","org":"上海交通大学","org_zh":"上海交通大学","orgid":"5f71b54b1c455f439fe502b0"},{"id":"616c85c460a9656471f2dca8","name":"XIAO Lv","name_zh":"肖旅","org":"上海航天精密机械研究所","org_zh":"上海航天精密机械研究所","orgid":"623317710a6eb1456047c439"},{"id":"56cb18b6c35f4f3c6565d5ce","name":"ZENG Xiaoqin","name_zh":"曾小勤","org":"上海交通大学","org_zh":"上海交通大学","orgid":"5f71b54b1c455f439fe502b0"},{"id":"53f556b9dabfaea7cd1d5d8b","name":"CHEN Bin","name_zh":"陈彬","org":"上海交通大学","org_zh":"上海交通大学","orgid":"5f71b54b1c455f439fe502b0"}]', '[]', '["镁合金(Mg)","稀土(RE)","高强度","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"上海航天（中英文）","raw":"Aerospace Shanghai"}', '2096-8655', '39', '6', 2022, NULL),
('62a862145aee126c0f371f61', '10.3969/j.issn.1005-4898.2022.02.01', 'Research progress and development trend of Al-Li alloys for aerospace applications', '航空航天用铝锂合金研究进展及发展趋势', NULL, '航空航天用Al-Li合金因具有突出的低密度、优异的综合性能和广阔的应用前景,已逐步成为与2×××、7×××系合金并列的新一代高性能铝合金.概述了近百年来国内外铝锂合金的研发历史和工业应用情况,分析了第一代至第三代铝锂合金的研发和性能改进思路,同时也总结了我国铝锂合金产业化大规模应用需要进一步克服的技术难点.最后针对未来我国铝锂合金产业的发展方向提出了见解.', '[{"id":"63342fb52fedb730e3abcb5a","name":"Du Kang","name_zh":"杜康","org_zh":"中铝材料应用研究院有限公司","orgid":"6233173a0a6eb14560472c79"},{"id":"54303079dabfaeca7c0e9678","name":"Wang Junqiang","name_zh":"王军强","org_zh":"中铝材料应用研究院有限公司","orgid":"6233173a0a6eb14560472c79"},{"id":"650f71d28a47b61c50c1c8f4","name":"Cao Hailong","name_zh":"曹海龙","org_zh":"中铝材料应用研究院有限公司","orgid":"6233173a0a6eb14560472c79"},{"id":"62e380c6d9f2043704c77596","name":"Liu Cheng","name_zh":"刘成","org_zh":"中铝材料应用研究院有限公司","orgid":"6233173a0a6eb14560472c79"}]', NULL, '["航空航天用铝","铝锂合金","微合金化"]', '{"name_zh":"铝加工","raw":"Aluminium Fabrication"}', '1005-4898', NULL, '2', 2022, 2),
('62c7db845aee126c0f0ba94c', NULL, 'Error compensation technology and its application progress of an industrial robot', '机器人精度补偿技术与应用进展', NULL, '当今工业机器人加工技术越来越多地被应用于航空、航天、高铁、船舶等高端制造领域中的制孔、铆接、铣削、磨削等工艺.然而,由于工业机器人定位精度低限制了其自身发展及其在高精制造业中的进一步应用;因此,开展机器人精度补偿技术研究对提高机器人定位精度十分重要.对工业机器人精度补偿技术的研究现状进行综述,分析了机器人的定位误差来源,梳理了当前在提高机器人定位精度方面的研究方法和技术以及目前的应用进展,总结了未来工业机器人定位精度提升方法的趋势,可为工业机器人在制造业的应用发展提供指导.', '[{"id":"542e8b6ddabfae2222dd548e","name":"LIAO Wenhe","name_zh":"廖文和","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"60b484ed9e795e6baaaa90b0","name":"TIAN Wei","name_zh":"田威","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"name":"LI Bo","name_zh":"李波","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"60b484f79e795e6baaaa90cc","name":"Li Pengcheng","name_zh":"李鹏程","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"name":"ZHANG Wei","name_zh":"张苇","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"651942878a47b61c50ccad2e","name":"LI Yufei","name_zh":"李宇飞","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"}]', NULL, '["工业机器人","精度补偿","机器人加工","误差分析","航空航天制造"]', '{"name_zh":"航空学报","raw":"Acta Aeronautica ET Astronautica Sinica"}', '1000-6893', '43', '5', 2022, 2),
('63d6f95690e50fcafd431fc2', '10.19392/j.cnki.1671-7341.202235008', NULL, '面向航空航天应用的工业机器人精度补偿实践教学建设研究', NULL, '工业机器人以其高柔性化及灵活性的优势在航空航天制造中已广泛应用,同时随着我国航空航天事业的快速发展,对工业机器人的精度要求也不断提高.目前工业机器人的精度限制了其在更多航空航天产品加工及装配向自动化、数字化、智能化发展过程中的应用,因此,对航空宇航制造工程专业人才培养过程中,应着重关注工业机器人精度补偿技术的教学,尤其是在实践教学环节,应加强学生对工业机器人精度补偿理论的理解及实践,从而构成完整的教学闭环.本文通过作者在相关科研项目积累中,针对航空航天制造过程中工业机器人精度补偿技术的需求场景,建设了相应的实验教学平台及内容,填补当前我国飞行器制造工程专业在工业机器人精度补偿及应用实践教学平台方面的空白.', '[{"id":"64829d5b9dd32e00019e7ccf","name_zh":"李鹏程","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"60b484ed9e795e6baaaa90b0","name_zh":"田威","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"60b484f69e795e6baaaa90cb","name_zh":"胡俊山","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"name_zh":"李波","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"},{"id":"674d37165e594d9fc5b79a9e","name_zh":"王长瑞","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"}]', '[]', '["工业机器人","精度补偿","航空航天制造"]', '{"name_zh":"科技风","raw":"Technology Wind"}', '1671-7341', NULL, '35', 2022, NULL),
('63419c7790e50fcafd0cbfb6', NULL, NULL, '航空航天结构耐久性振动试验技术研究', NULL, '航空航天产品使用时存在多种分布式振源,近年来为了对此类振动源开展振动力控制,创新发明了多种振动试验技术,推动了对航空航天结构耐久性的振动试验.本文概述了航空航天结构耐久性相关的耐久性、结构耐久性内涵,结合某型航空航天发动机试验件,对其结构耐久性振动进行了具体讨论.', '[{"id":"64ff3c398a47b66e9a692801","name_zh":"马子杰","org_zh":"贵州振华群英电器有限公司","orgid":"623316d20a6eb145604609e5"},{"name_zh":"徐博","org_zh":"贵州振华群英电器有限公司","orgid":"623316d20a6eb145604609e5"},{"id":"6324a369a36d2225e102e157","name_zh":"田浩","org_zh":"贵州振华群英电器有限公司","orgid":"623316d20a6eb145604609e5"}]', NULL, '["航空航天","结构耐久性","振动试验技术"]', '{"name_zh":"产业创新研究","raw":"industrial innovation"}', '2096-4714', NULL, '6', 2022, NULL),
('63d83f4890e50fcafd24ea0d', '10.6052/1000-0992-22-038', 'A Pioneer of Structural Strength in Aeronautics and Astronaut-Ics in China — Huang Yushan', '我国航空航天结构强度事业的开拓者——黄玉珊', NULL, '黄玉珊先生是我国著名的力学家、航空航天科学家,新中国航空高等教育的奠基人.他不满14岁考入大学,不满23岁时师从国际著名力学大师铁摩辛柯获博士学位,随即义无反顾地回到战火连绵的祖国,受聘中央大学教授.新中国成立后,面对航空工业初建时期技术基础薄弱、人才储备不足、教育体系不完善的困境,他呕心沥血,鞠躬尽瘁,建立新学科,开创新局面,毕生致力于祖国航空航天教育和科技事业.他被认为是我国旧飞机疲劳定寿和延寿、损伤容限评定和新飞机损伤容限设计最早的创始人之一,也是我国飞机自激励振动研究和航天结构环境强度事业的开拓者.本文通过回顾黄玉珊先生在固体力学、航空航天结构强度领域的主要学术成果和卓越贡献,缅怀其坚定不移的报国情怀、严谨求实的治学态度、勇于开拓的创新精神、高瞻远瞩的学术视野以及求真务实的教育思想.', '[{"id":"542eae6adabfae3f1d58dc51","name":"SUO Tao","name_zh":"索涛","org_zh":"西北工业大学航空学院,西安 710072","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"id":"542a6462dabfae646d55b4bd","name":"LI Yulong","name_zh":"李玉龙","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"name":"GUO Wanlin","name_zh":"郭万林","org_zh":"南京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e349"}]', NULL, '["固体力学","结构强度","飞行器设计","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"力学进展"}', '1000-0992', '52', '4', 2022, NULL),
('62a8620b5aee126c0f36edd7', '10.3969/j.issn.1671-6795.2022.02.001', 'Analysis on Development Path of Alcoa'' s Aerospace Industry', '美国铝业公司旗下航空航天产业发展路径分析', NULL, '文章梳理了美国铝业公司旗下航空航天产品的发展路径,并针对其航空航天产品中富有特色的紧固件产品进行了详尽分析,旨在为铝加工企业相关产品的研发和推广应用提供具体指导及参考,从而使铝加工企业更好地适应和满足我国高端制造业特别是航空工业快速发展的需要.', '[{"id":"64d0676eede2170001164cc5","name":"Zhang Qingdong","name_zh":"张庆东","org_zh":"中国铝业股份有限公司","orgid":"5f71b3731c455f439fe42fc4"}]', NULL, '["铝合金","美国铝业公司","航空航天","紧固件"]', '{"name_zh":"有色金属加工","raw":"Nonferrous Metals Processing"}', '1671-6795', '51', '2', 2022, NULL),
('6290750b5aee126c0f53775a', '10.14028/j.cnki.1003-3726.2022.04.002', 'Progress of Aerogel Materials and Their Applications in Aerospace', '气凝胶材料的研究进展及其在航空航天领域的应用', NULL, '气凝胶材料是由聚合物分子链或纳米粒子组成的一种三维纳米骨架结构的多孔材料,它具有低密度、高孔体积、高孔隙率和大比表面积等结构特点,表现出优异的光、热、声、电和力学等特性.气凝胶这种轻质材料能够很好地代替金属材料,在隔热保温、电磁屏蔽、能量储存和基体骨架等航空航天领域具有广泛的应用前景.本文介绍了气凝胶最新研究进展及其在航空航天领域应用,并且展望了气凝胶在该领域的潜在应用和未来发展方向.', '[{"id":"650b2d95768b11dc729dd236","name":"LV Lu-tao","name_zh":"吕璐涛","org_zh":"青岛科技大学高分子科学与工程学院,青岛266000","orgid":"5f71b2e91c455f439fe3f23f"},{"id":"633416e62fedb730e3a38f01","name":"YANG Zong-lin","name_zh":"杨宗霖","org_zh":"青岛科技大学高分子科学与工程学院,青岛266000","orgid":"5f71b2e91c455f439fe3f23f"},{"id":"6151874160a9652002066c43","name":"LIU Wei","name_zh":"刘伟","org_zh":"青岛科技大学高分子科学与工程学院,青岛266000","orgid":"5f71b2e91c455f439fe3f23f"},{"name":"LU Xian-yong","name_zh":"鹿现永","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', NULL, '["电磁屏蔽","气凝胶","隔热保护","轻质材料","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"高分子通报","raw":"Chinese Polymer Bulletin"}', '1003-3726', NULL, '4', 2022, 1),
('63771a2190e50fcafd4bcca0', '10.15925/j.cnki.issn1005-3360.2022.09.026', 'Research Progress on Modification and Application of Polyetheretherketone', '聚醚醚酮的改性及应用研究进展', NULL, '为改善聚醚醚酮(PEEK)生物表面活性、导热性能与耐磨性能,需对PEEK进行改性处理.文章主要从填充改性、共混改性、界面改性和协同改性等方面,综述PEEK复合材料的研究进展,对PEEK及其复合材料在航天航空、电子电器和生物医学等领域的应用进行介绍.研究表明:PEEK共混改性应注重性能间的平衡,填充改性应加强对PEEK界面性能的研究,并加大对PEEK界面改性和协同改性的探索,为制备单方面性能突出、综合性能优异的PEEK复合材料提供思路.', '[{"id":"63340d692fedb730e39fe591","name":"REN Tian-xiang","name_zh":"任天翔","org_zh":"绍兴文理学院","orgid":"5f71b4821c455f439fe4a786"},{"id":"64d8eba3e1382322ddb4090d","name":"TENG Xiao-bo","name_zh":"滕晓波","org_zh":"凯泰特种纤维科技有限公司","orgid":"623316db0a6eb14560462206"},{"name":"HUANG Xing","name_zh":"黄兴","org_zh":"绍兴文理学院","orgid":"5f71b4821c455f439fe4a786"},{"id":"62e3b46cd9f2043704e70aae","name":"MA Jin-xing","name_zh":"马金星","org_zh":"绍兴水乡纺织科技有限公司"},{"id":"62e4bc05d9f204418d70e2d9","name":"ZHAO De-fang","name_zh":"赵德方","org_zh":"绍兴文理学院纺织服装学院,浙江绍兴312000","orgid":"5f71b4821c455f439fe4a786"},{"id":"6165923d60a9657b486fcb79","name":"ZHAN Hai-hua","name_zh":"占海华","org_zh":"绍兴文理学院纺织服装学院,浙江绍兴312000","orgid":"5f71b4821c455f439fe4a786"}]', NULL, '["聚醚醚酮","填充改性","共混改性","航空航天","生物医学"]', '{"name_zh":"塑料科技"}', '1005-3360', '50', '9', 2022, 1);

——基于身体体验的现象学研究', NULL, '健美课程作为北京航空航天大学开设的一门公共必修课,能够通过身体认知的方式增强大学生的爱国思想,实现"享受乐趣、增强体质、健全人格、锤炼意志"学校体育的"四位一体"目标.本文基于梅洛庞蒂的现象学理论,运用文献资料法、访谈法、社会学个案法、数理统计法等研究方法,以实践案例的形式展示健美课课程思政的育人实效.研究认为,北京航空航天大学的学生在体验健美课之前,大部分学生想通过体育改变身材,促进健康.体验过程中,学生感受到放弃与坚持思想的博弈,挥洒汗水的成就与肌肉酸痛的苦楚相伴.体验后,学生拥有了爱国、敬业、友善等社会主义核心价值观的优良品质.', '[{"name_zh":"宫美凤"}]', '[]', '["北京航空航天大学","健美课","立德树人","现象学"]', '{"name_zh":"青少年体育"}', '2095-4581', NULL, '12', 2022, NULL),
('637325a090e50fcafd877746', '10.13224/j.cnki.jasp.20220493', 'Review on Shape Memory Alloys''application in Field of Aerospace', '形状记忆合金在航空航天领域的应用研究综述', NULL, '为了在航空航天领域更好地利用形状记忆合金(shape memory alloys,SMA)的形状记忆效应和超弹性两方面的突出力学特性,综述了 SMA在材料与工艺、本构模型、形状记忆效应应用和超弹性应用方面的研究进展.主要探讨了 NiTiHf、NiTiAu等三元高温合金、SMA热处理工艺和3D打印工艺、形状记忆效应和超弹性本构模型、利用形状记忆效应设计的SMA丝、管、弹簧和带驱动器、利用超弹性设计的减振器、自适应结构等在航空航天领域的应用研究特点,并指出当前存在的不足.该研究结果表明:随着材料、工艺、控制、信息技术的融合发展,SMA的应用研究将向着更宽的工作温度范围、结构多样化以及智能化方向发展.', '[{"name":"QU Lei","name_zh":"渠磊","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"64e364538a47b677857969ef","name":"YAN Zehong","name_zh":"闫泽红","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"63afb9e384ab04bd7fbc7936","name":"RAO Zhixiang","name_zh":"饶智祥","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name":"WANG Xiaoyuan","name_zh":"王啸远","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"64425f3ae3c28ee84cd550d6","name":"LENG Jiaming","name_zh":"冷佳明","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"name":"WAN Weifeng","name_zh":"万维锋","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"},{"id":"561f244945cedb3398196883","name":"YAN Xiaojun","name_zh":"闫晓军","org_zh":"北京航空航天大学能源与动力工程学院,北京100191","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3da46"}]', NULL, '["形状记忆合金","形状记忆效应","超弹性","航空航天","本构模型","压紧释放机构"]', '{"name_zh":"航空动力学报"}', '1000-8055', '37', '10', 2022, 1),
('62d82ab05aee126c0fc5b734', '10.3969/j.issn1001-8948.2022-01-006', 'Preparation technology and application progress of fiber reinforced resin based prepreg', '纤维增强树脂基预浸料的制备技术及应用进展', NULL, '纤维增强树脂基预浸料作为复合材料的中间材料,有利于复合材料实现高质量、高精度和可设计性等优势,能够更好地满足航空航天、交通运输、体育休闲等领域愈来愈高的需求.对预浸料的几种主要制备工艺进行了简要介绍,并总结了其在研究和应用领域的发展现状.', '[{"name":"ZHANG Gan","name_zh":"张淦","org_zh":"西安航天复合材料研究所"},{"id":"6161a80260a9657b486af87a","name":"LIU Jian-chao","name_zh":"刘建超","org_zh":"西安航天复合材料研究所"},{"id":"6164997c60a9657b486ebf81","name":"ZHANG Cheng-shuang","name_zh":"张承双","org_zh":"西安航天复合材料研究所"}]', NULL, '["预浸料","复合材料","航空航天"]', '{"name_zh":"炭素","raw":"Carbon"}', '1001-8948', NULL, '1', 2022, 1),
('629075005aee126c0f5359fe', '10.16080/j.issn1671-833x.2022.03.108', 'Research Progress on Milling Deformation and Control of Aviation Structural Parts', '航空结构件铣削变形及其控制研究进展', NULL, '随着机床加工性能和刀具切削性能的提升,航空结构件的高效高精加工成为可能.航空结构件薄壁加工特征多,在铣削过程中易发生变形,因此预测与控制航空结构件的加工变形是切削加工领域内亟待解决的难题.通过总结了航空结构件的特点及加工难点,对加工变形形成机理进行深入分析;对加工变形影响最为关键的铣削力模型进行归纳;阐述了航空结构件残余应力变形预测的研究进展,以及利用加工工艺优化、数控补偿技术和高速切削加工技术等实现航空结构件加工变形控制的主要策略,最后对其未来研究方向进行了展望.', '[{"id":"65032270ea10f8257b35cebf","name":"ZHAO Mingwei","name_zh":"赵明伟","org_zh":"哈尔滨理工大学,哈尔滨150080","orgid":"5f71b3d61c455f439fe45ac8"},{"id":"53f4cd12dabfaee579783b6c","name":"YUE Caixu","name_zh":"岳彩旭","org_zh":"哈尔滨理工大学,哈尔滨150080","orgid":"5f71b3d61c455f439fe45ac8"},{"id":"542e5a02dabfae48d124aa8e","name":"CHEN Zhitao","name_zh":"陈志涛","org_zh":"哈尔滨理工大学,哈尔滨150080","orgid":"5f71b3d61c455f439fe45ac8"},{"id":"63e2a2f58def4c1ab7a8148f","name":"ZHANG Juntao","name_zh":"张俊涛","org_zh":"哈尔滨理工大学,哈尔滨150080","orgid":"5f71b3d61c455f439fe45ac8"},{"id":"53f4262fdabfaeb1a7b54169","name":"LIU Xianli","name_zh":"刘献礼","org_zh":"哈尔滨理工大学,哈尔滨150080","orgid":"5f71b3d61c455f439fe45ac8"}]', NULL, '["航空航天应用","加工变形","变形预测与控制","铣削力模型","航空结构件"]', '{"name_zh":"航空制造技术","raw":"Aeronautical Manufacturing Technology"}', '1671-833X', '65', '3', 2022, 2),
('629f33e45aee126c0fd03748', '10.16615/j.cnki.1674-8190.2022.01.20', 'Research Status and Frontier Analysis of Aerospace Field in Chinese Universities', '我国高等学校在航空航天领域的研究现状及前沿分析', 'Universities are the important source of original innovation in aviation and astronautics,and play an important role in the development and progress of aerospace technology. In order to analyze the development of Chinese universities in the field of aerospace,the aerospace engineering journals included in JCR are taken as the data source,the papers published by Chinese universities from 2011 to 2020 are selected,and the CiteSpace software is used to visually analyze the paper publication,institution cooperation,keyword co-occurrence and keyword clustering in the field of aerospace. The research status,cooperation relationship and future research hotspots of Chinese universities in the field of aerospace are summarized. By combining the research situation in the field of aviation and astronautics in universities in China,the study in this paper provides the important reference value for the planning layout and innovation development of Chinese aviation and astronautics.', '高等学校是航空航天原始创新的重要发源地,在航空航天技术发展和进步中发挥了重要作用.为了分析我国高等学校在航空航天领域的发展情况,以JCR收录的航空航天工程类期刊为数据源,选取2011—2020年我国高等学校发表论文,利用CiteSpace软件对航空航天领域的论文发表情况、机构合作关系、关键词共现、关键词聚类等进行可视化分析,总结我国高等学校在航空航天领域的研究现状、合作关系以及未来研究前沿.通过梳理我国高等学校关于航空航天领域的研究情况,本文研究为我国航空航天事业的规划布局、创新发展提供一定参考价值.', '[{"id":"6152d5cf60a965200208f586","name":"YU Hui","name_zh":"于辉","org":"School of Life Science, Northwestern Polytechnical University, Xi’an 710072, China","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"},{"id":"6324c81ca36d2225e10970da","name":"YOU Jun","name_zh":"游骏","org":"School of Astronautics, Northwestern Polytechnical University, Xi’an 710072, China","org_zh":"西北工业大学","orgid":"5f71b36a1c455f439fe42b67"}]', '["universities","aerospace","visualized analysis","research status","future research topics"]', '["研究现状","航空航天","高等学校","可视化分析","未来研究主题"]', '{"name_zh":"航空工程进展","raw":"Advances in Aeronautical Science and Engineering"}', '1674-8190', '13', '1', 2022, NULL),
('68c10588163c01c850853336', '10.26599/phys.2025.9320301', 'QUANTUM TECHNOLOGY AND MODERN QUANTUM EDUCATION', '量子科技与现代量子教育', 'This article focuses on the field of quantum science and technology,and discusses its current development,educational challenges,and corresponding strategies.Quantum tech-nology is developing rapidly and will usher in an important node in 2025,but its education faces many problems,such as the non-intuitive nature of knowledge and the lack of teachers.By analyzing the quantum technology development and education initiatives in different re-gions,the necessity of comprehensive reform from basic education to higher education is em-phasized in order to cultivate talents who adapt to the quantum technology revolution and pro-mote the sustainable development of this field.', '本文聚焦于量子科技领域，探讨其发展现状、面临的教育挑战以及相应的应对策略。量子科技发展迅速，2025年将迎来重要节点，然而其教育面临诸多难题，如知识的非直觉性、师资不足等。通过分析不同地区的量子科技发展与教育举措，本文强调从基础教育到高等教育全面变革的必要性，以培养适应量子科技革命的人才，推动该领域持续发展。', '[{"name_zh":"张庆瑞","org":"Chung Yuan Christian University, Taoyuan, Taiwan 320314","org_zh":"中原大学","orgid":"5f71b3381c455f439fe415af"},{"name_zh":"陈韵琳","org":"The High School Affiliated to Renmin University of China, Shenzhen, Guangdong 518000","org_zh":"人大附中深圳学校","orgid":"5f71b8741c455f439fe601f1"},{"name_zh":"朱广天","org":"Teachers College, Jimei University, Xiamen, Fujian 361021","org_zh":"集美大学师范学院","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e336"}]', '["quantum technology","quantum education"]', '["量子科技","量子教育"]', '{"name_zh":"物理与工程"}', '1009-7104', NULL, '3', 2025, NULL),
('656df61b939a5f40821b0b24', '10.3969/j.issn.1003-0670.2023.10.009', NULL, '推进量子科技领域军民协同创新研究', NULL, '量子科技在军事领域应用场景广泛,对现代战争具有颠覆性、变革性的潜在影响,亟须在推进量子科技领域发展中强化军民协同创新.当前,我国推进量子科技领域军民协同创新还面临技术瓶颈限制、军地研究布局缺乏统筹、成果向军转化障碍等问题,应充分借鉴国外经验做法,在做好顶层设计和前瞻布局、整合军地科技资源、强化军民联合攻坚、促进产学研用协同等方面聚焦用力,加速量子科技领域技术突破,为抢占量子科技领域国际竞争制高点、构筑军事和经济发展新动能提供"硬核引擎".', '[{"name_zh":"李治琴","org_zh":"国家发展和改革委员会经济与国防协调发展研究中心","orgid":"5f71b3da1c455f439fe45d14"}]', '[]', '["量子科技","军民协同创新","量子通信","量子计算","量子测量"]', '{"name_zh":"发展研究","raw":"Development Research"}', '1003-0670', '40', '10', 2023, NULL),
('64b262a53fda6d7f062e3d41', '10.16507/j.issn.1006-6055.2022.10.007', 'Case Study of Typical Foreign Quantum Industry-university-research Institute Alliance and Its Enlightenment to China', '国外典型量子产学研联盟案例研究及对中国的启示', 'At the forefront of science and technology today,the development of quantum technology is bringing about subversive and revolutionary scientific discoveries and scientific and technological inventions,which will undoubtedly promote the leapfrog development of human society.The developed countries and regions in the world,represented by the United States and the European Union,are increasing their investment in quantum technology and accelerating the progress of research and development.In this process,Industry-University-Research Institute Alliance has become a strategic measure for many countries and regions to build a quantum innovation ecosystem.This paper investigates and analyzes the two internationally representative and influential industry-university research alliances and collaborative communities of the United States Quantum Economic Development Alliance（QED-C） and the EU Quantum Flagship Community.This paper systematically studies and analyzes their construction mode and cooperation characteristics from the perspective of member composition,organizational structure,operation mode,mission,goal,vision,and key initiatives.At the same time,based on the current situation and problems of the development of China’s Industry-University-Re search Institute Alliance,practical suggestions are put forward for the development of quantum science and technology from the four dimensions of the overall strategic development plan,the construction of an open innovation ecosystem,the cultivation of multi-subject alliances and communities,and the scientific education and scientific communication groups with a community mechanism.', '作为当今世界科技的最前沿领域,量子科技的发展正在带来颠覆性和革命性的科学发现和科技发明,这无疑将推动人类社会实现跨越式发展.以美国、欧盟等为代表的世界发达国家和地区都在加大对量子科技的投入、加速研发进度,在这一进程中,产学研联盟成为很多国家和地区建设量子创新生态系统的战略性抓手.本文调研分析了美国量子经济发展联盟(Quantum Economic Development Consortium,QED-C)、欧盟量子旗舰社区两个在国际上具有代表性和重大影响力的产学研联盟和协同社区,从成员构成、组织结构、运行模式、使命、目标、愿景、关键举措等角度,系统研究和解析了其构建模式和协同特征.同时结合中国量子科技领域的联盟发展现状及问题,从整体性战略发展规划、开放式创新生态系统构建、主体泛化的联盟与社区培育、具备社群机制的科学教育与科学传播群体四个维度对量子科技的发展提出实效建议.', '[{"name":"QIN Qing","name_zh":"秦庆","org":"中国科学技术大学","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"id":"53f434cbdabfaedd74d91f66","name":"TANG Shukun","name_zh":"汤书昆","org":"中国科学技术大学科技传播系,合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学科技传播系,合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"}]', '[".Quantum Science and Technology","Industry-University-Research Institute Alliance","Community","Europe and America","Case Study"]', '["量子科技","产学研联盟","社区","欧美","案例研究"]', '{"name_zh":"世界科技研究与发展","raw":"World Sci-Tech R & D"}', '1006-6055', '45', '2', 2023, NULL),
('64b108813fda6d7f060f96a1', '10.3969/j.issn.1001-2362.2023.02.045', NULL, '量子信息技术应用及产业发展研究综述', NULL, '随着量子信息技术的快速发展,当前世界各国加速了在量子信息技术领域的研究和竞争,抢占量子科技的制高点,凸显了推动量子科技发展的重要性和紧迫性.阐述了世界主要国家和地区量子信息技术创新与产业化的有关情况,分析了我国在量子信息技术领域取得的突破性成就,下一步我国在发展量子信息技术与产业方面仍需克服的挑战,并提出了有关工作建议,为推动我国量子信息产业发展提供借鉴.', '[{"id":"6156461860a96506679ee1bf","name_zh":"彭云峰","org_zh":"安徽省经济信息中心"}]', '[]', '["量子信息","量子通信","量子计算","量子科技"]', '{"name_zh":"信息系统工程","raw":"China CIO　News"}', '1001-2362', NULL, '2', 2023, NULL),
('64b262423fda6d7f062db411', NULL, 'The experience and enlightenment of the socialization and collaborative communication of quantum science and technology in America', '美国量子科技社会化协同传播的经验及启示', NULL, '随着第二次量子革命的到来,量子科技正对科学认知和技术应用产生颠覆式冲击.美国在量子科技领域处于世界前列,一方面得益于其强大的科技基础和经济实力,另一方面与其高水平的科学传播能力、高公民科学素养密不可分.通过研究美国量子科技的社会化协同传播策略,解析了其政策设计初衷及演化路径、科研与教育系统的联动促进方式、产业与市场机构的高效孵化及推广模式、公私社会组织和科学传播个体的嵌入行为,提炼了美国量子科技业态社会化传播设计与执行的经验.提出了美国量子科技社会化协同传播对中国的3点启示,即依托建制优势加快构建科学传播和科学教育双轨驱动的量子科技社会化协同传播体系、建立基础教育—高等教育—职业教育层层进阶的量子科技教育内容供给体系、培育量子科技领域多层次的高水平科技中介组织.', '[{"id":"5408b855dabfae450f43a1df","name":"QIN Qing","name_zh":"秦庆","org":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"53f434cbdabfaedd74d91f66","name":"TANG Shukun","name_zh":"汤书昆","org":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"542d4273dabfae11fc45257a","name":"FAN Qiong","name_zh":"范琼","org":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"name":"WANG Juan","name_zh":"王娟","org":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学院科学传播研究中心,合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"64d58a3de138232355159c80","name":"ZHANG Xiaoyu","name_zh":"张啸宇","org":"中国科学技术大学","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"}]', '[]', '["量子科技","社会化协同","传播策略"]', '{"name_zh":"科技导报","raw":"Science & Technology Review"}', '1000-7857', '41', '9', 2023, NULL),
('6570a046939a5f4082e1ccc7', '10.16607/j.cnki.1674-6708.2023.02.025', NULL, '面向公众的前沿科学可视化传播策略研究——以量子科技领域为例', NULL, '从前沿科学可视化的传播价值入手展开论述,以量子科技这一前沿科学领域为例,对其可视化传播案例展开梳理与分析.通过借鉴国外在该领域的优秀案例,对我国的前沿科学可视化传播提出3条可借鉴的发展路径:充实作品的艺术设计,增强科学内容的公众可达性;建立跨界合作桥梁,协同开发可视化作品;同时要以公众需求为导向,因人制宜策划可视化的展现与传播形式.', '[{"name_zh":"梁琰","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"name_zh":"李雅彤","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"}]', '[]', '["前沿科学","可视化传播","科学传播","量子科技"]', '{"name_zh":"科技传播","raw":"PUBLIC COMMUNICATION OF SCIENCE & TECHNOLOGY"}', '1674-6708', '15', '2', 2023, NULL),
('646b3d99d68f896efa1d5c89', '10.3969/j.issn.1003-0670.2023.02.010', NULL, '加快推进福建省量子科技及产业发展的建议', NULL, '通过分析量子科技发展基本情况及福建省量子科技发展的现状,建议福建省从推进量子产业布局,实施"错位发展战略",加快基础研究,加强关键核心技术攻关,强化政策支持,加大资金投入,促进产学研协同创新,建设高水平人才队伍等方面建立多元创新服务体系,加快推进福建省量子科技及相关产业发展.', '[{"name_zh":"宋春华","org_zh":"福建省创新研究院"},{"id":"54489073dabfae1e04131282","name_zh":"吴庄莹","org_zh":"福建省经济信息中心"}]', '[]', '["量子科技","量子科技产业","福建省"]', '{"name_zh":"发展研究","raw":"Development Research"}', '1003-0670', '40', '2', 2023, NULL),
('643933eed6db87a146ae4c3b', '10.3969/j.issn.1671-153X.2022.17.006', 'Research on the Current Situation and Innovation Trend of Quantum Technology Bank in the Era of ABCDI', 'ABCDI时代下量子科技赋能智慧银行的现状及创新趋势研究', 'Quantum technology empowers smart banks in the ABCDI era are still in the preliminary exploration stage. Quantum technology has a disruptive impact on achieving true interconnection and providing more powerful algorithms and cryptographic security for various industries. After the integration of quantum technology and ABCDI and other financial technologies, it can empower smart banks for cross-border payment, remote payment, real-time online banking transactions, customer information encryption, secure transmission of disaster recovery data, artificial intelligence applications, machine learning, network security transportation and delivery, financial venture capital, risk assessment, risk control, financial credit ecosystem, intelligent finance, intelligent supervision, etc., which has certain practical significance for realizing "quantum technology + smart finance + shared finance".', 'ABCDI时代的量子科技赋能智慧银行仍处于初步探索阶段.量子科技对实现真正的互联互通,以及为各行业提供更强大的算法、加密安全具有颠覆性影响.量子科技与ABCDI等金融技术融合后,可以赋能智慧银行跨境支付、异地支付、网银实时交易、客户信息加密、灾备数据的安全传输、人工智能应用、机器学习、网络安全运输交付、金融风险投资、风险评估、风险控制、金融信用生态圈、智能金融与智能监管等功能,对实现"量子科技+智慧金融+共享金融"具有一定实践意义.', '[{"name_zh":"蒋亚利"}]', '["quantum technology","bank","quantum"]', '["量子科技","银行","量子"]', '{"name_zh":"信息技术时代","raw":"Information Technology TIMES"}', '1671-153X', NULL, '17', 2022, NULL),
('62a85f555aee126c0f2a2bfd', '10.3969/j.issn.1004-8626.2022.01.006', NULL, '量子科技领域的前沿和热点研究(2018—2021)——基于WOS高被引论文的科技术语分析', NULL, '研究以VOSviewer为主要研究工具,对WOS数据库中近四年(2018—2021)发表的量子科技研究的文献进行计量分析和可视化呈现.分析结果表明:量子计算、量子电动力学以及量子发射是量子科技领域未来研究的主要方向,量子科技可以应用于我们生活的方方面面.此外,对量子科技的研究提出了相关的建议及对策,为我国量子科技领域发展的策略制定提供有力支持.', '[{"id":"633402f42fedb730e39c72ba","name_zh":"侯艺林","org_zh":"北京印刷学院","orgid":"61e69bad689627346573d822"}]', NULL, '["量子科技:科学术语","VOSviewer","可视化分析"]', '{"name_zh":"北京印刷学院学报","raw":"Journal of Beijing Institute of Graphic Communication"}', '1004-8626', '30', '1', 2022, NULL),
('62d446565aee126c0f1f7e00', '10.3969/j.issn.1008-3596.2022.04.002', 'Potential Scenarios and Innovative Strategies of Quantum Technology Intervention in Sports Applications', '量子科技介入体育应用的潜在场景与创新策略', NULL, '量子科技作为一项颠覆性创新技术,在确保信息安全、提高运算能力、提升测量精度方面具备先发优势.量子科技包含量子通信技术、量子计算技术、量子精密测量与量子管理思维,其在引领全民健身发展、赋能竞技体育革新、驱动体育产业升级、促进体育文化传播的多元场景下都具有较大的应用潜力.利用技术—组织—环境(TOE)框架分析认为,影响量子科技介入体育应用的关键因素包括量子信息技术发展水平与兼容度、体育科技资源配置与组织创新接受度、体育消费环境与宏观政策支持精准度.鉴于此,认为应该推进量子科技研发转化,明确体育应用突破方向;加强量子信息体系建设,弥补数字体育治理短板;深化量子科技植入场景,促进体育生产要素升级,实现"量子+体育"的创新.', '[{"id":"6154727d60a96506679ca370","name":"HAN Song","name_zh":"韩松","org_zh":"四川大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3dac5"},{"id":"64ca26e4ede21700010da308","name":"CHEN Jiaqi","name_zh":"陈佳琦","org_zh":"四川大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3dac5"},{"id":"64ca2192e138232355052d8b","name":"YANG Silei","name_zh":"杨思磊","org_zh":"四川大学","orgid":"5f71b2b41c455f439fe3dac5"}]', NULL, '["量子科技","体育","场景","创新","组织","技术","环境","关键因素"]', '{"name_zh":"河北体育学院学报","raw":"Journal of Hebei Sport University"}', '1008-3596', '36', '4', 2022, 1),
('6279eb7a5aee126c0f3d9778', '10.12178/1001-0548.2021374', 'Opportunities and Challenges of Blockchain in the Quantum Era', '区块链在量子时代的机遇和挑战', NULL, '区块链是随着数字加密货币而逐渐兴起的一种全新的去中心化基础架构.以区块链为底层技术的应用范畴早已超越数字加密货币,延伸到了金融、经济、科技和政治等各个领域.与此同时,具有重大科学意义和战略价值的量子科技正在迅速发展,在即将到来的量子时代,区块链将面临量子科技带来的前所未有的机遇和挑战.主要体现为:一是强大的量子计算对区块链密码体系造成极大威胁,二是在区块链中应用量子科技能有效提高系统的安全性.分析了量子计算攻击区块链的不同方式,指出量子科技赋能区块链的发展现状和趋势."区块链+量子计算"的交叉融合研究具有重大的现实意义,量子区块链必将成为未来高新技术产业的研究热点.', '[{"id":"5627ab9745cedb339872a31d","name":"YAN Shilu","name_zh":"颜世露","org_zh":"华南理工大学自动化科学与工程学院 广州 510640","orgid":"5f71b2a11c455f439fe3d33e"},{"id":"63342abb2fedb730e3aa01cf","name":"XIANG Lipeng","name_zh":"相里朋","org_zh":"工业和信息化部电子第五研究所 广州 511300","orgid":"623316d00a6eb1456046072e"},{"id":"560a76ca45cedb33970f2716","name":"CUI Wei","name_zh":"崔巍","org_zh":"华南理工大学自动化科学与工程学院 广州 510640","orgid":"5f71b2a11c455f439fe3d33e"}]', NULL, '["数字加密货币","量子科技","量子计算","区块链"]', '{"name_zh":"电子科技大学学报","raw":"Journal of University of Electronic Science and Technology of China"}', '1001-0548', '51', '2', 2022, 1),
('6376f75690e50fcafdb81570', '10.3969/j.issn.1000-7695.2022.18.002', 'Enlightenment of German Quantum Plan to China''s Advanced Layout of Future Industry', '德国量子计划对我国超前布局未来产业的启示', NULL, '为促进我国在科技自立自强发展阶段超前布局未来产业、推动经济高质量发展,在辨析"未来产业"的概念内涵、其与战略性新兴产业的区别与联系的基础上,以德国的量子计划为例,剖析其最新发展举措及其对我国未来产业布局的启示.分析发现:德国联邦政府主要针对"政产学研"和公众等不同主体,分别通过不断开拓量子技术研究领域、为新应用拓展研究网络、确立技术主权和确保技术安全、加强国际合作以及提高公众参与度等举措促进量子科技发展.针对我国在未来产业发展上缺乏国家层面综合性战略布局、专项资金和人才体系等现状,从战略规划、专项资金支持、合作平台构建以及鼓励公众参与等4个方面提出对策建议.', '[{"name":"Liu Xiao","name_zh":"刘笑","org_zh":"上海工程技术大学","orgid":"61e698836896273465736854"},{"id":"64d7c600e1382366bc5361ab","name":"Jie Yongqin","name_zh":"揭永琴","org_zh":"上海工程技术大学","orgid":"61e698836896273465736854"},{"name":"Liu Yan","name_zh":"刘琰","org_zh":"上海市科学学研究所","orgid":"61e6a1dd689627346574caf4"}]', NULL, '["未来产业","产业布局","量子科技","德国经验"]', '{"name_zh":"科技管理研究"}', '1000-7695', '42', '18', 2022, NULL),
('63d87bd490e50fcafd9f6f8d', '10.3772/j.issn.1009-8623.2022.09.001', 'Research on Global Quantum S&T Talent Policies', '全球量子人才政策研究', NULL, '本文对美国等主要国家的量子人才政策进行了研究,发现这些国家的量子人才存在较大缺口.这些国家从增加基数和提高能力两方面入手,提出了人才可持续发展的主要措施,包括:早期教育和科普唤醒全社会的量子意识,良好量子教育生态打造人才蓄水池,研发基地或研发中心实现公私合作人才培养,人才引进与人才国际化推动思想流动.我国作为全球量子研究的重要力量,需要在早期教育、科普、教产融合等方面加强政策指导.', '[{"id":"56cb1892c35f4f3c656519c1","name":"ZHANG Yi-yan","name_zh":"张翼燕","org":"中国科学技术信息研究所","org_zh":"中国科学技术信息研究所","orgid":"5f71b2861c455f439fe3c74a"}]', '[]', '["量子科技","科技人才","教育生态","公私合作模式"]', '{"name_zh":"全球科技经济瞭望","raw":"Global Science, Technology and Economy Outlook"}', '1009-8623', '37', '9', 2022, 1),
('64cd4f753fda6d7f064a70bb', '10.11973/dlyny202106002', 'Development and Evolution of Quantum Technology and Analysis of Competitive Situation of Different Countries', '量子科技发展演进脉络与各国竞争态势分析', NULL, '量子科技是事关国家安全和社会经济高质量发展的战略性领域,其应用涉及通信、测量、制药、材料、化学等多行业,已成为国家弯道超车的重要赛道.阐述了量子科技的本质概念和学科的演进脉络,分析了两次量子革命带来的深刻变革,围绕量子领域的专利布局和国家政策,分析了量子科技发展成熟度、各国竞争态势.', '[{"name":"LI Wenqing","name_zh":"李文清","org":"国网上海市电力公司电力科学研究院","org_zh":"国网上海市电力公司电力科学研究院","orgid":"623316e90a6eb14560464945"},{"id":"6509c1c38a47b61c50ba8e06","name":"QI Xiaoman","name_zh":"齐晓曼","org":"国网上海市电力公司电力科学研究院","org_zh":"国网上海市电力公司电力科学研究院","orgid":"623316e90a6eb14560464945"},{"id":"61708b3560a965737d755a54","name":"ZHAO Sanshan","name_zh":"赵三珊","org":"国网上海市电力公司电力科学研究院","org_zh":"国网上海市电力公司电力科学研究院","orgid":"623316e90a6eb14560464945"}]', '[]', '["量子科技","专利布局","发展成熟度","竞争态势"]', '{"name_zh":"电力与能源","raw":"Power & Energy"}', '2095-1256', '42', '6', 2021, NULL),
('61cacfb85244ab9dcb2093cc', '10.16619/j.cnki.rmltxsqy.2021.07.007', 'Embracing the Era of Quantum Technology:The Status Quo and Prospect of Quantum Computing', '拥抱量子科技时代:量子计算的现状与前景', NULL, '量子计算作为物理和计算机深度融合的技术,正成长为一个具有广泛应用前景的新兴前沿领域.量子计算有望显著提升经典计算机的计算能力,实现一系列重要实际问题的高效求,对推动新一轮科技革命和产业变革、促进高质量发展、提高我国信息产业国际竞争力、保障国家安全具有重要意义.在实用化量子计算机的这场国际马拉松竞赛中,中国和欧美发达国家都处于起跑阶段.依靠和发挥我国长期积累的、在物理和材料等学科的研究基础优势,并把这些优势转化成推动力,外加合适的科技政策引导,我国有望赢得这场颠覆性的科技竞赛.', '[{"id":"542a1f04dabfae81b7d53fe2","name_zh":"张威","org_zh":"中国人民大学物理学系","orgid":"5f71b2b11c455f439fe3d913"}]', NULL, '["量子计算","量子科技","量子信息处理"]', '{"name_zh":"人民论坛·学术前沿","raw":"Renming Luntan·Xueshu Qianyan"}', '2095-3461', NULL, '7', 2021, 2),
('62abf1ec5aee126c0f4d7213', NULL, 'Characteristics of the United State''s National Quantum Initiative and the enlightenment', '美国国家量子计划实施的特点及启示', NULL, '美国国家量子计划已实施2年.梳理了该计划相关法案、管理机制、重点领域、经费投入、实施进展等情况,分析了该计划战略部署、协调推进、多学科平台建设、人才培养和国际合作等方面的做法和特点.提出中国应加强和优化量子科技战咯规划和顶层设计、加强统筹协调、构建量子科技创新生态等发展建议.', '[{"id":"6169e2d860a9656471ed88a7","name":"ZHU Qingping","name_zh":"朱庆平","org_zh":"科技部高技术研究发展中心"},{"id":"61630f6160a9657b486cfd66","name":"WU Gen","name_zh":"吴根","org_zh":"科技部高技术研究发展中心"},{"id":"63340f982fedb730e3a0c350","name":"CHE Zifan","name_zh":"车子璠","org_zh":"科技部高技术研究发展中心"},{"id":"6324cd03a36d2225e10aacde","name":"LIU Yaohu","name_zh":"刘耀虎","org_zh":"中国科学院前沿科学与教育局,北京100864","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', NULL, '["美国国家量子计划","科技创新生态","量子科技战略规划"]', '{"name_zh":"科技导报","raw":"Science & Technology Review"}', '1000-7857', '39', '18', 2021, 1),
('61cacf3f5244ab9dcb16bb8f', '10.16507/j.issn.1006-6055.2020.12.007', 'Analysis of European and US Quantum Science and Technology Policy and the Related Scientists Behind It', '欧美量子科技政策及其背后相关科学家分析', NULL, '量子科技是具有极强产业远景和关系国家战略发展的前沿领域,越来越多的国家和地区把量子科技的发展列入国家重点战略.了解量子科技发展强国的相关政策和科学家信息,可以管窥到其在政策制定上的一些特质,也可以为预测下一步的政策制定提供参考.本文梳理了欧盟和美国的量子政策发展轨迹,重点分析了其中最新的重大战略部署以及影响政策制定的相关科学家,通过与我国情况进行对比,为我国未来量子科技政策的制定提出了加快国家战略顶层设计、通过国家项目推动量子产业发展、建设量子科技人才梯队等几点建议.', '[{"id":"53f434cbdabfaedd74d91f66","name_zh":"汤书昆","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"name_zh":"叶珍珍","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"id":"542d4273dabfae11fc45257a","name_zh":"范琼","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"}]', NULL, '["量子科技","量子科技政策","欧盟","量子技术旗舰计划","美国","量子信息科学国家战略概述"]', '{"name_zh":"世界科技研究与发展","raw":"World Sci-Tech R & D"}', '1006-6055', NULL, '1', 2021, 4),
('604b3bf36f90b7f6cab333a0', NULL, 'Development Strategy of Quantum Cryptography Communication and Quantum network in Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area2.1', '粤港澳大湾区量子保密通信与量子网络发展战略', NULL, '量子保密通信与量子网络作为战略性前沿技术,与国家安全和前瞻性技术战略关系密切,具有广泛应用的潜力.简要综述量子保密通信与量子网络的研究进展以及产业基础,分析国际量子科技战略,提出遵循粤港澳大湾区发展创新驱动、改革引领的基本原则,集聚国际创新资源,攻关量子网络的基础科学和若干实用关键技术,规划部署粤港澳大湾区量子干线和制定QKD量子网络评估策略,有助于打造湾区国际量子创新高地及培育具有国际竞争力的量子保密通信与量子计算现代产业体系.', '[{"id":"560b940945cedb33973668a7","name":"Bang-hong GUO","name_zh":"郭邦红","org_zh":"深圳大学计算机与软件学院,广东深圳518060;华南师范大学信息光电子科技学院/广东省微纳光子功能材料与器件重点实验室,广东广州510631","orgid":"5f71b3f81c455f439fe46a61"},{"id":"63ceaf748def4c1ab786f3ea","name":"Min HU","name_zh":"胡敏","org_zh":"华南师范大学","orgid":"5f71b3f81c455f439fe46a61"},{"id":"56cb18bcc35f4f3c6565f554","name":"Rui MAO","name_zh":"毛睿","org_zh":"深圳大学","orgid":"5f71b3491c455f439fe41cf6"},{"name":"Guo-liang CHEN","name_zh":"陈国良","org_zh":"深圳大学计算机与软件学院,广东深圳518060;南京邮电大学高性能计算与大数据处理研究所,江苏南京210003","orgid":"5f71b4481c455f439fe48e8a"}]', NULL, '["粤港澳大湾区","量子密码与量子计算","量子网络","高性能QKD","量子科技战略"]', '{"name_zh":"信息安全与通信保密","raw":"Information Security And Communications Privacy"}', '1009-8054', NULL, '5', 2020, 1),
('604b35dc6f90b7f6ca79fd5e', NULL, NULL, '如何在科研建筑设计中结合传统人文与现代科技元素', NULL, '笔者近期有幸作为主创建筑师参与王建国院士团队精心打造的中科院量子信息与量子科技创新研究院项目建筑设计工作.借此项目工程进展顺利、即将落成之际,对在设计过程中从前期理念到建筑形体生成的两个层面上如何将中国传统的人文要素与现代前沿科学的系统结合在一起做一个初步的总结.', '[{"name_zh":"雷雪松","org_zh":"南京佳的建筑设计事务所有限公司,江苏南京 210000"}]', NULL, '["自然","量子科技","中国元素","情怀"]', '{"name_zh":"建材与装饰","raw":"Construction Materials & Decoration"}', '2096-2894', NULL, '33', 2020, NULL),
('604b6db46f90b7f6ca558419', NULL, NULL, '科技新闻的“软”处理', NULL, '科技新闻的通俗化表达,是建立在记者对科技领域透彻把握基础上的.只有成为某个领域的“半个专家”,能够与科学家直接对话甚至交朋友,对硬新闻的“软处理”才会通俗易懂且不出偏差.让广大用户全面了解最新科技,传统媒体要利用好直播、动画、音视频等新媒体技术手段.', '[{"name_zh":"方田","org_zh":"安徽广播电视台新闻中心"}]', NULL, '["科技新闻","软处理","量子科技"]', '{"name_zh":"新闻战线","raw":"Journalistic Front"}', '0257-5930', NULL, '13', 2020, NULL),
('604b3bf36f90b7f6cab33313', '10.3969/j.issn.1009-8054.2019.09.007', 'The US QIS Strategy and Its Impact on Sino-US Relations', '美国量子战略对中美 在科技领域竞争与合作的影响', NULL, '当前,世界正处于新一轮"量子革命"的发端阶段.自执政以来,特朗普政府通过公布战略文件、立法等措施,已逐步完善其量子科技战略.美国的量子科技战略注重强化政府部门与独立机构之间、公私部门之间的机制化合作;关注量子科技人力资源培养,并具有明显的安全目标导向.美国战略界对中国量子科技发展态势的关切是美国量子战略发展的重要推动因素.美国政府的量子科技战略将加剧中美在量子科技领域的竞争,制约两国在量子科技与产业领域的合作空间,并将阻滞中国与其他国家在这一领域的合作进程.', '[{"id":"61681a6160a9656471eb0255","name":"Hai-yong SUN","name_zh":"孙海泳","org_zh":"上海国际问题研究院,上海,200233","orgid":"61e69ed46896273465745237"}]', NULL, '["中美科技关系","美国科技战略","量子科技战略"]', '{"name_zh":"信息安全与通信保密","raw":"Information Security And Communications Privacy"}', '1009-8054', NULL, '9', 2019, 4),
('604b4f466f90b7f6ca543557', NULL, NULL, '量子科技与新形态的美容产业分析', NULL, '随着生活习惯和生活环境的改变,人体的皮肤到了一定的年龄后开始由巅峰走向下坡,护肤美容产业近年来逐步兴起.同时量子科技正逐步走人人们的生活,并改变着人们的生活.量子科技是今后的主流科技之一,对人体的帮助也很大,量子科技在医学中也得到了广泛的应用,并产生了新形态的美容产业.本文主要分析了量子科技的原理及应用,并重点分析了量子科技在新形态的美容产业中的应用.', '[{"id":"63341fb22fedb730e3a6828c","name_zh":"王瑞勤","org_zh":"浙江大学,浙江杭州,310063","orgid":"5f71b29c1c455f439fe3d0e1"}]', NULL, '["量子科技","美容产业","矿物质","化妆品"]', '{"name_zh":"医学美学美容","raw":"Journal of Medical Aesthetice and Cosmetology"}', NULL, '27', '16', 2018, NULL),
('69ccd0029be8eb7c4b863224', '10.15302/j-sscae-2025.12.026', 'Review and Prospect of the Development of China''s New-Generation Information Technology Industry', '我国新一代信息技术产业发展回顾与展望', 'The new-generation information technology industry is a strategic, foundational, and pioneering sector of the national economy, serving as a crucial pillar for building a strong manufacturing nation and achieving high-quality development. Based on comprehensive data, this study reviews the overall progress and achievements of China''s new-generation information technology industry from 2015 to 2025, focusing on four dimensions: industrial scale, industrial structure, innovation capacity, and integrated application. Meanwhile, aligning with the key development areas identified in the national strategy for strengthening the manufacturing sector, the study offers a detailed analysis of China''s concrete practices in accelerating the development of the new-generation information technology industry through application-driven approaches and industrial collaboration. Special attention is given to addressing shortcomings such as insufficient self-sufficiency in core components, lagging processes of advanced integrated circuits, and dependence on foreign high-end software. Looking ahead to the next decade, China''s new-generation information technology industry will center on supporting new-type industrialization, focusing on four key directions: innovation leadership, supply chain resilience, comprehensive penetration, and open cooperation. Through major strategic initiatives and multi-pronged measures, efforts will be made to achieve breakthroughs in cutting-edge technologies such as 6G, artificial intelligence, and quantum information; overcome critical constraints in high-end chips, core software, and key equipment; accelerate the widespread integration of new-generation information technologies across all sectors of the economy and society; and deepen the convergence of the digital and real economies, thereby providing robust momentum for Chinese modernization.', '新一代信息技术产业是国民经济的战略性、基础性和先导性产业,是建设制造强国、实现高质量发展的重要支撑.本文基于详实的数据,从产业规模、产业结构、创新能力和融合应用四方面,全面梳理了2015-2025年我国新一代信息技术产业的总体进展和成绩.与此同时,结合制造强国战略中确定的重点发展领域,细化分析了我国在通过应用牵引、产业协同等方式加快新一代信息技术产业发展的具体实践,着重对核心零部件自给不足、集成电路先进工艺滞后、高端软件受制于人等短板问题进行了分析.展望未来十年,我国新一代信息技术产业将以支撑新型工业化为核心目标,聚焦创新引领、供应链韧性、全域渗透、开放共赢四大方向,采取重大战略部署、多策并举推进等方式,重点突破第六代移动通信、人工智能、量子信息等前沿技术,全力攻克高端芯片、核心软件、关键装备等"卡脖子"环节,加快推进新一代信息技术向经济社会全域渗透,深化数实融合,为中国式现代化提供强劲动能.', '[{"name":"Wu Hequan","name_zh":"邬贺铨","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"1.supChinese Academy of Engineering, Beijing 100032, China","org_zh":"中国工程院"},{"name":"Yu Xiaohui","name_zh":"余晓晖","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"2.supChina Academy of Information and Communications Technology, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"中国信息通信研究院"},{"name":"Zhou Lan","name_zh":"周兰","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"2.supChina Academy of Information and Communications Technology, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"中国信息通信研究院"},{"name":"Xu Zhiyuan","name_zh":"许志远","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"2.supChina Academy of Information and Communications Technology, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"中国信息通信研究院"},{"name":"Di Shaoyan","name_zh":"邸绍岩","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"2.supChina Academy of Information and Communications Technology, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"中国信息通信研究院"},{"name":"Wang Qiong","name_zh":"王琼","org":"sup class=\"mag-xml-aff-label-sup added-by-sys\"2.supChina Academy of Information and Communications Technology, Beijing 100191, China","org_zh":"中国信息通信研究院"}]', '["new-generation information technology industry","new industrialization","information and communication equipment","integrated circuit","decade review"]', '["新一代信息技术产业","新型工业化","信息通信设备","集成电路","十年总结"]', '{"name_zh":"中国工程科学","raw":"Strategic Study of CAE"}', '1009-1742', '28', '1', 2026, NULL),
('69d7177c9be8eb7c4b66af26', '10.3788/cjl250714', 'Advances in Terahertz Technology for Non-Destructive Defect Detection in Packaged Integrated Circuits:a Comprehensive Review', '基于太赫兹技术的封装芯片缺陷无损检测研究进展', 'Significance In the context of the rapid development of modern electronic technology,integrated circuits,as the core components of various electronic devices,have become key factors determining the performance and stability of devices in terms of quality and reliability.Failures of integrated circuits mainly fall into three categories:physical structural failures(including cracks,voids,bubbles,delamination,and bonding wire faults or wear),material performance degradation(such as aging of packaging materials,degradation of semiconductor material properties,corrosion of metal materials,and deterioration of insulating material performance),and electrical performance failures(common issues like open circuits and short circuits). Traditional detection methods—such as Volt-Ampere characteristic curve analysis,image processing-based detection,infrared detection,and X-ray scanning—along with analytical tools like deep learning,can detect integrated circuit defects to a certain extent,but each has its shortcomings.These include inability to accurately locate fault positions,lengthy testing cycles,difficulty in effectively distinguishing defects in complex packaging and high-density wiring,low resolution,susceptibility to external interference,and slow detection speed.Against this backdrop,terahertz non-destructive testing technology,with its unique advantages,has gradually become a powerful means to meet the demands of integrated circuit defect detection.This is of great significance for ensuring the quality of integrated circuits and promoting the development of the electronics industry. Progress Terahertz non-destructive testing technology mainly includes terahertz time-domain spectroscopy(THz-TDS),terahertz imaging technology,and terahertz pulse time-domain reflection(THz-TDR)technology.In the field of physical structural defect detection,this technology has achieved remarkable results.It can accurately detect cracks in integrated circuits with micron-level resolution and has a wide range of applications—for example,it can effectively identify cracks in printed circuit boards(PCBs),methacrylimide foam,composite insulators,and carbon fiber composites. In the detection of voids and bubbles,terahertz technology not only covers a wide detection range but also offers extremely high accuracy.Through image processing algorithms,it can accurately measure the size of voids/bubbles and determine their distribution within integrated circuits.For integrated circuit delamination,researchers can accurately identify the delamination position and severity by analyzing terahertz detection data using machine learning algorithms.In the detection of bonding wire faults and wear,terahertz imaging technology enables fault or wear identification by analyzing image features,while also determining the location and extent of the issue. Terahertz technology also performs well in detecting material performance degradation.By analyzing terahertz spectra,the aging degree of packaging materials can be effectively evaluated.Studies on the aging of various rubber materials show that although this technology can achieve quantitative detection,it is affected by material thickness:it requires testing within specific frequency bands and must be combined with molecular simulation methods. In the detection of semiconductor material performance degradation,terahertz technology can measure carrier lifetime,detect surface defects,monitor aging status in real time,and quantify resistivity and carrier concentration.For metal material corrosion detection,terahertz technology can identify corrosion types and severity,as well as measure corrosion layer thickness.However,it faces challenges such as insufficient penetration capability,signal attenuation that impairs measurement accuracy,and inability to accurately quantify corrosion severity. In the detection of insulating material performance degradation,terahertz technology can assess the degree of performance deterioration and,when combined with imaging technology,observe internal defects.In terms of electrical performance fault diagnosis,terahertz pulse time-domain reflection(THz-TDR)technology plays a crucial role:it can accurately locate impedance discontinuities in integrated circuits,with the location accuracy for open-circuit and short-circuit faults in advanced packaging reaching the micrometer level. Conclusions and Prospects Terahertz non-destructive testing technology has demonstrated significant advantages in the field of integrated circuit fault diagnosis:it has strong penetrability,enabling detection deep inside integrated circuits;it has a robust ability to detect minor faults with high resolution;and it is a non-contact method that does not cause physical damage to integrated circuits. However,this technology also faces challenges in practical applications.High equipment costs limit its widespread use in industrial settings;its ability to detect complex integrated circuit structures is limited—especially for multi-layer stacked 3D-packaged integrated circuits,which are difficult to test;it has high requirements for the dielectric properties of integrated circuit materials,as highly conductive or absorptive materials can significantly attenuate terahertz waves and thus compromise detection performance. With the continuous advancement of technology,equipment costs are expected to decrease,and detection speed will be further improved.Optimizing signal processing algorithms(e.g.,integrating deep learning and big data analysis)can enhance detection accuracy for complex integrated circuit structures.Combining terahertz technology with traditional detection methods such as X-ray and ultrasonic detection can achieve complementary advantages,improving detection accuracy and efficiency.Additionally,integrating artificial intelligence and machine learning will enable automated signal analysis and fault diagnosis,further enhancing the intelligence of detection systems. In emerging integrated circuit technology fields—such as quantum integrated circuits and photonic integrated circuits—terahertz technology has great potential for detecting the dielectric properties and internal structures of new materials.It is expected to become an indispensable tool in integrated circuit manufacturing and quality control.', '随着现代电子技术的发展,复杂先进封装集成芯片在电子设备中的地位愈发关键,其质量和可靠性直接影响着设备的性能与稳定性.因此,对芯片缺陷进行精确、快速检测已成为芯片生产过程中和使用前至关重要的一环.传统的检测方法存在诸多缺陷,而太赫兹无损检测技术凭借其独特的优势逐渐成为公认的新型有力手段.太赫兹波频率在0.1～10 THz之间,具有低能量辐射、穿透性强、成像分辨率高等特性,这些特性使其在无损检测领域能有效弥补传统检测方法的不足,为芯片故障检测开辟了一条全新路径.在物理结构缺陷检测方面,该技术不仅可以精准探测芯片裂缝,分辨率达微米量级,还可以检测空洞与气泡的大小和分布、判断芯片层间分离的位置与程度、识别键合线故障与磨损情况.在材料性能劣化检测方面,该技术可以评估封装材料的老化程度、诊断半导体材料的性能退化情况、检测金属材料的腐蚀状态以及绝缘材料的性能衰减情况.在电气性能故障诊断方面,太赫兹脉冲时域反射技术可以定位芯片中阻抗不连续的位置.目前的太赫兹无损检测技术具有穿透性强、非接触式检测、能检测微小故障等显著优势,但也存在设备成本高、检测速度慢、对复杂芯片检测能力有限以及对芯片材料介电特性要求较高等局限性.未来,随着技术的持续进步,设备成本有望降低,检测速度也有望进一步提升.通过结合深度学习等算法对信号处理过程进行优化,以及与其他检测技术相结合,太赫兹技术有望在芯片制造和质量控制领域实现更加广泛的应用,尤其是在新兴芯片技术领域,将拥有更加广阔的发展前景.', '[{"name":"Xu Zhen","name_zh":"徐振","org_zh":"天津大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc14"},{"name":"Luo Man","name_zh":"罗曼","org_zh":"天津大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc14"},{"name":"Liang Bohan","name_zh":"梁博涵","org_zh":"天津大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc14"},{"name":"Li Jining","name_zh":"李吉宁","org_zh":"天津大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc14"},{"name":"Zhang Jiaxin","name_zh":"张嘉昕","org_zh":"航天科工防御技术研究试验中心"},{"name":"Wang Tan","name_zh":"王坦","org_zh":"航天科工防御技术研究试验中心"},{"name":"Chen Kai","name_zh":"陈锴","org_zh":"天津大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc14"},{"name":"Xu Degang","name_zh":"徐德刚","org_zh":"天津大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc14"}]', '["terahertz","packaged integrated circuits","integrated circuits","defect detection","fault diagnosis"]', '["太赫兹","封装芯片","集成电路","缺陷分析","故障诊断"]', '{"name_zh":"中国激光","raw":"Chinese Journal of Lasers"}', '0258-7025', '53', '2', 2026, 1),
('6a73c1bb0a96f8c83c5808cd', '10.3788/gzxb20265506.0613002', 'Inverse-designed Polarization-insensitive 2×2 Waveguide Crossings', '逆向设计的偏振不敏感2×2交叉波导', 'Photonic Integrated Circuits(PICs)based on silicon-on-insulator offer a promising solution to address the growing demand for communication capacity.The large refractive index difference between silicon and silica in silicon-based waveguides enables strong optical confinement within the cross-section,which effectively reduces device footprints and favors the dense integration of on-chip photonic components.Despite the remarkable advantages in integration density,such a high refractive index contrast inevitably introduces a strong waveguide birefringence effect,leading to considerable discrepancies in mode propagation,field distribution,and transmission loss between Transverse Electric(TE)and Transverse Magnetic(TM)polarizations. Waveguide crossing is one of the fundamental building blocks in large-scale PICs,as it enables the interconnection of different waveguide paths with low losses.In conventional straight waveguide crossings,owing to the weakened optical confinement at the center of the waveguide crossing,light undergoes strong diffraction and no longer propagates along the original waveguide direction.Meanwhile,the inherent birefringence effect further enlarges the propagation mismatch between optical modes of different polarizations,thus resulting in degraded performance of conventional waveguide crossings.Consequently,the development of high-performance,polarization-manipulated waveguide crossings has become one of the critical challenges for realizing large-scale and low-loss silicon photonic integrated systems. To alleviate the issues of high polarization sensitivity and limited integration density in straight waveguide crossings,polarization-insensitive 2×2 waveguide crossings are proposed by combining the multimode interference principle with the direct binary search algorithm.Specifically,the proposed devices include the dual-polarization waveguide crossing(DP-WC),the TM0 waveguide crossing(TM0-WC),and the TE0 waveguide crossing(TE0-WC).The DP-WC is designed to support both the TE0 and TM0 modes simultaneously,while the TM0-WC supports the TM0 mode and suppresses the TE0 mode,and the TE0-WC supports the TE0 mode and suppresses the TM0 mode.In addition,the multimode interference theory is adopted to construct high-quality initial structures with the target optical field distribution,and the direct binary search algorithm is subsequently utilized to optimize the structural geometry for further performance enhancement.All the proposed devices are fabricated using commercial complementary metal-oxide-semiconductor compatible processes and characterized using a fiber-coupled test platform. The footprints of the waveguide crossings are all 4.8 μm×4.8 μm,realizing ultra-high integration density.The DP-WC exhibits the Insertion Loss(IL)of less than 1.3 dB and the Extinction Ratio(ER)of greater than 14 dB for the TE0 mode,the IL of less than 1.2 dB and the ER of greater than 13.4 dB for the TM0 mode,and the Polarization-dependent Loss(PDL)of less than 0.1 dB from 1 540 nm to 1 560 nm.The TM0-WC exhibits the IL of less than 1 dB and the ER of greater than 14.9 dB for the TM0 mode,the IL of greater than 12 dB and the ER of greater than 2 dB for the TE0 mode,and the PDL of greater than 11 dB from 1 540 nm to 1 560 nm.The TE0-WC exhibits the IL of less than 2.4 dB and the ER of greater than 14.6 dB for the TE0 mode,the IL of greater than 10.7 dB and the ER of greater than 5.1 dB for the TM0 mode,and the PDL of greater than 8.3 dB from 1 540 nm to 1 560 nm.These measured results verify the functions of dual-mode efficient transmission and single-mode selective suppression of these polarization-insensitive waveguide crossings. In this work,waveguide crossings with ultra-compact footprints and polarization insensitivity are proposed via the inverse design method.These devices provide an effective inverse design solution to the inherent issues of strong polarization sensitivity and low integration density in conventional waveguide crossings,and they can serve as key functional components to support the development of large-scale silicon-based PICs.', '针对光子集成电路中交叉波导的偏振敏感性强及集成密度低的问题,基于多模干涉原理,利用直接二进制搜索算法,优化了偏振不敏感的 2×2交叉波导,包括双偏振(Dual-polarization Waveguide Crossing,DP-WC)、TM0 偏振(Fundamental Transverse Magnetic Waveguide Crossing,TM0-WC)及TE0偏振(Fundamental Transverse Electric Waveguide Crossing,TE0-WC)交叉波导.交叉波导的尺寸皆为4.8 μm×4.8 μm.加工器件的表征结果表明,DP-WC支持TE0和TM0模式,在1 540 nm到1 560 nm带宽范围内,TE0模式的插入损耗(Insertion Loss,IL)和消光比(Extinction Ratio,ER)分别小于1.3 dB和大于 14 dB,TM0 模式的 IL 和 ER 分别小于 1.2 dB 和大于 13.4 dB,而偏振相关损耗(Polarization Dependent Loss,PDL)PDL小于0.1 dB;TM0-WC支持TM0模式而抑制TE0模式,在1 540 nm到1 560 nm带宽范围内,TM0模式的IL和ER分别小于1 dB和大于14.9 dB,TE0模式的IL和ER分别大于12 dB和大于2 dB,而PDL大于11 dB;TE0-WC支持TE0模式而抑制TM0模式,在1 540 nm到1 560 nm带宽范围内,TE0模式的IL和ER小于2.4 dB和大于14.6 dB,TM0模式的IL和ER分别大于10.7 dB和大于5.1 dB,而PDL大于8.3 dB.', '[{"name":"MA Hansi","name_zh":"马汉斯","org_zh":"湖南工商大学 微电子与物理学院,长沙 410205","orgid":"6481885e6fdfd94331130f69"},{"name":"LIN Zhen","name_zh":"林振","org_zh":"湖南工商大学 微电子与物理学院,长沙 410205","orgid":"6481885e6fdfd94331130f69"},{"name":"SUN Fan","name_zh":"孙樊","org_zh":"湖南工商大学 微电子与物理学院,长沙 410205","orgid":"6481885e6fdfd94331130f69"},{"name":"XIAO Yun","name_zh":"肖韵","org_zh":"湖南工商大学 微电子与物理学院,长沙 410205","orgid":"6481885e6fdfd94331130f69"},{"name":"XIAO Haichuan","name_zh":"肖海川","org_zh":"湖南工商大学 微电子与物理学院,长沙 410205","orgid":"6481885e6fdfd94331130f69"},{"name":"ZHAO Na","name_zh":"赵娜","org_zh":"湖南工商大学 微电子与物理学院,长沙 410205","orgid":"6481885e6fdfd94331130f69"},{"name":"GAN Longfei","name_zh":"甘龙飞","org_zh":"湖南工商大学 微电子与物理学院,长沙 410205","orgid":"6481885e6fdfd94331130f69"},{"name":"YANG Junbo","name_zh":"杨俊波","org_zh":"中国人民解放军国防科技大学","orgid":"62331e330a6eb147dca8a7a2"}]', '["Photonic Integrated Circuits","Polarization-insensitive waveguide crossings","Multimode interference","Direct binary search algorithm"]', '["光子集成电路","偏振不敏感的交叉波导","多模干涉","直接二进制搜索算法"]', '{"name_zh":"光子学报","raw":"Acta Photonica Sinica"}', '1004-4213', '55', '6', 2026, NULL),
('69f3b3cb0a96f8c83cbde060', '10.15302/j-sscae-2025.09.019', 'Current Application Status and Development Direction of High-end Magnetron Sputtering Target in China', '我国高端磁控溅射靶材应用现状及发展方向', 'High-end magnetron sputtering targets serve as the core foundational materials for fabricating critical functional films used in integrated circuits and flat panel displays.China currently faces a high external dependency in this field,along with persistent structural challenges such as weak fundamental research,lagging high-purity material preparation technologies,and reliance on imported core equipment.This study reviews the application status of high-end magnetron sputtering targets in two major fields—semiconductor chips and flat panel displays,and identifies common issues including micro-composition and structural homogeneity of raw materials and targets,preparation and testing equipment for sputtering targets,and the transition to smart manufacturing.It proposes key development directions for the sputtering target industry,such as research on micro-homogenization of composition and structure of ultra-high purity targets,collaborative efforts across the industrial chain to tackle key equipment for target processing and testing,driving research paradigm transformation through digital-intelligent integration,and focusing on forward-looking layouts of critical fields.Practical actions can be taken in areas including developing high-purity material purification and processing technologies,deepening industry-university-research-application collaborative innovation mechanisms,improving the industrial chain and standards systems,balancing independent talent cultivation with targeted recruitment,and reshaping the innovation ecosystem of the sputtering target industry.These measures will help transition China''s sputtering target industry from a follower model featuring"equipment introduction-process imitation"to an innovative"data-driven-standard-led"paradigm,thereby supporting the development needs of strategic emerging industries such as integrated circuits and flat panel displays.', '高端磁控溅射靶材(简称溅射靶材)是制备集成电路、平板显示用关键功能薄膜的核心基础材料,我国在此领域对外依存度较高,长期面临基础研究薄弱、高纯材料制备技术滞后、核心装备依赖进口等结构性挑战.本文系统梳理了半导体芯片、平板显示两类主要领域中高端磁控溅射靶材的应用现状,辨识了原材料及溅射靶材的微观成分与组织均一性、溅射靶材制备与检测装备、智能制造转型等方面的共性问题,提出了开展超高纯溅射靶材成分与组织的微观均质化研究、产业链合力攻关溅射靶材加工和检测关键设备、以数智融合驱动溅射靶材研发范式变革、聚焦前沿布局关键领域溅射靶材等产业重点发展方向.着力在攻关高纯度材料提纯与加工技术、深化"产学研用"协同创新机制、完善产业链与标准体系、兼顾人才自主培养与精准引进、重塑溅射靶材产业创新生态等方面采取务实行动,推动我国溅射靶材产业从"设备引进-工艺模仿"的跟随发展模式向"数据驱动-标准引领"的创新范式跃迁,保障集成电路、平板显示等战略性新兴产业的发展需求.', '[{"id":"609a86c19e795ecb5b2f1721","name":"Li Qingkui","name_zh":"李庆奎","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"id":"609a86e49e795ecb5b2f1779","name":"Sun Benshuang","name_zh":"孙本双","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"id":"56cb18bfc35f4f3c65660158","name":"He Jinjiang","name_zh":"何金江","org_zh":"有研亿金新材料有限公司,北京 102200"},{"id":"609a86c59e795ecb5b2f1728","name":"Wang Chengduo","name_zh":"王成铎","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"id":"637abbf5f789b382bea35b24","name":"Che Yusi","name_zh":"车玉思","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"name":"Yang Jiaqiang","name_zh":"杨家强","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"id":"609a86e59e795ecb5b2f177c","name":"Chen Jie","name_zh":"陈杰","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"id":"62e8b27ed9f20422f0bd8613","name":"Wang Zhijun","name_zh":"王之君","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"id":"609a86c99e795ecb5b2f1733","name":"Wu Xiaochao","name_zh":"吴小超","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"},{"id":"54403edddabfae7d84b7b98c","name":"He Jilin","name_zh":"何季麟","org_zh":"中原关键金属实验室,郑州 450001"}]', '["sputtering target","high-purity materials","integrated circuit","flat panel display","microscopic homogenization"]', '["溅射靶材","高纯材料","集成电路","平板显示","微观均质化"]', '{"name_zh":"中国工程科学","raw":"Strategic Study of CAE"}', '1009-1742', '28', '2', 2026, NULL);




——以数字电路与系统设计基础课程为例', 'Professional curriculum is the core carrier of higher education, ideological and political educationis a powerful means to give full play to the educational function of professional curriculum. Taking digital circuit and system design fundamentals courses as an example, this paper explores the effective path of carrying out curriculum ideological and political construction in professional courses. From the aspects of ideological and political elements mining, teaching content reconstruction, diversified course organization forms and the expansion of educational time and space, this paper explains the design ideas and implementation methods of ideological and political education in the course, in order to provide reference for professional courses to carry out curriculum ideological and political construction.', '专业课程是高等教育的核心载体,课程思政是发挥专业课程育人功能的有力手段.以数字电路与系统设计基础专业课程为例,探究专业课程开展课程思政建设的有效路径.从思政元素挖掘、教学内容重构、多元化的课程组织形式及育人时间与空间的扩展等方面阐释了课程思政的设计思路与实施方法,以期为专业课程开展课程思政建设提供借鉴与参考.', '[{"id":"609e7d659e795e26c4379e23","name":"Zhang Xia","name_zh":"张霞","org":"西安邮电大学","org_zh":"西安邮电大学","orgid":"61e69dda689627346574286a"},{"name":"Li Lijun","name_zh":"李立珺","org":"西安邮电大学","org_zh":"西安邮电大学","orgid":"61e69dda689627346574286a"}]', '["ideological and political education","teaching design","integrated circuit"]', '["课程思政","教学设计","集成电路"]', '{"name_zh":"中国现代教育装备","raw":"China Modern Educational Equipment"}', '1672-1438', NULL, '7', 2023, NULL),
('655b81fd939a5f40825e4727', '10.3969/j.issn.1006-3404.2023.05.020', NULL, '借鉴赛道经验,打造上海国资集成电路"灯塔工厂"', NULL, '"十四五"以来,部分地区为升级集成电路的产业生态,提出打造世界级"灯塔工厂"以推动经济社会高质量发展的战略上海"聚焦张江",将集成电路打造为三大先导产业之一,吸引中芯、华虹、展锐等龙头企业入驻,发展至今已经形成以张江、临港为核心的产业集群.上海国资在集团组建、并购重组、产业基金等模式中谱写了众多可行性经验,有利于巩固产业发展规模、革新材料设备技术、积聚产业人才.从"由近及远"、"避免重复"、"国资为优"、"正反评价"四个原则进行模式筛选,以国资力量、行业人才、应用场景三个角度为打造集成电路"灯塔工厂"提供发展建议.', '[{"name_zh":"陈韬","org_zh":"上海黄浦科创集团有限公司战略发展部"}]', '[]', '["集成电路","上海国资","引领","人才","场景"]', '{"name_zh":"决策咨询","raw":"Decision-Making & Consultancy"}', '1006-3404', NULL, '5', 2023, NULL),
('65567565939a5f40829b2b31', '10.3969/j.issn.1672－3414.2023.20.056', NULL, '海沧区产业发展情况分析', NULL, '文章对厦门市海沧区的产业发展现状进行分析,指出制约产业发展的问题,提出推动产业发展的对策建议,希望能够为打造在部分细分领域位居全国前列、具有国际竞争力的产业集群,以及全面提升产业核心竞争力等方面提供参考和借鉴.', '[{"name_zh":"许智婷","org_zh":"厦门市海沧区企业服务中心"}]', '[]', '["海沧区","产业发展","生物医药","集成电路","新材料","现代服务业"]', '{"name_zh":"投资与创业","raw":"UNDERTAKING&INVESTMENT"}', '1672－3414', '34', '20', 2023, NULL),
('65321e97939a5f40824008e8', '10.19339/j.issn.1674-2583.2023.08.034', 'Strategies and Prospects for Promoting Domestic Automotive Chips', '国产汽车芯片的推进策略与展望', NULL, '阐述当前国内汽车电子芯片应用与推广的现状、汽车及汽车电子芯片的发展趋势,对国内集成电路企业研发和推进汽车芯片产品提出建议.', '[{"name":"LIU Jinmei","name_zh":"刘劲梅","org":"华大半导体有限公司","org_zh":"华大半导体有限公司","orgid":"623316e90a6eb145604648ab"}]', '["integrated circuit development","vehicle specifications","automotive chips","chip product outlook"]', '["集成电路发展","车规","汽车芯片","芯片产品展望"]', '{"name_zh":"集成电路应用","raw":"Applications of IC"}', '1674-2583', '40', '8', 2023, NULL),
('648292ebd68f896efa47010b', '10.19339/j.issn.1674-2583.2023.04.014', 'Evaluation of Process Application of Photoresist Shrinkage Technology in Debonding Machine', '光刻胶收缩工艺在去胶机台的工艺应用评估', 'This paper expounds the use of the Descum process in the debonding machine to solve the residual defects caused by insufficient development ability in certain special graphic areas of the photolithography process, or to prevent the curing of the photoresist from peening in wet etching grooves. The CIS process requires several different ion implantation processes in the pixel area, with each layer requiring photolithography followed by ion implantation followed by debonding. Some layers of ion implantation have similar areas, and due to cost considerations, customers hope to achieve the requirement of reducing lithography layers by using a debonding machine to shrink the photoresist.Explore the impact of different wafer materials, collect data between machines and WTW, and conduct mass production demonstration and evaluation of high-temperature ASH pin-up CD shrink process.', '阐述去胶机台Descum工艺用于解决光刻工艺在某些特殊图形区域的显影能力不足导致的缺陷残留,或者用于防止光刻胶在湿法刻蚀槽中peeling而进行的固化用途.CIS工艺在像素区需要数道不同区域的离子注入,每层次都需要先光刻然后离子注入再去胶,有些层次离子注入的区域很相似,出于成本考量,客户希望通过去胶机台实现光刻胶的shrink使得达到减少光刻层次的需求.探讨对不同wafer材质的影响、对机台间、WTW间的数据收集,对高温ASH pin-up CD shrink工艺进行量产论证评估.', '[{"id":"63dc57398def4c1ab79c65e6","name":"JIANG Min","name_zh":"江旻","org":"上海华力集成电路制造有限公司","org_zh":"上海华力集成电路制造有限公司","orgid":"623317280a6eb1456046f6ad"}]', '["integrated circuit manufacturing","photoresist shrinkage","debonding machine","process window"]', '["集成电路制造","光刻胶收缩","去胶机台","工艺窗口"]', '{"name_zh":"集成电路应用","raw":"Applications of IC"}', '1674-2583', '40', '4', 2023, NULL),
('657b2b96939a5f408275ffa9', '10.19339/j.issn.1674-2583.2023.10.013', 'Design of BiCMOS Process for High Reliable Digital Integrated Circuits', '高可靠数字集成电路的BiCMOS工艺设计', NULL, '阐述一种基于5V BiCMOS高可靠数字集成电路的器件结构、工艺设计和工艺开发,并对该器件的电参数进行测试,与试验仿真值进行比对分析,结果相符合.', '[{"name":"LIU Yunjie","name_zh":"刘云洁","org":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","org_zh":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","orgid":"6233172f0a6eb14560470c0d"},{"id":"542c0de4dabfae1ad895a487","name":"PU Yaochuan","name_zh":"蒲耀川","org":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","org_zh":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","orgid":"6233172f0a6eb14560470c0d"},{"name":"WANG Yijun","name_zh":"王轶军","org":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","org_zh":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","orgid":"6233172f0a6eb14560470c0d"},{"name":"LI Wenjun","name_zh":"李文军","org":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","org_zh":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","orgid":"6233172f0a6eb14560470c0d"},{"name":"PAN Zhaoxia","name_zh":"潘照霞","org":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","org_zh":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","orgid":"6233172f0a6eb14560470c0d"},{"name":"REN Xiong","name_zh":"任雄","org":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","org_zh":"天水天光半导体有限责任公司,甘肃 741000","orgid":"6233172f0a6eb14560470c0d"}]', '["integrated circuit manufacturing","BiCMOS","device structure","process design"]', '["集成电路制造","BiCMOS","器件结构","工艺设计"]', '{"name_zh":"集成电路应用","raw":"Applications of IC"}', '1674-2583', '40', '10', 2023, NULL),
('658a436c939a5f4082a1d7c8', NULL, NULL, '电网企业知识产权管理的重要性分析与保护研究', NULL, '电网企业知识产权管理时存在技术成果、知识产权等变化,导致管理措施出现不当的问题.文章在阐述知识产权的分类基础上,通过对电网企业知识产权重要性进行分析,确定了电网企业知识产权重要性,并根据需求提出了具体的知识产权保护措施.', '[{"name_zh":"巫俊洁","org_zh":"国网重庆市电力公司","orgid":"623316e90a6eb1456046494b"}]', '[]', '["知识产权","电网企业","集成电路产业","合规风险"]', '{"name_zh":"知识经济","raw":"Knowlegde Economy"}', '1007-3825', '664', '36', 2023, NULL),
('64db04d43fda6d7f06583861', '10.16526/j.cnki.11-4762/tp.2023.07.012', 'Hardware Platform Design of Integrated Circuit Automatic Test System', '集成电路综合自动测试系统硬件平台设计', NULL, '针对当前国内集成电路产业快速发展的现状,通过分析集成电路测试需求,研制了国产超大规模集成电路综合自动测试系统硬件平台;首先设计了基于PXIe总线的硬件平台总体架构方案,其次研制了包含数字测试模块等高性能PXIe测试仪器,进一步构建了测试头等分系统并完成系统集成;采用高性能外部仪器和自检校准分系统,对硬件平台进行了指标测试;基于BM3110MPB开展了测试验证;验证结果表明,硬件平台数字测试单通道最高测试速率为1 600 Mbps、DPS可实现最大输出电压12 V、最大输出电流800 mA,具备连接性测试、功能测试、直流参数与交流参数测试等功能;该硬件平台未来可有效满足国产超大规模集成电路测试需要.', '[{"id":"5d9c64a16827f2cc03c3ec2c","name":"FENG Jiancheng","name_zh":"冯建呈","org":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","org_zh":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","orgid":"623316ef0a6eb145604655c4"},{"id":"633411182fedb730e3a163aa","name":"WANG Zhanxuan","name_zh":"王占选","org":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","org_zh":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","orgid":"623316ef0a6eb145604655c4"},{"id":"62e398f4d9f2043704d63c94","name":"YAN Liqin","name_zh":"闫丽琴","org":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","org_zh":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","orgid":"623316ef0a6eb145604655c4"},{"id":"63341e562fedb730e3a621fe","name":"YIN Ye","name_zh":"殷晔","org":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","org_zh":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","orgid":"623316ef0a6eb145604655c4"},{"name":"WEI Xiaohui","name_zh":"尉晓惠","org":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","org_zh":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","orgid":"623316ef0a6eb145604655c4"},{"name":"WANG Hongyu","name_zh":"王红宇","org":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","org_zh":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","orgid":"623316ef0a6eb145604655c4"},{"name":"WU Zhaohua","name_zh":"吴朝华","org":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","org_zh":"北京航天测控技术有限公司","orgid":"623316ef0a6eb145604655c4"}]', '["IC test","automatic test system","PXIe Bus","digital test","tester head"]', '["集成电路测试","自动测试系统","PXIe总线","数字测试","测试头"]', '{"name_zh":"计算机测量与控制","raw":"Computer Measurement & Control"}', '1671-4598', '31', '7', 2023, NULL),
('69b159019be8eb7c4b631cb8', '10.19678/j.issn.1000-3428.0070060', 'Research and Implementation of Computational Storage System for High-Energy Physics', '面向高能物理的可计算存储系统研究与实现', 'In high-energy physics experiments, data processing typically involves a compute-storage separated computing model. During the computation process, data must be transferred between the computing and storage nodes. The continuous growth in experimental data and data analysis demands has led to data transfer bottlenecks, reducing the overall processing efficiency of these systems. This paper proposes a computational storage system for high-energy physics. First, the storage software EOS is extended. Computational storage plugins are introduced by building on the original architecture. After parsing user commands, the storage server executes local computations based on the file I/O, thereby reducing data movement, alleviating network pressure, and enhancing data processing efficiency. Second, a computational storage server based on a Central Processing Unit-Field Programmable Gate Array (CPU-FPGA) heterogeneous computing architecture is constructed. Considering the lower computational complexity of I/O-intensive tasks, tasks suitable for parallel computing are offloaded to the FPGA via the PCIe bus, thereby extending the computational capabilities of the storage server. Experimental evaluations show that the computational storage system eliminates queuing time and network latency, thereby shortening the overall execution time of computational tasks. Moreover, leveraging FPGA-based hardware acceleration effectively compensates for the weak computing performance of CPUs in storage servers, thereby enhancing the algorithmic versatility of computational storage devices. In tests based on decoding by LHAASO, the computational storage system achieves a speedup of approximately sixfold.', '高能物理实验数据处理普遍采用存算分离的计算模式,计算过程中需要在计算节点和存储节点间传输数据.实验数据和数据分析需求的不断增长造成了数据传输瓶颈,降低了系统整体的处理效率.针对上述问题提出面向高能物理的可计算存储系统.首先,对存储软件EOS进行扩展,在原架构的基础上增加可计算存储插件,存储服务器解析用户命令后,在文件I/O的基础上执行本地计算,减少数据移动,缓解网络压力,提升数据处理效率.然后,构建基于中央处理器-现场可编程门阵列(CPU-FPGA)异构计算架构的可计算存储服务器.针对I/O密集型任务计算复杂度较低的特点,将适合并行计算的任务通过PCIe总线卸载到FPGA中,扩展了存储服务器的计算能力.对系统的实验评估结果表明,可计算存储系统能有效消除排队时间和网络延迟,进而缩短计算任务的整体执行时间.基于FPGA的硬件加速,有效弥补了存储服务器中CPU计算性能较弱的缺陷,提升了可计算存储设备的算法通用性.在基于LHAASO的解码作业的测试中,可计算存储系统实现了约6倍的速度提升.', '[{"name":"GAO Yu","name_zh":"高宇","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所"},{"name":"CHENG Yaodong","name_zh":"程耀东","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所,北京 100049"},{"name":"ZHANG Minxing","name_zh":"张敏行","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所"},{"name":"CHENG Yaosong","name_zh":"程垚松","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所"},{"name":"BI Yujiang","name_zh":"毕玉江","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所"}]', '["computational storage","heterogeneous computing","Field Programmable Gate Array(FPGA)","big data","high-energy physics"]', '["可计算存储","异构计算","现场可编程门阵列","大数据","高能物理"]', '{"name_zh":"计算机工程","raw":"Computer Engineering"}', '1000-3428', '52', '3', 2026, NULL),
('6a3e62a10a96f8c83c3ca5bc', '10.1360/csb-2025-5947', 'Quantum Feasibility Verification and Advantage Exploration in High-Energy Physics: Frontier Algorithms for Jet Reconstruction and Event Classification', '高能物理中的量子可行性验证与优势探索:喷注重建与事例分类的前沿算法', 'High-energy physics (HEP) experiments have fully entered a data-intensive era in which event sizes, detector granularity, and analysis complexity are increasing rapidly. These trends impose growing pressure on conventional computing in multiple parts of the reconstruction-and-analysis chain. In particular, classical methods can exhibit practical bottlenecks when confronted with high-dimensional feature spaces, intrinsically combinatorial decision making, and the need to process massive datasets under stringent throughput constraints. Quantum computing, exploiting quantum superposition and entanglement, provides a complementary computational paradigm that may help address such challenges by enabling new algorithmic routes for optimization and learning, especially through hybrid quantum-classical workflows suitable for near-term devices. This article reviews two representative lines of recent progress on quantum algorithms for HEP data analysis. The first focuses on jet clustering, which is translated into a combinatorial optimization problem. Final-state particles are mapped to vertices of a weighted graph, where edge weights encode geometric relations (e.g., angular separation) and circuit resources are controlled via k-nearest-neighbor sparsification. The clustering objective is then reformulated as a Max-Cut instance and encoded into an Ising-type Hamiltonian. A quantum approximate optimization algorithm (QAOA) alternates cost and mixer evolutions within a shallow parameterized circuit, while a classical optimizer iteratively updates circuit parameters based on repeated measurements of the objective. Small-scale studies demonstrate that QAOA-based jet clustering, via a Max-Cut mapping, establishes the feasibility of hybrid quantum-classical optimization for event reconstruction on current hardware within statistical uncertainties in practice. The second application targets Higgs event classification in the context of a circular electron-positron collider (CEPC) using quantum kernel methods. A quantum support vector machine with a kernel (QSVM-kernel) embeds compact kinematic feature vectors into a quantum feature space through a designed feature-map circuit. Quantum circuits are used to estimate kernel matrix elements on hardware (or calibrated noisy simulators), after which a classical support vector machine (SVM) solves the associated convex optimization problem in kernel space. For benchmark CEPC Higgs analyses with low-dimensional inputs, the quantum-kernel classifier achieves signal-background discrimination comparable to classical kernel SVMs, and the workflow can be executed stably on current superconducting platforms at the relevant qubit scales. Despite the fact that present-day quantum hardware remains constrained by noise, limited qubit counts, and decoherence, a growing body of frontier studies has already validated the feasibility of quantum algorithms on small-scale tasks such as jet reconstruction and event classification, while also initiating preliminary investigations toward potential quantum advantage. With continued improvements in hardware fidelity, the maturation of quantum error mitigation techniques, and the development of scalable divide-and-conquer strategies, quantum computing is expected to play an increasingly important role in future data processing and analysis pipelines of high-energy physics experiments.', '随着高能物理实验全面迈入"大数据时代",事件规模和分析复杂度迅速提升,经典计算方法在处理高维特征、组合优化和海量数据时逐渐显现出性能瓶颈.量子计算依托量子叠加与纠缠所带来的潜在并行性,为应对这些挑战提供了新的技术路径.本文介绍了量子计算在高能物理分析中的两项代表性工作:其一是基于量子近似优化算法实现喷注聚类,将该任务映射为最大割问题并展示了量子-经典混合优化在事件重建中的可行性;其二是基于量子核支持向量机用于环形正负电子对撞机的希格斯事例分类,通过量子特征映射实现与经典核支持向量机相当的信号-本底区分性能.尽管当前量子硬件仍受限于噪声、量子比特数和退相干等因素,但已有一系列前沿研究在小规模喷注重建和事例分类等任务中验证了量子算法的可行性并开展了量子优势的初步探索.随着硬件保真度提升、量子误差缓解与可扩展分治策略的发展,量子计算有望在未来高能物理实验的数据处理与分析中发挥越来越重要的作用.', '[{"name":"Yongfeng Zhu","org":"Chinese Acad Sci, Inst High Energy Phys, Beijing 100049, Peoples R China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所"},{"name":"Jinzhe Wu","org":"Jilin Univ, Sch Phys, Changchun 130012, Peoples R China","org_zh":"吉林大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e34d"},{"name":"Chen Zhou","org":"Peking Univ, Sch Phys, State Key Lab Nucl Phys & Technol, Beijing 100871, Peoples R China","org_zh":"北京大学物理学院,核物理与核技术全国重点实验室,北京 100871","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c85d"}]', '["quantum computing","quantum optimization","quantum machine learning","high-energy physics","jet reconstruction","event classification"]', '["量子计算","量子优化","量子机器学习","高能物理","喷注重建","事例分类"]', '{"raw":"CHINESE SCIENCE BULLETIN-CHINESE"}', '0023-074X', '71', '15', 2026, NULL),
('6a9a09f60a96f8c83cce5b65', '10.26599/phys.2026.9320506', 'PROBING PARTICLE PHYSICS WITH ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE', '以人工智能窥探粒子的奥秘', 'Particle physics experiments have long research cycles and high barriers to entry.Limited human resources make it difficult to fully explore and analyze large volumes of colli-sion data.Agents based on large language models can write code,retrieve literature,and car-ry out multi-step analyses,offering an opportunity to address this challenge.This article fo-cuses on the Just Furnish Context(JFC)agent framework and examines results produced by the framework,including the CMS H→τ+τ-signal-strength measurement and the ALEPH Lund jet-plane density measurement,as well as their implications for particle physics re-search.It also summarizes the framework''s current limitations and discusses prospects for benchmark-dataset construction,data processing at next-generation large-scale scientific facili-ties,and the training of future physicists.', '高能物理实验研究周期长、知识门槛高,受限于人力,大量对撞数据难以得到充分的挖掘与分析.以大语言模型为基础的智能体能够编写代码、检索文献并执行多步分析,为突破困境提供契机.本文聚焦Just Furnish Context(JFC)智能体框架,分析其完成的CMS实验 H→τ+τ-信号强度测量、ALEPH 实验 Lund喷注平面密度测量等结果,及其对高能物理研究的意义;同时概括其当前局限性,并展望基准数据集构建、下一代大科学装置数据处理、人才培养的发展前景.', '[{"name":"ZHAO Yiyang","name_zh":"赵一扬","org":"Department of Physics, Tsinghua University, Beijing 100084","org_zh":"清华大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c860"},{"name":"HU Zhen","name_zh":"胡震","org":"Department of Physics, Tsinghua University, Beijing 100084","org_zh":"清华大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c860"}]', '["particle physics","high energy physics experiment","artificial intelligence","large lan-guage models","AI agents"]', '["粒子物理","高能物理实验","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体"]', '{"name_zh":"物理与工程","raw":"Physics and Engineering"}', '1009-7104', '46', '5', 2026, NULL),
('68a6999e163c01c850b97711', '10.3724/j.issn.1000-3045.20240629004', 'Disciplines Transmutation Prompted by Atomic Energy Development: from Nuclear Physics to High Energy Physics and Theoretical Physics', '发展原子能事业催生的学科嬗变：从核物理到高能物理与理论物理', NULL, '发展原子能事业高效带动了我国一批关键学科的布局和发展。文章通过回顾史实，探讨我国如何集中科研力量优先发展核科技，突破尖端武器研制并带动高能物理与理论物理实现学科的建制化过程。研究表明，理论物理在中国科技发展各时期扮演不同角色，高能物理发展则与经济、技术和社会环境密切相关。契合并满足国家发展需求与追求世界科技前沿新知是中国核物理、高能物理和理论物理发展的重要推动力。', '[{"name_zh":"刘金岩","org_zh":"中国科学院自然科学史研究所"}]', '["nuclear physics","high energy physics","theoretical physics","accelerator"]', '["核物理","高能物理","理论物理","加速器"]', '{"name_zh":"中国科学院院刊"}', '1000-3045', NULL, 'S2', 2025, NULL),
('68ad6923163c01c85020a4bc', '10.3724/sp.j.1461.2025.01081', 'The Rise of Neodymium Iron Boron Permanent Magnets in China in the 1980s and 1990s and Its Influence on the World', '20世纪80—90年代中国钕铁硼永磁材料的兴起及其世界影响（英文）', 'The research and development of neodymium iron boron(NdFeB)permanent magnets saw breakthroughs in China in 1984.The success of the technology of using low-purity Nd not only helped Chinese-made NdFeB permanent magnets reach a high cost-performance ratio,but also shaped China''s rare-earth industry for decades.This article emphatically investigates the important role played by a number of transnational factors since the 1970s in the development of the NdFeB technology in China,including the exploitation of rare earth mines in China,the introduction of the physics of amorphous solids into the country,Sino-French scientific and technological exchanges and cooperation,the plans to build BEPC and the subsequent BSRF in the field of high energy physics in Beijing,and the development of Alpha Magnetic Spectrometers in the United States.As China has participated more actively in the globalization of contemporary sciences since the 1970s,the quick development of physics of amorphous solids and NdFeB magnets serves as a representative case study for how the development of new industries has been boosted by advancements in contemporary physics in China.', '1984年中国钕铁硼（NdFeB）永磁材料的研发取得突破。低纯钕技术的成功，促使中国制造的钕铁硼永磁体具备高性价比的优势，也影响了此后数十年中国稀土与相关产业的发展。论文着重考察了自20世纪70年代以来，中国稀土矿开发、非晶态物理学引入、中法科技交流与合作、北京的高能物理计划、美国阿尔法磁谱仪的研制等跨国因素，在中国钕铁硼技术发展中扮演的重要角色。20世纪70年代之后，中国比以往更主动地参与到现代科学全球化的进程之中。非晶态物理学与钕铁硼材料的兴起是理解中国现代物理学促进新产业发展的一个典型案例。', '[{"name_zh":"孙烈","org":"Institute for the History of Natural Sciences, Chinese Academy of Sciences","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"name_zh":"李昕","org":"Institute for the History of Natural Sciences, Chinese Academy of Sciences","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '["neodymium iron boron(NdFeB)","rare earth","high energy physics","physics of amorphous solids","Chinese Academy of Sciences","globalization"]', '["钕铁硼","稀土","高能物理","非晶态物理学","中国科学院","全球化"]', '{"raw":"Chinese Annals of History of Science and Technology"}', '2096-4226', NULL, '1', 2025, NULL),
('6613d3bf13fb2c6cf63fa66b', NULL, NULL, '高频复用高能物理科学数据的特征及影响因素分析', NULL, '目的/意义 以Data Citation Index（DCI）数据库高能物理领域科学数据为研究对象，探究高能物理领域科学数据的复用特征及影响因素，为推动我国数据共享和引用规范性、提升数据价值和影响力提供参考与借鉴。 方法/过程 利用DCI数据库的数据基本信息和引用信息，采用统计回归方法，通过科学数据属性特征、科学数据复用特征、科学数据属性特征与复用特征相关性3个维度开展高能物理领域科学数据复用特征及影响因素的分析。 结果/结论 研究结果表明，高能物理领域科学数据共享数量逐年递增，但数据字段缺失比例较高，数据复用受数据等级、出版模式和学科类别的影响较大，导致被引频次分布极不均匀，高等级科学数据更易获得高频复用次数，科学数据共享和引用规范有待进一步加强。最后，本文据此提出高能物理科学数据复用的优化提升路径。', '[{"name_zh":"胡威","org_zh":"中国科学院成都文献情报中心","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"name_zh":"杨宁","org_zh":"中国科学院成都文献情报中心","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '[]', '["科学数据","高能物理","数据复用","影响因素","统计回归"]', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2024, NULL),
('64b0a4ae3fda6d7f06594906', '10.16400/j.cnki.kjdk.2022.30.022', 'Explore Ways to Involve Recent Progresses in High Energy Physics into Undergraduate Courses', '将高能物理前沿进展融入本科教学的创新探索', NULL, '高能物理是研究物质微观结构最前沿的学科,能够影响物理学的各个分支.将高能物理的前沿进展融入当前粒子物理相关课程的教学中,对教学知识体系进行补充与整合,有益于深化学生对量子力学、电动力学和理论力学知识的理解,拓展关于前沿科技的知识面,提高参与科研活动的积极性和粒子物理专业毕业论文的质量.入选相关课程的前沿热点需要被广泛认可、难度适宜并与现有体系相关联.在粒子物理导论课程中,可以引入希格斯波色子、缪子反常磁矩、波色子质量和引力波方面的最新实验和理论进展.', '[{"name":"ZHANG Yang","name_zh":"张阳","org":"郑州大学","org_zh":"郑州大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e346"},{"id":"61524d9d60a965200207f5f7","name":"WANG Fei","name_zh":"王飞","org":"郑州大学","org_zh":"郑州大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e346"},{"name":"CAI Yong","name_zh":"蔡勇","org":"郑州大学","org_zh":"郑州大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e346"},{"name":"LI Zhibin","name_zh":"李志镔","org":"郑州大学","org_zh":"郑州大学","orgid":"5f71b2c71c455f439fe3e346"}]', '[]', '["高能物理","希格斯粒子","缪子反常磁矩","引力波","教学改革"]', '{"name_zh":"科教导刊","raw":"The Guide of Science & Education"}', '1674-6813', NULL, '30', 2022, NULL),
('62cd51415aee126c0f199836', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-6804.2022.01.002', 'The Party is Over Chen-Ning Yang''s unique insight on high energy physics and its influences in China', '盛宴已经结束杨振宁对高能物理的独特观点及其在中国的影响', NULL, '杨振宁对高能物理有其独特的观点.他认为,高能物理是物理学的尖端,其发展就像在沙堆顶上撒沙子,从基底到顶端都有所提高,对整个物理学的发展有巨大推动作用.他同时对高能物理的未来发展持悲观态度,认为高能物理蓬勃发展的"盛宴"已经结束,他反对建造巨型高能加速器.究其原因,杨振宁认为,高能物理进一步发展需要的是物理思想、物理观念的革命性突破,而不是寄希望于无法继续下去的能量越来越高的巨型加速器.还原论理念遭遇严重挑战与质疑也是重要的时代背景之一.杨振宁对高能物理的独特观点在中国广泛传播并对中国科技发展有着深远的影响.', '[{"id":"53f436b1dabfaee2a1ce8f8d","name":"HUANG Qingqiao","name_zh":"黄庆桥","org_zh":"上海交通大学","orgid":"5f71b54b1c455f439fe502b0"}]', NULL, '["杨振宁","高能物理","高能加速器"]', '{"name_zh":"科学文化评论","raw":"Science & Culture Review"}', '1672-6804', '19', '1', 2022, NULL),
('6491e7e2d68f896efae5c69a', NULL, 'A historical investigation of the particle physics development', '粒子物理学发展的历史考察', NULL, '粒子物理是现代物理学的重要分支,也是人类文明的标志性成就之一.1955-1995年,约1/3的诺贝尔物理学奖授予了粒子物理相关理论或实验研究.为分析其发展历程,按照时间顺序,将粒子物理的发展分为初步探索期、理论成熟期、实验验证期和继续完善期4个阶段.其中,初步探索期(1930-1951年)是粒子物理的起步与独立阶段;理论成熟期(1952-1967年)是粒子物理的理论体系构建阶段;实验验证期(1968-1985年)是粒子物理理论体系得到实验验证阶段;继续完善期(1986年至今)是粒子物理的接续发展阶段.现在人类比以往任何时期都更加接近于超越标准模型的新物理.', '[{"id":"6170556c60a965737d74a42d","name":"QIAO Xiaofei","name_zh":"乔笑斐","org":"山西大学","org_zh":"山西大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e35c"},{"id":"64f3f37c8a47b6659627ab4f","name":"LU Haoming","name_zh":"路昊明","org":"山西大学","org_zh":"山西大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e35c"}]', '[]', '["粒子物理学","粒子加速器","高能物理"]', '{"name_zh":"科技导报","raw":"Science & Technology Review"}', '1000-7857', '40', '9', 2022, NULL),
('62a8611b5aee126c0f3392e6', '10.3772/j.issn.1674-1544.2022.01.004', 'Services and Applications of High Energy Physics Data', '高能物理科学数据服务与应用', NULL, '高能物理科学数据是用于研究物质的基本构成以及宇宙起源基础研究的重要资源。利用网络、计算、存储等基础设施可以提供包括数据汇交、数据共享、数据处理等高能物理科学数据服务,研究探讨高能物理科学数据的服务与应用具有重要意义。本文阐述国家高能物理科学数据中心支持的包括宇宙线观测、空间科学、粒子物理和材料科学领域的数据应用模式以及所采用的技术手段和方法,并通过典型服务案例介绍国内高能物理科学数据服务与应用。', '[{"id":"6153d73760a96506679be8d4","name_zh":"曾珊","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"560d515a45ce1e5960c2192b","name_zh":"陈刚","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"60e2b4979e795ecf20d0896e","name_zh":"齐法制","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"61520c5760a9652002075aa0","name_zh":"张红梅","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"542c483adabfae2b4e1fce10","name_zh":"李海波","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"6324e8dea36d2225e113e6d5","name_zh":"李亚康","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"562ad0b745cedb339895142e","name_zh":"田浩来","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', NULL, '["高能物理","科学数据","数据汇交","数据处理","数据共享","数据应用"]', '{"name_zh":"中国科技资源导刊"}', '1674-1544', NULL, '1', 2022, NULL),
('63c20f7590e50fcafd460b52', '10.7693/wl20221102', 'A sketch of the Higgs boson', '漫谈希格斯粒子', NULL, '希格斯玻色子发现于2012年,是粒子物理学研究中的一件划时代的大事.它在粒子物理的"标准模型"中起关键性作用,通过神秘的对称性破缺机制给基本粒子带来质量,和高深莫测的量子真空息息相关,也被认为在宇宙演化的极早期起重要作用.在希格斯玻色子发现十周年之际,文章将从科普视角出发,描绘希格斯玻色子的理论背景、粒子特性、实验探测、研究现状和展望,揭开希格斯玻色子的神秘面纱,理解它的过去、现在和未来.', '[{"id":"56091a0345cedb3396e189df","name":"WU Yu-Sheng","name_zh":"吴雨生","org":"中国科学技术大学 粒子科学技术研究中心 合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学 粒子科学技术研究中心 合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"id":"65038d448a47b65b84b5970f","name":"XU Lai-Lin","name_zh":"徐来林","org":"中国科学技术大学 粒子科学技术研究中心 合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学 粒子科学技术研究中心 合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"name":"ZHANG Yang","name_zh":"张扬","org":"中国科学技术大学 交叉学科理论研究中心 合肥230026","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学 交叉学科理论研究中心 合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"}]', '[]', '["希格斯玻色子","标准模型","高能物理实验"]', '{"name_zh":"物理","raw":"Physics"}', '0379-4148', '51', '11', 2022, NULL),
('619bbbaa1c45e57ce97c694b', '10.1360/sspma-2021-0108', 'Data and Computing for High Energy Physics Experiments', '高能物理实验中的数据与计算技术', 'High energy physics (HEP), which is also known as particle physics, is the study of the fundamental building blocks of nature, the interactions of elementary particles, and the origin of the Universe. Large-scale HEP experiments can produce hundreds of petabytes of real and simulated data yearly. This capability has made HEP a major explorer of scientific computing in the last few decades. In this work, three computing tasks, i.e., event reconstruction, physics simulation, and data analysis, are introduced. Subsequently, data and computing challenges are demonstrated with different examples of HEP experiments. To address the challenges, the HEP community has been focusing on developing computing models in the last thirty years. The HEP-computing model has evolved from local centers with mainframes and workstations to distributed clusters and worldwide computing grids. Some technologies generated through HEP computing, such as WWW, have made a considerable impact on the world. In the concluding part of this work, the perspective of computing technologies in HEP is discussed.', '高能物理也称作粒子物理,是研究物质微观结构与相互作用、宇宙起源的重要基础科学前沿分支.高能物理实验装置非常复杂,产生的实验数据规模巨大,从20世纪后期的实验每年产生TB级发展到现在最新的实验每年产生近百PB.过去数十年来高能物理一直对数据与计算技术提出挑战,同时也充当数据与计算技术发展的推动者.高能物理实验一方面在利用最新计算机技术实现对数据及计算的支撑,同时也在推动计算机技术发展与突破.本文首先介绍高能物理实验数据与计算的基本模式,列举典型的高能物理实验说明数据规模及数据处理的挑战.在此基础上介绍高能物理计算技术的发展过程,特别就当前主流的网格计算、云计算技术及数据共享进行了讨论.', '[{"id":"63735861ec88d95668d6ec0c","name":"Chen Gang","org":"Chinese Acad Sci, Inst High Energy Phys, Beijing 100049, Peoples R China"}]', '["data analytics","big data","grid computing","high energy physics experiment","offline data"]', '["数据分析","大数据","网格计算","高能物理实验","离线数据"]', '{"raw":"SCIENTIA SINICA-PHYSICA MECHANICA & ASTRONOMICA"}', '1674-7275', '51', '9', 2021, 2),
('61cacf7f5244ab9dcb1bab9e', '10.11959/j.issn.2096-0271.2021046', 'Data Processing System for HEP Based on Domestic Processor Architecture', '基于国产处理器架构的高能物理数据处理系统', 'More and more scientific data are produced by fast-developing high energy physics (HEP) experiments, which urgently require advanced data processing system to support scientific research.At present, HEP data processing system is facing new opportunities and challenges with the rapid development of domestic CPU such as ARM architecture.Firstly, a brief introduction to the requirements and architecture of HEP data processing system was given.Then the relevant work such as porting software to domestic CPU architecture was described.Additionally, a cutting-edge computational storage technology for HEP data processing was proposed.Finally, the evaluation results of typical HEP applications on domestic CPU architecture were given as well.', '随着规模的不断扩大,高能物理实验产生了越来越多的科学数据,迫切需要先进的数据处理系统来支撑科学研究.目前,以ARM架构等为代表的国产处理器发展迅速,高能物理数据处理系统面临着新的机遇与挑战.首先总结了高能物理数据处理系统的需求及体系架构;然后描述了在国产处理器上开展的高能物理数据处理软件移植等相关工作,并提出了一种新的面向高能物理数据处理的可计算存储技术方案;最后给出了在国产处理器架构上的典型应用评测结果.', '[{"id":"5430e8f1dabfaecb587332e3","name_zh":"程耀东","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"65d3c85d8a47b622193287a2","name_zh":"程垚松","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"6379ec28f789b382be9da6be","name_zh":"毕玉江","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"63d595cc05c03100016ac7e6","name_zh":"高宇","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"542c483adabfae2b4e1fce10","name_zh":"李海波","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"6156fe6260a96506679fe17f","name_zh":"汪璐","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"650c57248a47b61c50bdf16b","name_zh":"姚秋玲","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '["domestic CPU","high energy physics","data processing","computational storage"]', '["国产处理器","高能物理","数据处理","可计算存储"]', '{"name_zh":"大数据"}', '2096-0271', NULL, '5', 2021, NULL),
('61caceaf5244ab9dcb0d39f6', '10.11889/j.0253-3219.2021.hjs.44.060502', 'Research on streaming data acquisition framework for high energy physics tracking system', '高能物理实验径迹系统流式数据获取框架的研究', 'BackgroundHigh energy physics (HEP) experiments aimed at studying elementary particles and their interactions need to acquire and analyze large amount of experimental data to discover new particles or measure the properties of known particles. With the development of HEP experiments, the energy and luminosity of accelerators are increasing, the scale of experiments is expanding, and consequently the acquisition, processing and analysis of large amount of data will be more challenging.PurposeThis study aims to design and implement a more advanced or effective distributed data acquisition framework to acquire and process the huge amount of data generated by tracking detectors for future HEP experiments where the number of channels and data volume of tracking detectors is extremely large.MethodsThe distributed data acquisition framework in HEP experiment divided into data flow software and online software was redesigned by using Hadoop big data framework, mainstream open source big data processing components was adopted to develope a new data acquisition framework—BigDataDAQ. Finally, this framework was applied to the prototype of the time projection chamber for verification.Results & ConclusionsResults of performance test show that the framework has high performance in data throughput and data processing, and can be easily deployed and managed. It provides a feasible solution for the future data acquisition system of high energy physics experiment.', '高能物理实验研究基本粒子及其相互作用,需要获取和分析大量的实验数据以发现新粒子或测量已知粒子的特性.随着高能物理实验规模的不断扩大以及加速器能量和亮度的不断提升,海量数据的获取、处理及分析将更具挑战性.在高能物理实验中,径迹系统探测器的通道数和数据量尤为巨大,为了读出和在线处理径迹系统探测器产生的海量数据,本文结合Hadoop大数据框架,引入主流开源的大数据处理组件,研究实现了一种流式数据获取框架——BigDataDAQ,并应用于时间投影室探测器模型实验中.实验室性能测试结果表明:这一数据获取框架具有良好的数据吞吐和数据处理能力,且易于部署和管理,为未来高能物理径迹系统结合大数据框架研制处理海量数据的流式数据获取系统进行了有益的尝试,并提供了一种可行的解决方案.', '[{"id":"63282f1630241ae3e5a7ba65","name":"WU Ye","name_zh":"王之滨","org":"State Key Laboratory of Particle Detection and Electronics, Institute of High Energy Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100049, China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所核探测与核电子学国家重点实验室 北京 100049","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"53f4692ddabfaeecd6a17cff","name":"ZHANG Hongyu","name_zh":"祁辉荣","org":"State Key Laboratory of Particle Detection and Electronics, Institute of High Energy Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100049, China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所核探测与核电子学国家重点实验室 北京 100049","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"60e2bff26750f80c68e4ebb2","name":"ZHU Kejun","name_zh":"章红宇","org":"State Key Laboratory of Particle Detection and Electronics, Institute of High Energy Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100049, China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所核探测与核电子学国家重点实验室 北京 100049","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"5432f620dabfaeb43f2a396b","name":"WANG Zhibin","name_zh":"陈玛丽","org":"State Key Laboratory of Particle Detection and Electronics, Institute of High Energy Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100049, China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所核探测与核电子学国家重点实验室 北京 100049","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"5448a69edabfae87b7e5a0a8","name":"CHEN Mali","name_zh":"朱科军","org":"State Key Laboratory of Particle Detection and Electronics, Institute of High Energy Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100049, China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所核探测与核电子学国家重点实验室 北京 100049","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"65c6b2bf671a27199842811f","name":"QI Huirong","name_zh":"吴冶","org":"State Key Laboratory of Particle Detection and Electronics, Institute of High Energy Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100049, China","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所核探测与核电子学国家重点实验室 北京 100049","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '["high energy physics experiment","tracking detectors","data acquisition system","hadoop big data framework","streaming data processing"]', '["高能物理实验","径迹系统探测器","数据获取系统","Hadoop大数据框架","流式数据处理"]', '{"name_zh":"核技术","raw":"Nuclear Techniques"}', '0253-3219', '44', '6', 2021, NULL),
('61cacf3f5244ab9dcb16a795', NULL, 'The development process of high energy physics in China and the enlightenment', '中国高能物理学的发展历程与启示', NULL, '中华人民共和国成立70多年来,随着时代和国情的变化,党和国家的科技政策不断进步、完善.作为基础科学重要组成部分的高能物理也顺应时代大潮而获得不断发展.按照时间顺序,将中国高能物理的发展分为创业期、建设期、收获期和跨越期4个阶段,并结合时代背景讨论了科技政策在不同阶段对高能物理发展的作用和影响.', '[{"name_zh":"张鹏","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学科技史与科技考古系,合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"id":"54591fbfdabfaeb0fe3096e8","name_zh":"丁兆君","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学科技史与科技考古系,合肥230026","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"}]', NULL, '["科技政策","高能物理","高能加速器"]', '{"name_zh":"科技导报","raw":"Science & Technology Review"}', '1000-7857', NULL, '12', 2021, NULL),
('62a860c95aee126c0f31b5d7', '10.3969/j.issn.1673-2219.2021.05.008', NULL, 'PYTHIA在高能粒子物理计算中的应用', NULL, 'PYTHIA程序是高能碰撞中事件产生的标准工具,包括一组连贯的物理模型,用于从少体硬过程演化到复杂的多粒子末态,是对撞机物理的核心软件,已成为研究现代对撞机物理不可或缺的有力工具.利用PYTHIA模拟了量子色动力学中的高能粒子碰撞,计算了喷注中末态粒子的多重数分布和横动量分布以及末态带电粒子的快度和赝快度.', '[{"id":"542ca524dabfae4a071ef415","name_zh":"谭美华","org_zh":"湖南科技学院","orgid":"5f71b5e61c455f439fe54248"},{"id":"6164025e60a9657b486e2647","name_zh":"唐耀平","org_zh":"湖南科技学院","orgid":"5f71b5e61c455f439fe54248"},{"id":"6164d65a60a9657b486f2253","name_zh":"史小飞","org_zh":"湖南科技学院","orgid":"5f71b5e61c455f439fe54248"}]', NULL, '["高能物理","蒙特卡罗","事件产生器","强子化","弦碎裂","粒子衰变"]', '{"name_zh":"湖南科技学院学报","raw":"Journal of Hunan University of Science and Engineering"}', '1673-2219', '42', '5', 2021, NULL),
('61cacf7b5244ab9dcb1b5271', '10.3969/j.issn.1672-6804.2021.01.007', 'Multidimensional World of Masatoshi Koshiba', '诺奖得主小柴昌俊的多维世界', NULL, '研究了诺贝尔奖得主小柴昌俊的科学贡献,并从中总结了若干成功经验.还介绍了鲜为人知的与中日历史问题有关的内容.', '[{"id":"560d176945cedb33975a5b0b","name_zh":"施郁","org_zh":"复旦大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c861"}]', NULL, '["诺贝尔奖","小柴昌俊","实验高能物理","中微子","中日历史"]', '{"name_zh":"科学文化评论","raw":"Science & Culture Review"}', '1672-6804', NULL, '1', 2021, NULL),
('61cacec15244ab9dcb0e69cc', '10.13373/j.cnki.cjrm.XY19050007', 'Progress in Application of Rare Light Metal Beryllium and Its Alloys', '稀有轻金属铍及其合金的应用进展', NULL, '铍是一种具有优异核性能和物理性能的稀有轻金属,密度低、比刚度高、比强度大、热性能优异,常作为功能和结构材料应用于许多重要领域,其合金具有独特的机械性能、物理性能和良好的加工性能,是高科技领域的重要材料.本文综述了铍及其合金在核能、高能物理、国防及航空航天和商业等众多关键领域的最新应用进展.在核能领域,铍及氧化铍常用作核反应堆的反射体材料或减速剂;在高能物理领域,世界各国均将铍作为粒子加速器中束流管/窗口的最佳制作材料;在国防及航空航天领域,铍是惯性导航系统最理想的结构材料,由铍作为主材的惯性器件具有最高的导航精度,铍及其合金应用于飞行器结构件上,可有效减小构件重量、降低发射成本,铍及铍铝合金良好的光学性能和机械性能,使其成为光学系统中镜体和支撑结构的首选材料;在商业领域中,铍振膜的应用使音响品质显著提升.本文通过铍及其合金在促进其应用领域技术进步和改进产品性能中所发挥的重要作用,说明其作为“战略性、关键性”工程材料所起到的关键支撑,进而分析了我国在铍及其合金的研究生产现状,展望了其发展前景.本文将有助于科技人员对铍及其合金应用的全面认识,使其进入更多领域发挥独特作用.', '[{"id":"5430548bdabfaecb862088f3","name":"Zheng Lifang","name_zh":"郑莉芳","org_zh":"北京科技大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e36a"},{"id":"63249ebda36d2225e1021b63","name":"Wang Xiaogang","name_zh":"王晓刚","org_zh":"北京科技大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e36a"},{"id":"63792691f789b382be986f45","name":"Yue Lina","name_zh":"岳丽娜","org_zh":"华北科技学院化学与环境工程学院河北省危险化学品安全与控制技术重点实验室,河北燕郊065201","orgid":"5f71b8c81c455f439fe60d17"},{"id":"633415772fedb730e3a30001","name":"Huang Junzhong","name_zh":"黄俊忠","org_zh":"北京科技大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e36a"},{"id":"56cb188fc35f4f3c65650f66","name":"Zhong Jingming","name_zh":"钟景明","org_zh":"西北稀有金属材料研究院","orgid":"623317420a6eb1456047423f"}]', NULL, '["高能物理","国防及航空航天","铍合金","铍","核能"]', '{"name_zh":"稀有金属","raw":"Chinese Journal of Rare Metals"}', '0258-7076', '45', '4', 2021, 8),
('604b7d4c6f90b7f6caeec0e1', '10.19678/j.issn.1000-3428.0053582', 'Dual Layer Job Scheduling System for Large Scale Heterogeneous Computing Clusters', '大规模异构计算集群的双层作业调度系统', 'HTCondor and SLURM computing clusters in high-energy physics computing platforms provide data processing services for many high-energy physics experiments.However,HTCondor is not efficient in parallel job scheduling,and SLURM could not manage massive serial jobs.Also,the overall resource management and scheduling strategies of computing platforms are too simple.To meet the demands of high-energy physics computing clusters running with heavy duties,this paper designs a dual layer job scheduling system,which adds a job management layer on the existing job scheduler.The system is designed to efficiently schedule serial and parallel jobs,ensure fair use of resources between experiment groups,and enable users to implement fine-grained management of jobs.Test results show that the dual layer job scheduling system supports rapid submission of massive high-energy physics jobs,makes full use of resources of a computing platform,and has a high performance in job scheduling.', '高能物理计算平台中的 HTCondor 和 SLURM计算集群为多个高能物理实验提供数据处理服务,然而HTCondor并行作业调度效率较低、SLURM难以应对大量串行作业,且计算平台整体资源管理及调度策略过于简单.为满足高能物理计算集群高负荷运行的需求,在传统作业调度器上增加作业管理层,设计双层作业调度系统,通过高效调度串并行作业并兼顾实验组间资源的使用公平性,实现用户对作业的细粒度管理.测试结果表明,双层作业调度系统支持大批量高能物理作业的快速提交,并充分利用计算平台的总体资源,具有较好的作业调度性能.', '[{"id":"62e3b004d9f2043704e44ffd","name_zh":"孙震宇","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"60e2bc939e795ecf20d093f1","name_zh":"石京燕","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"560568b745cedb33966106f3","name_zh":"孙功星","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"63244cf5c03fbd5be1f55e9e","name_zh":"杜然","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"5448444bdabfae857590b006","name_zh":"姜晓巍","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"64f012a4559445a0412a8179","name_zh":"邹佳恒","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"66987c62b7aee34109382524","name_zh":"谭宏楠","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '["computing cluster management|job scheduler|high throughput computing(htc)|high performance computing(hpc)|high energy physics computing"]', '["计算集群管理","作业调度器","高通量计算","高性能计算","高能物理计算"]', '{"name_zh":"计算机工程"}', '1000-3428', NULL, '1', 2020, 2),
('62abf1ef5aee126c0f4d90a1', NULL, 'Before and after the discovery of anti-sigma negative hyperon', '反西格马负超子((Σ)-)的发现前后', NULL, '因高能加速器建设滞后,中国粒子物理学科在发展早期只能开展理论研究、宇宙线观测或通过国际合作开展高能实验研究.多国合作的杜布纳联合原子核研究所的成立为中国高能物理发展创造了良机,反西格马负超子的发现更是中国物理学史上浓墨重彩的一笔.中国学者在杜布纳的系列科学成就,为此后中国亚原子物理发展奠定了重要的知识基础与人才基础.', '[{"id":"54591fbfdabfaeb0fe3096e8","name":"DING Zhaojun","name_zh":"丁兆君","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"},{"id":"64df0232e1382323551fbb9e","name":"LI Shouchen","name_zh":"李守忱","org_zh":"中国科学技术大学","orgid":"5f71b2c81c455f439fe3e380"}]', NULL, '["王淦昌","反西格马负超子","杜布纳","加速器","高能物理","探测器"]', '{"name_zh":"科技导报","raw":"Science & Technology Review"}', '1000-7857', '38', '23', 2020, 1),
('5d9e04ee9e795e957709a58e', '10.3778/j.issn.1002-8331.1812-0009', 'Cross-Domain File System for Distributed Sites', '分布式站点间的跨域文件系统', 'Lots of data are produced by large scale scientific facilities in High Energy Physics(HEP)studies. Scientific computing is based on these distributed data. Grid computing technology is used to share data between different sites in traditional way. However, low resource utilization, long response time and difficult operations limit data sharing between small sites. While a cross-domain file system based on streaming&cache is designed for data sharing between small sites in HEP computing. Native access for remote data, quick response, data transmission and management on demand based on HTTP, data block hash and store, uniform file view are implemented. Compared with commonly distributed file sys-tems EOS, GlusterFS and Lustre, availability in WAN, insensitivity to network delay and high-performance data access are performed.', '高能物理科学研究大多依托固定站点大科学装置,拥有海量实验数据。因此数据计算往往基于异地站点的海量实验数据。针对这些海量的分布式实验数据,传统的高能物理计算模式中采用了网格的方式进行跨域数据共享,但资源利用率低、响应时间长以及部署维护困难等问题,限制了网格技术在中小型站点间的数据共享。针对高能物理计算环境中,中小型站点间的数据共享问题,以Streaming&Cache为核心思想,设计一种远程文件系统,提出远程数据访问本地化,提供高实时性数据访问模式,实现基于HTTP协议的按需数据传输与管理,拥有数据块散列存储和文件统一化视图管理。与高能物理计算中常用分布式文件系统EOS、Lustre、GlusterFS相比,具有广域网可用性、网络时延不敏感性和高性能数据访问模式。', '[{"id":"5430e8f1dabfaecb587332e3","name":"Qi XU","name_zh":"程耀东","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"56cb18a2c35f4f3c65657ca8","name":"Cong WANG","name_zh":"陈刚","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"5440faaddabfae7f9b35f17b","name":"Yaodong CHENG","name_zh":"王聪","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"63248148a36d2225e1fd267e","name":"Gang CHEN","name_zh":"徐琪","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', NULL, '["高能物理实验数据","跨域访问","远程文件系统","缓存","高性能"]', '{"name_zh":"计算机工程与应用","raw":"计算机工程与应用"}', '1002-8331', '55', '8', 2019, 1),
('5ef205f69e795e72cd71b1d7', '10.13969/j.cnki.cn31-1893.2019.01.001', 'Application and Research of New Structural Materials in High-Energy Physical Detectors', '高能物理探测设备中结构新材料的应用技术研究', NULL, '高能物理探测设备往往是一种大型的空间结构,采用了大量的新材料,如:不锈钢、无氧铜、有机玻璃、尼龙等。介绍了几种类型的高能物理探测设备,并对以上几种新材料的研究现状作了总结。归纳了清华大学关于高能物理探测设备中新材料的研究,对于不锈钢主要进行了材性和本构、构件承载性能、连接节点、整体设计分析、残余应力等研究;对于无氧铜,进行了材性和本构以及构件承载性能的研究;对于有机玻璃,对其节点性能进行了试验研究,并且将通过单轴拉伸、蠕变、冲击韧性和断裂韧性的试验来研究其材性和本构关系。', '[{"id":"542adfd7dabfaec7081e5441","name":"Yuanqing WANG","name_zh":"王元清","org_zh":"清华大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c860"},{"id":"60d9a9f06750f85de6991f37","name":"Zongyi WANG","name_zh":"王综轶","org_zh":"清华大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c860"},{"id":"560c185845cedb339748be23","name":"Xinxi DU","name_zh":"杜新喜","org_zh":"武汉大学","orgid":"5f71b2cf1c455f439fe3e6ee"},{"id":"54483303dabfae87b7de4b75","name":"Shaomin CHEN","name_zh":"陈少敏","org_zh":"清华大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c860"},{"id":"560a541645cede056056deed","name":"Zhe WANG","name_zh":"王喆","org_zh":"清华大学","orgid":"5f71b2881c455f439fe3c860"},{"id":"652e7b0e8a47b64923116604","name":"Tianxiong ZHANG","name_zh":"张天雄","org_zh":"天津大学","orgid":"5f71b2b81c455f439fe3dc14"},{"id":"542f0fc2dabfaea2f5538f45","name":"Yuekun HENG","name_zh":"衡月昆","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', NULL, '["高能物理探测设备","不锈钢","无氧铜","有机玻璃","尼龙"]', '{"raw":"Jianzhu Gangjiegou Jinzhan"}', '1671-9379', NULL, NULL, 2019, 1),
('604b417d6f90b7f6cae2affd', '10.11896/cldb.18050221', 'Bi4Si3O12:an Important Heavy Scintillation with Fast Decay Time and New Multi-functional Crystal Materials', '硅酸铋——一种快计时重闪烁新型多功能晶体材料', NULL, '硅酸铋(Bi4 Si3 O12,BSO)晶体是一种新型的闪烁晶体,具有高辐射硬度、短衰减时间、低成本等优点,作为闪烁材料近年来引起了人们的极大关注.BSO晶体短的紫外吸收边能更好地分离Cherenkov光和闪烁光,并有效收集Cherenkov光信号,使其成为未来双读出量能器和均匀强子量能器的最佳候选材料.稀土离子掺杂BSO晶体在LED和激光等方面表现出优良的性能,被认为是一种不错的发光二极管和激光晶体材料.尽管BSO晶体是一种综合性能指标非常优异的多功能晶体,但该晶体迄今为止还没有被真正应用于实际生产中.随着大尺寸BSO晶体生长技术的突破以及稀土离子掺杂BSO晶体闪烁性能的提升,该晶体独特的双读出性能和极具优势的价格使其在高能物理、核医学成像等粒子探测和LED、激光等方面展现出巨大的应用潜力.', '[{"id":"62e8aefbd9f20422f0baf977","name":"Xuefeng XIAO","name_zh":"肖学峰","org_zh":"北方民族大学物理与光电信息功能材料重点实验室,银川750021;北方民族大学电气信息工程学院,银川750021;上海应用技术大学材料科学与工程学院,上海201418;同济大学材料科学与工程学院,上海201804","orgid":"5f71b2c31c455f439fe3e151"},{"id":"54091cb3dabfae450f462148","name":"Jiayue XU","name_zh":"徐家跃","org_zh":"上海应用技术大学","orgid":"623317480a6eb14560475374"},{"id":"637c7ceef789b382beae4b34","name":"Haicheng WEI","name_zh":"韦海成","org_zh":"北方民族大学物理与光电信息功能材料重点实验室,银川750021;北方民族大学电气信息工程学院,银川750021","orgid":"61e69dc26896273465742773"},{"id":"543290cedabfaecb862192b2","name":"Huan ZHANG","name_zh":"张欢","org_zh":"北方民族大学物理与光电信息功能材料重点实验室,银川750021;北方民族大学电气信息工程学院,银川750021","orgid":"61e69dc26896273465742773"},{"name":"Xuefeng ZHANG","name_zh":"张学锋","org_zh":"北方民族大学物理与光电信息功能材料重点实验室,银川750021;宁夏钜晶源晶体科技有限公司,石嘴山753000","orgid":"61e69dc26896273465742773"}]', NULL, '["硅酸铋晶体","闪烁晶体","双读出性能","高能物理","激光应用","发光二极管(","LED)应用"]', '{"name_zh":"材料导报","raw":"Materials Review"}', '1005-023X', '33', '15', 2019, 1),
('604b5faf6f90b7f6cad3ccd4', '10.3969/j.issn.1007-0834.2019.01.012', 'Application of CompHEP in High-energy Physics Calculation', 'CompHEP在高能物理计算中的应用', NULL, 'CompHEP是一个在树图阶用来进行费曼图计算和对多重态相空间进行积分的程序包.介绍了它的工作环境和操作方法,并用它对γγ→W+W-过程进行了截面计算,其数值结果和相关文献相一致.', '[{"id":"6166c8e860a9656471e93460","name":"Qingpeng QIAO","name_zh":"乔庆鹏","org_zh":"河南财政金融学院(龙子湖校区) 物理与电子工程学院,河南 郑州,450046"},{"id":"6166c8e860a9656471e93461","name":"Xiangdan ZHANG","name_zh":"张向丹","org_zh":"新乡学院 物理与电子工程学院,河南 新乡,453003","orgid":"61e6a0c76896273465749e91"}]', NULL, '["CompHEP","Vegas积分","蒙特卡罗","对撞机","高能物理","截面"]', '{"name_zh":"河南教育学院学报（自然科学版）","raw":"Journal of Henan Institute of Education(Natural Science Edition)"}', '1007-0834', '28', '1', 2019, 2),
('5d9deda49e795e9577086d14', '10.19678/j.issn.1000-3428.0051077', 'Distributed Data Processing System Based on MPI', '基于MPI的分布式数据处理系统', 'In order to simplify the off-line data processing flow of Jiangmen Underground Neutrino Observation(JUNO) and reduce resource consumption,a general software system is proposed to process data in distributed computing environment.Based on Message Passing Interface(MPI),communication and data exchange between nodes are realized.Master/Worker architecture is used to manage the life cycle of computing jobs,including computing job splitting,computing resource allocation,computing task execution and monitoring.Test results show that the proposed system has good scalability,and the data generated by the system is consistent with the data generated by manual step-by-step execution of job scripts to run simulation software.', '为简化江门中微子实验的离线数据处理流程,减少资源消耗,提出一种在分布式计算环境中进行数据处理的通用软件系统。基于信息传递接口实现节点间的通信与数据交换,使用Master/Worker架构对计算作业生命周期进行管理,包括计算作业拆分、计算资源分配以及计算任务执行与监控。测试结果表明,该系统具有良好的可扩展性,其产生的数据与人工逐步执行作业脚本运行模拟软件产生的数据一致。', '[{"name_zh":"赵宝琦","org_zh":"中国科学院大学计算机与控制学院","orgid":"5f71b3941c455f439fe43dc6"},{"id":"53f6395fdabfae02cc3fa785","name_zh":"李卫东","org_zh":"中国科学院大学计算机与控制学院","orgid":"5f71b3941c455f439fe43dc6"},{"id":"64f012a4559445a0412a8179","name_zh":"邹佳恒","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"6334184d2fedb730e3a4180f","name_zh":"林韬","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"6334184d2fedb730e3a4180f","name_zh":"颜田","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', '["high energy physics|jiangmen underground neutrino observation(juno)|off-line data processing|distributed computing|message passing interface(mpi)"]', '["高能物理","江门中微子实验","离线数据处理","分布式计算","信息传递接口"]', '{"name_zh":"计算机工程"}', '1000-3428', NULL, '7', 2019, 1),
('5d9e05019e795e957709a5cf', '10.3778/j.issn.1002-8331.1712-0325', 'Studies and Implementation of Data Transfer System for High Energy Physics Experiment', '高能物理实验数据传输系统的研究和实现', 'High energy physics mainly studies elementary particles and the interactions among them through various types of experiments, which yield a tremendous amount of data every day. Also the high energy physics experiments are regional-crossing. How to transfer experimental data reliably and efficiently in real time from the on-site detector to a data center for processing and analysis is one of the most important research topics for each experiment. After considering the requirements from different experiments, this paper introduces a general purpose data transfer system, which meets the needs of various high energy physics experiments through the way of interface definition and configuration files. The sys-tem provides the following functions:multipath source data scanning, data transferring, system information sharing, sys-tem configuration, log management and performance monitoring. At present, the system has been used by the experiment of Jiangmen Underground Neutrino Observatory to transfer the data of photomultiplier tube measurements. The good per-formance of real operation shows the that system satisfies the experiment’s requirements.', '高能物理主要通过各种实验来研究基本粒子及其相互作用,每个高能物理实验每天都会产生大量的实验数据。由于高能物理实验异地建设的特点,如何把实验数据实时、可靠的从实验现场传输到远程的数据中心进行处理和分析,是各个实验需要研究的重要课题。介绍了一种通用的高能物理数据传输系统,通过接口定义与配置文件相结合的方法,满足各个高能物理实验的需求。该系统的模块包括:多路径源数据扫描模块、数据传输模块、数据共享模块、系统配置模块、日志和监视模块等。目前,该系统已经应用于江门中微子实验光电倍增管测试的数据传输。实际运行结果表明,该系统性能良好,能够满足实验的需求。', '[{"id":"53f6395fdabfae02cc3fa785","name":"Sisi CHEN","name_zh":"李卫东","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"6153d73760a96506679be8d4","name":"Shan ZENG","name_zh":"曾珊","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"60e2b4979e795ecf20d0896e","name":"Weidong LI","name_zh":"齐法制","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"},{"id":"542ff599dabfaea2f5547f9e","name":"Fazhi QI","name_zh":"陈思思","org_zh":"中国科学院高能物理研究所","orgid":"5f71b29f1c455f439fe3d25c"}]', NULL, '["高能物理","数据传输","通用系统"]', '{"name_zh":"计算机工程与应用","raw":"计算机工程与应用"}', '1002-8331', '55', '13', 2019, 2);



